CALL () { UNWIND [{`id`:"edge:0026d17f8758374e",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:bff048b48ff1",`target`:"shipkg:check:168aa4cf65c8",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及检查方法",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:0026d17f8758374e",`case_id`:"knowledge:generator_bearing_wear",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:65e2c4b3facd8c2b",`source_file`:"STAMFORD_AGN076_alternator_bearings.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.stamford-avk.com/sites/stamfordavk/files/2024-04/AGN076_C.pdf",`page`:"4",`locator`:"PDF page 4",`quote`:"t fail because of axial vibration, causing a fretting action in the housing, the cylindrical roller bearing might fail because of lack of grease or misalignment damage. The anti-friction ball bearings used on STAMFORD alternators are not insulated bearings. The design of STAMFORD alternators is such that the shaft does not come under the influence of magnetic fields that result in excessive vol",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及检查方法\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:00e268c583920977",`source`:"shipkg:case:1e6479e108d9",`target`:"shipkg:fault:2c644dcfc770",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:00e268c583920977",`case_id`:"kommandor_susan_dg1_2025",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:5f282b514e870587",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_10_Kommandor_Susan_generator_bearing_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/catastrophic-engine-failure-and-subsequent-fire-on-board-the-site-investigation-vessel-kommandor-susan",`page`:"5",`locator`:"PDF page 5",`quote`:"oot cause is failure of connecting rod bearing number five. The excessive wear on the other connecting rod bearings show that the most likely root cause for the bearing failure is weak bonding of the copper layer. Evidence of weak material bonding was found in several bearings (Figure 4). Figure 3: Comparison between genuine OEM (left) and CTP bottom end bearings (right) Image courtesy of Pon Power",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:0194af9f6cddb0da",`source`:"shipkg:case:d6e9f8f8ade2",`target`:"shipkg:cause:29f8307f5eed",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及原因",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:0194af9f6cddb0da",`case_id`:"finlandia_seaways_me_2018",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:ed4a18d326cb49be",`source_file`:"MAIB_2021_02_Finlandia_Seaways_connecting_rod_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/engine-failure-and-subsequent-fire-on-ro-ro-cargo-vessel-finlandia-seaways-with-1-person-injured",`page`:"9",`locator`:"PDF page 9",`quote`:"used to replace the connecting rod small end piston pin bearing bushes by the vessel manager’s maintenance support contractor had introduced stress raisers that signficantly increased the likelihood of crack initiation and fatigue failure. Other factors that contributed to the engine failure included: standards of maintenance management; lack of appreciation of the importance of following the engine manufacturer’s instructions for the removal and refitting of the",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及原因\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:0217b36a9ad5309a",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:8a35cec932af",`target`:"shipkg:action:9b0a2bc57f23",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及运维措施",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:0217b36a9ad5309a",`case_id`:"knowledge:damper_failure",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:222a60daefcc64e4",`source_file`:"MAN_SL2017_654_torsional_damper.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.man-es.com/docs/default-source/service-letters/sl2017-654.pdf",`page`:"1",`locator`:"PDF page 1",`quote`:"l noise from the torsional vibration damper or any change in the vibra- tion behavior of the complete GenSet. In such a case, the complete torsional vibration damper must be replaced. For questions or comments please contact operation dept. Holeby: leo7@mandieselturbo.com Yours faithfully Crankshaft Torsional Vibration Damper SL2017-654/JNN November 2017 Concerns Owners and operators of MAN four-stroke diesel",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及运维措施\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:03d12ed508f7286d",`source`:"shipkg:case:9676bd22b5e5",`target`:"shipkg:action:d556abb4fcfa",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及运维措施",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:03d12ed508f7286d",`case_id`:"sd2013_05_missing_filter",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:dee08b2e20581c60",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"23",`locator`:"PDF page 23",`quote`:"wrong. 3. An oil mist detector gives advance warning of an impending major failure. When a detector alarm occurs, the thought of stopping and inspecting the engine as soon as possible should be uppermost in an engineer’s mind. The consequences of ignoring it are clear, and expensive.",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及运维措施\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:04838774cf46ba51",`source`:"shipkg:case:537a034e93e3",`target`:"shipkg:action:3a42e9e6e745",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及运维措施",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:04838774cf46ba51",`case_id`:"sd2013_03_turning_gear",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:bbdf7e438bd85b80",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"18",`locator`:"PDF page 18",`quote`:"ps cannot be rectified immediately, they must be reported. Living with the problem is not a solution. 3. It is important that the status of the main engine machinery conforms to the status recorded in the engine movement log and machinery state boards to enable everyone involved in an operation to maintain a clear understanding. If it does not, confusion can easily develop, and this inevitably increases the risk of damage t",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及运维措施\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:0638cbb99140f864",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:3353dce7f4ad",`target`:"shipkg:fault:ce4fe75e21d8",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:0638cbb99140f864",`case_id`:"knowledge:bearing_seizure",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:0523deba67297b7c",`source_file`:"MAN_SL2013_569_bearing_wear_monitoring.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.man-es.com/docs/default-source/service-letters/sl2013-569.pdf",`page`:"2",`locator`:"PDF page 2",`quote`:"C A main bearing damage was recently experienced on an MAN B&W S-MC-C main engine of medium bore size. The damage was caused by a sudden ingress of foreign matter into the bearing via the lubricating oil system, and it devel - oped rapidly into a bearing seizure. The engine was equipped with a bearing wear monitoring (BWM) system as recommended by MAN Diesel & Turbo (MDT). However, for rea",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:06a63349625ad703",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:6456485708ad",`target`:"shipkg:check:c586aa545141",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及检查方法",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:06a63349625ad703",`case_id`:"knowledge:shaft_generator_alignment",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:52377c3b77516eac",`source_file`:"STAMFORD_AGN039_marine_shaft_generators.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.stamford-avk.com/sites/stamfordavk/files/AGNs/AGN-039_C-Marine-Shaft-Generators.pdf",`page`:"2",`locator`:"PDF page 2",`quote`:"are to allow for the thermal expansion of the hot gearbox, which may well expand and lift the shaft centre line by < 1 mm. If the alignment is not accurate, then excessive vibration is likely to damage the shaft generator. There can also be lots of generator damaging vibration when the main engine is running at slow speeds and also when the ship is in storm conditions, because the s",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及检查方法\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:07c4866d3d32227d",`source`:"shipkg:case:7a1c0165bb56",`target`:"shipkg:check:3b1fdbe04792",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及检查方法",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:07c4866d3d32227d",`case_id`:"sd2016_08_generator_oil",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:7732c1387876e1fb",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"28",`locator`:"PDF page 28",`quote`:"s on the engines exceed acceptable limits. Overall vibration velocity can be measured with very simple instruments. If excessive, frequency analysis of the vibration waveform can often identify the root cause of excessive vibration levels. Figure 3: Example of a thermal image showing ‘hot spots’ on uninsulated sections of the exhaust system",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及检查方法\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:08271517ea215b52",`source`:"shipkg:case:597875e258c6",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:5c4ffe048cb7",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及后果",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:08271517ea215b52",`case_id`:"sd2016_05_cpp_backup",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:a2b206da94882af3",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"19",`locator`:"PDF page 19",`quote`:"y from the berth. The master’s actions proved ineffective as the vessel tore through the linkspan at a speed of about 7 knots and made heavy contact with the concrete berth (Figure 3). Almost immediately, bilge alarms, indicating water ingress into the vessel’s forward spaces, began to sound. The pitch on both propellers was brought to zero but the main engines were kept running. The bridge team mad",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及后果\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:0a2756d92ff951d1",`source`:"shipkg:case:1f8ffc7c55c3",`target`:"shipkg:action:b6c45b2c3ead",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及运维措施",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:0a2756d92ff951d1",`case_id`:"pride_can_cpp_2014",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:51d27e03785728b6",`source_file`:"MAIB_2015_22_Pride_of_Canterbury_CPP_hydraulic_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/563092daed915d566d000002/MAIBInvReport-22_2015.pdf",`page`:"35",`locator`:"PDF page 35",`quote`:"ull coverage of all high-risk machinery. 4.2 WARTSILA Wartsila has issued a Technical Bulletin (Annex C) instructing operators to replace back pressure valves at least every 15 years.",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及运维措施\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:0a3e1ac1f171f110",`source`:"shipkg:case:1f8ffc7c55c3",`target`:"shipkg:fault:ae4a492efe41",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:0a3e1ac1f171f110",`case_id`:"pride_can_cpp_2014",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:fbf6ef7897c61557",`source_file`:"MAIB_2015_22_Pride_of_Canterbury_CPP_hydraulic_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/563092daed915d566d000002/MAIBInvReport-22_2015.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"akes of the starboard main engines. The flanged joint ruptured because the CPP system became over- pressurised as a result of the back pressure valve (PSV3) becoming jammed in the closed position. The reason for the temporary increase in the starboard main engine load to 100% and corresponding increase in turbocharger rpm has not been determined. However, the reason is not believed to be related to the cause of the fire.",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:0bb0af8bc5dccadd",`source`:"shipkg:case:6f58fb8a8b17",`target`:"shipkg:check:7bc4821b359e",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及检查方法",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:0bb0af8bc5dccadd",`case_id`:"sd2016_22_cooling_pipe",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:f402f62ae7b113ec",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"60",`locator`:"PDF page 60",`quote`:"a water cooling pipe. Analysis of maintenance records showed that this pipework had not been inspected or renewed for many years. Sea inlet pipework should be thoroughly checked during planned maintenance periods. skipper, who had remained in the wheelhouse, then broadcast a “Mayday” message on VHF radio, which was received and relayed by the coastguard to all vessels in the area. As the vessel began to",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及检查方法\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:0e7bd1419d3d64a0",`source`:"shipkg:case:8b13bdb1a5bc",`target`:"shipkg:check:470049664913",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及检查方法",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:0e7bd1419d3d64a0",`case_id`:"sd2016_09_cpp_response",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:ec533ae27276b674",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"rried out. These drills will give operators confidence in the back-up systems and help them react effectively in an emergency. 3. Frequent engine response tests should be completed, both ahead and astern. This is particularly important before entering and leaving port or congested waters",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及检查方法\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:0fac0de4ede4d3e0",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:40cb53a64e31",`target`:"shipkg:condition:06d3b90c2d7b",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:0fac0de4ede4d3e0",`case_id`:"knowledge:winding_insulation",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:31bd0a2dcc933aac",`source_file`:"STAMFORD_AGN040_winding_insulation.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.stamford-avk.com/sites/stamfordavk/files/AGNs/AGN-040_E-Winding-Insulation-System.pdf",`page`:"6",`locator`:"PDF page 6",`quote`:"s of just a few MegOhms become more typical. Major factors, which affect and reduce the IR value, start with the winding outhang. Surface moisture, often present in conjunction with surface contamination, are typically the result of prevailing site conditions. Either will seriously reduce measured IR values, and if the root cause that allows this contaminant to be present i",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:10a8437270c808e2",`source`:"shipkg:case:597875e258c6",`target`:"shipkg:condition:7647f12090ef",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:10a8437270c808e2",`case_id`:"sd2016_05_cpp_backup",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:4812bf9684b2b7ad",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"21",`locator`:"PDF page 21",`quote`:"14 MAIB Safety Digest 1/2016 CASE 5 The Lessons 1. Ergonomically, the layout of the bridge console was not well designed. The close proximity of the safety-critical propulsion control buttons and the similar looking everyday use dimmer buttons, increased the likelihood of the type of human error seen in this case. There is always a risk that watchkeepers and equipment operators will inadvertently press the wrong butto",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:11b27f2c7d4f531d",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:660e09f63773",`target`:"shipkg:fault:0b115c0dd100",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:11b27f2c7d4f531d",`case_id`:"knowledge:coolant_blockage",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:1ac13d5b81e13593",`source_file`:"MAN_SL2016_623_cooling_water.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.man-es.com/docs/default-source/service-letters/sl2016-623.pdf",`page`:"2",`locator`:"PDF page 2",`quote`:"der head. The damages are often a result of corrosion, restrictions in or blocking of the cooling water flow, which are caused by deposits of limescale and/or rust. In general corrosion may result in leakages and thereby re - duce the lifetime and safety of the engine components. Lime- scale as well as rust deposits will reduce the heat transfer and may result in thermal overload of the com",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:11e5f29a1f7dfe4f",`source`:"shipkg:case:00057f56fe39",`target`:"shipkg:cause:cf3cb78b47cf",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及原因",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:11e5f29a1f7dfe4f",`case_id`:"wight_sky_me_2017",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:7407bf8cf7722325",`source_file`:"MAIB_2018_14_Wight_Sky_engine_bearing_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5b5217c7ed915d0b81e003df/MAIBInvReport14_2018.pdf",`page`:"14",`locator`:"PDF page 14",`quote`:"am ensured the safety of the vessel, passengers and crew. • Volvo Penta’s investigation into the engine failure concluded that: ○ Debris in the engine’s oil channels was most probably responsible for initiating the failure. ○ When the shells of main bearing 5 turned, the lubrication supply to big end bearing 4 was blocked, resulting in destructive failure. • Rebuilding the engine in a clean and controlled environment and transferring it complete in",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及原因\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:11ef722062ee75f5",`source`:"shipkg:case:00057f56fe39",`target`:"shipkg:fault:d047fdea9ee9",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:11ef722062ee75f5",`case_id`:"wight_sky_me_2017",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:dcba2393344bd01c",`source_file`:"MAIB_2018_14_Wight_Sky_engine_bearing_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5b5217c7ed915d0b81e003df/MAIBInvReport14_2018.pdf",`page`:"14",`locator`:"PDF page 14",`quote`:"e engine’s oil channels was most probably responsible for initiating the failure. ○ When the shells of main bearing 5 turned, the lubrication supply to big end bearing 4 was blocked, resulting in destructive failure. • Rebuilding the engine in a clean and controlled environment and transferring it complete into the engine room would have reduced the likelihood of debris ingress. • The engine was not fitted w",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:12639aeeb7d3d60d",`source`:"shipkg:case:187dc871fbd5",`target`:"shipkg:condition:2ee58a9a8fad",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:12639aeeb7d3d60d",`case_id`:"spirit_of_discovery_pods_2023",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:9d2abeeb05ea44b5",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_06_Spirit_of_Discovery_propulsion_loss.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/loss-of-propulsion-in-heavy-weather-experienced-by-the-passenger-vessel-spirit-of-discovery-leading-to-over-100-injuries-and-one-fatality",`page`:"42",`locator`:"PDF page 42",`quote`:"parked at 90° to the vessel’s heading. Given the weather conditions at the time, it is almost certain that Spirit of Discovery’s pitching caused the propellers to come out of the water. This caused a sudden reduction in torque on the propulsion motor and led to a very rapid increase in the motors’ rpm. The engine alarm and monitoring system recorded that, immediately before their shutdown, the rpm of each pod’s",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:126b6700643453b3",`source`:"shipkg:case:537a034e93e3",`target`:"shipkg:fault:439f73a406a0",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:126b6700643453b3",`case_id`:"sd2013_03_turning_gear",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:85dce6df90ffbd20",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"16",`locator`:"PDF page 16",`quote`:"turning gear control lever with the intention of disengaging the turning gear from the main engine flywheel. The turning gear was not marked in any way to show whether it was engaged or disengaged, and the operating instructions that were posted nearby had been painted over. The engineer then went to the machinery control room to start the engine. Although the indicator for the turning gear, which was sited on the control",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:12919a648d0ee1b2",`source`:"shipkg:case:63aa8b018e0d",`target`:"shipkg:action:f8d140a40b2e",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及运维措施",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:12919a648d0ee1b2",`case_id`:"stena_europe_fuel_2023",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:27210f9a269e08cf",`source_file`:"MAIB_2024_20_Stena_Europe_fuel_spray_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6756db0ba63e1781efb87793/2024-20-StenaEurope.pdf",`page`:"31",`locator`:"PDF page 31",`quote`:"tion thermographic survey following ME3’s return to service on 17 May. ● Undertaken a review of its company SMS and implemented a review process to manage service bulletins and technical service letters from all manufacturers of main engines and auxiliary engines within the Stena fleet.",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及运维措施\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:132a3aef440a9e86",`source`:"shipkg:case:9792cd36162e",`target`:"shipkg:fault:8d2d73a67f71",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:132a3aef440a9e86",`case_id`:"windcat8_port_engine_2017",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:921221ff746c010e",`source_file`:"MAIB_2018_01_Windcat8_bearing_failure_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/683922/MAIBInvReport01_2018.pdf",`page`:"1",`locator`:"PDF page 1",`quote`:"to Windcat 8’s port main engine was caused by the failure of a piston connecting rod big end shell bearing, which resulted in the connecting rod assembly releasing and penetrating through the engine crankcase. The investigation also identified that: • A high oil temperature alarm prior to the engine failure warranted a more cautious approach to the use of the engine until a deeper technical investigation could be conducted. • The fire",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:135acd7b707d34d5",`source`:"shipkg:case:63aa8b018e0d",`target`:"shipkg:fault:256ba55c5fb2",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:135acd7b707d34d5",`case_id`:"stena_europe_fuel_2023",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:2d2994aad520a17a",`source_file`:"MAIB_2024_20_Stena_Europe_fuel_spray_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6756db0ba63e1781efb87793/2024-20-StenaEurope.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"MMENDATIONS 1. Stena Europe experienced a fire on one of its main engines due to an uncontrolled release of pressurised fuel. The fuel sprayed onto the exposed exhaust manifold that was operating at a temperature exceeding 220°C when a screw in a two-screw flange within the fuel oil pipework loosened. [2.2] 2. The fuel oil spray was allowed to reach the hot surface because the joint was not protected by",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:1495616155627afc",`source`:"shipkg:case:ad49b658b30b",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:81fff36694d8",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及后果",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:1495616155627afc",`case_id`:"sd2016_14_sea_valve",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:a7f4aefea80b44c7",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"40",`locator`:"PDF page 40",`quote`:"age to machinery, he left the bilge system to stop the generator and main engine, and sent the motorman to the bridge to tell the master that the engine room was flooding. With the water level continuing to rise, the chief engineer evacuated the engine room, leaving open the watertight door between the engine room and the accommodation as he did so. On being informed of the flooding, the master le",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及后果\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:14a2d2737f32e8e3",`source`:"shipkg:case:ad49b658b30b",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:196ff2650762",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及后果",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:14a2d2737f32e8e3",`case_id`:"sd2016_14_sea_valve",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:fb6cf34a58c7fe85",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"40",`locator`:"PDF page 40",`quote`:"f water ingress to the cargo hold, all six crew abandoned to one of the lifeboats. The vessel continued to flood (Figure 1), with water entering the accommodation areas through the open engine room doorway. The vessel’s owner contracted salvors, who were able to stop the flooding and, once stable, the vessel was towed into port.",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及后果\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:14a533788398ee65",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:8a35cec932af",`target`:"shipkg:condition:20591bbadf85",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:14a533788398ee65",`case_id`:"knowledge:damper_failure",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:71b1d838f3e59389",`source_file`:"MAN_SL2017_654_torsional_damper.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.man-es.com/docs/default-source/service-letters/sl2017-654.pdf",`page`:"1",`locator`:"PDF page 1",`quote`:"oil - r educed lube oil supply - c ontaminated lube oil leading to carbon built up internal the damper b y the centrifugal forces will reduce the service life of the torsional vibration damper and may lead to failure before reaching the mentioned operation limits. Indications of a failing torsional vibration damper could be abnormal noise from the torsional vibration damper or any chan",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:14cf68cd3afe643d",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:ce7933999459",`target`:"shipkg:condition:ee040110dad4",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_