fc594a9fab7",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:775549e4c085",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及后果",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:15375aa4d0128108",`case_id`:"sd2013_12_oily_rag",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:1abb50030379f9ee",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"41",`locator`:"PDF page 41",`quote`:"rag, which he casually left on a tank top above the engine exhaust manifold. Vibration caused the oil-soaked rag to fall onto the hot manifold and catch fire. The small fire then ignited the engine high temperature alarm cabling loom, causing it to short circuit and set off the alarm in the wheelhouse (Figure 2). The functional fire and smoke alarm sensors were some distance from the",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及后果\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:16dc5b835e383d0c",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:796439daaa03",`target`:"shipkg:check:3e5bf3f8ece1",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及检查方法",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:16dc5b835e383d0c",`case_id`:"knowledge:electrical_oscillation",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:172a7fb8c0a27ceb",`source_file`:"Frontiers_2021_marine_converter_oscillations.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.frontiersin.org/journals/energy-research/articles/10.3389/fenrg.2020.529756/pdf",`page`:"1",`locator`:"PDF page 1",`quote`:"aneous frequency is determined and subsequently ﬂuctuations of fundamental components and chosen harmonics are calculated using zoom- DFT. The characteristics of these irregular ﬂuctuations are compared and commented on. Next, phase portraits and Poincare map of the registered voltages are calculated and compared. Moreover, the impact of ship rolling and pitching",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及检查方法\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:177e2c44dbbe54eb",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:796439daaa03",`target`:"shipkg:condition:725f6ac0521d",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:177e2c44dbbe54eb",`case_id`:"knowledge:electrical_oscillation",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:de200230bb22400e",`source_file`:"Frontiers_2021_marine_converter_oscillations.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.frontiersin.org/journals/energy-research/articles/10.3389/fenrg.2020.529756/pdf",`page`:"6",`locator`:"PDF page 6",`quote`:"rd 45.1, 2017). Since the majority of loads had linear characteristic and did not vary, such a behavior is to be associated with power converter control under the condition of signi ﬁcantly varying frequency at the shaft generator terminal. Moreover, the level of all parameters oscillation was the highest of all analyzed ships. Research Onboard of Research-Training Ship The case study for the res",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:177f6419aee60b9d",`source`:"shipkg:case:213f8edb92c2",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:fc1835efb5ca",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及后果",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:177f6419aee60b9d",`case_id`:"queen_mary2_hf_2010",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:f17ab4bbdcec2bfc",`source_file`:"MAIB_2011_28_Queen_Mary_2_harmonic_filter_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/547c6fa6ed915d4c10000031/QM2Report.pdf",`page`:"13",`locator`:"PDF page 13",`quote`:"e suppression spray heads were activated, one in the aft harmonic filter room and the other in the aft main switchboard room. The explosion was triggered by deterioration in the capacitors in the aft HF . Internal arcing between the capacitor plates developed, which vaporised the dielectric medium causing the internal pressure to increase, until it caused the capacitor casing to rupture. Dielectri",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及后果\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:17b9e2683d9eda01",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:6dbd0d51366c",`target`:"shipkg:condition:3516d66bca42",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:17b9e2683d9eda01",`case_id`:"knowledge:bearing_electrical_erosion",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:9eb024fc4137b406",`source_file`:"STAMFORD_AGN033_bearing_currents.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.stamford-avk.com/sites/stamfordavk/files/AGNs/AGN-033_C-Shaft-Bearing-Currents.pdf",`page`:"1",`locator`:"PDF page 1",`quote`:"aft within a rotating electrical machine - motor or alternator – to come under the influence of magnetic fields which result in a voltage (electrical pressure) generated along the axial length of the shaft. This ‘shaft voltage’ will then force current to flow from one end of the shaft, along a path which is radially out of the shaft through an end bracket continue along the alternators stator fra",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:1b5a5a4f3d4170ea",`source`:"shipkg:case:213f8edb92c2",`target`:"shipkg:condition:db2e89c50479",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:1b5a5a4f3d4170ea",`case_id`:"queen_mary2_hf_2010",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:3bea0430b472030b",`source_file`:"MAIB_2011_28_Queen_Mary_2_harmonic_filter_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/547c6fa6ed915d4c10000031/QM2Report.pdf",`page`:"64",`locator`:"PDF page 64",`quote`:"current imbalance transformer were tested during manufacture, subsequent tests of the system were by secondary current injection, bypassing the windings. As the IAS did not specifically register which rank of the HF had developed an imbalance current, it was not possible to confirm if the current imbalance transformers on rank 1 1.3 had ever worked in service. It is concerning th",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:1c226d729369d0f6",`source`:"shipkg:case:9792cd36162e",`target`:"shipkg:symptom:d2a57b31e287",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及症状",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:1c226d729369d0f6",`case_id`:"windcat8_port_engine_2017",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:caaf8005d66a8fbb",`source_file`:"MAIB_2018_01_Windcat8_bearing_failure_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/683922/MAIBInvReport01_2018.pdf",`page`:"1",`locator`:"PDF page 1",`quote`:"in the connecting rod assembly releasing and penetrating through the engine crankcase. The investigation also identified that: • A high oil temperature alarm prior to the engine failure warranted a more cautious approach to the use of the engine until a deeper technical investigation could be conducted. • The fire resulted from the ignition of oil vapour released from the damaged crankcase and did not spread bey",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及症状\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:1cb99c9ff8f33678",`source`:"shipkg:case:537a034e93e3",`target`:"shipkg:check:de8a5b9844ad",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及检查方法",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:1cb99c9ff8f33678",`case_id`:"sd2013_03_turning_gear",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:d2bfff6df47b53cc",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"18",`locator`:"PDF page 18",`quote`:"2013 The Lessons 1. The turning gear interlock had not been included within the planned maintenance system on board and there was no record of it having been tested. 2. Control console illumination panels are vital to the safe operation of machinery and should therefore be tested regularly. If problems with visual indication or warning lamps cannot be rectified immediately, they must be repo",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及检查方法\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:1d0bd0949cf8eae1",`source`:"shipkg:case:ad49b658b30b",`target`:"shipkg:fault:86ef7d39fd57",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:1d0bd0949cf8eae1",`case_id`:"sd2016_14_sea_valve",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:9bfb29365e610d09",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"40",`locator`:"PDF page 40",`quote`:"nected the electric motor from the pump. He then removed the flange bolts connecting the inlet pipe to the pump. Soon afterwards, water started to flow from the inlet pipe at a rapidly increasing rate. The chief engineer tried to reduce the rate by jamming rags into the pipe, but the flow was too strong. He then sent the motorman to fetch some pieces of wood, which he intended to force into the pip",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:1d440ef96d835931",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:84e503bec36b",`target`:"shipkg:check:72fca2c03641",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及检查方法",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:1d440ef96d835931",`case_id`:"knowledge:shaft_torsional",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:34006c39dec5327b",`source_file`:"STAMFORD_AGN235_torsional_analysis.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.stamford-avk.com/sites/stamfordavk/files/AGNs/AGN-235_A-Generating-Set-Assembly-Torsional-Vibration-Analysis.pdf",`page`:"7",`locator`:"PDF page 7",`quote`:"ing sequence, cycle to cycle variation impacts different cylinder firing orders differently. All torsional vibration calculations require validation by test. Typical results from torsional vibration calculations are; - Angular displacements. - Angular accelerations. - Vibratory torques and stresses at shaft sections. - All torsional modes of vibration (natural frequencies and forced",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及检查方法\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:1ea6a0499635645c",`source`:"shipkg:case:63aa8b018e0d",`target`:"shipkg:condition:4ae93bca9f29",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:1ea6a0499635645c",`case_id`:"stena_europe_fuel_2023",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:9d1bc8efb3c65396",`source_file`:"MAIB_2024_20_Stena_Europe_fuel_spray_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6756db0ba63e1781efb87793/2024-20-StenaEurope.pdf",`page`:"27",`locator`:"PDF page 27",`quote`:"’s main engine fuel systems were historically reported in the vessel’s DOCMAP system. However, this had stopped over time and the crew instead repaired the leaks and recorded them locally in the engine room logbook. The relatively high turnover and heavy workload of engine room crew had resulted in defect reporting being considered a low priority, which had led to the requirements in SMS document SMM-0255 not bein",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:1f82a0c4bfb7661d",`source`:"shipkg:case:63aa8b018e0d",`target`:"shipkg:fault:7b886d9d51c3",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:1f82a0c4bfb7661d",`case_id`:"stena_europe_fuel_2023",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:38b5d9eb759b1681",`source_file`:"MAIB_2024_20_Stena_Europe_fuel_spray_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6756db0ba63e1781efb87793/2024-20-StenaEurope.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"f pressurised fuel. The fuel sprayed onto the exposed exhaust manifold that was operating at a temperature exceeding 220°C when a screw in a two-screw flange within the fuel oil pipework loosened. [2.2] 2. The fuel oil spray was allowed to reach the hot surface because the joint was not protected by anti-splashing tape or shielding and fuel was able to escape forcefully. [2.3.2] 3. The engine manufacturer’s recommended fu",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:204a741a8d15342d",`source`:"shipkg:case:1f8ffc7c55c3",`target`:"shipkg:condition:37dbebf86df6",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:204a741a8d15342d",`case_id`:"pride_can_cpp_2014",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:169a62f5f3bc2de6",`source_file`:"MAIB_2015_22_Pride_of_Canterbury_CPP_hydraulic_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/563092daed915d566d000002/MAIBInvReport-22_2015.pdf",`page`:"30",`locator`:"PDF page 30",`quote`:"from the OD box were protected. Critically, in the zone between the two starboard main engines where the leak occurred, there was no evidence after the fire of shielding on the flanged joints. Given the port side arrangement had no shielding for the same joints (Figure 19), it is concluded unlikely that shielding was ever in place on the starboard side. Although surveyed and inspected on a regular basis, the omission",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:2154e85207766498",`source`:"shipkg:case:1f8ffc7c55c3",`target`:"shipkg:fault:dd6aba2caf5a",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:2154e85207766498",`case_id`:"pride_can_cpp_2014",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:9cb1e1609e478a6f",`source_file`:"MAIB_2015_22_Pride_of_Canterbury_CPP_hydraulic_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/563092daed915d566d000002/MAIBInvReport-22_2015.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"oil, from a ruptured pipework joint in the starboard CPP system, onto the hot exhaust uptakes of the starboard main engines. The flanged joint ruptured because the CPP system became over- pressurised as a result of the back pressure valve (PSV3) becoming jammed in the closed position. The reason for the temporary increase in the starboard main engine load to 100% and corresponding increase in turbocharger rpm has not been det",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:215927f377f46931",`source`:"shipkg:case:9792cd36162e",`target`:"shipkg:fault:2c644dcfc770",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:215927f377f46931",`case_id`:"windcat8_port_engine_2017",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:caaf8005d66a8fbb",`source_file`:"MAIB_2018_01_Windcat8_bearing_failure_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/683922/MAIBInvReport01_2018.pdf",`page`:"1",`locator`:"PDF page 1",`quote`:"in the connecting rod assembly releasing and penetrating through the engine crankcase. The investigation also identified that: • A high oil temperature alarm prior to the engine failure warranted a more cautious approach to the use of the engine until a deeper technical investigation could be conducted. • The fire resulted from the ignition of oil vapour released from the damaged crankcase and did not spread bey",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:21aa538ccb186c35",`source`:"shipkg:case:1e6479e108d9",`target`:"shipkg:condition:9e0b58e70948",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:21aa538ccb186c35",`case_id`:"kommandor_susan_dg1_2025",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:01e497b491874531",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_10_Kommandor_Susan_generator_bearing_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/catastrophic-engine-failure-and-subsequent-fire-on-board-the-site-investigation-vessel-kommandor-susan",`page`:"8",`locator`:"PDF page 8",`quote`:"Caterpillar was approved on the basis that genuine parts were used. The CTP parts were designed for a standard service interval. Use of the CTP parts beyond their design life led the connecting rod bearings to fail, initiating a chain of mechanical failures that culminated in the engine failure and subsequent fire. The extended service intervals were inappropriate for these substitute components, accelerating the risk of failure. Anchoring",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:2374f0fb0067bcfd",`source`:"shipkg:case:6f58fb8a8b17",`target`:"shipkg:fault:34646312c70d",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:2374f0fb0067bcfd",`case_id`:"sd2016_22_cooling_pipe",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:f99011c1bd987967",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"59",`locator`:"PDF page 59",`quote`:"e bilge pump but could not reach the two sea water inlet valves as they were already more than a metre below the water level. The main engine then stopped and the engineer told the skipper that nothing could be done to stem the ingress of water. The Figure 1: Sequence showing fishing vessel sinking",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:24678dd0c27492bb",`source`:"shipkg:case:1e6479e108d9",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:775549e4c085",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及后果",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:24678dd0c27492bb",`case_id`:"kommandor_susan_dg1_2025",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:390711bc162bb6ce",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_10_Kommandor_Susan_generator_bearing_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/catastrophic-engine-failure-and-subsequent-fire-on-board-the-site-investigation-vessel-kommandor-susan",`page`:"1",`locator`:"PDF page 1",`quote`:"r Susan suffered a catastrophic failure of a diesel generator engine while conducting sea trials in the Firth of Forth, Scotland. The failure resulted in an engine room fire and a complete power blackout. The crew responded promptly, extinguished the fire and mustered safely. The vessel lost propulsion and began drifting eastwards. Attempts to deploy anchors were unsuccessful because the anchor winches required electrical power t",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及后果\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:250daa18db4d1b2d",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:f8ea1aa17718",`target`:"shipkg:check:7015063ef15d",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及检查方法",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:250daa18db4d1b2d",`case_id`:"knowledge:cooling_cavitation",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:a4b9b5883574eb17",`source_file`:"MAN_main_engine_auxiliary_efficiency.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.man-es.com/docs/default-source/document-sync/efficiency-improvements-main-engine-auxiliary-systems-eng.pdf",`page`:"11",`locator`:"PDF page 11",`quote`:"exceeded, and the engine may thereby not fulfil the Tier II NO X requirements. On this basis, a system has to be established that maintains a constant cooling water flow to the scavenge air cooler and, at the same time, makes it possible to reduce the flow to the LO and jacket water coolers, see Fig. 13. The total flow versus engine load can be obtained by taking the approach that the water flow",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及检查方法\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:2545959e01cfe463",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:ce7933999459",`target`:"shipkg:check:78fb4dfb3734",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及检查方法",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:2545959e01cfe463",`case_id`:"knowledge:liner_scuffing",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:da388522df310fbc",`source_file`:"MAN_SL2016_633_piston_rings_scuffing.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.man-es.com/docs/default-source/service-letters/sl2016-633.pdf",`page`:"3",`locator`:"PDF page 3",`quote`:"is recommended. Otherwise, polishing and smearing of the liner surface may occur and, thereby, in - crease the risk for seizures. Conditioning the liner surface When overhauling after prolonged operation on ULSF, the liner surface may not be in an adequate condition to facilitate the running-in of new piston rings as is the case when oper - ating on high-sulphur fuels. It may therefore b",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及检查方法\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:263ecee819bf904e",`source`:"shipkg:case:8b13bdb1a5bc",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:2597a77f75b3",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及后果",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:263ecee819bf904e",`case_id`:"sd2016_09_cpp_response",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:de42c2cda585b232",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"respond and continued to proceed ahead. Despite placing the pitch control to full astern, the CPP did not respond in time and the vessel’s bow struck the quay. The bulbous bow was holed, but fortunately the damage was above the waterline (Figure 1). The subsequent investigation identified that the vessel had a history of sluggish astern response. However, the crew had accepted this as",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及后果\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:2733fac75d04cfac",`source`:"shipkg:case:63aa8b018e0d",`target`:"shipkg:condition:8012db626950",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:2733fac75d04cfac",`case_id`:"stena_europe_fuel_2023",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:3b167c1e7ff25a89",`source_file`:"MAIB_2024_20_Stena_Europe_fuel_spray_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6756db0ba63e1781efb87793/2024-20-StenaEurope.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"-screw flange within the fuel oil pipework loosened. [2.2] 2. The fuel oil spray was allowed to reach the hot surface because the joint was not protected by anti-splashing tape or shielding and fuel was able to escape forcefully. [2.3.2] 3. The engine manufacturer’s recommended fuel system modification had been fitted to the external fuel system of just one of Stena Europe’s four main engines. The opportunity to fit",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:2922e209ba44a55f",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:12275851bbd1",`target`:"shipkg:fault:7386c69bc1ea",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:2922e209ba44a55f",`case_id`:"knowledge:coupling_failure",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:56138ddb26a2655e",`source_file`:"MAIB_2017_20_Hebrides_CPP_coupling.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/59b7ab1c40f0b61231e71a54/MAIBInvReport20_2017.pdf",`page`:"30",`locator`:"PDF page 30",`quote`:"tepper motor shaft rotated inside the jaw coupling in response to the electrical signals from the remote propulsion consoles, the coupling remained stationary and the shaft’s rotary motion was not transferred to the ball screw mechanism. Therefore, the pitch set on the port CPP was unaltered. The setscrew securing the jaw coupling to the stepper motor shaft had loosened since its insta",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:2aa27c4d75451e83",`source`:"shipkg:case:ad49b658b30b",`target`:"shipkg:action:07654f6d6a9b",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及运维措施",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:2aa27c4d75451e83",`case_id`:"sd2016_14_sea_valve",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:0e5aaddc8a474eee",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"41",`locator`:"PDF page 41",`quote`:"ve not holding. 2. The crew’s response to the flooding was ineffective because they were not prepared for the emergency. They had never carried out an engine room flooding drill, and half of them had never carried out any form of emergency drill since joining the vessel. Are you prepared for a flooding emergency? 3. Examination of the isolating valve following the accident identified that the valve actua",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及运维措施\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:2ace6735cf364daf",`source`:"shipkg:case:537a034e93e3",`target`:"shipkg:fault:8027eb707475",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:2ace6735cf364daf",`case_id`:"sd2013_03_turning_gear",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:157ede421b19ee3a",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"16",`locator`:"PDF page 16",`quote`:"neer. When the main engine start button was pressed to turn the engine on compressed air, a loud bang was heard; the turning gear interlock, the last remaining safety barrier, had failed to work. The resulting damage to the shaft and gearing (Figure 1) and to the turning gear casing (Figure 2) disabled the ship for a month and cost a six-figure sum to repair. To Turn or Not to Turn?",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:2b009d7f31dff02d",`source`:"shipkg:case:278d7572ef08",`target`:"shipkg:fault:a20cef558a0a",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:2b009d7f31dff02d",`case_id`:"wight_sky_me4_2018",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:a4a51bca0c30f80d",`source_file`:"MAIB_2022_04_Wight_Sky_multiple_engine_failures.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6267cc85e90e071690c1b679/2022-4-WightSky-Report.pdf",`page`:"84",`locator`:"PDF page 84",`quote`:"f the engine’s matched connecting rod big end bearing caps had been transposed during the engine assembly process. [2.3.2] 4. The transposition of the bearing caps reduced the metal-to-metal contact between surfaces of the connecting rods and their bearing caps. This would have caused fretting wear between the mating faces, which would have led to loosening and rapid failure of the end cap securing bolts. [2.3.2] 5. Four of",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:2b331df2c1fbca59",`source`:"shipkg:case:adf367a46f33",`target`:"shipkg:condition:2d805325d843",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:2b331df2c1fbca59",`case_id`:"wight_sky_me2_2018",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:26718cca28f9fc30",`source_file`:"MAIB_2022_04_Wight_Sky_multiple_engine_failures.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6267cc85e90e071690c1b679/2022-4-WightSky-Report.pdf",`page`:"84",`locator`:"PDF page 84",`quote`:"heir housing. Poor fuel combustion, the presence of silica sand and other abrasive particles embedded in the main bearing shells, engine misalignment, high levels of vibration, and contaminated lubricating oil might all have contributed to the event failure. [2.3.1] 3. Wight Sky’s ME4 failed catastrophically because of an assembly error during build at Volvo Penta’s factory in Sweden. Two of the engine’s matched connecting rod big end bearing caps had been trans",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:2f2a629e62f4e00e",`source`:"shipkg:case:00057f56fe39",`target`:"shipkg:condition:19ae439543bd",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:2f2a629e62f4e00e",`case_id`:"wight_sky_me_2017",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:9094aa614ec060db",`source_file`:"MAIB_2018_14_Wight_Sky_engine_bearing_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5b5217c7ed915d0b81e003df/MAIBInvReport14_2018.pdf",`page`:"14",`locator`:"PDF page 14",`quote`:"ntrolled environment and transferring it complete into the engine room would have reduced the likelihood of debris ingress. • The engine was not fitted with a wear detector, so there was no means of receiving a warning before the engine failed. • The essential services switchboard aft circuit breaker had been left in manual mode, resulting in the loss of power to critical equipment, including the fixed fire-fighting system. ACTION TAKEN Wightli",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:2f74f8761bde5300",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:12275851bbd1",`target`:"shipkg:check:61f2da350e19",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及检查方法",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:2f74f8761bde5300",`case_id`:"knowledge:coupling_failure",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:6312cf968733db1b",`source_file`:"MAIB_2017_20_Hebrides_CPP_coupling.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/59b7ab1c40f0b61231e71a54/MAIBInvReport20_2017.pdf",`page`:"36",`locator`:"PDF page 36",`quote`:"NISATIONS Rolls-Royce Marine has: ● Issued a service letter to all users of the HeliconX propulsion control systems regarding the inspection and integrity of the jaw coupling within the linear servomotor actuator. ● Issued a service procedure for the linear servomotor based on OEM requirements. CalMac Ferries Ltd h as: ● Issued a technical bulletin to its major vessels that requires all propulsion con",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及检查方法\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:2fcce99768197f87",`source`:"shipkg:case:6f58fb8a8b17",`target`:"shipkg:action:f1e90ec0f59b",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及运维措施",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:2fcce99768197f87",`case_id`:"sd2016_22_cooling_pipe",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:6d6d03a1efd0d418",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"60",`locator`:"PDF page 60",`quote`:"ated as designed, with no one present in the wheelhouse to either see or hear it, it was not detected in time to save the vessel. Never leave the wheelhouse unmanned when underway; doing so is in contravention of the COLREGs and puts you and your vessel at risk. 2. The crew were instructed to enter the accommodation to collect lifejackets in preparation for abandoning the vessel, but instead took personal",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及运维措施\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:3039557ef9ebcbab",`source`:"shipkg:case:597875e258c6",`target`:"shipkg:fault:dddb0abee018",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:3039557ef9ebcbab",`case_id`:"sd2016_05_cpp_backup",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:738f5c3dde53a776",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"20",`locator`:"PDF page 20",`quote`:"ety Digest 1/2016 CASE 5 The investigation found that when the starboard CPP back-up control mode was inadvertently selected, the master lost bridge control of that propeller. The starboard CPP continued to thrust at over half ahead throughout the vessel’s approach to the berth and up until its engine was stopped (about 2 hours after the contact). Starboard pitch back-up on/off control button Centre c",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:30663730625e9bfa",`source`:"shipkg:case:63aa8b018e0d",`target`:"shipkg:condition:4277de3a84c9",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:30663730625e9bfa",`case_id`:"stena_europe_fuel_2023",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:446e44bf86c01e9d",`source_file`:"MAIB_2024_20_Stena_Europe_fuel_spray_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6756db0ba63e1781efb87793/2024-20-StenaEurope.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"the external fuel systems on the remaining engines was missed and the risk of fuel leakage remained high. [2.3. 1] 4. Much of the insulation and shielding on all of Stena Europe’s engines was in a poor state of repair or missing completely. The ship’s crew and shore management had become accustomed to this condition over time, possibly due to the age of the vessel, leading to machi",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:30ec4f84b22ce4cc",`source`:"shipkg:case:ffc594a9fab7",`target`:"shipkg:condition:d96dbed6a05c",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:30ec4f84b22ce4cc",`case_id`:"sd2013_12_oily_rag",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:c6b798ec4934dc08",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"41",`locator`:"PDF page 41",`quote`:"iling checks, he wiped the engine sump dipstick on a rag, which he casually left on a tank top above the engine exhaust manifold. Vibration caused the oil-soaked rag to fall onto the hot manifold and catch fire. The small fire then ignited the engine high temperature alarm cabling loom, causing it to short circuit and set off the alarm in the wheelhouse (Figure 2). The functional fire and smoke alarm",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:31dfd344abe4c50d",`source`:"shipkg:case:1f8ffc7c55c3",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:775549e4c085",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及后果",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:31dfd344abe4c50d",`case_id`:"pride_can_cpp_2014",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:45f3ae7b802f6792",`source_file`:"MAIB_2015_22_Pride_of_Canterbury_CPP_hydraulic_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/563092daed915d566d000002/MAIBInvReport-22_2015.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"he accident as a basis for making recommendations to prevent similar accidents occurring in the future. 2.2 CAUSE OF THE FIRE The fire was initiated following the spray of hydraulic oil, from a ruptured pipework joint in the starboard CPP system, onto the hot exhaust uptakes of the starboard main engines. The flanged joint ruptured because the CPP system became over- pressurised as a result of t",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及后果\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:3540543d2a826525",`source`:"shipkg:case:187dc871fbd5",`target`:"shipkg:fault:d005e46c6652",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:3540543d2a826525",`case_id`:"spirit_of_discovery_pods_2023",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:bcc74e57d3088cc6",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_06_Spirit_of_Discovery_propulsion_loss.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/loss-of-propulsion-in-heavy-weather-experienced-by-the-passenger-vessel-spirit-of-discovery-leading-to-over-100-injuries-and-one-fatality",`page`:"42",`locator`:"PDF page 42",`quote`:"eed trips been the only issue. However, with the WLS sequence request active on both pods, when the propulsion motors tripped the pods automatically parked at 90° to Spirit of Discovery‘s heading and the vessel quickly lost speed and steerage. This left the bridge team doing their best to control the vessel’s heading using its bow thrusters. As a result, Spirit of Discovery’s bow was quick",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:354679b4a77737e2",`source`:"shipkg:case:597875e258c6",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:35c015f940ee",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及后果",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:354679b4a77737e2",`case_id`:"sd2016_05_cpp_backup",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:d11a787d7d142f9d",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"19",`locator`:"PDF page 19",`quote`:"a speed of about 7 knots and made heavy contact with the concrete berth (Figure 3). Almost immediately, bilge alarms, indicating water ingress into the vessel’s forward spaces, began to sound. The pitch on both propellers was brought to zero but the main engines were kept running. The bridge team made safety announcements to the passengers, alerted the port authorities and requested tug assistance. The",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及后果\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:372f4d4cfd3bf6cd",`source`:"shipkg:case:278d7572ef08",`target`:"shipkg:check:fa162d9e9a3f",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及检查方法",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:372f4d4cfd3bf6cd",`case_id`:"wight_sky_me4_2018",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:c74257f47f29e86a",`source_file`:"MAIB_2022_04_Wight_Sky_multiple_engine_failures.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6267cc85e90e071690c1b679/2022-4-WightSky-Report.pdf",`page`:"72",`locator`:"PDF page 72",`quote`:"ble to determine why the technician made such a basic error. However, the engine manufacturer’s investigation identified that the serial numbers on the connecting rods and caps were not routinely checked to ensure that they matched following assembly. To mitigate the risk of similar errors, Volvo Penta introduced an improved method of identifying and matching the connecting rods into its production process. 2.4 OTHER WIGHT CLASS",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及检查方法\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:39d6a1b7977bb326",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:ce7933999459",`target`:"shipkg:fault:2c6822dc16f4",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:39d6a1b7977bb326",`case_id`:"knowledge:liner_scuffing",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:5fd90f16f36a665e",`source_file`:"MAN_SL2016_633_piston_rings_scuffing.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.man-es.com/docs/default-source/service-letters/sl2016-633.pdf",`page`:"2",`locator`:"PDF page 2",`quote`:"l film. When the oil film is compromised, the cast iron piston rings, which are in contact with the cast iron liner, may generate high friction and seizures that will not recover (liner scuffing). During scuffing, the surface of the liner is hardened and will need machining to recover before new rings can be run in. Cermet is a composite, part-ceramic, part-metal material. It combines the best properties of a ceramic, i.e",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:3a5f384db1585024",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:84e503bec36b",`target`:"shipkg:condition:1500802ee98b",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:3a5f384db1585024",`case_id`:"knowledge:shaft_torsional",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:5cf0da035bedd926",`source_file`:"STAMFORD_AGN035_fault_protection.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.stamford-avk.com/sites/stamfordavk/files/AGNs/AGN-035_B-Overload-and-Fault-Protection.pdf",`page`:"5",`locator`:"PDF page 5",`quote`:"ic energy, identified by electrical engineers as inertia constant (H). Obviously, the coupling will be subjected to some level of transient peak torque demand during the time zero up to steady state condition and the 'typical' level considered by responsible mechanical engineers is 12 times rated torque. It should not be forgotten that the most arduous conditions for generating mechani",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:3aa989245b5650ef",`source`:"shipkg:case:9792cd36162e",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:775549e4c085",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及后果",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:3aa989245b5650ef",`case_id`:"windcat8_port_engine_2017",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:f55562c55772b4c1",`source_file`:"MAIB_2018_01_Windcat8_bearing_failure_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/683922/MAIBInvReport01_2018.pdf",`page`:"11",`locator`:"PDF page 11",`quote`:"lure warranted a more cautious approach to the use of the engine until a deeper technical investigation could be conducted. • The fire resulted from the ignition of oil vapour released from the damaged crankcase and did not spread beyond the port engine. • The fixed fire-fighting system was rendered ineffective because not all the port engine space vents were closed prior to its release. • The safety of the embarked technicians was given",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及后果\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:3b9ad0d4ceb80585",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:f8ea1aa17718",`target`:"shipkg:fault:6e677eff9bb9",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:3b9ad0d4ceb80585",`case_id`:"knowledge:cooling_cavitation",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:cac3b1da7944aa5a",`source_file`:"MAN_main_engine_auxiliary_efficiency.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.man-es.com/docs/default-source/document-sync/efficiency-improvements-main-engine-auxiliary-systems-eng.pdf",`page`:"11",`locator`:"PDF page 11",`quote`:"higher humidity level in the combustion chamber, which will have a negative effect on the general cylinder condition and thereby increase cylinder wear. – Increased scavenge air temperature which will lead to increased fuel oil consumption. – A flow which is too low may cause local boiling on the water side inside the scavenge air cooler, which may lead to cavitation in the cool",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:3da61367b2966ed4",`source`:"shipkg:case:213f8edb92c2",`target`:"shipkg:fault:73da5c52ce5d",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:3da61367b2966ed4",`case_id`:"queen_mary2_hf_2010",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:a0ea937863e1a2df",`source_file`:"MAIB_2011_28_Queen_Mary_2_harmonic_filter_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/547c6fa6ed915d4c10000031/QM2Report.pdf",`page`:"13",`locator`:"PDF page 13",`quote`:"om and the other in the aft main switchboard room. The explosion was triggered by deterioration in the capacitors in the aft HF . Internal arcing between the capacitor plates developed, which vaporised the dielectric medium causing the internal pressure to increase, until it caused the capacitor casing to rupture. Dielectric fluid vapour sprayed out, igniting and creating the likely conditions for an arc-flash",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:3e0b4b995a0fefd9",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:ce7933999459",`target`:"shipkg:fault:0134b2c4ef20",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:3e0b4b995a0fefd9",`case_id`:"knowledge:liner_scuffing",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:2caee49788bf31ab",`source_file`:"MAN_SL2019_685_ring_coating_wear.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.man-es.com/docs/default-source/service-letters/sl2019-685.pdf",`page`:"2",`locator`:"PDF page 2",`quote`:"ng, and so forth. The wear of the cermet coating can to some extent be assessed by analysis of drain oil samples. If these have a high iron content, the piston rings and the liners are worn correspondingly. Figure 2: Examples of piston ring packs with cermet coating Alu coating CL-groove Double S-lock Cermet High ring High ring High ring Alu coating CL-groove Double S-lock C",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:4079815458cd42f4",`source`:"shipkg:case:278d7572ef08",`target`:"shipkg:fault:9b76a4f68834",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:4079815458cd42f4",`case_id`:"wight_sky_me4_2018",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:1218b476bea8d173",`source_file`:"MAIB_2022_04_Wight_Sky_multiple_engine_failures.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6267cc85e90e071690c1b679/2022-4-WightSky-Report.pdf",`page`:"84",`locator`:"PDF page 84",`quote`:"ng caps reduced the metal-to-metal contact between surfaces of the connecting rods and their bearing caps. This would have caused fretting wear between the mating faces, which would have led to loosening and rapid failure of the end cap securing bolts. [2.3.2] 5. Four of the five catastrophic engine failures discussed in detail in this report failed suddenly because of a loss of lubrication supply to the engines’ crankshaft journal bearings and cr",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:407989b69ef9c36d",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:660e09f63773",`target`:"shipkg:fault:1ff35faef80c",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:407989b69ef9c36d",`case_id`:"knowledge:coolant_blockage",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:4cdcbf4e0a149c7e",`source_file`:"MAN_SL2016_623_cooling_water.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.man-es.com/docs/default-source/service-letters/sl2016-623.pdf",`page`:"2",`locator`:"PDF page 2",`quote`:"t in thermal overload of the components to be cooled by the engine cooling water. A thermal overload may, however, also result in cracks and leakages as seen in the exhaust valve seat ring. Insufficient cooling water flow has widespread consequenc - es, in many cases this will influence the combustion process as well and therefore the overall performance and safety of Fig. 1:",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:419343fd4e4b08fa",`source`:"shipkg:case:597875e258c6",`target`:"shipkg:condition:290bfe38530e",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:419343fd4e4b08fa",`case_id`:"sd2016_05_cpp_backup",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:2d8d8f05ec0d8390",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"21",`locator`:"PDF page 21",`quote`:"tective covers over safety- critical buttons, switches and knobs. 2. The master was confident that he had control of his CPPs and did not look at the pitch indicators located on the control consoles. Had he done so he would have realised the starboard CPP was not responding to his orders. 3. The ship’s engineers recognised that something was untoward well before the master had committed to his",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:4329884f77eb369a",`source`:"shipkg:case:00057f56fe39",`target`:"shipkg:action:752d3ce3e403",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及运维措施",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:4329884f77eb369a",`case_id`:"wight_sky_me_2017",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:c2745665875d9964",`source_file`:"MAIB_2018_14_Wight_Sky_engine_bearing_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5b5217c7ed915d0b81e003df/MAIBInvReport14_2018.pdf",`page`:"14",`locator`:"PDF page 14",`quote`:"the shells of main bearing 5 turned, the lubrication supply to big end bearing 4 was blocked, resulting in destructive failure. • Rebuilding the engine in a clean and controlled environment and transferring it complete into the engine room would have reduced the likelihood of debris ingress. • The engine was not fitted with a wear detector, so there was no means of receiving a warning before the engine failed. • The",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及运维措施\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:4387396797703972",`source`:"shipkg:case:ffc594a9fab7",`target`:"shipkg:fault:b7f3d0b1bf24",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:4387396797703972",`case_id`:"sd2013_12_oily_rag",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:c6b798ec4934dc08",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"41",`locator`:"PDF page 41",`quote`:"iling checks, he wiped the engine sump dipstick on a rag, which he casually left on a tank top above the engine exhaust manifold. Vibration caused the oil-soaked rag to fall onto the hot manifold and catch fire. The small fire then ignited the engine high temperature alarm cabling loom, causing it to short circuit and set off the alarm in the wheelhouse (Figure 2). The functional fire and smoke alarm",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:47065ca9543bdbba",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:12275851bbd1",`target`:"shipkg:fault:675217222811",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:47065ca9543bdbba",`case_id`:"knowledge:coupling_failure",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:2cdda8701b9f350e",`source_file`:"MAIB_2017_20_Hebrides_CPP_coupling.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/59b7ab1c40f0b61231e71a54/MAIBInvReport20_2017.pdf",`page`:"30",`locator`:"PDF page 30",`quote`:"CONTROL FAILURE MECHANISM It is evident from the inspection carried out by Hebrides’s engineers shortly after the accident, that control of the ferry’s port CPP was lost due to a mechanical failure within the linear servomotor actuator sited on the port gearbox (Figure 6). The setscrew used to secure one half of the jaw coupling to the stepper motor ‘D’ shaped shaft had backed off from the shaft’",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:48373db8b29a2bfe",`source`:"shipkg:case:9676bd22b5e5",`target`:"shipkg:fault:4865d7c855d8",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:48373db8b29a2bfe",`case_id`:"sd2013_05_missing_filter",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:76540dbe3ce4a2dc",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"21",`locator`:"PDF page 21",`quote`:"engine was allowed to cool, the crankcase doors were removed; several crankshaft bearings were severely damaged (Figure 1) which prevented the engine from further operation. The vessel was towed to the nearest available port for further assessment. Subsequent investigation by the engine manufacturer determined that the damage included: the failure of all crankshaft main and crankpin bearings; the di",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:48e40c5d0538a595",`source`:"shipkg:case:9676bd22b5e5",`target`:"shipkg:check:02ead897029b",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及检查方法",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:48e40c5d0538a595",`case_id`:"sd2013_05_missing_filter",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:b10e854dd960072c",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"21",`locator`:"PDF page 21",`quote`:"ate without any problems and the vessel undertook several voyages. However, after the engine failure, the duplex filter was found without a filter cartridge in the on-line filter chamber, and the engine lubricating oil system was contaminated. The contamination caused main bearing seizure, the rotation of bearing shells and the blockage of oil ways, and subsequent oil starvation and",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及检查方法\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:4ad4724fd72c9dac",`source`:"shipkg:case:551512d967af",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:c5047807b300",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及后果",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:4ad4724fd72c9dac",`case_id`:"sd2013_02_control_air",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:16e773b397fb6388",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"15",`locator`:"PDF page 15",`quote`:"ge the clutches. Although the starboard anchor was let go in an attempt to reduce the speed of approach, this did not prevent the ferry’s bow hitting her berth at a speed of 2.5kts and causing minor damage. Shortly after the impact, the engineers successfully re-engaged the port main engine clutch and the vessel was able to berth safely alongside, assisted by harbour tugs. Subsequent in",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及后果\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:4bc0d6c9bab364b8",`source`:"shipkg:case:63aa8b018e0d",`target`:"shipkg:action:4578c5b2c727",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及运维措施",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:4bc0d6c9bab364b8",`case_id`:"stena_europe_fuel_2023",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:1ba466d574203869",`source_file`:"MAIB_2024_20_Stena_Europe_fuel_spray_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6756db0ba63e1781efb87793/2024-20-StenaEurope.pdf",`page`:"31",`locator`:"PDF page 31",`quote`:"s for the purpose of regular hot spot monitoring and detection in machinery spaces. ● Modified the external fuel piping on ME3 to incorporate four-screw flanges. ● Repaired or replaced the shielding and lagging around the external fuel systems and hot surfaces and fitted anti-splashing tape to all joints on the low-pressure fuel systems on all of Stena Europe’s operational engines. ● On",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及运维措施\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:4c53bfc05ebec355",`source`:"shipkg:case:213f8edb92c2",`target`:"shipkg:condition:f61e4eef7cce",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:4c53bfc05ebec355",`case_id`:"queen_mary2_hf_2010",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:1caa6757e63a8feb",`source_file`:"MAIB_2011_28_Queen_Mary_2_harmonic_filter_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/547c6fa6ed915d4c10000031/QM2Report.pdf",`page`:"62",`locator`:"PDF page 62",`quote`:"ed lifetime of 20 years due to the operating conditions being harsher than expected. The initial degradation of the capacitor was likely to have been caused by one or both of the following: • being subjected to voltages in excess of their design rating • being exposed to frequent voltage transients due to increased number of switching cycles Failure initiation due to minor manufacturing anomalies s",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:4ee4a7ac66de8329",`source`:"shipkg:case:9676bd22b5e5",`target`:"shipkg:fault:401ffd7724bc",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:4ee4a7ac66de8329",`case_id`:"sd2013_05_missing_filter",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:0fb80ad604213aad",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"21",`locator`:"PDF page 21",`quote`:"was contaminated. The contamination caused main bearing seizure, the rotation of bearing shells and the blockage of oil ways, and subsequent oil starvation and overheating to other bearings and to the pistons. The engine daily logs referred to oil filter cartridge changes only prior to the repair to the oil pumps. They also showed that the pressure reading on the differential pressure gauge for the",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:4f0f4202cd5f432d",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:bff048b48ff1",`target`:"shipkg:action:feb3b27e10a6",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及运维措施",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:4f0f4202cd5f432d",`case_id`:"knowledge:generator_bearing_wear",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:e409b2a83322445c",`source_file`:"STAMFORD_AGN039_marine_shaft_generators.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.stamford-avk.com/sites/stamfordavk/files/AGNs/AGN-039_C-Marine-Shaft-Generators.pdf",`page`:"2",`locator`:"PDF page 2",`quote`:"at many different speeds and for much of this time unexcited, the ships maintenance schedule should include clear guidance about bearing regreasing instructions. It is recommended that the shaft generator is fitted with re- greasable bearings, which should be specified at time of order. When the shaft generator is aligned with the gearbox drive shaft, the ships design engineer must take",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及运维措施\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:508dce207c93fa46",`source`:"shipkg:case:7a1c0165bb56",`target`:"shipkg:action:fa72ffe2b82b",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及运维措施",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:508dce207c93fa46",`case_id`:"sd2016_08_generator_oil",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:05847d350f09dacc",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"26",`locator`:"PDF page 26",`quote`:"eak oil that had been sprayed on the exhaust casing of the adjacent engine caught fire. Fortunately the crew were able to quickly identify and isolate the source of the leak and extinguish the fire before it was able to spread. No one was hurt in the incident. Subsequent investigation revealed that: • The oil had come from a loose plug on the generator’s engine-mounted lubricating oil pump (Figure 2a",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及运维措施\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:52613af2df3efb73",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:660e09f63773",`target`:"shipkg:check:e53578d74732",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及检查方法",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:52613af2df3efb73",`case_id`:"knowledge:coolant_blockage",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:9282652d0f980004",`source_file`:"MAN_SL2016_623_cooling_water.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.man-es.com/docs/default-source/service-letters/sl2016-623.pdf",`page`:"3",`locator`:"PDF page 3",`quote`:"ontent ≤50 mg/l ≤50 mg/l 2) Fig. 3: Rust and limescale blocks the cooling water bores (valve seat removed from cylinder head) The quality of the freshwater must be checked using the MAN Diesel & Turbo water testing kit or a similar test kit pro - vided by the manufacturer. The requirements to freshwater quality are stated in Table 1. Treatment and periodical checks of the cooling water W hen distil",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及检查方法\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:54dee65c4e08657c",`source`:"shipkg:case:537a034e93e3",`target`:"shipkg:condition:7da9174934f9",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:54dee65c4e08657c",`case_id`:"sd2013_03_turning_gear",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:85dce6df90ffbd20",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"16",`locator`:"PDF page 16",`quote`:"turning gear control lever with the intention of disengaging the turning gear from the main engine flywheel. The turning gear was not marked in any way to show whether it was engaged or disengaged, and the operating instructions that were posted nearby had been painted over. The engineer then went to the machinery control room to start the engine. Although the indicator for the turning gear, which was sited on the control",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:55324e3c0f114933",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:f8ea1aa17718",`target`:"shipkg:fault:0ad9453d012b",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:55324e3c0f114933",`case_id`:"knowledge:cooling_cavitation",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:fbe07737c9447c24",`source_file`:"MAN_main_engine_auxiliary_efficiency.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.man-es.com/docs/default-source/document-sync/efficiency-improvements-main-engine-auxiliary-systems-eng.pdf",`page`:"11",`locator`:"PDF page 11",`quote`:"d fuel oil consumption. – A flow which is too low may cause local boiling on the water side inside the scavenge air cooler, which may lead to cavitation in the cooling water pipes. – The stated max. scavenge air temperature values given in the technical file may be exceeded, and the engine may thereby not fulfil the Tier II NO X requirements. On this basis, a system has to be established that maintains a c",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:58ca32aa7dc4793b",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:6456485708ad",`target`:"shipkg:condition:37396a158a92",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:58ca32aa7dc4793b",`case_id`:"knowledge:shaft_generator_alignment",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:46c70849c9c28abc",`source_file`:"STAMFORD_AGN039_marine_shaft_generators.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.stamford-avk.com/sites/stamfordavk/files/AGNs/AGN-039_C-Marine-Shaft-Generators.pdf",`page`:"2",`locator`:"PDF page 2",`quote`:"When the shaft generator is aligned with the gearbox drive shaft, the ships design engineer must take great care to allow for the thermal expansion of the hot gearbox, which may well expand and lift the shaft centre line by < 1 mm. If the alignment is not accurate, then excessive vibration is likely to damage the shaft generator. There can also be lots of generator damaging vibration when the",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:5977da23d9b25eaa",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:796439daaa03",`target`:"shipkg:condition:50dc70737e5d",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:5977da23d9b25eaa",`case_id`:"knowledge:electrical_oscillation",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:17d803145e66029c",`source_file`:"Frontiers_2021_marine_converter_oscillations.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.frontiersin.org/journals/energy-research/articles/10.3389/fenrg.2020.529756/pdf",`page`:"6",`locator`:"PDF page 6",`quote`:"otational speed of the prime mover is still present adding to the severity of ﬂuctuations due to waves. As a result, the depth of voltage and frequency modulations increase as well. For the presented example, the difference between maximum and minimum instantaneous frequency reaches 0.32 Hz or 0.32% of twice the system rated frequency. This is still below the recommended limit value of 0.5% ( IEEE Standard 4",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:5a2e7fc343b02236",`source`:"shipkg:case:9676bd22b5e5",`target`:"shipkg:fault:ce4fe75e21d8",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:5a2e7fc343b02236",`case_id`:"sd2013_05_missing_filter",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:f82c24711a999936",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"21",`locator`:"PDF page 21",`quote`:"r was found without a filter cartridge in the on-line filter chamber, and the engine lubricating oil system was contaminated. The contamination caused main bearing seizure, the rotation of bearing shells and the blockage of oil ways, and subsequent oil starvation and overheating to other bearings and to the pistons. The engine daily logs referred to oil filter cartridge changes only prior to the re",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:5a9102d3a07c1238",`source`:"shipkg:case:1f8ffc7c55c3",`target`:"shipkg:condition:ff505693e52e",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:5a9102d3a07c1238",`case_id`:"pride_can_cpp_2014",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:c2f0061fd7fa1953",`source_file`:"MAIB_2015_22_Pride_of_Canterbury_CPP_hydraulic_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/563092daed915d566d000002/MAIBInvReport-22_2015.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"ation of the CPP system as it maintained the overall system pressure. When this component failed to operate correctly, there were no means within the system to effectively relieve excess pressure. In addition, pressure safety valve (PSV1), which enabled pressure to be dissipated into the return line, was set to operate at 145 bar. This was significantly higher than the pressure at which some parts of the system were able",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:5b6b187f0b5cd4b8",`source`:"shipkg:case:ad49b658b30b",`target`:"shipkg:action:fa948d692647",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及运维措施",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:5b6b187f0b5cd4b8",`case_id`:"sd2016_14_sea_valve",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:7331136605690ccd",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"40",`locator`:"PDF page 40",`quote`:"sing water level, which was now above the bottom plates. Worried about potential damage to machinery, he left the bilge system to stop the generator and main engine, and sent the motorman to the bridge to tell the master that the engine room was flooding. With the water level continuing to rise, the chief engineer evacuated the engine room, leaving open the watertight door between the engine",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及运维措施\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:5c0d926482f44a39",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:ce7933999459",`target`:"shipkg:symptom:f944832200f3",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及症状",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:5c0d926482f44a39",`case_id`:"knowledge:liner_scuffing",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:2caee49788bf31ab",`source_file`:"MAN_SL2019_685_ring_coating_wear.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.man-es.com/docs/default-source/service-letters/sl2019-685.pdf",`page`:"2",`locator`:"PDF page 2",`quote`:"ng, and so forth. The wear of the cermet coating can to some extent be assessed by analysis of drain oil samples. If these have a high iron content, the piston rings and the liners are worn correspondingly. Figure 2: Examples of piston ring packs with cermet coating Alu coating CL-groove Double S-lock Cermet High ring High ring High ring Alu coating CL-groove Double S-lock C",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及症状\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:5cd100dfe147469c",`source`:"shipkg:case:7a1c0165bb56",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:775549e4c085",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及后果",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:5cd100dfe147469c",`case_id`:"sd2016_08_generator_oil",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:2937d3b0bfe9d29f",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"26",`locator`:"PDF page 26",`quote`:"was spraying on to the adjacent generator. While they were investigating the source of the leak oil that had been sprayed on the exhaust casing of the adjacent engine caught fire. Fortunately the crew were able to quickly identify and isolate the source of the leak and extinguish the fire before it was able to spread. No one was hurt in the incident. Subsequent investigation revealed that: • The oil had c",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及后果\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:5cf486a771805663",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:12275851bbd1",`target`:"shipkg:fault:7c36cc5888d4",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:5cf486a771805663",`case_id`:"knowledge:coupling_failure",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:d3e64cd30311c1bb",`source_file`:"MAIB_2017_20_Hebrides_CPP_coupling.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/59b7ab1c40f0b61231e71a54/MAIBInvReport20_2017.pdf",`page`:"35",`locator`:"PDF page 35",`quote`:"s caused by the loosening of a setscrew used to attach a coupling to a stepper motor shaft due to its lack of rundown torque, the absence of thread locking fluid, and vibration during the actuator’s operation. [2.2] 3. The absence of service instructions for the actuator’s inspection and maintenance that were available from its manufacturer was pivotal to the failure. [2.3] 4. No thread l",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:5f9cae20edd98540",`source`:"shipkg:case:187dc871fbd5",`target`:"shipkg:condition:0a605c97371c",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:5f9cae20edd98540",`case_id`:"spirit_of_discovery_pods_2023",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:9d2abeeb05ea44b5",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_06_Spirit_of_Discovery_propulsion_loss.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/loss-of-propulsion-in-heavy-weather-experienced-by-the-passenger-vessel-spirit-of-discovery-leading-to-over-100-injuries-and-one-fatality",`page`:"42",`locator`:"PDF page 42",`quote`:"parked at 90° to the vessel’s heading. Given the weather conditions at the time, it is almost certain that Spirit of Discovery’s pitching caused the propellers to come out of the water. This caused a sudden reduction in torque on the propulsion motor and led to a very rapid increase in the motors’ rpm. The engine alarm and monitoring system recorded that, immediately before their shutdown, the rpm of each pod’s",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:5ffce834e8f66d51",`source`:"shipkg:case:213f8edb92c2",`target`:"shipkg:condition:2d0261049d78",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:5ffce834e8f66d51",`case_id`:"queen_mary2_hf_2010",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:2bd29efb1b18cf94",`source_file`:"MAIB_2011_28_Queen_Mary_2_harmonic_filter_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/547c6fa6ed915d4c10000031/QM2Report.pdf",`page`:"13",`locator`:"PDF page 13",`quote`:"was not chosen at build. However, it is considered most likely that the disruption within the aft HF at the time of the accident caused general instability in the electrical network which could not be contained and led to the generators shutting down. Lloyd’s Register (Europe, Middle East and Asia) (LR) has been recommended to take forward proposals to the International Association of Classification Societie",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:6004491261f8dd90",`source`:"shipkg:case:9792cd36162e",`target`:"shipkg:condition:7a0e4d2405ef",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:6004491261f8dd90",`case_id`:"windcat8_port_engine_2017",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:e678a8a1bb3f1aec",`source_file`:"MAIB_2018_01_Windcat8_bearing_failure_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/683922/MAIBInvReport01_2018.pdf",`page`:"11",`locator`:"PDF page 11",`quote`:"ire resulted from the ignition of oil vapour released from the damaged crankcase and did not spread beyond the port engine. • The fixed fire-fighting system was rendered ineffective because not all the port engine space vents were closed prior to its release. • The safety of the embarked technicians was given a high priority. ACTION TAKEN Windcat Workboats BV Ltd has: • Instructed crews on board vessels fitted with Volvo Penta D16 engines to stop the affected eng",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}}] AS row MATCH (a:ShipKG {id:row.source}), (b:ShipKG {id:row.target}) MERGE (a)-[r:INVOLVES {id:row.id}]->(b) SET r += row.properties RETURN count(r) AS processed_17 }
CALL () { UNWIND [{`id`:"edge:60450c763db70e7c",`source`:"shipkg:case:9792cd36162e",`target`:"shipkg:action:4a27034a0842",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及运维措施",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:60450c763db70e7c",`case_id`:"windcat8_port_engine_2017",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:a14d5a0a3ae37d97",`source_file`:"MAIB_2018_01_Windcat8_bearing_failure_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/683922/MAIBInvReport01_2018.pdf",`page`:"11",`locator`:"PDF page 11",`quote`:"h priority. ACTION TAKEN Windcat Workboats BV Ltd has: • Instructed crews on board vessels fitted with Volvo Penta D16 engines to stop the affected engine when a high oil temperature alarm activates, and not to restart the engine until the reason for the alarm has been determined. • Identified lessons to be learned from the accident and emergency response that will be highlighted in future crew training. • Programmed additio",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及运维措施\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:60b43025dcf3cc94",`source`:"shipkg:case:551512d967af",`target`:"shipkg:symptom:13f0f30403ca",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及症状",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:60b43025dcf3cc94",`case_id`:"sd2013_02_control_air",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:9fa6115be15d0d77",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"14",`locator`:"PDF page 14",`quote`:"ntre main engine was started and all three main engines were put on standby in preparation for entering port. During this period, multiple alarms sounded in the ECR warning of low control air pressure. In response, two engineers searched the engine room for a possible air leak. The senior engineer in the ECR telephoned the bridge and informed the OOW that there was a problem with the compressed air supply and that there was a",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及症状\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:60e080a3ec2c5c94",`source`:"shipkg:case:213f8edb92c2",`target`:"shipkg:fault:7d56f05dfb4b",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:60e080a3ec2c5c94",`case_id`:"queen_mary2_hf_2010",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:f4ea99f2d07cb7c1",`source_file`:"MAIB_2011_28_Queen_Mary_2_harmonic_filter_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/547c6fa6ed915d4c10000031/QM2Report.pdf",`page`:"13",`locator`:"PDF page 13",`quote`:"en Mary 2 (QM2) was approaching Barcelona, an explosion occurred in the vessel’s aft main switchboard room. Within a few seconds, all four propulsion motors shut down, and the vessel blacked out shortly afterwards. Fortunately, the vessel was clear of navigational hazards and drifted in open sea. The emergency generator started automatically and provided essential supplies to the vessel, and i",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:630031f30cf9312a",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:40cb53a64e31",`target`:"shipkg:condition:5cabdd7ce44c",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:630031f30cf9312a",`case_id`:"knowledge:winding_insulation",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:454c2c34e07b2395",`source_file`:"STAMFORD_AGN035_fault_protection.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.stamford-avk.com/sites/stamfordavk/files/AGNs/AGN-035_B-Overload-and-Fault-Protection.pdf",`page`:"2",`locator`:"PDF page 2",`quote`:"e within the graphically displayed current against time, in order to avoid initiating permanent damage, which would result in the thermal degradation of the alternator’s insulation system. The disconnect times are achieved by the engineer responsible for selecting a circuit breaker, which has the appropriate adjustable tripping characteristics that can be set to ensure complia",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:631fd40455f0979a",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:12275851bbd1",`target`:"shipkg:cause:9b5341f924b9",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及原因",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:631fd40455f0979a",`case_id`:"knowledge:coupling_failure",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:d3e64cd30311c1bb",`source_file`:"MAIB_2017_20_Hebrides_CPP_coupling.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/59b7ab1c40f0b61231e71a54/MAIBInvReport20_2017.pdf",`page`:"35",`locator`:"PDF page 35",`quote`:"s caused by the loosening of a setscrew used to attach a coupling to a stepper motor shaft due to its lack of rundown torque, the absence of thread locking fluid, and vibration during the actuator’s operation. [2.2] 3. The absence of service instructions for the actuator’s inspection and maintenance that were available from its manufacturer was pivotal to the failure. [2.3] 4. No thread l",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及原因\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:63290134edaabcd8",`source`:"shipkg:case:d6e9f8f8ade2",`target`:"shipkg:fault:4e2929b80b35",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:63290134edaabcd8",`case_id`:"finlandia_seaways_me_2018",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:ed4a18d326cb49be",`source_file`:"MAIB_2021_02_Finlandia_Seaways_connecting_rod_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/engine-failure-and-subsequent-fire-on-ro-ro-cargo-vessel-finlandia-seaways-with-1-person-injured",`page`:"9",`locator`:"PDF page 9",`quote`:"used to replace the connecting rod small end piston pin bearing bushes by the vessel manager’s maintenance support contractor had introduced stress raisers that signficantly increased the likelihood of crack initiation and fatigue failure. Other factors that contributed to the engine failure included: standards of maintenance management; lack of appreciation of the importance of following the engine manufacturer’s instructions for the removal and refitting of the",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:638158499a61e934",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:3353dce7f4ad",`target`:"shipkg:check:cf70a74f2d91",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及检查方法",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:638158499a61e934",`case_id`:"knowledge:bearing_seizure",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:561c84866e09149d",`source_file`:"MAN_SL2013_569_bearing_wear_monitoring.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.man-es.com/docs/default-source/service-letters/sl2013-569.pdf",`page`:"4",`locator`:"PDF page 4",`quote`:"2013-569/HWC Bearing Wear Monitoring. Page 4 of 4 Encl. 2a of 2 Bearing Wear Monitoring Procedures for Checking for Update Status Ability to detect rapidly developing bearing damage Kongsberg Maritime The ability to detect rapid wear can be checked in the fol - lowing manner: From the Navigator panel “Bearing wear” is selected. If a screen named “Rapid wear” appears, the system is ca- pable of early detectio",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及检查方法\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:63f50ee6c2328b58",`source`:"shipkg:case:278d7572ef08",`target`:"shipkg:fault:fee4df6aeb24",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:63f50ee6c2328b58",`case_id`:"wight_sky_me4_2018",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:3ca79df2a0332a1a",`source_file`:"MAIB_2022_04_Wight_Sky_multiple_engine_failures.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6267cc85e90e071690c1b679/2022-4-WightSky-Report.pdf",`page`:"84",`locator`:"PDF page 84",`quote`:"igh levels of vibration, and contaminated lubricating oil might all have contributed to the event failure. [2.3.1] 3. Wight Sky’s ME4 failed catastrophically because of an assembly error during build at Volvo Penta’s factory in Sweden. Two of the engine’s matched connecting rod big end bearing caps had been transposed during the engine assembly process. [2.3.2] 4. The transposition of the bearing caps reduced the",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:6419fdcefc2e3875",`source`:"shipkg:case:9676bd22b5e5",`target`:"shipkg:condition:32eb7154ffd7",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:6419fdcefc2e3875",`case_id`:"sd2013_05_missing_filter",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:7d233ab71e7cf2a1",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"21",`locator`:"PDF page 21",`quote`:"engine appeared to operate without any problems and the vessel undertook several voyages. However, after the engine failure, the duplex filter was found without a filter cartridge in the on-line filter chamber, and the engine lubricating oil system was contaminated. The contamination caused main bearing seizure, the rotation of bearing shells and the blockage of oil ways, and subsequent oil starvation and",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:6496872e1022a1e2",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:12275851bbd1",`target`:"shipkg:action:2cd7b4f4bdb0",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及运维措施",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:6496872e1022a1e2",`case_id`:"knowledge:coupling_failure",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:de520bd4ed098df8",`source_file`:"MAIB_2017_20_Hebrides_CPP_coupling.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/59b7ab1c40f0b61231e71a54/MAIBInvReport20_2017.pdf",`page`:"36",`locator`:"PDF page 36",`quote`:"sion control systems regarding the inspection and integrity of the jaw coupling within the linear servomotor actuator. ● Issued a service procedure for the linear servomotor based on OEM requirements. CalMac Ferries Ltd h as: ● Issued a technical bulletin to its major vessels that requires all propulsion controls, including emergency controls, at all stations are tested regularly. ● Conducted its own",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及运维措施\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:64c00d1e6c14aab4",`source`:"shipkg:case:213f8edb92c2",`target`:"shipkg:condition:4a944c6dd633",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:64c00d1e6c14aab4",`case_id`:"queen_mary2_hf_2010",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:d82fabc2bbd1fcf1",`source_file`:"MAIB_2011_28_Queen_Mary_2_harmonic_filter_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/547c6fa6ed915d4c10000031/QM2Report.pdf",`page`:"13",`locator`:"PDF page 13",`quote`:"e the aft HF from the electrical network. It was not possible to determine the exact cause of the subsequent blackout because the option for storing historical data concerning blackouts was not chosen at build. However, it is considered most likely that the disruption within the aft HF at the time of the accident caused general instability in the electrical network which could not be contained and led to the generators shuttin",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:651a2c88e2a183f7",`source`:"shipkg:case:213f8edb92c2",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:d1c468a6b34b",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及后果",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:651a2c88e2a183f7",`case_id`:"queen_mary2_hf_2010",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:c1d3874bb4a2345c",`source_file`:"MAIB_2011_28_Queen_Mary_2_harmonic_filter_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/547c6fa6ed915d4c10000031/QM2Report.pdf",`page`:"13",`locator`:"PDF page 13",`quote`:"room. Within a few seconds, all four propulsion motors shut down, and the vessel blacked out shortly afterwards. Fortunately, the vessel was clear of navigational hazards and drifted in open sea. The emergency generator started automatically and provided essential supplies to the vessel, and it wa s qu ickly es tablished th at th e ex plosion ha d ta ken pl ace in th e af t ha rmonic filter (HF) room, situated within the",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及后果\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:659bbf10be517468",`source`:"shipkg:case:187dc871fbd5",`target`:"shipkg:fault:c9a34bd46532",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:659bbf10be517468",`case_id`:"spirit_of_discovery_pods_2023",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:b6540313ab8acd21",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_06_Spirit_of_Discovery_propulsion_loss.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/loss-of-propulsion-in-heavy-weather-experienced-by-the-passenger-vessel-spirit-of-discovery-leading-to-over-100-injuries-and-one-fatality",`page`:"42",`locator`:"PDF page 42",`quote`:"conditions at the time, it is almost certain that Spirit of Discovery’s pitching caused the propellers to come out of the water. This caused a sudden reduction in torque on the propulsion motor and led to a very rapid increase in the motors’ rpm. The engine alarm and monitoring system recorded that, immediately before their shutdown, the rpm of each pod’s propulsion motor very rapidly increased and exceeded the preset o",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:669531f0d11140ad",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:f8ea1aa17718",`target`:"shipkg:condition:0abf74811b34",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:669531f0d11140ad",`case_id`:"knowledge:cooling_cavitation",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:2d4645410e75d447",`source_file`:"MAN_main_engine_auxiliary_efficiency.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.man-es.com/docs/default-source/document-sync/efficiency-improvements-main-engine-auxiliary-systems-eng.pdf",`page`:"11",`locator`:"PDF page 11",`quote`:"ion and thereby increase cylinder wear. – Increased scavenge air temperature which will lead to increased fuel oil consumption. – A flow which is too low may cause local boiling on the water side inside the scavenge air cooler, which may lead to cavitation in the cooling water pipes. – The stated max. scavenge air temperature values given in the technical file may be exceeded, and the engine may thereby",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:66f3a7463cabf09f",`source`:"shipkg:case:8b13bdb1a5bc",`target`:"shipkg:fault:fce2f501a499",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:66f3a7463cabf09f",`case_id`:"sd2016_09_cpp_response",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:88dffcc589cf9235",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"y to bring the vessel back under control before it struck the quay. It was also revealed during the investigation that the system parameters for astern pitch control had been incorrectly set during the commissioning of the propulsion system when the vessel was delivered from the yard. The Lessons 1. If you are expected to manoeuvre a vessel, you should make every effort to familiarise yourself with the controls at yo",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:689722a468f575a5",`source`:"shipkg:case:213f8edb92c2",`target`:"shipkg:fault:b2aa91be158b",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:689722a468f575a5",`case_id`:"queen_mary2_hf_2010",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:ab39293c5f3260fc",`source_file`:"MAIB_2011_28_Queen_Mary_2_harmonic_filter_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/547c6fa6ed915d4c10000031/QM2Report.pdf",`page`:"64",`locator`:"PDF page 64",`quote`:"ious problems. 2.4.5 Current imbalance detection system The capacitor exploded because the inoperative imbalance detection system could not identify the deterioration of the capacitors. The failure of the imbalance system’s current transformer remained undetected for what could have been several years. It is certain that this system was not working in 2008 when Converteam detected two defective capacitors durin",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:692cd6f5c446cb5f",`source`:"shipkg:case:63aa8b018e0d",`target`:"shipkg:action:4e32ee36eba1",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及运维措施",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:692cd6f5c446cb5f",`case_id`:"stena_europe_fuel_2023",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:a7a96386e16a8f7e",`source_file`:"MAIB_2024_20_Stena_Europe_fuel_spray_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6756db0ba63e1781efb87793/2024-20-StenaEurope.pdf",`page`:"31",`locator`:"PDF page 31",`quote`:"porate four-screw flanges. ● Repaired or replaced the shielding and lagging around the external fuel systems and hot surfaces and fitted anti-splashing tape to all joints on the low-pressure fuel systems on all of Stena Europe’s operational engines. ● On 7 June 2023, engaged a third-party contractor to undertake a SOLAS compliance verification thermographic survey following ME3’s return to service",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及运维措施\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:6a0c01b673ea0882",`source`:"shipkg:case:adf367a46f33",`target`:"shipkg:check:f9cad3df2b98",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及检查方法",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:6a0c01b673ea0882",`case_id`:"wight_sky_me2_2018",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:d8028bdc4d93a0c8",`source_file`:"MAIB_2022_04_Wight_Sky_multiple_engine_failures.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6267cc85e90e071690c1b679/2022-4-WightSky-Report.pdf",`page`:"84",`locator`:"PDF page 84",`quote`:"Opportunities to identify and diagnose engine problems early, and therefore avoid catastrophic failures, were missed because the condition of the engine lubricating oil and coolant was not closely monitored. [2.6.2] [2.6.3] 9. Some aspects of the maintenance work carried out by RKM did not meet the standards set by Volvo Penta and those expected by Wightlink. Assembly errors had been made during overhauls, basic levels of workshop c",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及检查方法\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:6aa3d158fac4fc87",`source`:"shipkg:case:597875e258c6",`target`:"shipkg:fault:c44e6c4545bf",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:6aa3d158fac4fc87",`case_id`:"sd2016_05_cpp_backup",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:a33dab8e3476ce99",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"20",`locator`:"PDF page 20",`quote`:"tarboard CPP back-up control mode was inadvertently selected, the master lost bridge control of that propeller. The starboard CPP continued to thrust at over half ahead throughout the vessel’s approach to the berth and up until its engine was stopped (about 2 hours after the contact). Starboard pitch back-up on/off control button Centre console lamps dimmer control buttons Figure 1: Part of brid",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:6ae54d8a164aef2b",`source`:"shipkg:case:551512d967af",`target`:"shipkg:condition:ed8375f7583f",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:6ae54d8a164aef2b",`case_id`:"sd2013_02_control_air",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:c0ffd1edc9aa8938",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"15",`locator`:"PDF page 15",`quote`:"afely alongside, assisted by harbour tugs. Subsequent investigation identified that No2 compressor had a damaged discharge valve. Neither compressor had been able to keep up with demand.",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:6bb7cda14120b20d",`source`:"shipkg:case:8b13bdb1a5bc",`target`:"shipkg:action:13d66975b925",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及运维措施",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:6bb7cda14120b20d",`case_id`:"sd2016_09_cpp_response",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:9663fdde50e013ce",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"your disposal. The function of back-up controls should be well understood and tested. They can help prevent serious accidents. 2. Regular drills simulating propulsion system failure and recovery should be carried out. These drills will give operators confidence in the back-up systems and help them react effectively in an emergency. 3. Frequent engine response tests should be completed, both ahead and astern. This is part",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及运维措施\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:6c39217d80e284a8",`source`:"shipkg:case:9676bd22b5e5",`target`:"shipkg:fault:58d32c38d0ac",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:6c39217d80e284a8",`case_id`:"sd2013_05_missing_filter",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:7d233ab71e7cf2a1",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"21",`locator`:"PDF page 21",`quote`:"engine appeared to operate without any problems and the vessel undertook several voyages. However, after the engine failure, the duplex filter was found without a filter cartridge in the on-line filter chamber, and the engine lubricating oil system was contaminated. The contamination caused main bearing seizure, the rotation of bearing shells and the blockage of oil ways, and subsequent oil starvation and",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:6c3befd77e6fe6f6",`source`:"shipkg:case:1e6479e108d9",`target`:"shipkg:action:984af3c3d6c8",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及运维措施",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:6c3befd77e6fe6f6",`case_id`:"kommandor_susan_dg1_2025",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:1b6ee0d38c733128",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_10_Kommandor_Susan_generator_bearing_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/catastrophic-engine-failure-and-subsequent-fire-on-board-the-site-investigation-vessel-kommandor-susan",`page`:"6",`locator`:"PDF page 6",`quote`:"edules are only applicable for these parts. Non-Caterpillar parts used in the engine tent to have a shorter service life. [sic] • Check the use of non-Caterpillar bearings in the other engines on the vessel. If so, plan a early change of the main and connecting rod bearings. [sic] Parts approval process The approval process for a ship’s engine parts involved several steps to ensure compliance with safety and performanc",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及运维措施\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:6c4f11ad59c41da3",`source`:"shipkg:case:ad49b658b30b",`target`:"shipkg:fault:15fa82225a89",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:6c4f11ad59c41da3",`case_id`:"sd2016_14_sea_valve",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:951a6820ce2d0fc6",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"40",`locator`:"PDF page 40",`quote`:"alarm, mustering the remaining crew. The seaman rigged the portable electric water pump on the main deck but, with the vessel now running on emergency power only, he was unable to start the pump. The master contacted the coastguard by VHF radio and advised that the vessel was flooding. The coastguard transmitted a “Mayday Relay”, and RNLI lifeboats from two stations were tasked to assist",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:6d2b0bee1d6de6c7",`source`:"shipkg:case:1e6479e108d9",`target`:"shipkg:check:1c503f83ef89",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及检查方法",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:6d2b0bee1d6de6c7",`case_id`:"kommandor_susan_dg1_2025",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:1a0b3fbe432ab46d",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_10_Kommandor_Susan_generator_bearing_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/catastrophic-engine-failure-and-subsequent-fire-on-board-the-site-investigation-vessel-kommandor-susan",`page`:"8",`locator`:"PDF page 8",`quote`:"ting priorities during the vessel’s conversion project, this resulted in Hays Ships providing minimal oversight to Holderness and no verification of authenticity for the parts used, enabling the installation of non- OEM components that later contributed to the engine failure. Similar to the lack of oversight highlighted in both the Finlandia Seaways and Finnmaster cases, the lack of structured supervision a",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及检查方法\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:6d59e335291686df",`source`:"shipkg:case:63aa8b018e0d",`target`:"shipkg:check:b9b23cb93dc6",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及检查方法",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:6d59e335291686df",`case_id`:"stena_europe_fuel_2023",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:0917ec321d12afd2",`source_file`:"MAIB_2024_20_Stena_Europe_fuel_spray_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6756db0ba63e1781efb87793/2024-20-StenaEurope.pdf",`page`:"32",`locator`:"PDF page 32",`quote`:"ght the hazards of entering a fire-damaged space without the correct personal protective equipment. 2024/174 Introduce the use of thermal imaging cameras to all Stena vessels with appropriate functionality for the detection of exposed hot surfaces of over 220°C within machinery spaces. Safety recommendations shall in no case create a presumption of blame or liability.",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及检查方法\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:6dfe9b41b6b14146",`source`:"shipkg:case:1e6479e108d9",`target`:"shipkg:condition:9e280aeb615b",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:6dfe9b41b6b14146",`case_id`:"kommandor_susan_dg1_2025",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:1a0b3fbe432ab46d",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_10_Kommandor_Susan_generator_bearing_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/catastrophic-engine-failure-and-subsequent-fire-on-board-the-site-investigation-vessel-kommandor-susan",`page`:"8",`locator`:"PDF page 8",`quote`:"ting priorities during the vessel’s conversion project, this resulted in Hays Ships providing minimal oversight to Holderness and no verification of authenticity for the parts used, enabling the installation of non- OEM components that later contributed to the engine failure. Similar to the lack of oversight highlighted in both the Finlandia Seaways and Finnmaster cases, the lack of structured supervision a",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:6e209903c83a94e7",`source`:"shipkg:case:187dc871fbd5",`target`:"shipkg:fault:cdf116929c39",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:6e209903c83a94e7",`case_id`:"spirit_of_discovery_pods_2023",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:91f76498fecf4e21",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_06_Spirit_of_Discovery_propulsion_loss.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/loss-of-propulsion-in-heavy-weather-experienced-by-the-passenger-vessel-spirit-of-discovery-leading-to-over-100-injuries-and-one-fatality",`page`:"43",`locator`:"PDF page 43",`quote`:"cating oil. In principle this was an entirely sensible precaution to protect the high voltage pod motor from damage. However, the low position of the bilge sensor meant that it could be activated by a relatively small amount of liquid that accumulated within the pod. Since the bilge suction probably did not extend low enough for the automatic bilge pumps to effectively pump the water out, it is likely the vessel’s motion in heavy weather caused the small amoun",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:70aa583bbf239778",`source`:"shipkg:case:187dc871fbd5",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:d1c468a6b34b",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及后果",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:70aa583bbf239778",`case_id`:"spirit_of_discovery_pods_2023",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:166a2a0932391029",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_06_Spirit_of_Discovery_propulsion_loss.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/loss-of-propulsion-in-heavy-weather-experienced-by-the-passenger-vessel-spirit-of-discovery-leading-to-over-100-injuries-and-one-fatality",`page`:"42",`locator`:"PDF page 42",`quote`:"ULSION 2.3.1 Initial loss of propulsion Spirit of Discovery was pitching heavily and rolling violently in 8m to 9m waves when its port pod automatically shut down, followed shortly afterwards by its starboard pod. After shutting down, each pod then automatically rotated and parked at 90° to the vessel’s heading. Given the weather conditions at the time, it is almost certain that Spirit of Discovery’s pitching caused the propellers to come",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及后果\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:70de1f9037a33264",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:6456485708ad",`target`:"shipkg:condition:85d0ac216249",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:70de1f9037a33264",`case_id`:"knowledge:shaft_generator_alignment",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:2d11f04e90b4e6a9",`source_file`:"STAMFORD_AGN039_marine_shaft_generators.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.stamford-avk.com/sites/stamfordavk/files/AGNs/AGN-039_C-Marine-Shaft-Generators.pdf",`page`:"2",`locator`:"PDF page 2",`quote`:"ator damaging vibration when the main engine is running at slow speeds and also when the ship is in storm conditions, because the ship’s hull flexes and so the gearbox to generator alignment becomes distorted. An experienced ship design engineer will know of these potential problems and will ensure that the coupling between gearbox and the shaft generator is a high quality, d",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:71c93c3028f0d7ae",`source`:"shipkg:case:00057f56fe39",`target`:"shipkg:fault:fee4df6aeb24",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:71c93c3028f0d7ae",`case_id`:"wight_sky_me_2017",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:b10bdbaa38429105",`source_file`:"MAIB_2018_14_Wight_Sky_engine_bearing_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5b5217c7ed915d0b81e003df/MAIBInvReport14_2018.pdf",`page`:"14",`locator`:"PDF page 14",`quote`:"for initiating the failure. ○ When the shells of main bearing 5 turned, the lubrication supply to big end bearing 4 was blocked, resulting in destructive failure. • Rebuilding the engine in a clean and controlled environment and transferring it complete into the engine room would have reduced the likelihood of debris ingress. • The engine was not fitted with a wear detector, so there was",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:71d295f3dea12315",`source`:"shipkg:case:551512d967af",`target`:"shipkg:fault:b6b2c9f08149",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:71d295f3dea12315",`case_id`:"sd2013_02_control_air",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:008f983201b4fd11",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"14",`locator`:"PDF page 14",`quote`:"he bottom end bearing had overheated and failed (see figure). No1 compressor was isolated but the engineers soon noticed that the air pressure in the main air receiver was dropping. Shortly afterwards, the centre main engine was started and all three main engines were put on standby in preparation for entering port. During this period, multiple alarms sounded in the ECR warning of low control air pressure.",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:71dfe99b39f72e50",`source`:"shipkg:case:6f58fb8a8b17",`target`:"shipkg:fault:72c71c94ca13",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:71dfe99b39f72e50",`case_id`:"sd2016_22_cooling_pipe",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:e235f3eb9480640d",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"60",`locator`:"PDF page 60",`quote`:"al. Never delay unnecessarily when abandoning a sinking ship. 4. The rate of water ingress and the speed at which the vessel sank suggests the failure of a main engine sea water cooling pipe. Analysis of maintenance records showed that this pipework had not been inspected or renewed for many years. Sea inlet pipework should be thoroughly checked during planned maintenance periods. skipper, who had remained in the whe",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:7289037472eac8df",`source`:"shipkg:case:7a1c0165bb56",`target`:"shipkg:action:32b0fb5f9f2b",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及运维措施",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:7289037472eac8df",`case_id`:"sd2016_08_generator_oil",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:e9d71048b791d31a",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"26",`locator`:"PDF page 26",`quote`:"as a result of it being insufficiently tightened by shore staff during a recent dry dock. • A section of the adjacent generator’s exhaust piping had been left unlagged following its overhaul during the recent dry dock (Figure 2b). This was hidden from view by the exhaust casing. • Fine oil spray ignited when it came into contact with the hot exhaust casing. Figure 1: Location of the generator w",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及运维措施\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:72e1196f9d79cbee",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:ce7933999459",`target`:"shipkg:condition:9dd79587307a",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:72e1196f9d79cbee",`case_id`:"knowledge:liner_scuffing",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:e7c05a5721cf177a",`source_file`:"MAN_SL2016_633_piston_rings_scuffing.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.man-es.com/docs/default-source/service-letters/sl2016-633.pdf",`page`:"2",`locator`:"PDF page 2",`quote`:"ct with the cast iron liner, may generate high friction and seizures that will not recover (liner scuffing). During scuffing, the surface of the liner is hardened and will need machining to recover before new rings can be run in. Cermet is a composite, part-ceramic, part-metal material. It combines the best properties of a ceramic, i.e. high tem - perature-resistance and hardness, with tho",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:72ff96202cf72397",`source`:"shipkg:case:7a1c0165bb56",`target`:"shipkg:symptom:9d91c2845b73",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及症状",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:72ff96202cf72397",`case_id`:"sd2016_08_generator_oil",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:5a52dfb1b2f1d73b",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"26",`locator`:"PDF page 26",`quote`:"arrative A fully loaded ro-ro passenger ferry was en route to its next port when the engineers in the control room acknowledged a low oil pressure alarm on one of the generators (Figure 1). On the CCTV they observed that oil from this generator was spraying on to the adjacent generator. While they were investigating the source of the leak oil that had been sprayed on the exhaust casing of the adjacent en",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及症状\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:7949bbaafc812272",`source`:"shipkg:case:8b13bdb1a5bc",`target`:"shipkg:action:6e0e5173ee8f",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及运维措施",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:7949bbaafc812272",`case_id`:"sd2016_09_cpp_response",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:1ed28429bcfc3816",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"tion of this button bypassed the feedback control system, giving direct control of pitch to the pitch control lever. However, the master was not familiar with its use, and therefore lost the opportunity to bring the vessel back under control before it struck the quay. It was also revealed during the investigation that the system parameters for astern pitch control had been incorrectly set duri",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及运维措施\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:79a5db0475c1e820",`source`:"shipkg:case:ad49b658b30b",`target`:"shipkg:fault:c1ffab11185c",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:79a5db0475c1e820",`case_id`:"sd2016_14_sea_valve",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:e8101941c0ddc6d2",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"41",`locator`:"PDF page 41",`quote`:"ng emergency? 3. Examination of the isolating valve following the accident identified that the valve actuator had been defective, giving an impression that the valve was fully closed when it was not. Although there was a visual indicator located on the side of the actuator, this was not checked to confirm that the valve was closed prior to removal of the flange bolts. The actuator had previously been repaired. However, the c",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:79cd69b193217e96",`source`:"shipkg:case:ffc594a9fab7",`target`:"shipkg:action:1b28685e1f2a",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及运维措施",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:79cd69b193217e96",`case_id`:"sd2013_12_oily_rag",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:59fee15f97a89579",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"42",`locator`:"PDF page 42",`quote`:"at was dealt with quickly and safely. However, it does serve to highlight the importance of good housekeeping - in this case, the correct disposal of contaminated waste. Although the rag was ignited by the hot exhaust manifold, oil-soaked waste is also susceptible to self-heating and spontaneous combustion. 1. Distraction can cause carelessness in the proper disposal of waste. Discarded oily mat",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及运维措施\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:7a0a161daa004c6f",`source`:"shipkg:case:551512d967af",`target`:"shipkg:fault:3dabb05debb4",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:7a0a161daa004c6f",`case_id`:"sd2013_02_control_air",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:c8e14e20edb4d870",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"15",`locator`:"PDF page 15",`quote`:", the need to isolate the main air cylinder when the reserve air cylinder was brought on line was not included. Consequently, the air pressure equalised at a level that was insufficient to re-engage the main engine’s clutches. Use check cards, but don’t let them stop you from thinking on your feet as well. In the engine room, the reserve compressed air cylinder was opened but there was still insufficient air pre",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:7b9be00c22960658",`source`:"shipkg:case:00057f56fe39",`target`:"shipkg:condition:e21862ad051d",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:7b9be00c22960658",`case_id`:"wight_sky_me_2017",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:d2ddab6cf68a9801",`source_file`:"MAIB_2018_14_Wight_Sky_engine_bearing_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5b5217c7ed915d0b81e003df/MAIBInvReport14_2018.pdf",`page`:"14",`locator`:"PDF page 14",`quote`:"s. • The engine was not fitted with a wear detector, so there was no means of receiving a warning before the engine failed. • The essential services switchboard aft circuit breaker had been left in manual mode, resulting in the loss of power to critical equipment, including the fixed fire-fighting system. ACTION TAKEN Wightlink Limited has: • Agreed with RKM that all engines will be fully assembled and load-tested prior to delivery on",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:7d535036592d5a35",`source`:"shipkg:case:ffc594a9fab7",`target`:"shipkg:check:2ae63dd081a2",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及检查方法",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:7d535036592d5a35",`case_id`:"sd2013_12_oily_rag",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:f5fbae0eb047725b",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"42",`locator`:"PDF page 42",`quote`:"f waste. Discarded oily materials significantly increase fire risks, especially in hot areas such as engine rooms. 2. Do consider visiting the engine room(s) soon after starting equipment for the first time in the day. Equipment cools down overnight, and restarting it is a vulnerable time because leaks can occur when equipment reaches normal operating temperatures. Also, as this case shows, it provides the opportu",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及检查方法\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:7d59998bfaf8fb98",`source`:"shipkg:case:187dc871fbd5",`target`:"shipkg:condition:7fb8a1a33328",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:7d59998bfaf8fb98",`case_id`:"spirit_of_discovery_pods_2023",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:91f76498fecf4e21",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_06_Spirit_of_Discovery_propulsion_loss.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/loss-of-propulsion-in-heavy-weather-experienced-by-the-passenger-vessel-spirit-of-discovery-leading-to-over-100-injuries-and-one-fatality",`page`:"43",`locator`:"PDF page 43",`quote`:"cating oil. In principle this was an entirely sensible precaution to protect the high voltage pod motor from damage. However, the low position of the bilge sensor meant that it could be activated by a relatively small amount of liquid that accumulated within the pod. Since the bilge suction probably did not extend low enough for the automatic bilge pumps to effectively pump the water out, it is likely the vessel’s motion in heavy weather caused the small amoun",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:7dfcf57bdf379f1c",`source`:"shipkg:case:551512d967af",`target`:"shipkg:condition:be80fb98e414",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:7dfcf57bdf379f1c",`case_id`:"sd2013_02_control_air",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:c8e14e20edb4d870",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"15",`locator`:"PDF page 15",`quote`:", the need to isolate the main air cylinder when the reserve air cylinder was brought on line was not included. Consequently, the air pressure equalised at a level that was insufficient to re-engage the main engine’s clutches. Use check cards, but don’t let them stop you from thinking on your feet as well. In the engine room, the reserve compressed air cylinder was opened but there was still insufficient air pre",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:7f08ab11206bc8bc",`source`:"shipkg:case:adf367a46f33",`target`:"shipkg:fault:96cc1c0ff36e",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:7f08ab11206bc8bc",`case_id`:"wight_sky_me2_2018",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:a67a93bfec361edf",`source_file`:"MAIB_2022_04_Wight_Sky_multiple_engine_failures.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6267cc85e90e071690c1b679/2022-4-WightSky-Report.pdf",`page`:"84",`locator`:"PDF page 84",`quote`:"y due to a sudden loss of lubricating oil supply to its number five main journal bearing and number four crankpin. [2.3.1] 2. The oilway to the main journal and crankpin was blocked off when the bearing shells turned in their housing. Poor fuel combustion, the presence of silica sand and other abrasive particles embedded in the main bearing shells, engine misalignment, high levels of vibration, and contaminated lubricating oil might all have",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:800d5ddca452c848",`source`:"shipkg:case:6f58fb8a8b17",`target`:"shipkg:symptom:89c72d5dc590",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及症状",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:800d5ddca452c848",`case_id`:"sd2016_22_cooling_pipe",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:e7c09d475a3dc5ea",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"59",`locator`:"PDF page 59",`quote`:"on deck sorting a previous catch. The skipper returned to the wheelhouse to investigate the noises and found that the engine room bilge high level alarm was illuminated and sounding. The skipper instructed the engineer to go to the engine room and investigate. The engineer observed that water was almost level with the top of the main engine and was rising quickly. He started the bilge pump but could not reac",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及症状\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:816852e6b1b6d63f",`source`:"shipkg:case:8b13bdb1a5bc",`target`:"shipkg:check:52bfc5553a79",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及检查方法",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:816852e6b1b6d63f",`case_id`:"sd2016_09_cpp_response",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:88dffcc589cf9235",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"y to bring the vessel back under control before it struck the quay. It was also revealed during the investigation that the system parameters for astern pitch control had been incorrectly set during the commissioning of the propulsion system when the vessel was delivered from the yard. The Lessons 1. If you are expected to manoeuvre a vessel, you should make every effort to familiarise yourself with the controls at yo",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及检查方法\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:81bc37da1dbdfc7b",`source`:"shipkg:case:213f8edb92c2",`target`:"shipkg:fault:5737f3610967",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:81bc37da1dbdfc7b",`case_id`:"queen_mary2_hf_2010",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:1caa6757e63a8feb",`source_file`:"MAIB_2011_28_Queen_Mary_2_harmonic_filter_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/547c6fa6ed915d4c10000031/QM2Report.pdf",`page`:"62",`locator`:"PDF page 62",`quote`:"ed lifetime of 20 years due to the operating conditions being harsher than expected. The initial degradation of the capacitor was likely to have been caused by one or both of the following: • being subjected to voltages in excess of their design rating • being exposed to frequent voltage transients due to increased number of switching cycles Failure initiation due to minor manufacturing anomalies s",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:83c25edbca1b855a",`source`:"shipkg:case:d6e9f8f8ade2",`target`:"shipkg:fault:fee4df6aeb24",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:83c25edbca1b855a",`case_id`:"finlandia_seaways_me_2018",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:53cb0d46e7e767ec",`source_file`:"MAIB_2021_02_Finlandia_Seaways_connecting_rod_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/engine-failure-and-subsequent-fire-on-ro-ro-cargo-vessel-finlandia-seaways-with-1-person-injured",`page`:"9",`locator`:"PDF page 9",`quote`:"ent and Incident Investigation Division and the engine manufacturer, MAN Diesel and Turbo SE. The investigation identified that a fracture of the connecting rod small end had led to the sudden failure of the main engine. The investigation also found that the method used to replace the connecting rod small end piston pin bearing bushes by the vessel manager’s maintenance support contractor had introduced stress raisers that signficantly increased",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:8523597eb0f25833",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:40cb53a64e31",`target`:"shipkg:action:1487f0a35cfe",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及运维措施",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:8523597eb0f25833",`case_id`:"knowledge:winding_insulation",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:245f0a658820c70a",`source_file`:"STAMFORD_AGN040_winding_insulation.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.stamford-avk.com/sites/stamfordavk/files/AGNs/AGN-040_E-Winding-Insulation-System.pdf",`page`:"6",`locator`:"PDF page 6",`quote`:"ate storage conditions. Any temporarily reduced IR values can be restored to expected values by following the following explained drying out procedures. Then further operation on load will complete a thorough heating of the winding assemblies and will completely dry-off the IR reducing moisture. The following is offered as helpful guidance, but should be read in conjunction with",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及运维措施\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:86447f51ce898523",`source`:"shipkg:case:213f8edb92c2",`target`:"shipkg:action:04317a406bca",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及运维措施",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:86447f51ce898523",`case_id`:"queen_mary2_hf_2010",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:54970b12e1896794",`source_file`:"MAIB_2011_28_Queen_Mary_2_harmonic_filter_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/547c6fa6ed915d4c10000031/QM2Report.pdf",`page`:"70",`locator`:"PDF page 70",`quote`:"e of its capacitors and the circumstances that could lead to this. • Replaced the capacitors in QM2’s aft harmonic filter with an improved and safer design. • Carried out a quality audit of the capacitor manufacturer. Lloyd’s Register (Europe, Middle East and Asia) has: • Progressed with existing work to review its rules to recognise and mitigate the hazard of arc-flash associated w",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及运维措施\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:87f629c6df27074a",`source`:"shipkg:case:1e6479e108d9",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:d1c468a6b34b",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及后果",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:87f629c6df27074a",`case_id`:"kommandor_susan_dg1_2025",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:96c615c53d3b0715",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_10_Kommandor_Susan_generator_bearing_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/catastrophic-engine-failure-and-subsequent-fire-on-board-the-site-investigation-vessel-kommandor-susan",`page`:"1",`locator`:"PDF page 1",`quote`:"ted in an engine room fire and a complete power blackout. The crew responded promptly, extinguished the fire and mustered safely. The vessel lost propulsion and began drifting eastwards. Attempts to deploy anchors were unsuccessful because the anchor winches required electrical power to operate. Kommandor Susan was eventually returned to Leith harbour with limited propulsion restored. The investigation found tha",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及后果\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:884ae5aaa77f0593",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:6456485708ad",`target`:"shipkg:condition:dc209dc61e12",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:884ae5aaa77f0593",`case_id`:"knowledge:shaft_generator_alignment",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:46c70849c9c28abc",`source_file`:"STAMFORD_AGN039_marine_shaft_generators.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.stamford-avk.com/sites/stamfordavk/files/AGNs/AGN-039_C-Marine-Shaft-Generators.pdf",`page`:"2",`locator`:"PDF page 2",`quote`:"When the shaft generator is aligned with the gearbox drive shaft, the ships design engineer must take great care to allow for the thermal expansion of the hot gearbox, which may well expand and lift the shaft centre line by < 1 mm. If the alignment is not accurate, then excessive vibration is likely to damage the shaft generator. There can also be lots of generator damaging vibration when the",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:89354445a36570a7",`source`:"shipkg:case:1e6479e108d9",`target`:"shipkg:action:16d3373950f9",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及运维措施",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:89354445a36570a7",`case_id`:"kommandor_susan_dg1_2025",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:9225f4c20470527c",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_10_Kommandor_Susan_generator_bearing_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/catastrophic-engine-failure-and-subsequent-fire-on-board-the-site-investigation-vessel-kommandor-susan",`page`:"9",`locator`:"PDF page 9",`quote`:"ns taken by other organisations Gardline Shipping Limited has: • Rebuilt DG1 with genuine spares, including a new engine block; • Completed major overhauls of DG2, DG3 and DG4 using genuine Caterpillar parts; • Changed the onboard anchoring procedure, highlighting that clutches must remain disengaged when the winches are not in use to ensure they remain ready for use in the event of power failure. RECOMMENDATIONS In view of the actio",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及运维措施\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:898e34cfb1079802",`source`:"shipkg:case:1e6479e108d9",`target`:"shipkg:cause:0c02674d6024",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及原因",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:898e34cfb1079802",`case_id`:"kommandor_susan_dg1_2025",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:5f282b514e870587",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_10_Kommandor_Susan_generator_bearing_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/catastrophic-engine-failure-and-subsequent-fire-on-board-the-site-investigation-vessel-kommandor-susan",`page`:"5",`locator`:"PDF page 5",`quote`:"oot cause is failure of connecting rod bearing number five. The excessive wear on the other connecting rod bearings show that the most likely root cause for the bearing failure is weak bonding of the copper layer. Evidence of weak material bonding was found in several bearings (Figure 4). Figure 3: Comparison between genuine OEM (left) and CTP bottom end bearings (right) Image courtesy of Pon Power",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及原因\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:8aa74ee8ecd9a617",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:796439daaa03",`target`:"shipkg:condition:86fd7df9de11",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:8aa74ee8ecd9a617",`case_id`:"knowledge:electrical_oscillation",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:d85a741773e8f8b9",`source_file`:"Frontiers_2021_marine_converter_oscillations.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.frontiersin.org/journals/energy-research/articles/10.3389/fenrg.2020.529756/pdf",`page`:"2",`locator`:"PDF page 2",`quote`:"sed in percentage terms. The limits are 0.5% for frequency and 5% for voltage. Well documented causes of such behavior include pulsating torque of generators’ prime movers and/or ﬂuctuating load, which combined with commonly used droop control method for load sharing, possibly leads to severe short and long-term frequency ﬂuctuations. However, little is known about the osci",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:8aba503c2f7f68d2",`source`:"shipkg:case:1f8ffc7c55c3",`target`:"shipkg:action:ee6e6a9b5e59",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及运维措施",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:8aba503c2f7f68d2",`case_id`:"pride_can_cpp_2014",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:10c92776735ce916",`source_file`:"MAIB_2015_22_Pride_of_Canterbury_CPP_hydraulic_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/563092daed915d566d000002/MAIBInvReport-22_2015.pdf",`page`:"35",`locator`:"PDF page 35",`quote`:"-10 bar. For all ships in its fleet: • Checked that all CPP system flanges meet standards recommended by manufacturers. • Checked all CPP system flanges are fitted with protective coverings. • Examined hi-fog systems to ensure that the system provides full coverage of all high-risk machinery. 4.2 WARTSILA Wartsila has issued a Technical Bulletin (Annex C) instructing operators to replace back pressure valves at leas",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及运维措施\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:8b0c03c914867cec",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:6456485708ad",`target`:"shipkg:fault:9d33e738a3d3",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:8b0c03c914867cec",`case_id`:"knowledge:shaft_generator_alignment",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:9db4aabb400f0aae",`source_file`:"STAMFORD_AGN039_marine_shaft_generators.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.stamford-avk.com/sites/stamfordavk/files/AGNs/AGN-039_C-Marine-Shaft-Generators.pdf",`page`:"2",`locator`:"PDF page 2",`quote`:"ansion of the hot gearbox, which may well expand and lift the shaft centre line by < 1 mm. If the alignment is not accurate, then excessive vibration is likely to damage the shaft generator. There can also be lots of generator damaging vibration when the main engine is running at slow speeds and also when the ship is in storm conditions, because the ship’s hull flexes and so the gearbox to genera",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:8bf69ea181bbe34d",`source`:"shipkg:case:9676bd22b5e5",`target`:"shipkg:action:ac5834891dd6",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及运维措施",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:8bf69ea181bbe34d",`case_id`:"sd2013_05_missing_filter",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:79bf750178d19ebb",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"23",`locator`:"PDF page 23",`quote`:"times; however it is imperative that ships’ staff maintain sufficient oversight of work undertaken by contractors to ensure that critical steps are not overlooked. 2. One of the advantages of completing daily logs is the ability to assess trends in the operating machinery. A consistently low reading on the filter differential oil pressure gauge, and a comparison with previous operating hou",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及运维措施\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:8d8816361e273f26",`source`:"shipkg:case:1f8ffc7c55c3",`target`:"shipkg:action:ddf392fcaa6c",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及运维措施",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:8d8816361e273f26",`case_id`:"pride_can_cpp_2014",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:53344f366942bb5f",`source_file`:"MAIB_2015_22_Pride_of_Canterbury_CPP_hydraulic_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/563092daed915d566d000002/MAIBInvReport-22_2015.pdf",`page`:"35",`locator`:"PDF page 35",`quote`:"ented a maintenance programme in which at least PSV1, PSV3 and NRV6 are disabled and their function checked once every 5 years. • Added a full flow check-valve, with an opening pressure of 10-12 bar, in the return oil circuit by-passing PSV3, the Oil Cooler and NRV6. Also, an additional alarm signal was to be fitted in the control system to give an alarm at 9-10 bar. For all ships in it",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及运维措施\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:8e29af42afcde05b",`source`:"shipkg:case:ffc594a9fab7",`target`:"shipkg:condition:94ebbaf1c3c4",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:8e29af42afcde05b",`case_id`:"sd2013_12_oily_rag",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:db9d3c4ba46b3f43",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"41",`locator`:"PDF page 41",`quote`:"off the alarm in the wheelhouse (Figure 2). The functional fire and smoke alarm sensors were some distance from the fire, and the smoke and heat had not migrated that far by the time the master noticed the smoke on the camera monitor.",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:8f097c39f22f3c8a",`source`:"shipkg:case:537a034e93e3",`target`:"shipkg:fault:1a73f1a1e185",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:8f097c39f22f3c8a",`case_id`:"sd2013_03_turning_gear",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:543d0b7392fa5ff2",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"16",`locator`:"PDF page 16",`quote`:"on compressed air, a loud bang was heard; the turning gear interlock, the last remaining safety barrier, had failed to work. The resulting damage to the shaft and gearing (Figure 1) and to the turning gear casing (Figure 2) disabled the ship for a month and cost a six-figure sum to repair. To Turn or Not to Turn?",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:8f475ea8da323af4",`source`:"shipkg:case:537a034e93e3",`target`:"shipkg:action:4a5960af425f",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及运维措施",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:8f475ea8da323af4",`case_id`:"sd2013_03_turning_gear",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:6374a9e189a094d1",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"18",`locator`:"PDF page 18",`quote`:"e was no record of it having been tested. 2. Control console illumination panels are vital to the safe operation of machinery and should therefore be tested regularly. If problems with visual indication or warning lamps cannot be rectified immediately, they must be reported. Living with the problem is not a solution. 3. It is important that the status of the main engine machinery conforms to t",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及运维措施\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:8f4e09068ca037ea",`source`:"shipkg:case:551512d967af",`target`:"shipkg:fault:2ac2de665aa1",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:8f4e09068ca037ea",`case_id`:"sd2013_02_control_air",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:5bedf556e2401880",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"14",`locator`:"PDF page 14",`quote`:"diate investigation identified that the main lubricating oil discharge pipe assembly in No1 compressor had detached, and that the bottom end bearing had overheated and failed (see figure). No1 compressor was isolated but the engineers soon noticed that the air pressure in the main air receiver was dropping. Shortly afterwards, the centre main engine was started and all three main engines were put on s",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:8f6c13b709c0fd51",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:bff048b48ff1",`target`:"shipkg:fault:ad105e83a5af",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:8f6c13b709c0fd51",`case_id`:"knowledge:generator_bearing_wear",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:65e2c4b3facd8c2b",`source_file`:"STAMFORD_AGN076_alternator_bearings.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.stamford-avk.com/sites/stamfordavk/files/2024-04/AGN076_C.pdf",`page`:"4",`locator`:"PDF page 4",`quote`:"t fail because of axial vibration, causing a fretting action in the housing, the cylindrical roller bearing might fail because of lack of grease or misalignment damage. The anti-friction ball bearings used on STAMFORD alternators are not insulated bearings. The design of STAMFORD alternators is such that the shaft does not come under the influence of magnetic fields that result in excessive vol",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:91f5e2de171310bc",`source`:"shipkg:case:6f58fb8a8b17",`target`:"shipkg:condition:5d3ac9abb37a",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:91f5e2de171310bc",`case_id`:"sd2016_22_cooling_pipe",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:383cc33975e2e37e",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"60",`locator`:"PDF page 60",`quote`:"sank suggests the failure of a main engine sea water cooling pipe. Analysis of maintenance records showed that this pipework had not been inspected or renewed for many years. Sea inlet pipework should be thoroughly checked during planned maintenance periods. skipper, who had remained in the wheelhouse, then broadcast a “Mayday” message on VHF radio, which was received and relayed by the coastguard to",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:920c8e3b95f55394",`source`:"shipkg:case:8b13bdb1a5bc",`target`:"shipkg:cause:3667d8d2e0ca",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及原因",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:920c8e3b95f55394",`case_id`:"sd2016_09_cpp_response",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:88dffcc589cf9235",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"y to bring the vessel back under control before it struck the quay. It was also revealed during the investigation that the system parameters for astern pitch control had been incorrectly set during the commissioning of the propulsion system when the vessel was delivered from the yard. The Lessons 1. If you are expected to manoeuvre a vessel, you should make every effort to familiarise yourself with the controls at yo",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及原因\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:92fa17d9fe661124",`source`:"shipkg:case:537a034e93e3",`target`:"shipkg:condition:7d61f4e32250",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:92fa17d9fe661124",`case_id`:"sd2013_03_turning_gear",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:4ed3569c8bb32f4f",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"18",`locator`:"PDF page 18",`quote`:"CASE 3 17MAIB Safety Digest 2/2013 The Lessons 1. The turning gear interlock had not been included within the planned maintenance system on board and there was no record of it having been tested. 2. Control console illumination panels are vital to the safe operation of machinery and should therefore be tested regularly. If problems with visual indication or warnin",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:9371a20d59d38286",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:40cb53a64e31",`target`:"shipkg:fault:f09e1be695a7",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:9371a20d59d38286",`case_id`:"knowledge:winding_insulation",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:31bd0a2dcc933aac",`source_file`:"STAMFORD_AGN040_winding_insulation.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.stamford-avk.com/sites/stamfordavk/files/AGNs/AGN-040_E-Winding-Insulation-System.pdf",`page`:"6",`locator`:"PDF page 6",`quote`:"s of just a few MegOhms become more typical. Major factors, which affect and reduce the IR value, start with the winding outhang. Surface moisture, often present in conjunction with surface contamination, are typically the result of prevailing site conditions. Either will seriously reduce measured IR values, and if the root cause that allows this contaminant to be present i",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:9495f0de1540411d",`source`:"shipkg:case:63aa8b018e0d",`target`:"shipkg:fault:3349e319bedc",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:9495f0de1540411d",`case_id`:"stena_europe_fuel_2023",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:38b5d9eb759b1681",`source_file`:"MAIB_2024_20_Stena_Europe_fuel_spray_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6756db0ba63e1781efb87793/2024-20-StenaEurope.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"f pressurised fuel. The fuel sprayed onto the exposed exhaust manifold that was operating at a temperature exceeding 220°C when a screw in a two-screw flange within the fuel oil pipework loosened. [2.2] 2. The fuel oil spray was allowed to reach the hot surface because the joint was not protected by anti-splashing tape or shielding and fuel was able to escape forcefully. [2.3.2] 3. The engine manufacturer’s recommended fu",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:95e0b816528962dc",`source`:"shipkg:case:537a034e93e3",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:2cba0fdbf1dd",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及后果",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:95e0b816528962dc",`case_id`:"sd2013_03_turning_gear",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:1f80efa15bdc4c0e",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"16",`locator`:"PDF page 16",`quote`:"y barrier, had failed to work. The resulting damage to the shaft and gearing (Figure 1) and to the turning gear casing (Figure 2) disabled the ship for a month and cost a six-figure sum to repair. To Turn or Not to Turn?",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及后果\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:96e30e323354ad53",`source`:"shipkg:case:6f58fb8a8b17",`target`:"shipkg:condition:133adfa97595",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:96e30e323354ad53",`case_id`:"sd2016_22_cooling_pipe",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:6a6ede2b06a7fa26",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"60",`locator`:"PDF page 60",`quote`:"are supper. Although the bilge alarm operated as designed, with no one present in the wheelhouse to either see or hear it, it was not detected in time to save the vessel. Never leave the wheelhouse unmanned when underway; doing so is in contravention of the COLREGs and puts you and your vessel at risk. 2. The crew were instructed to enter the accommodation to collect lifejackets in preparation fo",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:98a5f307f9fea11b",`source`:"shipkg:case:ad49b658b30b",`target`:"shipkg:check:b9cd13a70a15",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及检查方法",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:98a5f307f9fea11b",`case_id`:"sd2016_14_sea_valve",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:e7382090fee9962a",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"41",`locator`:"PDF page 41",`quote`:"t the valve was fully closed when it was not. Although there was a visual indicator located on the side of the actuator, this was not checked to confirm that the valve was closed prior to removal of the flange bolts. The actuator had previously been repaired. However, the chief engineer, who had only recently joined the vessel, was unaware of the actuator’s poor internal condition (Figures 2 and 3). Figur",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及检查方法\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:98c5383ab9790842",`source`:"shipkg:case:adf367a46f33",`target`:"shipkg:fault:fee4df6aeb24",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:98c5383ab9790842",`case_id`:"wight_sky_me2_2018",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:4846a9af2b7e6456",`source_file`:"MAIB_2022_04_Wight_Sky_multiple_engine_failures.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6267cc85e90e071690c1b679/2022-4-WightSky-Report.pdf",`page`:"84",`locator`:"PDF page 84",`quote`:"S 3.1 SAFETY ISSUES DIRECTLY CONTRIBUTING TO THE ACCIDENTS THAT HAVE BEEN ADDRESSED OR RESULTED IN RECOMMENDATIONS 1. Wight Sky’s ME2 failed catastrophically due to a sudden loss of lubricating oil supply to its number five main journal bearing and number four crankpin. [2.3.1] 2. The oilway to the main journal and crankpin was blocked off when the bearing shells turned in their housing. Poor fuel combustion, the presence of silic",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:98d30903a2fed30b",`source`:"shipkg:case:537a034e93e3",`target`:"shipkg:condition:bdbca1b8295e",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:98d30903a2fed30b",`case_id`:"sd2013_03_turning_gear",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:6522054ba5597880",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"16",`locator`:"PDF page 16",`quote`:"Although the indicator for the turning gear, which was sited on the control panel, showed that the turning gear was in, this was poorly illuminated and was not seen by the engineer. When the main engine start button was pressed to turn the engine on compressed air, a loud bang was heard; the turning gear interlock, the last remaining safety barrier, had failed to work. The resulting damage t",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:993b77e83376eba6",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:660e09f63773",`target`:"shipkg:condition:88ba505ebf5b",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:993b77e83376eba6",`case_id`:"knowledge:coolant_blockage",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:5e17a921acb00b63",`source_file`:"MAN_SL2016_623_cooling_water.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.man-es.com/docs/default-source/service-letters/sl2016-623.pdf",`page`:"2",`locator`:"PDF page 2",`quote`:"ult in leakages and thereby re - duce the lifetime and safety of the engine components. Lime- scale as well as rust deposits will reduce the heat transfer and may result in thermal overload of the components to be cooled by the engine cooling water. A thermal overload may, however, also result in cracks and leakages as seen in the exhaust valve seat ring. Insufficient cooling water",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:99bf71e0bf124707",`source`:"shipkg:case:551512d967af",`target`:"shipkg:fault:40958d8dddba",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:99bf71e0bf124707",`case_id`:"sd2013_02_control_air",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:c0ffd1edc9aa8938",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"15",`locator`:"PDF page 15",`quote`:"afely alongside, assisted by harbour tugs. Subsequent investigation identified that No2 compressor had a damaged discharge valve. Neither compressor had been able to keep up with demand.",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:9a53d8ba8a365433",`source`:"shipkg:case:7a1c0165bb56",`target`:"shipkg:fault:020786dc9fd0",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:9a53d8ba8a365433",`case_id`:"sd2016_08_generator_oil",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:59a2040fb754c1d5",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"28",`locator`:"PDF page 28",`quote`:"21 MAIB Safety Digest 1/2016 CASE 8 The Lessons 1. Unlagged sections of exhaust piping will radiate heat to the protective casing, causing it to attain temperatures sufficient to ignite an oil or fuel spray. 2. These temperatures are not visible to the eye unless the surface is glowing. However, a thermal image will immediately identify unlagged sections (F",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:9a95cc71b3b29c9b",`source`:"shipkg:case:7a1c0165bb56",`target`:"shipkg:fault:f2f9d4b10a0b",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:9a95cc71b3b29c9b",`case_id`:"sd2016_08_generator_oil",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:4925b6b6f40f4c21",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"26",`locator`:"PDF page 26",`quote`:"a loose plug on the generator’s engine-mounted lubricating oil pump (Figure 2a). This had vibrated loose as a result of it being insufficiently tightened by shore staff during a recent dry dock. • A section of the adjacent generator’s exhaust piping had been left unlagged following its overhaul during the recent dry dock (Figure 2b). This was hidden from view by the exhaust casing. • Fine oil sp",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:9b4b0272e8704850",`source`:"shipkg:case:00057f56fe39",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:bcd3a732b87d",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及后果",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:9b4b0272e8704850",`case_id`:"wight_sky_me_2017",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:d2ddab6cf68a9801",`source_file`:"MAIB_2018_14_Wight_Sky_engine_bearing_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5b5217c7ed915d0b81e003df/MAIBInvReport14_2018.pdf",`page`:"14",`locator`:"PDF page 14",`quote`:"s. • The engine was not fitted with a wear detector, so there was no means of receiving a warning before the engine failed. • The essential services switchboard aft circuit breaker had been left in manual mode, resulting in the loss of power to critical equipment, including the fixed fire-fighting system. ACTION TAKEN Wightlink Limited has: • Agreed with RKM that all engines will be fully assembled and load-tested prior to delivery on",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及后果\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:9b6cccbb6adec25b",`source`:"shipkg:case:9676bd22b5e5",`target`:"shipkg:fault:6ade8daa881a",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:9b6cccbb6adec25b",`case_id`:"sd2013_05_missing_filter",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:82256a9ee8fd56dd",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"21",`locator`:"PDF page 21",`quote`:"d main bearing journals; overheating of the bedplate at the main bearing housings; overheating of the piston connecting rods; the seizure of several pistons (Figure 2); failure of the camshaft and turbo charger bearings, and metallic debris throughout the lubricating oil system. The damage sustained necessitated an engine rebuild and the replacement of the bedplate and crankshaft. A",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:9ba5aecd12bda1bb",`source`:"shipkg:case:63aa8b018e0d",`target`:"shipkg:condition:96f46a0b1ef9",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:9ba5aecd12bda1bb",`case_id`:"stena_europe_fuel_2023",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:412268fc761e9960",`source_file`:"MAIB_2024_20_Stena_Europe_fuel_spray_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6756db0ba63e1781efb87793/2024-20-StenaEurope.pdf",`page`:"27",`locator`:"PDF page 27",`quote`:"ions. 2.4 HOT SPOT MONITORING Stena’s practice of measuring the temperature of running engines using an infrared spot thermometer had not identified the significant hazard posed by exposed surfaces of over 220°C that still existed post-accident after the insulation and shielding were replaced. The use of infrared spot thermometers in engine spaces limited their effectiveness as they could only prov",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:9fd3b3bba35df042",`source`:"shipkg:case:00057f56fe39",`target`:"shipkg:fault:5f59e6b3ca42",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:9fd3b3bba35df042",`case_id`:"wight_sky_me_2017",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:9094aa614ec060db",`source_file`:"MAIB_2018_14_Wight_Sky_engine_bearing_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5b5217c7ed915d0b81e003df/MAIBInvReport14_2018.pdf",`page`:"14",`locator`:"PDF page 14",`quote`:"ntrolled environment and transferring it complete into the engine room would have reduced the likelihood of debris ingress. • The engine was not fitted with a wear detector, so there was no means of receiving a warning before the engine failed. • The essential services switchboard aft circuit breaker had been left in manual mode, resulting in the loss of power to critical equipment, including the fixed fire-fighting system. ACTION TAKEN Wightli",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:a002b79f5ebb756e",`source`:"shipkg:case:ad49b658b30b",`target`:"shipkg:condition:553e318feb99",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:a002b79f5ebb756e",`case_id`:"sd2016_14_sea_valve",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:951a6820ce2d0fc6",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"40",`locator`:"PDF page 40",`quote`:"alarm, mustering the remaining crew. The seaman rigged the portable electric water pump on the main deck but, with the vessel now running on emergency power only, he was unable to start the pump. The master contacted the coastguard by VHF radio and advised that the vessel was flooding. The coastguard transmitted a “Mayday Relay”, and RNLI lifeboats from two stations were tasked to assist",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:a32459f38be8571e",`source`:"shipkg:case:187dc871fbd5",`target`:"shipkg:action:4f7d85454ee0",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及运维措施",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:a32459f38be8571e",`case_id`:"spirit_of_discovery_pods_2023",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:5e9ac17b88449c65",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_06_Spirit_of_Discovery_propulsion_loss.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/loss-of-propulsion-in-heavy-weather-experienced-by-the-passenger-vessel-spirit-of-discovery-leading-to-over-100-injuries-and-one-fatality",`page`:"53",`locator`:"PDF page 53",`quote`:"s: ● Created an additional seakeeping and manoeuvring decision support poster and software tool for the Spirit Class vessels that includes propeller exposure in wave heights up to 10.5m.",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及运维措施\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:a4b835efae9cbcac",`source`:"shipkg:case:1e6479e108d9",`target`:"shipkg:condition:6fa538170906",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:a4b835efae9cbcac",`case_id`:"kommandor_susan_dg1_2025",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:1a0b3fbe432ab46d",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_10_Kommandor_Susan_generator_bearing_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/catastrophic-engine-failure-and-subsequent-fire-on-board-the-site-investigation-vessel-kommandor-susan",`page`:"8",`locator`:"PDF page 8",`quote`:"ting priorities during the vessel’s conversion project, this resulted in Hays Ships providing minimal oversight to Holderness and no verification of authenticity for the parts used, enabling the installation of non- OEM components that later contributed to the engine failure. Similar to the lack of oversight highlighted in both the Finlandia Seaways and Finnmaster cases, the lack of structured supervision a",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:a4cdf2d395f09c13",`source`:"shipkg:case:187dc871fbd5",`target`:"shipkg:fault:e97eee073fc6",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:a4cdf2d395f09c13",`case_id`:"spirit_of_discovery_pods_2023",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:755b4102fd859a55",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_06_Spirit_of_Discovery_propulsion_loss.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/loss-of-propulsion-in-heavy-weather-experienced-by-the-passenger-vessel-spirit-of-discovery-leading-to-over-100-injuries-and-one-fatality",`page`:"42",`locator`:"PDF page 42",`quote`:"y’s pitching caused the propellers to come out of the water. This caused a sudden reduction in torque on the propulsion motor and led to a very rapid increase in the motors’ rpm. The engine alarm and monitoring system recorded that, immediately before their shutdown, the rpm of each pod’s propulsion motor very rapidly increased and exceeded the preset overspeed limitation. The pod’s PCS therefore automat",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:a5d9b52c8786b552",`source`:"shipkg:case:8b13bdb1a5bc",`target`:"shipkg:condition:a40db02fd2fa",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:a5d9b52c8786b552",`case_id`:"sd2016_09_cpp_response",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:1ed28429bcfc3816",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"tion of this button bypassed the feedback control system, giving direct control of pitch to the pitch control lever. However, the master was not familiar with its use, and therefore lost the opportunity to bring the vessel back under control before it struck the quay. It was also revealed during the investigation that the system parameters for astern pitch control had been incorrectly set duri",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:a6ff3d7bef862430",`source`:"shipkg:case:00057f56fe39",`target`:"shipkg:fault:aba0717d72a0",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:a6ff3d7bef862430",`case_id`:"wight_sky_me_2017",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:7407bf8cf7722325",`source_file`:"MAIB_2018_14_Wight_Sky_engine_bearing_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5b5217c7ed915d0b81e003df/MAIBInvReport14_2018.pdf",`page`:"14",`locator`:"PDF page 14",`quote`:"am ensured the safety of the vessel, passengers and crew. • Volvo Penta’s investigation into the engine failure concluded that: ○ Debris in the engine’s oil channels was most probably responsible for initiating the failure. ○ When the shells of main bearing 5 turned, the lubrication supply to big end bearing 4 was blocked, resulting in destructive failure. • Rebuilding the engine in a clean and controlled environment and transferring it complete in",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:a7e6406ec79afd95",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:796439daaa03",`target`:"shipkg:fault:4de4eeb54341",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:a7e6406ec79afd95",`case_id`:"knowledge:electrical_oscillation",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:d85a741773e8f8b9",`source_file`:"Frontiers_2021_marine_converter_oscillations.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.frontiersin.org/journals/energy-research/articles/10.3389/fenrg.2020.529756/pdf",`page`:"2",`locator`:"PDF page 2",`quote`:"sed in percentage terms. The limits are 0.5% for frequency and 5% for voltage. Well documented causes of such behavior include pulsating torque of generators’ prime movers and/or ﬂuctuating load, which combined with commonly used droop control method for load sharing, possibly leads to severe short and long-term frequency ﬂuctuations. However, little is known about the osci",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:a89be5302fe7253d",`source`:"shipkg:case:63aa8b018e0d",`target`:"shipkg:condition:fc22b54510b9",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:a89be5302fe7253d",`case_id`:"stena_europe_fuel_2023",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:446e44bf86c01e9d",`source_file`:"MAIB_2024_20_Stena_Europe_fuel_spray_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6756db0ba63e1781efb87793/2024-20-StenaEurope.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"the external fuel systems on the remaining engines was missed and the risk of fuel leakage remained high. [2.3. 1] 4. Much of the insulation and shielding on all of Stena Europe’s engines was in a poor state of repair or missing completely. The ship’s crew and shore management had become accustomed to this condition over time, possibly due to the age of the vessel, leading to machi",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:a9a29b5decafa8ba",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:bff048b48ff1",`target`:"shipkg:condition:4e433b14487c",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:a9a29b5decafa8ba",`case_id`:"knowledge:generator_bearing_wear",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:0bd224f4476f3548",`source_file`:"STAMFORD_AGN076_alternator_bearings.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.stamford-avk.com/sites/stamfordavk/files/2024-04/AGN076_C.pdf",`page`:"4",`locator`:"PDF page 4",`quote`:"e expected, but the bearings might well be failing for different reasons. For example; where a ball bearing might fail because of axial vibration, causing a fretting action in the housing, the cylindrical roller bearing might fail because of lack of grease or misalignment damage. The anti-friction ball bearings used on STAMFORD alternators are not insulated bearings. The design of STAMFORD alternato",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:aa34a71289e4b926",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:6dbd0d51366c",`target`:"shipkg:check:c0dd4b8aa6a3",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及检查方法",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:aa34a71289e4b926",`case_id`:"knowledge:bearing_electrical_erosion",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:ac86437a65d64581",`source_file`:"STAMFORD_AGN033_bearing_currents.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.stamford-avk.com/sites/stamfordavk/files/AGNs/AGN-033_C-Shaft-Bearing-Currents.pdf",`page`:"3",`locator`:"PDF page 3",`quote`:"measured end to end, along the axial length of the alternator’s shaft was in the region of 60mV. The international standards for shaft voltage measurement differs in their determination of acceptable levels for non-insulated bearings, as shown in Table 1. Standard Description Range NEMA MG 1-2014 If the shaft voltage is larger than 300 millivolts peak, bearing insulation should be",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及检查方法\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:ab44237dacc29eaf",`source`:"shipkg:case:213f8edb92c2",`target`:"shipkg:check:c55d526e8c4c",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及检查方法",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:ab44237dacc29eaf",`case_id`:"queen_mary2_hf_2010",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:8d208881ac72d263",`source_file`:"MAIB_2011_28_Queen_Mary_2_harmonic_filter_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/547c6fa6ed915d4c10000031/QM2Report.pdf",`page`:"69",`locator`:"PDF page 69",`quote`:"possibly leading to a blackout and loss of control in restricted waters, the need for power quality surveillance is significant. Regular monitoring of power quality, using a pre-determined pattern of propulsion motor loading with associated motor operating parameters, would help ensure that the health of electrical equipment on board is closely monitored as the vessel and its equipment ages",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及检查方法\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:ac1e56ea13c88f93",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:6dbd0d51366c",`target`:"shipkg:action:9444999ad903",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及运维措施",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:ac1e56ea13c88f93",`case_id`:"knowledge:bearing_electrical_erosion",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:8552d0e3f49eb3e2",`source_file`:"STAMFORD_AGN033_bearing_currents.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.stamford-avk.com/sites/stamfordavk/files/AGNs/AGN-033_C-Shaft-Bearing-Currents.pdf",`page`:"3",`locator`:"PDF page 3",`quote`:"life. AvK Alternators. To overcome potential issues caused by induced shaft currents, AvK alternators utilise a combination of a rotor earthing brush and insulated bearings. The selection of these options are application and customer specific and will be determined during alternator specification negotiations. All AvK alternators for marine applications that are fitted with sleeve bearings have the",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及运维措施\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:ad18834d976ae608",`source`:"shipkg:case:7a1c0165bb56",`target`:"shipkg:fault:d26785dacafa",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:ad18834d976ae608",`case_id`:"sd2016_08_generator_oil",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:fc2a120321a8291a",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"26",`locator`:"PDF page 26",`quote`:"ers in the control room acknowledged a low oil pressure alarm on one of the generators (Figure 1). On the CCTV they observed that oil from this generator was spraying on to the adjacent generator. While they were investigating the source of the leak oil that had been sprayed on the exhaust casing of the adjacent engine caught fire. Fortunately the crew were able to quickly identify and isolate",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:ae11319705675ade",`source`:"shipkg:case:597875e258c6",`target`:"shipkg:action:8f48968a672d",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及运维措施",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:ae11319705675ade",`case_id`:"sd2016_05_cpp_backup",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:43a7cad5a93294eb",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"21",`locator`:"PDF page 21",`quote`:"articularly if they are tired or distracted. This type of risk is typically reduced on bridges and in engine control rooms by the fitting of protective covers over safety- critical buttons, switches and knobs. 2. The master was confident that he had control of his CPPs and did not look at the pitch indicators located on the control consoles. Had he done so he would have realised the st",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及运维措施\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:aeea1db0747cafe7",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:ce7933999459",`target`:"shipkg:action:41ba1c42b3a5",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及运维措施",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:aeea1db0747cafe7",`case_id`:"knowledge:liner_scuffing",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:3a5709969bdeb786",`source_file`:"MAN_SL2016_633_piston_rings_scuffing.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.man-es.com/docs/default-source/service-letters/sl2016-633.pdf",`page`:"2",`locator`:"PDF page 2",`quote`:"rmet will recover after the incident, provided the situ - ation is timely discovered and action is taken to ensure that it stops (increased lubrication and reduced load). However, the liner will need machining at the next overhaul to ensure proper running-in of the new rings. Fig. 1: The CPR ring pack containing 3 high rings with cermet-coating on all rings for 70 bore and above (SL2016-611/JAP)",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及运维措施\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:b139337ce7b3d157",`source`:"shipkg:case:597875e258c6",`target`:"shipkg:check:64ccf3c3f401",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及检查方法",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:b139337ce7b3d157",`case_id`:"sd2016_05_cpp_backup",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:aee93ed7c1866eb1",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"21",`locator`:"PDF page 21",`quote`:"id not fully understand the vessel’s propulsion control system and had not routinely tested their back-up and emergency controls. Regular testing of back-up and emergency control systems, and the conduct of machinery breakdown drills, provide the most effective method of ensuring the crew fully understand their ship’s systems and are best prepared to respond in an emergency. Figure 3: Damage to linkspan, mooring",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及检查方法\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:b15cee873e9d5efd",`source`:"shipkg:case:00057f56fe39",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:775549e4c085",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及后果",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:b15cee873e9d5efd",`case_id`:"wight_sky_me_2017",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:feb3c28c6560bd03",`source_file`:"MAIB_2018_14_Wight_Sky_engine_bearing_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5b5217c7ed915d0b81e003df/MAIBInvReport14_2018.pdf",`page`:"1",`locator`:"PDF page 1",`quote`:"t 2133 on 12 September 2017, while approaching Yarmouth, Isle of Wight, the ro-ro passenger ferry Wight Sky (Figure 1) suffered a catastrophic failure of one of its main propulsion engines, followed by a fire. The fire was brought under control in less than 2 minutes, but the vessel’s engineer, who had been standing near the engine, suffered serious burn injuries to his hands and face. Although he was discharged from hospital 7 days l",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及后果\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}}] AS row MATCH (a:ShipKG {id:row.source}), (b:ShipKG {id:row.target}) MERGE (a)-[r:INVOLVES {id:row.id}]->(b) SET r += row.properties RETURN count(r) AS processed_18 }
CALL () { UNWIND [{`id`:"edge:b1e927b793b4c3b4",`source`:"shipkg:case:adf367a46f33",`target`:"shipkg:fault:aba0717d72a0",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:b1e927b793b4c3b4",`case_id`:"wight_sky_me2_2018",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:a67a93bfec361edf",`source_file`:"MAIB_2022_04_Wight_Sky_multiple_engine_failures.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6267cc85e90e071690c1b679/2022-4-WightSky-Report.pdf",`page`:"84",`locator`:"PDF page 84",`quote`:"y due to a sudden loss of lubricating oil supply to its number five main journal bearing and number four crankpin. [2.3.1] 2. The oilway to the main journal and crankpin was blocked off when the bearing shells turned in their housing. Poor fuel combustion, the presence of silica sand and other abrasive particles embedded in the main bearing shells, engine misalignment, high levels of vibration, and contaminated lubricating oil might all have",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:b6118df8e96d8f9a",`source`:"shipkg:case:d6e9f8f8ade2",`target`:"shipkg:check:313a552b87bf",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及检查方法",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:b6118df8e96d8f9a",`case_id`:"finlandia_seaways_me_2018",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:33782f93bde6d8a1",`source_file`:"MAIB_2021_02_Finlandia_Seaways_connecting_rod_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/engine-failure-and-subsequent-fire-on-ro-ro-cargo-vessel-finlandia-seaways-with-1-person-injured",`page`:"56",`locator`:"PDF page 56",`quote`:"d a competent fitter to undertake the specific task of removing the piston pin bushes at its workshops in Klaipeda. Despite this, seven of the intact 11 small ends removed from Finlandia Seaways’ engine were found to have notch damage on the internal surfaces of their small end eyes. Three of Botnia Seaways’ small ends had similar damage and three had evidence of localised heat damage. Although the technical investigations did not identify when the damage had",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及检查方法\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:b87ce74b0276fc85",`source`:"shipkg:case:d6e9f8f8ade2",`target`:"shipkg:symptom:601948a19d34",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及症状",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:b87ce74b0276fc85",`case_id`:"finlandia_seaways_me_2018",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:b2ab413559094e03",`source_file`:"MAIB_2021_02_Finlandia_Seaways_connecting_rod_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/engine-failure-and-subsequent-fire-on-ro-ro-cargo-vessel-finlandia-seaways-with-1-person-injured",`page`:"56",`locator`:"PDF page 56",`quote`:"workshops in Klaipeda. Despite this, seven of the intact 11 small ends removed from Finlandia Seaways’ engine were found to have notch damage on the internal surfaces of their small end eyes. Three of Botnia Seaways’ small ends had similar damage and three had evidence of localised heat damage. Although the technical investigations did not identify when the damage had been done, it was clearly apparent that it had be",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及症状\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:b903a90841872075",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:796439daaa03",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:f285f6c5b4a4",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及后果",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:b903a90841872075",`case_id`:"knowledge:electrical_oscillation",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:852d00c244f5135b",`source_file`:"Frontiers_2021_marine_converter_oscillations.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.frontiersin.org/journals/energy-research/articles/10.3389/fenrg.2020.529756/pdf",`page`:"1",`locator`:"PDF page 1",`quote`:"frequency ﬂuctuations can lead to undesirable electrical motors shaft vibration and decrease in their energy efﬁciency and add thermal stress to insulation, thus creating hazardous operating conditions for electrical motors onboard ( Gnaci´nski et al., 2020 ). Frequency ﬂuctuations can also lead to undesirable resonances and cause crucial equipment such as measuring instruments to malfunct",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及后果\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:b94672f9cb6e6af1",`source`:"shipkg:case:8b13bdb1a5bc",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:ec261d7a91d6",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及后果",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:b94672f9cb6e6af1",`case_id`:"sd2016_09_cpp_response",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:085bb3fe51ea11cc",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"head. Despite placing the pitch control to full astern, the CPP did not respond in time and the vessel’s bow struck the quay. The bulbous bow was holed, but fortunately the damage was above the waterline (Figure 1). The subsequent investigation identified that the vessel had a history of sluggish astern response. However, the crew had accepted this as a ‘characteristic’ of the v",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及后果\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:b985df217b70c920",`source`:"shipkg:case:adf367a46f33",`target`:"shipkg:condition:a9a45fb680fd",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:b985df217b70c920",`case_id`:"wight_sky_me2_2018",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:cf454850540d2ce6",`source_file`:"MAIB_2022_04_Wight_Sky_multiple_engine_failures.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6267cc85e90e071690c1b679/2022-4-WightSky-Report.pdf",`page`:"85",`locator`:"PDF page 85",`quote`:"driving one VSP unit in parallel, because of the time it took the fluid couplings to declutch the shutdown engine. [2.8] 16. The inability to immediately declutch and therefore stop an engine when a shutdown signal was given significantly increased the severity of engine damage and the likelihood of explosions and fires. [2.8] 17. The long history of cavitation erosion and cylinder liner and engine block seal failures",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:b9eb58605a6a7f1b",`source`:"shipkg:case:9676bd22b5e5",`target`:"shipkg:symptom:ea2cdd59ea5c",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及症状",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:b9eb58605a6a7f1b",`case_id`:"sd2013_05_missing_filter",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:31361433815a45d9",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"21",`locator`:"PDF page 21",`quote`:"stigated but could not find any fault with the engine. He reset the alarm and continued with his duties. Several hours later, the OMD alarm activated again. The chief engineer was in the engine room and saw smoke vent from the main engine crankcase explosion relief doors. A lubricating oil low pressure alarm, and a lubricating oil low pressure trip alarm soon followed. The engine th",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及症状\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:ba193c8283f2f49a",`source`:"shipkg:case:551512d967af",`target`:"shipkg:fault:4cb7be531584",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:ba193c8283f2f49a",`case_id`:"sd2013_02_control_air",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:88a04930502bf0c9",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"14",`locator`:"PDF page 14",`quote`:"tended. The approach went according to plan until the ferry was about 1½ ships’ length from its final berthing position, when her three main engine clutches disengaged almost simultaneously. No Air, No Clutch, No CPP , No Brakes Damage to lubrication oil pipe and bottom end bearing Bottom end bearing Failed lubricant oil pipe end fitting",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:babcaa60c3fb022c",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:84e503bec36b",`target`:"shipkg:condition:43c6b88e1884",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:babcaa60c3fb022c",`case_id`:"knowledge:shaft_torsional",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:1e17c52e491ed79c",`source_file`:"STAMFORD_AGN235_torsional_analysis.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.stamford-avk.com/sites/stamfordavk/files/AGNs/AGN-235_A-Generating-Set-Assembly-Torsional-Vibration-Analysis.pdf",`page`:"1",`locator`:"PDF page 1",`quote`:"ng the extremely rapid pressure pulse of a burning air fuel mixture above the piston. The engine produces power in pulses and the pulses can excite very significant resonant responses. The pulsing of the power produced by the combustion process translates to angular vibrations in the crank shaft of the engine. The magnitude of the vibration depends on the number of cylinders in the engine. The movement of an i",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:bc165837532e5910",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:3353dce7f4ad",`target`:"shipkg:symptom:ea2cdd59ea5c",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及症状",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:bc165837532e5910",`case_id`:"knowledge:bearing_seizure",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:06bb917f36e1db67",`source_file`:"MAN_SL2013_569_bearing_wear_monitoring.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.man-es.com/docs/default-source/service-letters/sl2013-569.pdf",`page`:"2",`locator`:"PDF page 2",`quote`:"BWM system. • 58 minutes passed from the initial stage of the seizure until the alarm set off and slow-down was requested by the OMD system. The BWM specification issued by MDT was updated in 2011 to enable early detection of a sudden and rapidly Fig. 2: Sequence of alarms developing damage like the one mentioned above. The system fitted to the engine in question was",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及症状\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:bcecb7aae86074fb",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:84e503bec36b",`target`:"shipkg:fault:f6eb639558ed",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:bcecb7aae86074fb",`case_id`:"knowledge:shaft_torsional",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:1e17c52e491ed79c",`source_file`:"STAMFORD_AGN235_torsional_analysis.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.stamford-avk.com/sites/stamfordavk/files/AGNs/AGN-235_A-Generating-Set-Assembly-Torsional-Vibration-Analysis.pdf",`page`:"1",`locator`:"PDF page 1",`quote`:"ng the extremely rapid pressure pulse of a burning air fuel mixture above the piston. The engine produces power in pulses and the pulses can excite very significant resonant responses. The pulsing of the power produced by the combustion process translates to angular vibrations in the crank shaft of the engine. The magnitude of the vibration depends on the number of cylinders in the engine. The movement of an i",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:bff36626d49dda35",`source`:"shipkg:case:9676bd22b5e5",`target`:"shipkg:fault:aba0717d72a0",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:bff36626d49dda35",`case_id`:"sd2013_05_missing_filter",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:09940c64e5709cec",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"21",`locator`:"PDF page 21",`quote`:"n-line filter chamber, and the engine lubricating oil system was contaminated. The contamination caused main bearing seizure, the rotation of bearing shells and the blockage of oil ways, and subsequent oil starvation and overheating to other bearings and to the pistons. The engine daily logs referred to oil filter cartridge changes only prior to the repair to the oil pumps. They also showed that the pressure rea",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:c0134842aaaa9af1",`source`:"shipkg:case:551512d967af",`target`:"shipkg:fault:ccbff4c4e10b",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:c0134842aaaa9af1",`case_id`:"sd2013_02_control_air",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:5bedf556e2401880",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"14",`locator`:"PDF page 14",`quote`:"diate investigation identified that the main lubricating oil discharge pipe assembly in No1 compressor had detached, and that the bottom end bearing had overheated and failed (see figure). No1 compressor was isolated but the engineers soon noticed that the air pressure in the main air receiver was dropping. Shortly afterwards, the centre main engine was started and all three main engines were put on s",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:c06886f9f7e57f88",`source`:"shipkg:case:63aa8b018e0d",`target`:"shipkg:condition:ef4f2a093081",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:c06886f9f7e57f88",`case_id`:"stena_europe_fuel_2023",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:fc52e39e8b1fe63a",`source_file`:"MAIB_2024_20_Stena_Europe_fuel_spray_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6756db0ba63e1781efb87793/2024-20-StenaEurope.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"s. The opportunity to fit the modified flange connection to the external fuel systems on the remaining engines was missed and the risk of fuel leakage remained high. [2.3. 1] 4. Much of the insulation and shielding on all of Stena Europe’s engines was in a poor state of repair or missing completely. The ship’s crew and shore management had become accustomed to this condition over time, possi",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:c1f34997d40e15b9",`source`:"shipkg:case:1f8ffc7c55c3",`target`:"shipkg:fault:1e5a23a200ad",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:c1f34997d40e15b9",`case_id`:"pride_can_cpp_2014",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:fbf6ef7897c61557",`source_file`:"MAIB_2015_22_Pride_of_Canterbury_CPP_hydraulic_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/563092daed915d566d000002/MAIBInvReport-22_2015.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"akes of the starboard main engines. The flanged joint ruptured because the CPP system became over- pressurised as a result of the back pressure valve (PSV3) becoming jammed in the closed position. The reason for the temporary increase in the starboard main engine load to 100% and corresponding increase in turbocharger rpm has not been determined. However, the reason is not believed to be related to the cause of the fire.",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:c221e0c04eac453c",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:3353dce7f4ad",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:0d26b4ebcffb",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及后果",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:c221e0c04eac453c",`case_id`:"knowledge:bearing_seizure",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:7598b98aa07fcb83",`source_file`:"MAN_SL2013_569_bearing_wear_monitoring.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.man-es.com/docs/default-source/service-letters/sl2013-569.pdf",`page`:"2",`locator`:"PDF page 2",`quote`:"ist detec - tor (OMD) alarm set off and requested slow-down. At this stage, the bearing damage had evolved into a situation where comprehensive repair of the crankshaft and bearing housing (bedplate) was called for. Fig. 1: Damaged bearing shell A subsequent analysis of the signals stored in the BWM system log provided detailed information about the course of the bearing failure. It has been established tha",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及后果\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:c265fc9b04899aba",`source`:"shipkg:case:551512d967af",`target`:"shipkg:action:94c3bd7ec403",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及运维措施",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:c265fc9b04899aba",`case_id`:"sd2013_02_control_air",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:0f3029c8ff2b1f75",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"15",`locator`:"PDF page 15",`quote`:"unications between the engine room department and the bridge are imprecise or vague. Such difficulties can usually be overcome by conducting realistic machinery drills. Although such drills are often difficult to programme, they are a very good investment which, if conducted properly, will probably save time and money in the long run. 3. Check cards can be a useful aid to fault diagnosis and re",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及运维措施\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:c28d2e8c36e64d86",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:84e503bec36b",`target`:"shipkg:action:99ddd7acf595",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及运维措施",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:c28d2e8c36e64d86",`case_id`:"knowledge:shaft_torsional",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:40803a19c50fb460",`source_file`:"STAMFORD_AGN235_torsional_analysis.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.stamford-avk.com/sites/stamfordavk/files/AGNs/AGN-235_A-Generating-Set-Assembly-Torsional-Vibration-Analysis.pdf",`page`:"7",`locator`:"PDF page 7",`quote`:"cluding geometry, thermal capacity and torque transmission capacity. Pass / Fail criteria: • Vibratory torque at the coupling for engine normal and misfire scenarios. • Heat load in the coupling for engine normal and misfire scenarios. TVA Calculations and Results Analysis Hand calculations and Software tools such as Matlab, FEA, Dedicated TVA software, etc., are used to assess the system, co",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及运维措施\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:c56bd633add30006",`source`:"shipkg:case:9676bd22b5e5",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:d1c468a6b34b",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及后果",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:c56bd633add30006",`case_id`:"sd2013_05_missing_filter",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:893e7a7822c901f6",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"21",`locator`:"PDF page 21",`quote`:"ing oil low pressure alarm, and a lubricating oil low pressure trip alarm soon followed. The engine then shut down automatically. With propulsion lost, the master quickly anchored the vessel. After the engine was allowed to cool, the crankcase doors were removed; several crankshaft bearings were severely damaged (Figure 1) which prevented the engine from further operation. The",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及后果\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:c7203100f1a0ed3b",`source`:"shipkg:case:d6e9f8f8ade2",`target`:"shipkg:action:642ddc0bd6c5",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及运维措施",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:c7203100f1a0ed3b",`case_id`:"finlandia_seaways_me_2018",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:c4dfa47c81f2ebb5",`source_file`:"MAIB_2021_02_Finlandia_Seaways_connecting_rod_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/engine-failure-and-subsequent-fire-on-ro-ro-cargo-vessel-finlandia-seaways-with-1-person-injured",`page`:"56",`locator`:"PDF page 56",`quote`:"48 recommended procedures for overhauling the connecting rod small ends had not been followed, and the small ends had been damaged during the piston pin bush removal and fitting process. The extent of the damage was clearly visible to the naked eye but was either not identified during the engine/component overhauls or was",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及运维措施\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:c738aa985d178c94",`source`:"shipkg:case:9792cd36162e",`target`:"shipkg:condition:ff44ed04fc9f",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:c738aa985d178c94",`case_id`:"windcat8_port_engine_2017",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:1143f5b1ae869724",`source_file`:"MAIB_2018_01_Windcat8_bearing_failure_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/683922/MAIBInvReport01_2018.pdf",`page`:"9",`locator`:"PDF page 9",`quote`:"ation systems. Therefore, it is highly unlikely that the failure was the result of incorrect component assembly or a lack of oil. It is more likely that the failure was due to a weakness in the thin-walled shell bearing itself.",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:c73b68793ef21e47",`source`:"shipkg:case:9792cd36162e",`target`:"shipkg:action:9fa28e4c4571",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及运维措施",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:c73b68793ef21e47",`case_id`:"windcat8_port_engine_2017",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:e678a8a1bb3f1aec",`source_file`:"MAIB_2018_01_Windcat8_bearing_failure_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/683922/MAIBInvReport01_2018.pdf",`page`:"11",`locator`:"PDF page 11",`quote`:"ire resulted from the ignition of oil vapour released from the damaged crankcase and did not spread beyond the port engine. • The fixed fire-fighting system was rendered ineffective because not all the port engine space vents were closed prior to its release. • The safety of the embarked technicians was given a high priority. ACTION TAKEN Windcat Workboats BV Ltd has: • Instructed crews on board vessels fitted with Volvo Penta D16 engines to stop the affected eng",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及运维措施\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:c73d2b17b6de92f7",`source`:"shipkg:case:7a1c0165bb56",`target`:"shipkg:check:050d6770cfa0",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及检查方法",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:c73d2b17b6de92f7",`case_id`:"sd2016_08_generator_oil",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:1e3e12480476352c",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"28",`locator`:"PDF page 28",`quote`:"icient to ignite an oil or fuel spray. 2. These temperatures are not visible to the eye unless the surface is glowing. However, a thermal image will immediately identify unlagged sections (Figure 3). 3. All vessels are required to comply with SOLAS regulations regarding the maximum allowable temperature of an exposed surface (Chapter II/2): • All surfaces with temperatures above 220°C which may be impinged as a re",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及检查方法\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:c7ec08c7ad27397c",`source`:"shipkg:case:6f58fb8a8b17",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:81fff36694d8",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及后果",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:c7ec08c7ad27397c",`case_id`:"sd2016_22_cooling_pipe",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:e235f3eb9480640d",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"60",`locator`:"PDF page 60",`quote`:"al. Never delay unnecessarily when abandoning a sinking ship. 4. The rate of water ingress and the speed at which the vessel sank suggests the failure of a main engine sea water cooling pipe. Analysis of maintenance records showed that this pipework had not been inspected or renewed for many years. Sea inlet pipework should be thoroughly checked during planned maintenance periods. skipper, who had remained in the whe",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及后果\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:cb021a6095b947d3",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:3353dce7f4ad",`target`:"shipkg:action:e96de4e3b16c",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及运维措施",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:cb021a6095b947d3",`case_id`:"knowledge:bearing_seizure",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:b4983f0aef368bd8",`source_file`:"MAN_SL2013_569_bearing_wear_monitoring.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.man-es.com/docs/default-source/service-letters/sl2013-569.pdf",`page`:"2",`locator`:"PDF page 2",`quote`:"are capable of early detection of rapidly developing damage. Note that this update introduces connection of the BWM system to the automatic slow-down/load reduction func - tion of the main engine safety system. Questions regarding this service letter can be directed to our Operation department in Copenhagen (email: leo@mandieselturbo.com). -10 0 10 Minutes after damage initiation Damage init",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及运维措施\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:cb7f3503ca332be7",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:84e503bec36b",`target`:"shipkg:fault:64f6c42af0db",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:cb7f3503ca332be7",`case_id`:"knowledge:shaft_torsional",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:37c159b04a8c6f70",`source_file`:"STAMFORD_AGN235_torsional_analysis.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.stamford-avk.com/sites/stamfordavk/files/AGNs/AGN-235_A-Generating-Set-Assembly-Torsional-Vibration-Analysis.pdf",`page`:"2",`locator`:"PDF page 2",`quote`:"n a Generating Set. A TVA is required to measure the angular vibration against acceptable limits. A TVA should be performed:  To prevent fatigue or wear damage to the engine, alternator or the attached drivetrain system.  To minimize product noise and sound quality.  To improve equipment performance.  To avoid annoying vibrations transmitted to other parts of the machine.  To avoid",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:cccd4ad38e79c3fa",`source`:"shipkg:case:278d7572ef08",`target`:"shipkg:cause:0b368a5a5869",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及原因",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:cccd4ad38e79c3fa",`case_id`:"wight_sky_me4_2018",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:a4a51bca0c30f80d",`source_file`:"MAIB_2022_04_Wight_Sky_multiple_engine_failures.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6267cc85e90e071690c1b679/2022-4-WightSky-Report.pdf",`page`:"84",`locator`:"PDF page 84",`quote`:"f the engine’s matched connecting rod big end bearing caps had been transposed during the engine assembly process. [2.3.2] 4. The transposition of the bearing caps reduced the metal-to-metal contact between surfaces of the connecting rods and their bearing caps. This would have caused fretting wear between the mating faces, which would have led to loosening and rapid failure of the end cap securing bolts. [2.3.2] 5. Four of",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及原因\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:ccce652866418bbf",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:8a35cec932af",`target`:"shipkg:check:d57ef9f67880",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及检查方法",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:ccce652866418bbf",`case_id`:"knowledge:damper_failure",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:5cc0a7e2e1c99766",`source_file`:"MAN_SL2017_654_torsional_damper.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.man-es.com/docs/default-source/service-letters/sl2017-654.pdf",`page`:"1",`locator`:"PDF page 1",`quote`:"a failing torsional vibration damper could be abnormal noise from the torsional vibration damper or any change in the vibra- tion behavior of the complete GenSet. In such a case, the complete torsional vibration damper must be replaced. For questions or comments please contact operation dept. Holeby: leo7@mandieselturbo.com Yours faithfully Crankshaft Torsional Vibration Damper SL2017-654",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及检查方法\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:cd53ca4f8bd19d68",`source`:"shipkg:case:63aa8b018e0d",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:66c2df24581f",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及后果",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:cd53ca4f8bd19d68",`case_id`:"stena_europe_fuel_2023",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:db2b2fa6744312cc",`source_file`:"MAIB_2024_20_Stena_Europe_fuel_spray_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6756db0ba63e1781efb87793/2024-20-StenaEurope.pdf",`page`:"7",`locator`:"PDF page 7",`quote`:"Fishguard, Wales on passage from Rosslare, Ireland. The fire caused significant damage to the port main engine room and rendered one of its four main engines inoperative for several weeks. The fire was caused by fuel leaking under pressure from the fuel system of main engine number 3 and igniting on an exposed hot surface. No one was injured and there was no pollution. The investigation found that the fuel had ign",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及后果\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:ce639523e98e94d6",`source`:"shipkg:case:1f8ffc7c55c3",`target`:"shipkg:fault:562580f2bf5a",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:ce639523e98e94d6",`case_id`:"pride_can_cpp_2014",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:b1d5068e305409aa",`source_file`:"MAIB_2015_22_Pride_of_Canterbury_CPP_hydraulic_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/563092daed915d566d000002/MAIBInvReport-22_2015.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"recommendations to prevent similar accidents occurring in the future. 2.2 CAUSE OF THE FIRE The fire was initiated following the spray of hydraulic oil, from a ruptured pipework joint in the starboard CPP system, onto the hot exhaust uptakes of the starboard main engines. The flanged joint ruptured because the CPP system became over- pressurised as a result of the back pressure valve (PSV3) becoming jammed in",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:cf91d9f25181f963",`source`:"shipkg:case:187dc871fbd5",`target`:"shipkg:action:b39684450af7",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及运维措施",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:cf91d9f25181f963",`case_id`:"spirit_of_discovery_pods_2023",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:808bd8d1dd9e51f9",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_06_Spirit_of_Discovery_propulsion_loss.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/loss-of-propulsion-in-heavy-weather-experienced-by-the-passenger-vessel-spirit-of-discovery-leading-to-over-100-injuries-and-one-fatality",`page`:"53",`locator`:"PDF page 53",`quote`:"e vessel’s heading. ● Increased the SISHIp eSiPODs overspeed activation point following a mechanical evaluation of the systems. ● Improved the position of the SISHIp eSiPODs bilge sensor arrangements. Meyer Werft GmbH has: ● Created an additional seakeeping and manoeuvring decision support poster and software tool for the Spirit Class vessels that includes propeller exposure in wave heights up to 10.5m.",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及运维措施\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:d1a9dac1bb71f950",`source`:"shipkg:case:9676bd22b5e5",`target`:"shipkg:fault:8969204ea965",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:d1a9dac1bb71f950",`case_id`:"sd2013_05_missing_filter",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:09940c64e5709cec",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"21",`locator`:"PDF page 21",`quote`:"n-line filter chamber, and the engine lubricating oil system was contaminated. The contamination caused main bearing seizure, the rotation of bearing shells and the blockage of oil ways, and subsequent oil starvation and overheating to other bearings and to the pistons. The engine daily logs referred to oil filter cartridge changes only prior to the repair to the oil pumps. They also showed that the pressure rea",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:d2f632d6c0fb6506",`source`:"shipkg:case:1e6479e108d9",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:4f46c84c0d64",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及后果",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:d2f632d6c0fb6506",`case_id`:"kommandor_susan_dg1_2025",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:0ec8d60206b6b9cf",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_10_Kommandor_Susan_generator_bearing_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/catastrophic-engine-failure-and-subsequent-fire-on-board-the-site-investigation-vessel-kommandor-susan",`page`:"1",`locator`:"PDF page 1",`quote`:"ustered safely. The vessel lost propulsion and began drifting eastwards. Attempts to deploy anchors were unsuccessful because the anchor winches required electrical power to operate. Kommandor Susan was eventually returned to Leith harbour with limited propulsion restored. The investigation found that the engine failure was caused by premature wear of bearings fitted during a major overhaul in 2019. These co",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及后果\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:d34cfe896e4d0cec",`source`:"shipkg:case:adf367a46f33",`target`:"shipkg:symptom:ccae4eb65c57",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及症状",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:d34cfe896e4d0cec",`case_id`:"wight_sky_me2_2018",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:5124f3b43ff47b3a",`source_file`:"MAIB_2022_04_Wight_Sky_multiple_engine_failures.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6267cc85e90e071690c1b679/2022-4-WightSky-Report.pdf",`page`:"70",`locator`:"PDF page 70",`quote`:"ymington River. The engine was running at full speed (1800rpm) and was driving the forward VSP unit in parallel with ME1 when its ECU detected a loss of lubricating oil pressure and initiated an engine shutdown. 63 seconds later, the engine’s number four connecting rod and piston assembly was thrown out of the crankcase into the engine room. The engine had accumulated 2241 running hours and had been installed 11 months earlier as a new",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及症状\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:d369e4ac588c90d2",`source`:"shipkg:case:6f58fb8a8b17",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:cae4f7ac3ba9",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及后果",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:d369e4ac588c90d2",`case_id`:"sd2016_22_cooling_pipe",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:069c961d11b53b1c",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"60",`locator`:"PDF page 60",`quote`:"l sensors from the wheelhouse as he made his way to the liferaft. Once in the liferaft the crew cut the painter and watched their vessel sink in deep water as they drifted away (Figure 1) After spending an hour in the liferaft the crew were rescued by the crew of a vessel that had responded to the “Mayday” relay message. They were later transferred ashore, unharmed, by a rescue heli",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及后果\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:d516e4cdcfdb094e",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:6dbd0d51366c",`target`:"shipkg:condition:e3641dbad50c",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:d516e4cdcfdb094e",`case_id`:"knowledge:bearing_electrical_erosion",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:9eb024fc4137b406",`source_file`:"STAMFORD_AGN033_bearing_currents.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.stamford-avk.com/sites/stamfordavk/files/AGNs/AGN-033_C-Shaft-Bearing-Currents.pdf",`page`:"1",`locator`:"PDF page 1",`quote`:"aft within a rotating electrical machine - motor or alternator – to come under the influence of magnetic fields which result in a voltage (electrical pressure) generated along the axial length of the shaft. This ‘shaft voltage’ will then force current to flow from one end of the shaft, along a path which is radially out of the shaft through an end bracket continue along the alternators stator fra",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:d5aa2d44d6009bb2",`source`:"shipkg:case:63aa8b018e0d",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:775549e4c085",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及后果",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:d5aa2d44d6009bb2",`case_id`:"stena_europe_fuel_2023",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:b0b9daf02ad1af6f",`source_file`:"MAIB_2024_20_Stena_Europe_fuel_spray_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6756db0ba63e1781efb87793/2024-20-StenaEurope.pdf",`page`:"7",`locator`:"PDF page 7",`quote`:"noperative for several weeks. The fire was caused by fuel leaking under pressure from the fuel system of main engine number 3 and igniting on an exposed hot surface. No one was injured and there was no pollution. The investigation found that the fuel had ignited on part of the engine’s exhaust system that had a surface temperature of over 400°C. The post-accident inspection on board Stena Eu",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及后果\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:d5ec33f74bbb1e7c",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:ce7933999459",`target`:"shipkg:action:130ca8701fd4",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及运维措施",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:d5ec33f74bbb1e7c",`case_id`:"knowledge:liner_scuffing",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:76ff74dc44b9f086",`source_file`:"MAN_SL2023_737_cylinder_lubrication.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.man-es.com/docs/default-source/service-letters/sl2023-737.pdf",`page`:"1",`locator`:"PDF page 1",`quote`:"The lowered fuel sulphur content and the resulting lowering of the cylinder oil feed rate also stresses the importance of always maintaining an adequate oil film. For engines burning high-sulphur fuel, this Service Letter and SL2023-738/IKCA replace SL2014-587. For MC and MC-C engines with Alpha Lubricator Mk. 1 systems, SL2014-587, enclosure 4 should be used. High-performing engines call",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及运维措施\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:d6019c5d96f67955",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:f8ea1aa17718",`target`:"shipkg:condition:654fd1d6ce35",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:d6019c5d96f67955",`case_id`:"knowledge:cooling_cavitation",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:2d4645410e75d447",`source_file`:"MAN_main_engine_auxiliary_efficiency.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.man-es.com/docs/default-source/document-sync/efficiency-improvements-main-engine-auxiliary-systems-eng.pdf",`page`:"11",`locator`:"PDF page 11",`quote`:"ion and thereby increase cylinder wear. – Increased scavenge air temperature which will lead to increased fuel oil consumption. – A flow which is too low may cause local boiling on the water side inside the scavenge air cooler, which may lead to cavitation in the cooling water pipes. – The stated max. scavenge air temperature values given in the technical file may be exceeded, and the engine may thereby",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:d7a0292bd6013425",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:796439daaa03",`target`:"shipkg:check:4999713b2123",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及检查方法",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:d7a0292bd6013425",`case_id`:"knowledge:electrical_oscillation",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:10373ed4022e576f",`source_file`:"Frontiers_2021_marine_converter_oscillations.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.frontiersin.org/journals/energy-research/articles/10.3389/fenrg.2020.529756/pdf",`page`:"12",`locator`:"PDF page 12",`quote`:"amental voltage and frequency were affected in particular, with only minor impact of sea waves on harmonics modulation. Moreover, phase portraits can be used for fast detection of oscillatory behavior in maritime microgrids and their irregularities. The most important merit of such an approach is its simplicity. The calculations are fast and reliable. The dispersion of the results can",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及检查方法\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:d7a2187500e9acc9",`source`:"shipkg:case:1e6479e108d9",`target`:"shipkg:fault:423cd9a63be0",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:d7a2187500e9acc9",`case_id`:"kommandor_susan_dg1_2025",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:cebfc2d1ae68389d",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_10_Kommandor_Susan_generator_bearing_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/catastrophic-engine-failure-and-subsequent-fire-on-board-the-site-investigation-vessel-kommandor-susan",`page`:"5",`locator`:"PDF page 5",`quote`:"lts break by overload and connecting rod cap number six comes off. Pon Power’s report concluded that: With the facts gathered the most likely root cause is failure of connecting rod bearing number five. The excessive wear on the other connecting rod bearings show that the most likely root cause for the bearing failure is weak bonding of the copper layer. Evidence of weak material bonding was found in several bearings (Figure 4)",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:d83dfce415fccb49",`source`:"shipkg:case:ad49b658b30b",`target`:"shipkg:condition:f4f364d25a5d",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:d83dfce415fccb49",`case_id`:"sd2016_14_sea_valve",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:fb6cf34a58c7fe85",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"40",`locator`:"PDF page 40",`quote`:"f water ingress to the cargo hold, all six crew abandoned to one of the lifeboats. The vessel continued to flood (Figure 1), with water entering the accommodation areas through the open engine room doorway. The vessel’s owner contracted salvors, who were able to stop the flooding and, once stable, the vessel was towed into port.",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:dbc55013832a5dd9",`source`:"shipkg:case:ffc594a9fab7",`target`:"shipkg:symptom:674bee46af7f",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及症状",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:dbc55013832a5dd9",`case_id`:"sd2013_12_oily_rag",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:0e28dc346f51844d",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"41",`locator`:"PDF page 41",`quote`:"ifold and catch fire. The small fire then ignited the engine high temperature alarm cabling loom, causing it to short circuit and set off the alarm in the wheelhouse (Figure 2). The functional fire and smoke alarm sensors were some distance from the fire, and the smoke and heat had not migrated that far by the time the master noticed the smoke on the camera monitor.",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及症状\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:dbe48f5f44bca2f9",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:660e09f63773",`target`:"shipkg:action:6234e02eed7e",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及运维措施",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:dbe48f5f44bca2f9",`case_id`:"knowledge:coolant_blockage",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:63871ec3ef77a2d6",`source_file`:"MAN_SL2016_623_cooling_water.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.man-es.com/docs/default-source/service-letters/sl2016-623.pdf",`page`:"3",`locator`:"PDF page 3",`quote`:"which required topping up with untreated water. The MAN Diesel & Turbo recommendations are therefore once every 2 to 6 months to send a coolant sample to an in - dependent laboratory, the engine manufacturer or PrimeServ Lab. How often the coolant samples should be sent to the laboratory depends on the test result received from the labo - ratory. If the test results vary a lot over t",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及运维措施\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:dc1cbc084e5b7dc0",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:796439daaa03",`target`:"shipkg:check:5a856a1f5111",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及检查方法",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:dc1cbc084e5b7dc0",`case_id`:"knowledge:electrical_oscillation",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:77686b69a8ec6449",`source_file`:"Frontiers_2021_marine_converter_oscillations.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.frontiersin.org/journals/energy-research/articles/10.3389/fenrg.2020.529756/pdf",`page`:"13",`locator`:"PDF page 13",`quote`:"above described DP ship, a number of factors have to be taken into account: generators ’ prime movers modulated rotational speed, governors, and AVRs settings including droop control for load sharing, power converter parameters, and their control and ﬁnally irregularly modulated load of each drive. Therefore, the work will be pursued. The authors plan to concentrate on ships with elect",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及检查方法\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:dcc4bfb0d8c4d346",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:8a35cec932af",`target`:"shipkg:symptom:0164170e49d6",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及症状",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:dcc4bfb0d8c4d346",`case_id`:"knowledge:damper_failure",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:2204971987d93cb0",`source_file`:"MAN_SL2017_654_torsional_damper.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.man-es.com/docs/default-source/service-letters/sl2017-654.pdf",`page`:"1",`locator`:"PDF page 1",`quote`:"may lead to failure before reaching the mentioned operation limits. Indications of a failing torsional vibration damper could be abnormal noise from the torsional vibration damper or any change in the vibra- tion behavior of the complete GenSet. In such a case, the complete torsional vibration damper must be replaced. For questions or comments please contact operation de",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及症状\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:dd82911076f43af3",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:ce7933999459",`target`:"shipkg:condition:9b800c18cd13",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:dd82911076f43af3",`case_id`:"knowledge:liner_scuffing",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:ec47f7f58361e500",`source_file`:"MAN_SL2016_633_piston_rings_scuffing.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.man-es.com/docs/default-source/service-letters/sl2016-633.pdf",`page`:"2",`locator`:"PDF page 2",`quote`:"to polishing and, possibly, smearing of the surface. When the liner surface is smeared, the open graphite lamel - las are closed making it difficult to keep a proper oil film. When the oil film is compromised, the cast iron piston rings, which are in contact with the cast iron liner, may generate high friction and seizures that will not recover (liner scuffing). During scuffing, the surface of the lin",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:de5a862c5f6875ee",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:660e09f63773",`target`:"shipkg:cause:c5d7e29b6c94",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及原因",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:de5a862c5f6875ee",`case_id`:"knowledge:coolant_blockage",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:1ac13d5b81e13593",`source_file`:"MAN_SL2016_623_cooling_water.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.man-es.com/docs/default-source/service-letters/sl2016-623.pdf",`page`:"2",`locator`:"PDF page 2",`quote`:"der head. The damages are often a result of corrosion, restrictions in or blocking of the cooling water flow, which are caused by deposits of limescale and/or rust. In general corrosion may result in leakages and thereby re - duce the lifetime and safety of the engine components. Lime- scale as well as rust deposits will reduce the heat transfer and may result in thermal overload of the com",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及原因\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:e03688be7f2b579a",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:bff048b48ff1",`target`:"shipkg:condition:5b302d0da57d",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:e03688be7f2b579a",`case_id`:"knowledge:generator_bearing_wear",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:65e2c4b3facd8c2b",`source_file`:"STAMFORD_AGN076_alternator_bearings.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.stamford-avk.com/sites/stamfordavk/files/2024-04/AGN076_C.pdf",`page`:"4",`locator`:"PDF page 4",`quote`:"t fail because of axial vibration, causing a fretting action in the housing, the cylindrical roller bearing might fail because of lack of grease or misalignment damage. The anti-friction ball bearings used on STAMFORD alternators are not insulated bearings. The design of STAMFORD alternators is such that the shaft does not come under the influence of magnetic fields that result in excessive vol",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:e1f11fdd3d805260",`source`:"shipkg:case:9676bd22b5e5",`target`:"shipkg:symptom:ff3b8fa9a284",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及症状",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:e1f11fdd3d805260",`case_id`:"sd2013_05_missing_filter",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:0c984e504147698d",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"23",`locator`:"PDF page 23",`quote`:"e not overlooked. 2. One of the advantages of completing daily logs is the ability to assess trends in the operating machinery. A consistently low reading on the filter differential oil pressure gauge, and a comparison with previous operating hours between filter changes, should have rung alarm bells that something was wrong. 3. An oil mist detector gives advance warning of an impending major failure. When a detector alarm occ",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及症状\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:e3a5c848013e8ca2",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:660e09f63773",`target`:"shipkg:fault:41a15c8ffad7",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:e3a5c848013e8ca2",`case_id`:"knowledge:coolant_blockage",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:0aa614f9faf8b6fd",`source_file`:"MAN_SL2016_623_cooling_water.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.man-es.com/docs/default-source/service-letters/sl2016-623.pdf",`page`:"2",`locator`:"PDF page 2",`quote`:"e - duce the lifetime and safety of the engine components. Lime- scale as well as rust deposits will reduce the heat transfer and may result in thermal overload of the components to be cooled by the engine cooling water. A thermal overload may, however, also result in cracks and leakages as seen in the exhaust valve seat ring. Insufficient cooling water flow has widespread consequenc - e",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:e3d72c9785c554dc",`source`:"shipkg:case:213f8edb92c2",`target`:"shipkg:fault:c8fa85d36573",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:e3d72c9785c554dc",`case_id`:"queen_mary2_hf_2010",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:90e6711ec8bfcb6f",`source_file`:"MAIB_2011_28_Queen_Mary_2_harmonic_filter_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/547c6fa6ed915d4c10000031/QM2Report.pdf",`page`:"13",`locator`:"PDF page 13",`quote`:"between the capacitor plates developed, which vaporised the dielectric medium causing the internal pressure to increase, until it caused the capacitor casing to rupture. Dielectric fluid vapour sprayed out, igniting and creating the likely conditions for an arc-flash to occur between the 1 1000 volt bus bars that fed power to the aft HF . A current imbalance detection system, which was the only",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:e6221cf6d8ff0c74",`source`:"shipkg:case:d6e9f8f8ade2",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:775549e4c085",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及后果",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:e6221cf6d8ff0c74",`case_id`:"finlandia_seaways_me_2018",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:471026a1392177a8",`source_file`:"MAIB_2021_02_Finlandia_Seaways_connecting_rod_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/engine-failure-and-subsequent-fire-on-ro-ro-cargo-vessel-finlandia-seaways-with-1-person-injured",`page`:"9",`locator`:"PDF page 9",`quote`:"1 SYNOPSIS At 2003 on 16 April 2018, the Lithuanian registered ro-ro cargo vessel Finlandia Seaways suffered a catastrophic main engine failure that caused serious structural damage to the engine and a fire in the engine room. The vessel’s third engineer, who was on duty in the engine room at the time, suffered serious smoke-related lung, kidney and eye injuries during his escape. Finlandia Seaways was 11nm east of Lowestoft on a re",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及后果\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:e6b696047a99c943",`source`:"shipkg:case:551512d967af",`target`:"shipkg:check:f420d80dbf17",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及检查方法",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:e6b696047a99c943",`case_id`:"sd2013_02_control_air",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:3f0c5814259eb000",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"15",`locator`:"PDF page 15",`quote`:"st 2/2013 The Lessons 1. When starting machinery or when putting machinery on line or on load, it is good engineering practice to check that it is operating correctly. Assumptions often lead to unwanted surprises. 2. When a machinery breakdown occurs in close proximity to navigational dangers and other vessels, its consequences could be catastrophic unless effective action is taken quickly. Ho",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及检查方法\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:e7605f1ab5e66db2",`source`:"shipkg:case:6f58fb8a8b17",`target`:"shipkg:fault:511d6ce8c125",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:e7605f1ab5e66db2",`case_id`:"sd2016_22_cooling_pipe",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:8bf90883ea90543a",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"59",`locator`:"PDF page 59",`quote`:"gineer observed that water was almost level with the top of the main engine and was rising quickly. He started the bilge pump but could not reach the two sea water inlet valves as they were already more than a metre below the water level. The main engine then stopped and the engineer told the skipper that nothing could be done to stem the ingress of water. The Figure 1: Sequence showing fishing vessel s",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:e797ec5ada8c03e1",`source`:"shipkg:case:7a1c0165bb56",`target`:"shipkg:cause:2152c85364f8",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及原因",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:e797ec5ada8c03e1",`case_id`:"sd2016_08_generator_oil",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:4925b6b6f40f4c21",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"26",`locator`:"PDF page 26",`quote`:"a loose plug on the generator’s engine-mounted lubricating oil pump (Figure 2a). This had vibrated loose as a result of it being insufficiently tightened by shore staff during a recent dry dock. • A section of the adjacent generator’s exhaust piping had been left unlagged following its overhaul during the recent dry dock (Figure 2b). This was hidden from view by the exhaust casing. • Fine oil sp",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及原因\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:e8ca5aec715faadd",`source`:"shipkg:case:ffc594a9fab7",`target`:"shipkg:fault:999defd690d8",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:e8ca5aec715faadd",`case_id`:"sd2013_12_oily_rag",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:e3771166c08962b6",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"41",`locator`:"PDF page 41",`quote`:"ked rag to fall onto the hot manifold and catch fire. The small fire then ignited the engine high temperature alarm cabling loom, causing it to short circuit and set off the alarm in the wheelhouse (Figure 2). The functional fire and smoke alarm sensors were some distance from the fire, and the smoke and heat had not migrated that far by the time the master noticed the smoke on the camera monitor.",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:e991dcc60de6485a",`source`:"shipkg:case:551512d967af",`target`:"shipkg:action:8076c8558f20",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及运维措施",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:e991dcc60de6485a",`case_id`:"sd2013_02_control_air",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:a9d1c3390e834930",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"15",`locator`:"PDF page 15",`quote`:"g run. 3. Check cards can be a useful aid to fault diagnosis and rectification when things get hectic. However, in this case, the need to isolate the main air cylinder when the reserve air cylinder was brought on line was not included. Consequently, the air pressure equalised at a level that was insufficient to re-engage the main engine’s clutches. Use check cards, but don’t let them stop you f",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及运维措施\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:ea57d95758074a21",`source`:"shipkg:case:213f8edb92c2",`target`:"shipkg:action:bb1cd030e27b",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及运维措施",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:ea57d95758074a21",`case_id`:"queen_mary2_hf_2010",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:7ce8bf353caf8467",`source_file`:"MAIB_2011_28_Queen_Mary_2_harmonic_filter_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/547c6fa6ed915d4c10000031/QM2Report.pdf",`page`:"70",`locator`:"PDF page 70",`quote`:"accident (Annex K). Carnival PLC has: • Included harmonic filters in its list of critical equipment for QM2, and has ensured that procedures exist for regular testing of their protection systems. • Developed and implemented procedures for dealing with harmonic filter imbalance alarms and entering harmonic filter rooms after an alarm has activated. • Replaced all the capacitors in QM2’s aft harmonic filter. Converteam has",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及运维措施\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:ec34500d561a3beb",`source`:"shipkg:case:187dc871fbd5",`target`:"shipkg:action:b1b278b9bbdd",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及运维措施",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:ec34500d561a3beb",`case_id`:"spirit_of_discovery_pods_2023",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:c7e7236b07b0d8d2",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_06_Spirit_of_Discovery_propulsion_loss.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/loss-of-propulsion-in-heavy-weather-experienced-by-the-passenger-vessel-spirit-of-discovery-leading-to-over-100-injuries-and-one-fatality",`page`:"53",`locator`:"PDF page 53",`quote`:"obal GmbH & Co. KG has: ● Updated the SISHIp eSiPods software and corrected the operators’ manual. ● Updated the PCS to include a revised WLS sequence activation that allows the crew to intervene and prevent the SISHIp eSiPODs parking at 90° to the vessel’s heading. ● Increased the SISHIp eSiPODs overspeed activation point following a mechanical evaluation of the systems. ● Improved the position of the SISHIp eSiPODs bilg",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及运维措施\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:ecd21828868f7b9d",`source`:"shipkg:case:1e6479e108d9",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:4016217446bf",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及后果",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:ecd21828868f7b9d",`case_id`:"kommandor_susan_dg1_2025",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:390711bc162bb6ce",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_10_Kommandor_Susan_generator_bearing_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/catastrophic-engine-failure-and-subsequent-fire-on-board-the-site-investigation-vessel-kommandor-susan",`page`:"1",`locator`:"PDF page 1",`quote`:"r Susan suffered a catastrophic failure of a diesel generator engine while conducting sea trials in the Firth of Forth, Scotland. The failure resulted in an engine room fire and a complete power blackout. The crew responded promptly, extinguished the fire and mustered safely. The vessel lost propulsion and began drifting eastwards. Attempts to deploy anchors were unsuccessful because the anchor winches required electrical power t",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及后果\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:ed0db675da67eb16",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:3353dce7f4ad",`target`:"shipkg:cause:7009e2343511",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及原因",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:ed0db675da67eb16",`case_id`:"knowledge:bearing_seizure",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:0523deba67297b7c",`source_file`:"MAN_SL2013_569_bearing_wear_monitoring.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.man-es.com/docs/default-source/service-letters/sl2013-569.pdf",`page`:"2",`locator`:"PDF page 2",`quote`:"C A main bearing damage was recently experienced on an MAN B&W S-MC-C main engine of medium bore size. The damage was caused by a sudden ingress of foreign matter into the bearing via the lubricating oil system, and it devel - oped rapidly into a bearing seizure. The engine was equipped with a bearing wear monitoring (BWM) system as recommended by MAN Diesel & Turbo (MDT). However, for rea",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及原因\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:ed933a1ae04c11c1",`source`:"shipkg:case:213f8edb92c2",`target`:"shipkg:check:5a2af85dcbf4",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及检查方法",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:ed933a1ae04c11c1",`case_id`:"queen_mary2_hf_2010",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:38d40fe90e8b2dbf",`source_file`:"MAIB_2011_28_Queen_Mary_2_harmonic_filter_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/547c6fa6ed915d4c10000031/QM2Report.pdf",`page`:"69",`locator`:"PDF page 69",`quote`:"when there are no alternative or back-up systems, must fail safe. They should also be tested at regular intervals to verify that all the sub-components in the system are functional. [2.4.5] 7 . Awareness of arc-flash hazards needs to be significantly increased throughout the marine industry, so that designers, builders, owners, operators and engineers understand the hazard, risks and the potential risk redu",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及检查方法\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:edb07dad430e24d4",`source`:"shipkg:case:597875e258c6",`target`:"shipkg:symptom:fa4424a6b543",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及症状",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:edb07dad430e24d4",`case_id`:"sd2016_05_cpp_backup",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:b0c29f0e315a7acd",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"19",`locator`:"PDF page 19",`quote`:"continued towards the port. However, a few minutes later the engineers in the engine control room noticed that the starboard CPP back-up control system indicator lamp was illuminated on their console. Having not seen this before, they discussed its significance before deciding to take no immediate action. As the vessel entered the port the master reduced speed by decreasing the pitch settings on the port and",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及症状\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:edbb713d08d8dd44",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:84e503bec36b",`target`:"shipkg:fault:216400f082cf",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:edbb713d08d8dd44",`case_id`:"knowledge:shaft_torsional",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:5cf0da035bedd926",`source_file`:"STAMFORD_AGN035_fault_protection.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.stamford-avk.com/sites/stamfordavk/files/AGNs/AGN-035_B-Overload-and-Fault-Protection.pdf",`page`:"5",`locator`:"PDF page 5",`quote`:"ic energy, identified by electrical engineers as inertia constant (H). Obviously, the coupling will be subjected to some level of transient peak torque demand during the time zero up to steady state condition and the 'typical' level considered by responsible mechanical engineers is 12 times rated torque. It should not be forgotten that the most arduous conditions for generating mechani",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:ee29e9d5aa94c5ec",`source`:"shipkg:case:187dc871fbd5",`target`:"shipkg:fault:c830e7992f26",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:ee29e9d5aa94c5ec",`case_id`:"spirit_of_discovery_pods_2023",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:5d3cde311b090a6a",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_06_Spirit_of_Discovery_propulsion_loss.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/loss-of-propulsion-in-heavy-weather-experienced-by-the-passenger-vessel-spirit-of-discovery-leading-to-over-100-injuries-and-one-fatality",`page`:"42",`locator`:"PDF page 42",`quote`:"e rpm of each pod’s propulsion motor very rapidly increased and exceeded the preset overspeed limitation. The pod’s PCS therefore automatically tripped the power to its motor to prevent it being damaged. Spirit of Discovery’s engineers could likely have quickly reset the port and starboard motors and restored the vessel’s propulsion had the propulsion motor overspeed trips been the only issue. However",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:ee3a3fd7da059efd",`source`:"shipkg:case:1f8ffc7c55c3",`target`:"shipkg:condition:4dcab8c954bb",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:ee3a3fd7da059efd",`case_id`:"pride_can_cpp_2014",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:7058770c39736963",`source_file`:"MAIB_2015_22_Pride_of_Canterbury_CPP_hydraulic_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/563092daed915d566d000002/MAIBInvReport-22_2015.pdf",`page`:"30",`locator`:"PDF page 30",`quote`:"24 the valves and their refitting was deemed an unnecessary measure. However, the oil sampling programme had not identified the wear in the back pressure valve as it had, most likely, occurred gradually over a long period of time. 2.3.3 Pipework joints and shielding Whereas the main components of Pride of Canterbury’s CPP system were supplied after testing by",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:eed5662c75c14263",`source`:"shipkg:case:597875e258c6",`target`:"shipkg:fault:f078b5a27275",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:eed5662c75c14263",`case_id`:"sd2016_05_cpp_backup",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:4812bf9684b2b7ad",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"21",`locator`:"PDF page 21",`quote`:"14 MAIB Safety Digest 1/2016 CASE 5 The Lessons 1. Ergonomically, the layout of the bridge console was not well designed. The close proximity of the safety-critical propulsion control buttons and the similar looking everyday use dimmer buttons, increased the likelihood of the type of human error seen in this case. There is always a risk that watchkeepers and equipment operators will inadvertently press the wrong butto",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:eefb148231b37a54",`source`:"shipkg:case:1f8ffc7c55c3",`target`:"shipkg:condition:4fe499c68172",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:eefb148231b37a54",`case_id`:"pride_can_cpp_2014",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:a761595279b52f7c",`source_file`:"MAIB_2015_22_Pride_of_Canterbury_CPP_hydraulic_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/563092daed915d566d000002/MAIBInvReport-22_2015.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"ey need to be checked to ensure they continue to function correctly. However, in the case of Pride of Canterbury these valves had never been tested or inspected since the ship was constructed 23 years previously. The LIPS CPP system manual provided some maintenance instructions, including annual testing of pressure safety valve (PSV1) and the back pressure valve (PSV3). However, how this",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:efb389cfdce36b21",`source`:"shipkg:case:551512d967af",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:fd1e977000c3",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及后果",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:efb389cfdce36b21",`case_id`:"sd2013_02_control_air",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:7009d03f4c6f89d9",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"15",`locator`:"PDF page 15",`quote`:"ge the clutches. Although the starboard anchor was let go in an attempt to reduce the speed of approach, this did not prevent the ferry’s bow hitting her berth at a speed of 2.5kts and causing minor damage. Shortly after the impact, the engineers successfully re-engaged the port main engine clutch and the vessel was able to berth safely alongside, assisted by harbour tugs. Subsequent investigation identifie",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及后果\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:f08a562db82c3f55",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:8a35cec932af",`target`:"shipkg:fault:655f841ec7d0",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:f08a562db82c3f55",`case_id`:"knowledge:damper_failure",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:71b1d838f3e59389",`source_file`:"MAN_SL2017_654_torsional_damper.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.man-es.com/docs/default-source/service-letters/sl2017-654.pdf",`page`:"1",`locator`:"PDF page 1",`quote`:"oil - r educed lube oil supply - c ontaminated lube oil leading to carbon built up internal the damper b y the centrifugal forces will reduce the service life of the torsional vibration damper and may lead to failure before reaching the mentioned operation limits. Indications of a failing torsional vibration damper could be abnormal noise from the torsional vibration damper or any chan",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:f1537cdb6f539138",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:40cb53a64e31",`target`:"shipkg:check:e3171f6b59e1",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及检查方法",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:f1537cdb6f539138",`case_id`:"knowledge:winding_insulation",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:0e3fac9dc3cdbd8f",`source_file`:"STAMFORD_AGN040_winding_insulation.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.stamford-avk.com/sites/stamfordavk/files/AGNs/AGN-040_E-Winding-Insulation-System.pdf",`page`:"6",`locator`:"PDF page 6",`quote`:"ce and understanding about the risk of operation of the alternator’s insulation system is required, then the next test would be a Polarization Index - PI Test. The alternator's Insulation Resistance (IR), along with many other critical factors, will have been measured during the STAMFORD | AvK factory processes of manufacture, assembly and test. The alternator will have been",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及检查方法\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:f46de1d1d512d556",`source`:"shipkg:case:7a1c0165bb56",`target`:"shipkg:condition:52a5771f68ca",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:f46de1d1d512d556",`case_id`:"sd2016_08_generator_oil",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:59a2040fb754c1d5",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"28",`locator`:"PDF page 28",`quote`:"21 MAIB Safety Digest 1/2016 CASE 8 The Lessons 1. Unlagged sections of exhaust piping will radiate heat to the protective casing, causing it to attain temperatures sufficient to ignite an oil or fuel spray. 2. These temperatures are not visible to the eye unless the surface is glowing. However, a thermal image will immediately identify unlagged sections (F",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:f4e393236cdd2029",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:40cb53a64e31",`target`:"shipkg:fault:8b8846e83caf",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:f4e393236cdd2029",`case_id`:"knowledge:winding_insulation",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:454c2c34e07b2395",`source_file`:"STAMFORD_AGN035_fault_protection.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.stamford-avk.com/sites/stamfordavk/files/AGNs/AGN-035_B-Overload-and-Fault-Protection.pdf",`page`:"2",`locator`:"PDF page 2",`quote`:"e within the graphically displayed current against time, in order to avoid initiating permanent damage, which would result in the thermal degradation of the alternator’s insulation system. The disconnect times are achieved by the engineer responsible for selecting a circuit breaker, which has the appropriate adjustable tripping characteristics that can be set to ensure complia",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:f5b76f3c5a125c98",`source`:"shipkg:case:ad49b658b30b",`target`:"shipkg:action:84a87c035a24",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及运维措施",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:f5b76f3c5a125c98",`case_id`:"sd2016_14_sea_valve",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:d1a2571c248baad4",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"41",`locator`:"PDF page 41",`quote`:"e was safely released from the suction side of the pump by using the bleed nut on the suction strainer. • Ensuring that the inlet flange was split in a controlled manner with a number of loosened bolts still in situ to enable them to be re-tightened in the event of the isolating valve not holding. 2. The crew’s response to the flooding was ineffective because they were not prepared for the emerge",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及运维措施\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:f5f7e253a9fb05b7",`source`:"shipkg:case:ad49b658b30b",`target`:"shipkg:fault:db9b4536b139",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:f5f7e253a9fb05b7",`case_id`:"sd2016_14_sea_valve",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:e8101941c0ddc6d2",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"41",`locator`:"PDF page 41",`quote`:"ng emergency? 3. Examination of the isolating valve following the accident identified that the valve actuator had been defective, giving an impression that the valve was fully closed when it was not. Although there was a visual indicator located on the side of the actuator, this was not checked to confirm that the valve was closed prior to removal of the flange bolts. The actuator had previously been repaired. However, the c",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:f666dae6f01177ac",`source`:"shipkg:case:adf367a46f33",`target`:"shipkg:cause:8a2abf94d478",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及原因",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:f666dae6f01177ac",`case_id`:"wight_sky_me2_2018",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:f586cbe874297cd1",`source_file`:"MAIB_2022_04_Wight_Sky_multiple_engine_failures.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6267cc85e90e071690c1b679/2022-4-WightSky-Report.pdf",`page`:"84",`locator`:"PDF page 84",`quote`:"main journal and crankpin was blocked off when the bearing shells turned in their housing. Poor fuel combustion, the presence of silica sand and other abrasive particles embedded in the main bearing shells, engine misalignment, high levels of vibration, and contaminated lubricating oil might all have contributed to the event failure. [2.3.1] 3. Wight Sky’s ME4 failed catastrophically because of an assembly error during build at Vol",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及原因\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:f7e2453fe0a220b2",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:8a35cec932af",`target`:"shipkg:condition:212a684d37a2",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:f7e2453fe0a220b2",`case_id`:"knowledge:damper_failure",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:66303eda9ce85d8c",`source_file`:"MAN_SL2017_654_torsional_damper.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.man-es.com/docs/default-source/service-letters/sl2017-654.pdf",`page`:"1",`locator`:"PDF page 1",`quote`:"ses which inevitably lead to wear and tear on the torsional vibration damper. Unfavorable operating conditions such as: - e ngine over-speed - s hocks caused by hydraulic locks in engine cylinders - w ater in the lube oil - r educed lube oil supply - c ontaminated lube oil leading to carbon built up internal the damper b y the centrifugal forces will reduce the servic",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:f7f3e6ed5fcb1562",`source`:"shipkg:case:187dc871fbd5",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:7de07882b364",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及后果",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:f7f3e6ed5fcb1562",`case_id`:"spirit_of_discovery_pods_2023",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:a61057fac0fe1035",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_06_Spirit_of_Discovery_propulsion_loss.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/loss-of-propulsion-in-heavy-weather-experienced-by-the-passenger-vessel-spirit-of-discovery-leading-to-over-100-injuries-and-one-fatality",`page`:"51",`locator`:"PDF page 51",`quote`:"e vessel. [2.3.1] 3. The loss of control was exacerbated by the initiation of the pod’s water leakage stop sequence, which led to both pods being parked at 90° to the vessel’s heading. This caused the vessel to lose steerage, its bow to swing to port and its motion to become even more severe. [2.3.1] 4. The vessel’s propulsion control system was unable to prevent the loss of propulsion when its movement was wi",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及后果\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:f969f426eeb89319",`source`:"shipkg:case:213f8edb92c2",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:4016217446bf",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及后果",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:f969f426eeb89319",`case_id`:"queen_mary2_hf_2010",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:488cfef2b71e970c",`source_file`:"MAIB_2011_28_Queen_Mary_2_harmonic_filter_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/547c6fa6ed915d4c10000031/QM2Report.pdf",`page`:"13",`locator`:"PDF page 13",`quote`:"thin the aft HF at the time of the accident caused general instability in the electrical network which could not be contained and led to the generators shutting down. Lloyd’s Register (Europe, Middle East and Asia) (LR) has been recommended to take forward proposals to the International Association of Classification Societies to: • Establish a requirement for all new vessels fitted with harmo",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及后果\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:f9868eeca0e99d78",`source`:"shipkg:case:1f8ffc7c55c3",`target`:"shipkg:check:b6e1865763c1",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及检查方法",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:f9868eeca0e99d78",`case_id`:"pride_can_cpp_2014",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:ccd29d6aeef2b43d",`source_file`:"MAIB_2015_22_Pride_of_Canterbury_CPP_hydraulic_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/563092daed915d566d000002/MAIBInvReport-22_2015.pdf",`page`:"35",`locator`:"PDF page 35",`quote`:"d PSV3 on all CPP hydraulic modules. • Implemented a maintenance programme in which at least PSV1, PSV3 and NRV6 are disabled and their function checked once every 5 years. • Added a full flow check-valve, with an opening pressure of 10-12 bar, in the return oil circuit by-passing PSV3, the Oil Cooler and NRV6. Also, an additional alarm signal was to be fitted in the control system to give an alarm",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及检查方法\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:fa8b800951e9a69b",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:6456485708ad",`target`:"shipkg:action:acaa49cd0860",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及运维措施",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:fa8b800951e9a69b",`case_id`:"knowledge:shaft_generator_alignment",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:2bfc3c9a35fee950",`source_file`:"STAMFORD_AGN039_marine_shaft_generators.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.stamford-avk.com/sites/stamfordavk/files/AGNs/AGN-039_C-Marine-Shaft-Generators.pdf",`page`:"2",`locator`:"PDF page 2",`quote`:"and will ensure that the coupling between gearbox and the shaft generator is a high quality, designed for purpose unit, which can absorb misalignment, and also torsional vibrations to help the generator remain reliable. POWER TAKE OUT (PTO) / POWER TAKE IN (PTI) / POWER TAKE HOME (PTH) Marine shaft generators are often required to operate in a multi-function role. They could o",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及运维措施\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:fae55111f22503c3",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:f8ea1aa17718",`target`:"shipkg:symptom:986db6816df4",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及症状",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:fae55111f22503c3",`case_id`:"knowledge:cooling_cavitation",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:9b96e30fbe8114af",`source_file`:"MAN_main_engine_auxiliary_efficiency.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.man-es.com/docs/default-source/document-sync/efficiency-improvements-main-engine-auxiliary-systems-eng.pdf",`page`:"11",`locator`:"PDF page 11",`quote`:"a function of the engine load and the ambient conditions. When reducing the water flow the following implications are foreseen: – Increased scavenge air temperature which will lead to a reduction of the water condensation amount in certain ambient conditions. Reduced water condensation will lead to a higher humidity level in the combustion chamber, which will have a negative effect on the ge",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及症状\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:fbc1bc6eae5124a5",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:6dbd0d51366c",`target`:"shipkg:fault:7dd3cdd4fe58",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:fbc1bc6eae5124a5",`case_id`:"knowledge:bearing_electrical_erosion",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:0f7534e3f93d98e3",`source_file`:"STAMFORD_AGN033_bearing_currents.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.stamford-avk.com/sites/stamfordavk/files/AGNs/AGN-033_C-Shaft-Bearing-Currents.pdf",`page`:"1",`locator`:"PDF page 1",`quote`:"porting bearings, consequently any resulting current flow will pass across the rolling element of the bearings, and will initiate electrical erosion of the bearing materials, eventually reducing the low friction expectation of the bearing. It is possible for a single bearing alternator to suffer from shaft bearing currents, but here the current flow path at the drive end of the alternator’s shaft mus",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:fc8aac60ddb0a728",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:3353dce7f4ad",`target`:"shipkg:condition:ef7365f4e337",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:fc8aac60ddb0a728",`case_id`:"knowledge:bearing_seizure",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:a6b5f4147115c639",`source_file`:"MAN_SL2013_569_bearing_wear_monitoring.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.man-es.com/docs/default-source/service-letters/sl2013-569.pdf",`page`:"2",`locator`:"PDF page 2",`quote`:"g wear monitoring (BWM) system as recommended by MAN Diesel & Turbo (MDT). However, for reasons not relevant in this context, the crew did not react to the alarm and slow-down signals from the BWM system. Operation of the engine continued until the oil mist detec - tor (OMD) alarm set off and requested slow-down. At this stage, the bearing damage had evolved into a situation where compreh",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:fe66d3f252c52257",`source`:"shipkg:case:597875e258c6",`target`:"shipkg:action:2c60146dc1a8",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及运维措施",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:fe66d3f252c52257",`case_id`:"sd2016_05_cpp_backup",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:74d39332305ecab7",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"21",`locator`:"PDF page 21",`quote`:"and rectified the problem. Engineers are put on standby in control rooms during manoeuvring operations for a reason; not least to keep the bridge team informed of the status of all safety-critical systems. 4. The vessel’s crew were all experienced and many of them had spent most of their career operating similar types of vessels with the same company. However, the bridge and engineering teams did not",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及运维措施\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:fe9cd56fb06fbf29",`source`:"shipkg:case:7a1c0165bb56",`target`:"shipkg:fault:5bc176965c58",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及故障",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:fe9cd56fb06fbf29",`case_id`:"sd2016_08_generator_oil",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:a36fbb3ebb9e478c",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"26",`locator`:"PDF page 26",`quote`:"t unlagged following its overhaul during the recent dry dock (Figure 2b). This was hidden from view by the exhaust casing. • Fine oil spray ignited when it came into contact with the hot exhaust casing. Figure 1: Location of the generator with the loose oil plug and the adjacent generator with the uninsulated section of the exhaust piping",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及故障\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:fef8f4c4663670cd",`source`:"shipkg:case:ad49b658b30b",`target`:"shipkg:condition:b290b6459200",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及工况与状态",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:fef8f4c4663670cd",`case_id`:"sd2016_14_sea_valve",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:9bfb29365e610d09",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"40",`locator`:"PDF page 40",`quote`:"nected the electric motor from the pump. He then removed the flange bolts connecting the inlet pipe to the pump. Soon afterwards, water started to flow from the inlet pipe at a rapidly increasing rate. The chief engineer tried to reduce the rate by jamming rags into the pipe, but the flow was too strong. He then sent the motorman to fetch some pieces of wood, which he intended to force into the pip",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及工况与状态\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}}] AS row MATCH (a:ShipKG {id:row.source}), (b:ShipKG {id:row.target}) MERGE (a)-[r:INVOLVES {id:row.id}]->(b) SET r += row.properties RETURN count(r) AS processed_19 }
CALL () { UNWIND [{`id`:"edge:006a785db589c4f8",`source`:"shipkg:fault:c1ffab11185c",`target`:"shipkg:fault:86ef7d39fd57",`properties`:{`name`:"促成",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:006a785db589c4f8",`case_id`:"sd2016_14_sea_valve",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:5192357e40ea3dd4",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"41",`locator`:"PDF page 41",`quote`:"f the isolating valve following the accident identified that the valve actuator had been defective, giving an impression that the valve was fully closed when it was not. Although there was a visual indicator located on the side of the actuator, this was not checked to confirm that the valve was closed prior to removal of the flange bolts. The actuator had previously been repaired. However, the c",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"促成\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:19d0e288a66d196a",`source`:"shipkg:symptom:986db6816df4",`target`:"shipkg:fault:6e677eff9bb9",`properties`:{`context_id`:"knowledge:cooling_cavitation",`knowledge_layer`:"reference",`data_origin`:"manufacturer_guidance",`applicability`:"扫气空气冷却器水侧；该证据描述低流量局部沸腾及管路汽蚀，不等同于已证明所有冷却泵汽蚀由此引起。",`coupling_domains`:"热-机",`name`:"促成",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:19d0e288a66d196a",`case_id`:"knowledge:cooling_cavitation",`certainty`:"guidance",`certainty_zh`:"厂家一般机理/指导（须核对机型）",`evidence_id`:"ev:cac3b1da7944aa5a",`source_file`:"MAN_main_engine_auxiliary_efficiency.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.man-es.com/docs/default-source/document-sync/efficiency-improvements-main-engine-auxiliary-systems-eng.pdf",`page`:"11",`locator`:"PDF page 11",`quote`:"higher humidity level in the combustion chamber, which will have a negative effect on the general cylinder condition and thereby increase cylinder wear. – Increased scavenge air temperature which will lead to increased fuel oil consumption. – A flow which is too low may cause local boiling on the water side inside the scavenge air cooler, which may lead to cavitation in the cool",`props_json`:"{\"context_id\": \"knowledge:cooling_cavitation\", \"knowledge_layer\": \"reference\", \"data_origin\": \"manufacturer_guidance\", \"applicability\": \"扫气空气冷却器水侧；该证据描述低流量局部沸腾及管路汽蚀，不等同于已证明所有冷却泵汽蚀由此引起。\", \"coupling_domains\": \"热-机\", \"name\": \"促成\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:2582a75e6a4ea98b",`source`:"shipkg:condition:50dc70737e5d",`target`:"shipkg:fault:4de4eeb54341",`properties`:{`context_id`:"knowledge:electrical_oscillation",`knowledge_layer`:"reference",`data_origin`:"research_paper",`applicability`:"2021论文三类船舶的实测电网信号，含轴带发电化学品船；不是所有振荡都超限。DP船风浪影响主要作用于基波与频率，不能一概说风浪显著放大所有谐波。",`coupling_domains`:"机-电",`name`:"促成",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:2582a75e6a4ea98b",`case_id`:"knowledge:electrical_oscillation",`certainty`:"research_observation",`certainty_zh`:"论文实测观察（非本船已证实根因）",`evidence_id`:"ev:17d803145e66029c",`source_file`:"Frontiers_2021_marine_converter_oscillations.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.frontiersin.org/journals/energy-research/articles/10.3389/fenrg.2020.529756/pdf",`page`:"6",`locator`:"PDF page 6",`quote`:"otational speed of the prime mover is still present adding to the severity of ﬂuctuations due to waves. As a result, the depth of voltage and frequency modulations increase as well. For the presented example, the difference between maximum and minimum instantaneous frequency reaches 0.32 Hz or 0.32% of twice the system rated frequency. This is still below the recommended limit value of 0.5% ( IEEE Standard 4",`props_json`:"{\"context_id\": \"knowledge:electrical_oscillation\", \"knowledge_layer\": \"reference\", \"data_origin\": \"research_paper\", \"applicability\": \"2021论文三类船舶的实测电网信号，含轴带发电化学品船；不是所有振荡都超限。DP船风浪影响主要作用于基波与频率，不能一概说风浪显著放大所有谐波。\", \"coupling_domains\": \"机-电\", \"name\": \"促成\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:2dfbdbf1c8a3c98e",`source`:"shipkg:condition:fc22b54510b9",`target`:"shipkg:condition:4277de3a84c9",`properties`:{`name`:"促成",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:2dfbdbf1c8a3c98e",`case_id`:"stena_europe_fuel_2023",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:446e44bf86c01e9d",`source_file`:"MAIB_2024_20_Stena_Europe_fuel_spray_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6756db0ba63e1781efb87793/2024-20-StenaEurope.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"the external fuel systems on the remaining engines was missed and the risk of fuel leakage remained high. [2.3. 1] 4. Much of the insulation and shielding on all of Stena Europe’s engines was in a poor state of repair or missing completely. The ship’s crew and shore management had become accustomed to this condition over time, possibly due to the age of the vessel, leading to machi",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"促成\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:37ba783e68d5a5a2",`source`:"shipkg:fault:40958d8dddba",`target`:"shipkg:condition:ed8375f7583f",`properties`:{`name`:"促成",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:37ba783e68d5a5a2",`case_id`:"sd2013_02_control_air",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:c0ffd1edc9aa8938",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"15",`locator`:"PDF page 15",`quote`:"afely alongside, assisted by harbour tugs. Subsequent investigation identified that No2 compressor had a damaged discharge valve. Neither compressor had been able to keep up with demand.",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"促成\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:80d60dbbffd49fa6",`source`:"shipkg:condition:9e280aeb615b",`target`:"shipkg:condition:6fa538170906",`properties`:{`name`:"促成",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:80d60dbbffd49fa6",`case_id`:"kommandor_susan_dg1_2025",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:1a0b3fbe432ab46d",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_10_Kommandor_Susan_generator_bearing_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/catastrophic-engine-failure-and-subsequent-fire-on-board-the-site-investigation-vessel-kommandor-susan",`page`:"8",`locator`:"PDF page 8",`quote`:"ting priorities during the vessel’s conversion project, this resulted in Hays Ships providing minimal oversight to Holderness and no verification of authenticity for the parts used, enabling the installation of non- OEM components that later contributed to the engine failure. Similar to the lack of oversight highlighted in both the Finlandia Seaways and Finnmaster cases, the lack of structured supervision a",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"促成\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:8891c036cde74d94",`source`:"shipkg:cause:cf3cb78b47cf",`target`:"shipkg:fault:aba0717d72a0",`properties`:{`name`:"很可能促成",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:8891c036cde74d94",`case_id`:"wight_sky_me_2017",`certainty`:"probable",`certainty_zh`:"很可能",`evidence_id`:"ev:7407bf8cf7722325",`source_file`:"MAIB_2018_14_Wight_Sky_engine_bearing_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5b5217c7ed915d0b81e003df/MAIBInvReport14_2018.pdf",`page`:"14",`locator`:"PDF page 14",`quote`:"am ensured the safety of the vessel, passengers and crew. • Volvo Penta’s investigation into the engine failure concluded that: ○ Debris in the engine’s oil channels was most probably responsible for initiating the failure. ○ When the shells of main bearing 5 turned, the lubrication supply to big end bearing 4 was blocked, resulting in destructive failure. • Rebuilding the engine in a clean and controlled environment and transferring it complete in",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"很可能促成\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:896cf06f4f90c08a",`source`:"shipkg:fault:ccbff4c4e10b",`target`:"shipkg:condition:ed8375f7583f",`properties`:{`name`:"促成",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:896cf06f4f90c08a",`case_id`:"sd2013_02_control_air",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:c0ffd1edc9aa8938",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"15",`locator`:"PDF page 15",`quote`:"afely alongside, assisted by harbour tugs. Subsequent investigation identified that No2 compressor had a damaged discharge valve. Neither compressor had been able to keep up with demand.",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"促成\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:8fb3da4a6ad8dacd",`source`:"shipkg:condition:9e0b58e70948",`target`:"shipkg:fault:2c644dcfc770",`properties`:{`name`:"促成",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:8fb3da4a6ad8dacd",`case_id`:"kommandor_susan_dg1_2025",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:01e497b491874531",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_10_Kommandor_Susan_generator_bearing_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/catastrophic-engine-failure-and-subsequent-fire-on-board-the-site-investigation-vessel-kommandor-susan",`page`:"8",`locator`:"PDF page 8",`quote`:"Caterpillar was approved on the basis that genuine parts were used. The CTP parts were designed for a standard service interval. Use of the CTP parts beyond their design life led the connecting rod bearings to fail, initiating a chain of mechanical failures that culminated in the engine failure and subsequent fire. The extended service intervals were inappropriate for these substitute components, accelerating the risk of failure. Anchoring",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"促成\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:aba7bc4650a67d26",`source`:"shipkg:consequence:fc1835efb5ca",`target`:"shipkg:condition:2d0261049d78",`properties`:{`name`:"很可能促成",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:aba7bc4650a67d26",`case_id`:"queen_mary2_hf_2010",`certainty`:"probable",`certainty_zh`:"很可能",`evidence_id`:"ev:2bd29efb1b18cf94",`source_file`:"MAIB_2011_28_Queen_Mary_2_harmonic_filter_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/547c6fa6ed915d4c10000031/QM2Report.pdf",`page`:"13",`locator`:"PDF page 13",`quote`:"was not chosen at build. However, it is considered most likely that the disruption within the aft HF at the time of the accident caused general instability in the electrical network which could not be contained and led to the generators shutting down. Lloyd’s Register (Europe, Middle East and Asia) (LR) has been recommended to take forward proposals to the International Association of Classification Societie",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"很可能促成\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:b1ecac9cff5b11cd",`source`:"shipkg:fault:2ac2de665aa1",`target`:"shipkg:fault:ccbff4c4e10b",`properties`:{`name`:"促成",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:b1ecac9cff5b11cd",`case_id`:"sd2013_02_control_air",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:5bedf556e2401880",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"14",`locator`:"PDF page 14",`quote`:"diate investigation identified that the main lubricating oil discharge pipe assembly in No1 compressor had detached, and that the bottom end bearing had overheated and failed (see figure). No1 compressor was isolated but the engineers soon noticed that the air pressure in the main air receiver was dropping. Shortly afterwards, the centre main engine was started and all three main engines were put on s",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"促成\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:b72140166c9b6e90",`source`:"shipkg:fault:8027eb707475",`target`:"shipkg:fault:439f73a406a0",`properties`:{`name`:"促成",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:b72140166c9b6e90",`case_id`:"sd2013_03_turning_gear",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:157ede421b19ee3a",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"16",`locator`:"PDF page 16",`quote`:"neer. When the main engine start button was pressed to turn the engine on compressed air, a loud bang was heard; the turning gear interlock, the last remaining safety barrier, had failed to work. The resulting damage to the shaft and gearing (Figure 1) and to the turning gear casing (Figure 2) disabled the ship for a month and cost a six-figure sum to repair. To Turn or Not to Turn?",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"促成\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:b9d9e0cbe35e93fc",`source`:"shipkg:condition:ee040110dad4",`target`:"shipkg:condition:9b800c18cd13",`properties`:{`context_id`:"knowledge:liner_scuffing",`knowledge_layer`:"reference",`data_origin`:"manufacturer_guidance",`applicability`:"MAN B&W两冲程柴油机缸套/活塞环；2016通函用于机理，润滑油选择须查2023通函及本机手册。不能把活塞咬死一概等同于已证实拉缸。",`coupling_domains`:"热-机",`name`:"促成",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:b9d9e0cbe35e93fc",`case_id`:"knowledge:liner_scuffing",`certainty`:"guidance",`certainty_zh`:"厂家一般机理/指导（须核对机型）",`evidence_id`:"ev:ec47f7f58361e500",`source_file`:"MAN_SL2016_633_piston_rings_scuffing.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.man-es.com/docs/default-source/service-letters/sl2016-633.pdf",`page`:"2",`locator`:"PDF page 2",`quote`:"to polishing and, possibly, smearing of the surface. When the liner surface is smeared, the open graphite lamel - las are closed making it difficult to keep a proper oil film. When the oil film is compromised, the cast iron piston rings, which are in contact with the cast iron liner, may generate high friction and seizures that will not recover (liner scuffing). During scuffing, the surface of the lin",`props_json`:"{\"context_id\": \"knowledge:liner_scuffing\", \"knowledge_layer\": \"reference\", \"data_origin\": \"manufacturer_guidance\", \"applicability\": \"MAN B&W两冲程柴油机缸套/活塞环；2016通函用于机理，润滑油选择须查2023通函及本机手册。不能把活塞咬死一概等同于已证实拉缸。\", \"coupling_domains\": \"热-机\", \"name\": \"促成\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:f91e30b569a1ffe4",`source`:"shipkg:cause:0c02674d6024",`target`:"shipkg:fault:2c644dcfc770",`properties`:{`name`:"很可能促成",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:f91e30b569a1ffe4",`case_id`:"kommandor_susan_dg1_2025",`certainty`:"probable",`certainty_zh`:"很可能",`evidence_id`:"ev:5f282b514e870587",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_10_Kommandor_Susan_generator_bearing_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/catastrophic-engine-failure-and-subsequent-fire-on-board-the-site-investigation-vessel-kommandor-susan",`page`:"5",`locator`:"PDF page 5",`quote`:"oot cause is failure of connecting rod bearing number five. The excessive wear on the other connecting rod bearings show that the most likely root cause for the bearing failure is weak bonding of the copper layer. Evidence of weak material bonding was found in several bearings (Figure 4). Figure 3: Comparison between genuine OEM (left) and CTP bottom end bearings (right) Image courtesy of Pon Power",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"很可能促成\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:fd3a7af3d7b6d40d",`source`:"shipkg:condition:7da9174934f9",`target`:"shipkg:fault:439f73a406a0",`properties`:{`name`:"促成",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:fd3a7af3d7b6d40d",`case_id`:"sd2013_03_turning_gear",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:85dce6df90ffbd20",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"16",`locator`:"PDF page 16",`quote`:"turning gear control lever with the intention of disengaging the turning gear from the main engine flywheel. The turning gear was not marked in any way to show whether it was engaged or disengaged, and the operating instructions that were posted nearby had been painted over. The engineer then went to the machinery control room to start the engine. Although the indicator for the turning gear, which was sited on the control",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"促成\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}}] AS row MATCH (a:ShipKG {id:row.source}), (b:ShipKG {id:row.target}) MERGE (a)-[r:CONTRIBUTED_TO {id:row.id}]->(b) SET r += row.properties RETURN count(r) AS processed_20 }
CALL () { UNWIND [{`id`:"edge:008aa258d569a844",`source`:"shipkg:fault:0a5da1da4336",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:52e7560c8465",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"fuel_air",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:008aa258d569a844",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:19d72a1ed6647ccd",`source_file`:"Marine_Engine_Fault_Data_v1.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/19857425",`page`:"",`locator`:"dataset_index.csv:Injector_Nozzle/Clogged_Injector_Nozzle2_LoadProgram.csv",`quote`:"file_name=Injector_Nozzle/Clogged_Injector_Nozzle2_LoadProgram.csv; schema_type=scenario; scenario=Injection-valve nozzle clogging; nominal_load=load program (~40-85%); severity_or_program=two-hole plugged nozzle / load program; header_rows=3; data_rows=6791; columns=73; anomaly_state=all-anomaly (no baseline segment); notes=Anomalous operation only (no baseline segment). Compressor Filter Loss (dPf) and Turbine Back Pressure (dPex) not recorded in this run (columns present but empty).",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"fuel_air\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:0106d19583f0d5ff",`source`:"shipkg:component:28a67e535633",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:0106d19583f0d5ff",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:a815947a42cdaece",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"40",`locator`:"PDF page 40",`quote`:"seaman rigged the portable electric water pump on the main deck but, with the vessel now running on emergency power only, he was unable to start the pump. The master contacted the coastguard by VHF radio and advised that the vessel was flooding. The coastguard transmitted a “Mayday Relay”, and RNLI lifeboats from two stations were tasked to assist along with a Royal Navy helicopte",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:011d8ea9c97433cc",`source`:"shipkg:fault:7c36cc5888d4",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:011d8ea9c97433cc",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:56138ddb26a2655e",`source_file`:"MAIB_2017_20_Hebrides_CPP_coupling.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/59b7ab1c40f0b61231e71a54/MAIBInvReport20_2017.pdf",`page`:"30",`locator`:"PDF page 30",`quote`:"tepper motor shaft rotated inside the jaw coupling in response to the electrical signals from the remote propulsion consoles, the coupling remained stationary and the shaft’s rotary motion was not transferred to the ball screw mechanism. Therefore, the pitch set on the port CPP was unaltered. The setscrew securing the jaw coupling to the stepper motor shaft had loosened since its insta",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:01628787f3c5bf2e",`source`:"shipkg:condition:ef7365f4e337",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:01628787f3c5bf2e",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:b4983f0aef368bd8",`source_file`:"MAN_SL2013_569_bearing_wear_monitoring.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.man-es.com/docs/default-source/service-letters/sl2013-569.pdf",`page`:"2",`locator`:"PDF page 2",`quote`:"are capable of early detection of rapidly developing damage. Note that this update introduces connection of the BWM system to the automatic slow-down/load reduction func - tion of the main engine safety system. Questions regarding this service letter can be directed to our Operation department in Copenhagen (email: leo@mandieselturbo.com). -10 0 10 Minutes after damage initiation Damage init",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:02686b58cf82a529",`source`:"shipkg:component:c3d265fa990c",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:02686b58cf82a529",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:5e9210d8dbe9bf48",`source_file`:"MAIB_2021_02_Finlandia_Seaways_connecting_rod_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/engine-failure-and-subsequent-fire-on-ro-ro-cargo-vessel-finlandia-seaways-with-1-person-injured",`page`:"9",`locator`:"PDF page 9",`quote`:"Investigation Division and the engine manufacturer, MAN Diesel and Turbo SE. The investigation identified that a fracture of the connecting rod small end had led to the sudden failure of the main engine. The investigation also found that the method used to replace the connecting rod small end piston pin bearing bushes by the vessel manager’s maintenance support contractor had intr",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:02ca32e45e6ed203",`source`:"shipkg:fault:db9b4536b139",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:512427f592b7",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"cooling",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:02ca32e45e6ed203",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:e8101941c0ddc6d2",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"41",`locator`:"PDF page 41",`quote`:"ng emergency? 3. Examination of the isolating valve following the accident identified that the valve actuator had been defective, giving an impression that the valve was fully closed when it was not. Although there was a visual indicator located on the side of the actuator, this was not checked to confirm that the valve was closed prior to removal of the flange bolts. The actuator had previously been repaired. However, the c",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"cooling\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:02fc2b5ed60651a8",`source`:"shipkg:symptom:674bee46af7f",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:02fc2b5ed60651a8",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:0e28dc346f51844d",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"41",`locator`:"PDF page 41",`quote`:"ifold and catch fire. The small fire then ignited the engine high temperature alarm cabling loom, causing it to short circuit and set off the alarm in the wheelhouse (Figure 2). The functional fire and smoke alarm sensors were some distance from the fire, and the smoke and heat had not migrated that far by the time the master noticed the smoke on the camera monitor.",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:03266002fdfa26fc",`source`:"shipkg:condition:f61e4eef7cce",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:03266002fdfa26fc",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:1caa6757e63a8feb",`source_file`:"MAIB_2011_28_Queen_Mary_2_harmonic_filter_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/547c6fa6ed915d4c10000031/QM2Report.pdf",`page`:"62",`locator`:"PDF page 62",`quote`:"ed lifetime of 20 years due to the operating conditions being harsher than expected. The initial degradation of the capacitor was likely to have been caused by one or both of the following: • being subjected to voltages in excess of their design rating • being exposed to frequent voltage transients due to increased number of switching cycles Failure initiation due to minor manufacturing anomalies s",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:0572be31fff2b324",`source`:"shipkg:cause:29f8307f5eed",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:0572be31fff2b324",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:ed4a18d326cb49be",`source_file`:"MAIB_2021_02_Finlandia_Seaways_connecting_rod_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/engine-failure-and-subsequent-fire-on-ro-ro-cargo-vessel-finlandia-seaways-with-1-person-injured",`page`:"9",`locator`:"PDF page 9",`quote`:"used to replace the connecting rod small end piston pin bearing bushes by the vessel manager’s maintenance support contractor had introduced stress raisers that signficantly increased the likelihood of crack initiation and fatigue failure. Other factors that contributed to the engine failure included: standards of maintenance management; lack of appreciation of the importance of following the engine manufacturer’s instructions for the removal and refitting of the",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:05f1ae2e0881bbcf",`source`:"shipkg:fault:d26785dacafa",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:05f1ae2e0881bbcf",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:05847d350f09dacc",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"26",`locator`:"PDF page 26",`quote`:"eak oil that had been sprayed on the exhaust casing of the adjacent engine caught fire. Fortunately the crew were able to quickly identify and isolate the source of the leak and extinguish the fire before it was able to spread. No one was hurt in the incident. Subsequent investigation revealed that: • The oil had come from a loose plug on the generator’s engine-mounted lubricating oil pump (Figure 2a",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:067abe2265d5d174",`source`:"shipkg:cause:9b5341f924b9",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:067abe2265d5d174",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:d3e64cd30311c1bb",`source_file`:"MAIB_2017_20_Hebrides_CPP_coupling.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/59b7ab1c40f0b61231e71a54/MAIBInvReport20_2017.pdf",`page`:"35",`locator`:"PDF page 35",`quote`:"s caused by the loosening of a setscrew used to attach a coupling to a stepper motor shaft due to its lack of rundown torque, the absence of thread locking fluid, and vibration during the actuator’s operation. [2.2] 3. The absence of service instructions for the actuator’s inspection and maintenance that were available from its manufacturer was pivotal to the failure. [2.3] 4. No thread l",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:0688c2183202ec54",`source`:"shipkg:component:a85d6cb18c5c",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:52e7560c8465",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"fuel_air",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:0688c2183202ec54",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:2d2994aad520a17a",`source_file`:"MAIB_2024_20_Stena_Europe_fuel_spray_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6756db0ba63e1781efb87793/2024-20-StenaEurope.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"MMENDATIONS 1. Stena Europe experienced a fire on one of its main engines due to an uncontrolled release of pressurised fuel. The fuel sprayed onto the exposed exhaust manifold that was operating at a temperature exceeding 220°C when a screw in a two-screw flange within the fuel oil pipework loosened. [2.2] 2. The fuel oil spray was allowed to reach the hot surface because the joint was not protected by",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"fuel_air\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:0733b8d1b06e876a",`source`:"shipkg:action:32b0fb5f9f2b",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:0733b8d1b06e876a",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:e9d71048b791d31a",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"26",`locator`:"PDF page 26",`quote`:"as a result of it being insufficiently tightened by shore staff during a recent dry dock. • A section of the adjacent generator’s exhaust piping had been left unlagged following its overhaul during the recent dry dock (Figure 2b). This was hidden from view by the exhaust casing. • Fine oil spray ignited when it came into contact with the hot exhaust casing. Figure 1: Location of the generator w",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:08612a8344f50120",`source`:"shipkg:fault:8969204ea965",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:08612a8344f50120",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:09940c64e5709cec",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"21",`locator`:"PDF page 21",`quote`:"n-line filter chamber, and the engine lubricating oil system was contaminated. The contamination caused main bearing seizure, the rotation of bearing shells and the blockage of oil ways, and subsequent oil starvation and overheating to other bearings and to the pistons. The engine daily logs referred to oil filter cartridge changes only prior to the repair to the oil pumps. They also showed that the pressure rea",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:08c55eccde19b0f8",`source`:"shipkg:action:fa72ffe2b82b",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:08c55eccde19b0f8",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:05847d350f09dacc",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"26",`locator`:"PDF page 26",`quote`:"eak oil that had been sprayed on the exhaust casing of the adjacent engine caught fire. Fortunately the crew were able to quickly identify and isolate the source of the leak and extinguish the fire before it was able to spread. No one was hurt in the incident. Subsequent investigation revealed that: • The oil had come from a loose plug on the generator’s engine-mounted lubricating oil pump (Figure 2a",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:097962b6708c834a",`source`:"shipkg:check:050d6770cfa0",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:52e7560c8465",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"fuel_air",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:097962b6708c834a",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:1e3e12480476352c",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"28",`locator`:"PDF page 28",`quote`:"icient to ignite an oil or fuel spray. 2. These temperatures are not visible to the eye unless the surface is glowing. However, a thermal image will immediately identify unlagged sections (Figure 3). 3. All vessels are required to comply with SOLAS regulations regarding the maximum allowable temperature of an exposed surface (Chapter II/2): • All surfaces with temperatures above 220°C which may be impinged as a re",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"fuel_air\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:0a57256c18eb2079",`source`:"shipkg:condition:4277de3a84c9",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:52e7560c8465",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"fuel_air",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:0a57256c18eb2079",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:412268fc761e9960",`source_file`:"MAIB_2024_20_Stena_Europe_fuel_spray_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6756db0ba63e1781efb87793/2024-20-StenaEurope.pdf",`page`:"27",`locator`:"PDF page 27",`quote`:"ions. 2.4 HOT SPOT MONITORING Stena’s practice of measuring the temperature of running engines using an infrared spot thermometer had not identified the significant hazard posed by exposed surfaces of over 220°C that still existed post-accident after the insulation and shielding were replaced. The use of infrared spot thermometers in engine spaces limited their effectiveness as they could only prov",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"fuel_air\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:0aadae7556f90b65",`source`:"shipkg:condition:fc22b54510b9",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:52e7560c8465",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"fuel_air",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:0aadae7556f90b65",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:446e44bf86c01e9d",`source_file`:"MAIB_2024_20_Stena_Europe_fuel_spray_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6756db0ba63e1781efb87793/2024-20-StenaEurope.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"the external fuel systems on the remaining engines was missed and the risk of fuel leakage remained high. [2.3. 1] 4. Much of the insulation and shielding on all of Stena Europe’s engines was in a poor state of repair or missing completely. The ship’s crew and shore management had become accustomed to this condition over time, possibly due to the age of the vessel, leading to machi",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"fuel_air\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:0b3d9d80992101cb",`source`:"shipkg:action:157f8a0199e8",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:0b3d9d80992101cb",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:3ee08dc0eebc21a7",`source_file`:"Azimuth_Thruster_CBM_Dataset.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/20101612",`page`:"",`locator`:"table3_lti_by_fault_type_anonymised.csv:row8",`quote`:"System / engine-family case=CAT C7 shaftline reductor / CAT C7 case B; Fault or condition=Babbitt wear (Pb); Detection/event reference=Vibration alert Month -4.0; oil alert at Month -1.2; Reference class=LTI_oil; LTI / warning (mo)=2.8; Warning (h)=420.0; Recommended CBM action=Oil-confirmed mixed follow-up; 250 h vibration / 250 h oil; Included in mechanical LTI summary=yes",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:0c920d1c9017b191",`source`:"shipkg:condition:d96dbed6a05c",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:0c920d1c9017b191",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:c6b798ec4934dc08",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"41",`locator`:"PDF page 41",`quote`:"iling checks, he wiped the engine sump dipstick on a rag, which he casually left on a tank top above the engine exhaust manifold. Vibration caused the oil-soaked rag to fall onto the hot manifold and catch fire. The small fire then ignited the engine high temperature alarm cabling loom, causing it to short circuit and set off the alarm in the wheelhouse (Figure 2). The functional fire and smoke alarm",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:0cdca27d9f471e2a",`source`:"shipkg:symptom:9d91c2845b73",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:0cdca27d9f471e2a",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:5a52dfb1b2f1d73b",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"26",`locator`:"PDF page 26",`quote`:"arrative A fully loaded ro-ro passenger ferry was en route to its next port when the engineers in the control room acknowledged a low oil pressure alarm on one of the generators (Figure 1). On the CCTV they observed that oil from this generator was spraying on to the adjacent generator. While they were investigating the source of the leak oil that had been sprayed on the exhaust casing of the adjacent en",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:0e78da319c75874a",`source`:"shipkg:condition:37396a158a92",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:0e78da319c75874a",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:2d11f04e90b4e6a9",`source_file`:"STAMFORD_AGN039_marine_shaft_generators.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.stamford-avk.com/sites/stamfordavk/files/AGNs/AGN-039_C-Marine-Shaft-Generators.pdf",`page`:"2",`locator`:"PDF page 2",`quote`:"ator damaging vibration when the main engine is running at slow speeds and also when the ship is in storm conditions, because the ship’s hull flexes and so the gearbox to generator alignment becomes distorted. An experienced ship design engineer will know of these potential problems and will ensure that the coupling between gearbox and the shaft generator is a high quality, d",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:0efccc104bc9881e",`source`:"shipkg:fault:1a73f1a1e185",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:0efccc104bc9881e",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:1f80efa15bdc4c0e",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"16",`locator`:"PDF page 16",`quote`:"y barrier, had failed to work. The resulting damage to the shaft and gearing (Figure 1) and to the turning gear casing (Figure 2) disabled the ship for a month and cost a six-figure sum to repair. To Turn or Not to Turn?",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:0f1ff5fa49494e9b",`source`:"shipkg:fault:3349e319bedc",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:52e7560c8465",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"fuel_air",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:0f1ff5fa49494e9b",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:2d2994aad520a17a",`source_file`:"MAIB_2024_20_Stena_Europe_fuel_spray_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6756db0ba63e1781efb87793/2024-20-StenaEurope.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"MMENDATIONS 1. Stena Europe experienced a fire on one of its main engines due to an uncontrolled release of pressurised fuel. The fuel sprayed onto the exposed exhaust manifold that was operating at a temperature exceeding 220°C when a screw in a two-screw flange within the fuel oil pipework loosened. [2.2] 2. The fuel oil spray was allowed to reach the hot surface because the joint was not protected by",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"fuel_air\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:0f9f311d5a7796fd",`source`:"shipkg:equipment:563809ad0932",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:0f9f311d5a7796fd",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:ff3253f5416e42be",`source_file`:"MAIB_2018_01_Windcat8_bearing_failure_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/683922/MAIBInvReport01_2018.pdf",`page`:"1",`locator`:"PDF page 1",`quote`:"es. The MAIB investigation identified that the catastrophic damage to Windcat 8’s port main engine was caused by the failure of a piston connecting rod big end shell bearing, which resulted in the connecting rod assembly releasing and penetrating through the engine crankcase. The investigation also identified that: • A high oil temperature alarm prior to the engine failure warranted a more cautious a",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:0fdc086fe009ded3",`source`:"shipkg:symptom:d2a57b31e287",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:0fdc086fe009ded3",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:a14d5a0a3ae37d97",`source_file`:"MAIB_2018_01_Windcat8_bearing_failure_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/683922/MAIBInvReport01_2018.pdf",`page`:"11",`locator`:"PDF page 11",`quote`:"h priority. ACTION TAKEN Windcat Workboats BV Ltd has: • Instructed crews on board vessels fitted with Volvo Penta D16 engines to stop the affected engine when a high oil temperature alarm activates, and not to restart the engine until the reason for the alarm has been determined. • Identified lessons to be learned from the accident and emergency response that will be highlighted in future crew training. • Programmed additio",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:10d8f96aa55a9e20",`source`:"shipkg:fault:5bc176965c58",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:10d8f96aa55a9e20",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:2937d3b0bfe9d29f",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"26",`locator`:"PDF page 26",`quote`:"was spraying on to the adjacent generator. While they were investigating the source of the leak oil that had been sprayed on the exhaust casing of the adjacent engine caught fire. Fortunately the crew were able to quickly identify and isolate the source of the leak and extinguish the fire before it was able to spread. No one was hurt in the incident. Subsequent investigation revealed that: • The oil had c",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:11a7913eaebee94d",`source`:"shipkg:action:9444999ad903",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:11a7913eaebee94d",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:8552d0e3f49eb3e2",`source_file`:"STAMFORD_AGN033_bearing_currents.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.stamford-avk.com/sites/stamfordavk/files/AGNs/AGN-033_C-Shaft-Bearing-Currents.pdf",`page`:"3",`locator`:"PDF page 3",`quote`:"life. AvK Alternators. To overcome potential issues caused by induced shaft currents, AvK alternators utilise a combination of a rotor earthing brush and insulated bearings. The selection of these options are application and customer specific and will be determined during alternator specification negotiations. All AvK alternators for marine applications that are fitted with sleeve bearings have the",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:11e1dca3c36d2860",`source`:"shipkg:sensor:d9ffd75bfab4",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:11e1dca3c36d2860",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:bb4c3f647e81f1d2",`source_file`:"Marine_Engine_Fault_Data_v1.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/19857425",`page`:"",`locator`:"variable_dictionary.csv:Engine Speed",`quote`:"full_name=Engine Speed; symbol=N; unit=rpm; dtype=number; in_reference=TRUE; in_scenario_files=TRUE; category=operating / load",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:12aab1eaaa6034e9",`source`:"shipkg:condition:4ae93bca9f29",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:52e7560c8465",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"fuel_air",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:12aab1eaaa6034e9",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:9d1bc8efb3c65396",`source_file`:"MAIB_2024_20_Stena_Europe_fuel_spray_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6756db0ba63e1781efb87793/2024-20-StenaEurope.pdf",`page`:"27",`locator`:"PDF page 27",`quote`:"’s main engine fuel systems were historically reported in the vessel’s DOCMAP system. However, this had stopped over time and the crew instead repaired the leaks and recorded them locally in the engine room logbook. The relatively high turnover and heavy workload of engine room crew had resulted in defect reporting being considered a low priority, which had led to the requirements in SMS document SMM-0255 not bein",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"fuel_air\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:151625604920f911",`source`:"shipkg:fault:a7ebb889d098",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:151625604920f911",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:2c91ce63ed55748b",`source_file`:"Azimuth_Thruster_CBM_Dataset.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/20101612",`page`:"",`locator`:"table3_lti_by_fault_type_anonymised.csv:row2",`quote`:"System / engine-family case=CAT 3516C MPEB 1V; Fault or condition=Unconfirmed bearing-related spectral anomaly; Detection/event reference=Vibration alert Month -2.5; oil alert at Month -0.8; Reference class=LTI_oil; LTI / warning (mo)=1.7; Warning (h)=255.0; Recommended CBM action=Vibration-led CBM; 125 h vibration / 500 h oil; Included in mechanical LTI summary=yes",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:17e9a04f09929cc9",`source`:"shipkg:fault:b2aa91be158b",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:17e9a04f09929cc9",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:3bea0430b472030b",`source_file`:"MAIB_2011_28_Queen_Mary_2_harmonic_filter_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/547c6fa6ed915d4c10000031/QM2Report.pdf",`page`:"64",`locator`:"PDF page 64",`quote`:"current imbalance transformer were tested during manufacture, subsequent tests of the system were by secondary current injection, bypassing the windings. As the IAS did not specifically register which rank of the HF had developed an imbalance current, it was not possible to confirm if the current imbalance transformers on rank 1 1.3 had ever worked in service. It is concerning th",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:17f819589d86b303",`source`:"shipkg:component:be4ab56339d8",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:17f819589d86b303",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:0b7a42308cc8b6cc",`source_file`:"MAIB_2022_04_Wight_Sky_multiple_engine_failures.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6267cc85e90e071690c1b679/2022-4-WightSky-Report.pdf",`page`:"84",`locator`:"PDF page 84",`quote`:"D OR RESULTED IN RECOMMENDATIONS 1. Wight Sky’s ME2 failed catastrophically due to a sudden loss of lubricating oil supply to its number five main journal bearing and number four crankpin. [2.3.1] 2. The oilway to the main journal and crankpin was blocked off when the bearing shells turned in their housing. Poor fuel combustion, the presence of silica sand and other abrasive particles embe",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:182bd991ab0ff1c4",`source`:"shipkg:action:99ddd7acf595",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:182bd991ab0ff1c4",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:40803a19c50fb460",`source_file`:"STAMFORD_AGN235_torsional_analysis.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.stamford-avk.com/sites/stamfordavk/files/AGNs/AGN-235_A-Generating-Set-Assembly-Torsional-Vibration-Analysis.pdf",`page`:"7",`locator`:"PDF page 7",`quote`:"cluding geometry, thermal capacity and torque transmission capacity. Pass / Fail criteria: • Vibratory torque at the coupling for engine normal and misfire scenarios. • Heat load in the coupling for engine normal and misfire scenarios. TVA Calculations and Results Analysis Hand calculations and Software tools such as Matlab, FEA, Dedicated TVA software, etc., are used to assess the system, co",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:18c17913d9b3fc9a",`source`:"shipkg:condition:52a5771f68ca",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:52e7560c8465",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"fuel_air",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:18c17913d9b3fc9a",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:59a2040fb754c1d5",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"28",`locator`:"PDF page 28",`quote`:"21 MAIB Safety Digest 1/2016 CASE 8 The Lessons 1. Unlagged sections of exhaust piping will radiate heat to the protective casing, causing it to attain temperatures sufficient to ignite an oil or fuel spray. 2. These temperatures are not visible to the eye unless the surface is glowing. However, a thermal image will immediately identify unlagged sections (F",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"fuel_air\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:18f06d6e030180ee",`source`:"shipkg:component:a53bfe23945e",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:512427f592b7",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"cooling",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:18f06d6e030180ee",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:e235f3eb9480640d",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"60",`locator`:"PDF page 60",`quote`:"al. Never delay unnecessarily when abandoning a sinking ship. 4. The rate of water ingress and the speed at which the vessel sank suggests the failure of a main engine sea water cooling pipe. Analysis of maintenance records showed that this pipework had not been inspected or renewed for many years. Sea inlet pipework should be thoroughly checked during planned maintenance periods. skipper, who had remained in the whe",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"cooling\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:1b034a6a6b690120",`source`:"shipkg:condition:5b302d0da57d",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:1b034a6a6b690120",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:65e2c4b3facd8c2b",`source_file`:"STAMFORD_AGN076_alternator_bearings.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.stamford-avk.com/sites/stamfordavk/files/2024-04/AGN076_C.pdf",`page`:"4",`locator`:"PDF page 4",`quote`:"t fail because of axial vibration, causing a fretting action in the housing, the cylindrical roller bearing might fail because of lack of grease or misalignment damage. The anti-friction ball bearings used on STAMFORD alternators are not insulated bearings. The design of STAMFORD alternators is such that the shaft does not come under the influence of magnetic fields that result in excessive vol",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:1b2cad2aebdc21b9",`source`:"shipkg:component:1157de5d43da",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:1b2cad2aebdc21b9",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:e2523ed63e0b4019",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_06_Spirit_of_Discovery_propulsion_loss.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/loss-of-propulsion-in-heavy-weather-experienced-by-the-passenger-vessel-spirit-of-discovery-leading-to-over-100-injuries-and-one-fatality",`page`:"42",`locator`:"PDF page 42",`quote`:"at Spirit of Discovery’s pitching caused the propellers to come out of the water. This caused a sudden reduction in torque on the propulsion motor and led to a very rapid increase in the motors’ rpm. The engine alarm and monitoring system recorded that, immediately before their shutdown, the rpm of each pod’s propulsion motor very rapidly increased and exceeded the preset o",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:1bc77c83895d7e3d",`source`:"shipkg:fault:1a73f1a1e185",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:1bc77c83895d7e3d",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:1f80efa15bdc4c0e",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"16",`locator`:"PDF page 16",`quote`:"y barrier, had failed to work. The resulting damage to the shaft and gearing (Figure 1) and to the turning gear casing (Figure 2) disabled the ship for a month and cost a six-figure sum to repair. To Turn or Not to Turn?",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:1c2e7cb6937ec6aa",`source`:"shipkg:action:cc44cd1c6032",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:1c2e7cb6937ec6aa",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:26b16a38271f6b21",`source_file`:"Azimuth_Thruster_CBM_Dataset.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/20101612",`page`:"",`locator`:"table3_lti_by_fault_type_anonymised.csv:row6",`quote`:"System / engine-family case=CAT 3516C azimuth unit EB 2; Fault or condition=Gear mesh anomaly; Detection/event reference=Vibration alert Month -1.0; maintenance event; Reference class=LTI_maintenance; LTI / warning (mo)=1.0; Warning (h)=150.0; Recommended CBM action=Vibration-led CBM; 125 h vibration / 500 h oil; Included in mechanical LTI summary=yes",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:1d8b3c210ddd1d3d",`source`:"shipkg:equipment:1755b4f618f2",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:1d8b3c210ddd1d3d",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:19d0b2283f62b511",`source_file`:"MAIB_2018_14_Wight_Sky_engine_bearing_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5b5217c7ed915d0b81e003df/MAIBInvReport14_2018.pdf",`page`:"1",`locator`:"PDF page 1",`quote`:"examination conducted by the vessel’s engine maker, Volvo Penta UK, concluded that the most probable trigger for the failure was debris in the engine’s oil channels following rebuild. The MAIB investigation established the following: • The engine had been completely rebuilt and failed after 5½ hours of operation. • The vessel’s soft patches 1 had not been removed, necessitating the engine to be lowered piecem",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:1da9d7a549c5330c",`source`:"shipkg:fault:96cc1c0ff36e",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:1da9d7a549c5330c",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:a67a93bfec361edf",`source_file`:"MAIB_2022_04_Wight_Sky_multiple_engine_failures.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6267cc85e90e071690c1b679/2022-4-WightSky-Report.pdf",`page`:"84",`locator`:"PDF page 84",`quote`:"y due to a sudden loss of lubricating oil supply to its number five main journal bearing and number four crankpin. [2.3.1] 2. The oilway to the main journal and crankpin was blocked off when the bearing shells turned in their housing. Poor fuel combustion, the presence of silica sand and other abrasive particles embedded in the main bearing shells, engine misalignment, high levels of vibration, and contaminated lubricating oil might all have",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:1deff6587408d948",`source`:"shipkg:fault:675217222811",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:1deff6587408d948",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:2cdda8701b9f350e",`source_file`:"MAIB_2017_20_Hebrides_CPP_coupling.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/59b7ab1c40f0b61231e71a54/MAIBInvReport20_2017.pdf",`page`:"30",`locator`:"PDF page 30",`quote`:"CONTROL FAILURE MECHANISM It is evident from the inspection carried out by Hebrides’s engineers shortly after the accident, that control of the ferry’s port CPP was lost due to a mechanical failure within the linear servomotor actuator sited on the port gearbox (Figure 6). The setscrew used to secure one half of the jaw coupling to the stepper motor ‘D’ shaped shaft had backed off from the shaft’",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:1f5f1ecdc2a41111",`source`:"shipkg:condition:0abf74811b34",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:512427f592b7",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"cooling",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:1f5f1ecdc2a41111",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:2d4645410e75d447",`source_file`:"MAN_main_engine_auxiliary_efficiency.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.man-es.com/docs/default-source/document-sync/efficiency-improvements-main-engine-auxiliary-systems-eng.pdf",`page`:"11",`locator`:"PDF page 11",`quote`:"ion and thereby increase cylinder wear. – Increased scavenge air temperature which will lead to increased fuel oil consumption. – A flow which is too low may cause local boiling on the water side inside the scavenge air cooler, which may lead to cavitation in the cooling water pipes. – The stated max. scavenge air temperature values given in the technical file may be exceeded, and the engine may thereby",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"cooling\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:1f6fa15739f31ff6",`source`:"shipkg:condition:553e318feb99",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:1f6fa15739f31ff6",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:951a6820ce2d0fc6",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"40",`locator`:"PDF page 40",`quote`:"alarm, mustering the remaining crew. The seaman rigged the portable electric water pump on the main deck but, with the vessel now running on emergency power only, he was unable to start the pump. The master contacted the coastguard by VHF radio and advised that the vessel was flooding. The coastguard transmitted a “Mayday Relay”, and RNLI lifeboats from two stations were tasked to assist",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:20fc4c75223be3e1",`source`:"shipkg:fault:86ef7d39fd57",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:512427f592b7",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"cooling",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:20fc4c75223be3e1",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:5192357e40ea3dd4",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"41",`locator`:"PDF page 41",`quote`:"f the isolating valve following the accident identified that the valve actuator had been defective, giving an impression that the valve was fully closed when it was not. Although there was a visual indicator located on the side of the actuator, this was not checked to confirm that the valve was closed prior to removal of the flange bolts. The actuator had previously been repaired. However, the c",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"cooling\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:210b2cceab2a555f",`source`:"shipkg:check:7bc4821b359e",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:512427f592b7",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"cooling",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:210b2cceab2a555f",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:f402f62ae7b113ec",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"60",`locator`:"PDF page 60",`quote`:"a water cooling pipe. Analysis of maintenance records showed that this pipework had not been inspected or renewed for many years. Sea inlet pipework should be thoroughly checked during planned maintenance periods. skipper, who had remained in the wheelhouse, then broadcast a “Mayday” message on VHF radio, which was received and relayed by the coastguard to all vessels in the area. As the vessel began to",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"cooling\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:2144f26201ce087f",`source`:"shipkg:condition:f4f364d25a5d",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:512427f592b7",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"cooling",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:2144f26201ce087f",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:fb6cf34a58c7fe85",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"40",`locator`:"PDF page 40",`quote`:"f water ingress to the cargo hold, all six crew abandoned to one of the lifeboats. The vessel continued to flood (Figure 1), with water entering the accommodation areas through the open engine room doorway. The vessel’s owner contracted salvors, who were able to stop the flooding and, once stable, the vessel was towed into port.",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"cooling\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:2194a46a070ed50e",`source`:"shipkg:action:4a5960af425f",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:2194a46a070ed50e",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:6374a9e189a094d1",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"18",`locator`:"PDF page 18",`quote`:"e was no record of it having been tested. 2. Control console illumination panels are vital to the safe operation of machinery and should therefore be tested regularly. If problems with visual indication or warning lamps cannot be rectified immediately, they must be reported. Living with the problem is not a solution. 3. It is important that the status of the main engine machinery conforms to t",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:21978167aff599f0",`source`:"shipkg:action:b1b278b9bbdd",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:512427f592b7",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"cooling",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:21978167aff599f0",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:c7e7236b07b0d8d2",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_06_Spirit_of_Discovery_propulsion_loss.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/loss-of-propulsion-in-heavy-weather-experienced-by-the-passenger-vessel-spirit-of-discovery-leading-to-over-100-injuries-and-one-fatality",`page`:"53",`locator`:"PDF page 53",`quote`:"obal GmbH & Co. KG has: ● Updated the SISHIp eSiPods software and corrected the operators’ manual. ● Updated the PCS to include a revised WLS sequence activation that allows the crew to intervene and prevent the SISHIp eSiPODs parking at 90° to the vessel’s heading. ● Increased the SISHIp eSiPODs overspeed activation point following a mechanical evaluation of the systems. ● Improved the position of the SISHIp eSiPODs bilg",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"cooling\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:21e13b17380ef2e4",`source`:"shipkg:component:864e3371e086",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:52e7560c8465",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"fuel_air",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:21e13b17380ef2e4",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:e9d71048b791d31a",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"26",`locator`:"PDF page 26",`quote`:"as a result of it being insufficiently tightened by shore staff during a recent dry dock. • A section of the adjacent generator’s exhaust piping had been left unlagged following its overhaul during the recent dry dock (Figure 2b). This was hidden from view by the exhaust casing. • Fine oil spray ignited when it came into contact with the hot exhaust casing. Figure 1: Location of the generator w",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"fuel_air\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:22a4c1d018d4162f",`source`:"shipkg:fault:825e44b518ef",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:22a4c1d018d4162f",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:5f636d583be533fd",`source_file`:"TSRF_main.zip",`source_url`:"https://github.com/TS-RF/TSRF",`page`:"",`locator`:"data/Linner-wear.csv",`quote`:"Linner-wear.csv",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:24c2261dd8592474",`source`:"shipkg:component:6432d2482f06",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:24c2261dd8592474",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:157ede421b19ee3a",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"16",`locator`:"PDF page 16",`quote`:"neer. When the main engine start button was pressed to turn the engine on compressed air, a loud bang was heard; the turning gear interlock, the last remaining safety barrier, had failed to work. The resulting damage to the shaft and gearing (Figure 1) and to the turning gear casing (Figure 2) disabled the ship for a month and cost a six-figure sum to repair. To Turn or Not to Turn?",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:2515eeb0bbfde464",`source`:"shipkg:action:4a27034a0842",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:2515eeb0bbfde464",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:a14d5a0a3ae37d97",`source_file`:"MAIB_2018_01_Windcat8_bearing_failure_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/683922/MAIBInvReport01_2018.pdf",`page`:"11",`locator`:"PDF page 11",`quote`:"h priority. ACTION TAKEN Windcat Workboats BV Ltd has: • Instructed crews on board vessels fitted with Volvo Penta D16 engines to stop the affected engine when a high oil temperature alarm activates, and not to restart the engine until the reason for the alarm has been determined. • Identified lessons to be learned from the accident and emergency response that will be highlighted in future crew training. • Programmed additio",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:26a82edea7c6179d",`source`:"shipkg:condition:5d3ac9abb37a",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:512427f592b7",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"cooling",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:26a82edea7c6179d",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:383cc33975e2e37e",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"60",`locator`:"PDF page 60",`quote`:"sank suggests the failure of a main engine sea water cooling pipe. Analysis of maintenance records showed that this pipework had not been inspected or renewed for many years. Sea inlet pipework should be thoroughly checked during planned maintenance periods. skipper, who had remained in the wheelhouse, then broadcast a “Mayday” message on VHF radio, which was received and relayed by the coastguard to",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"cooling\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:28523785c507e158",`source`:"shipkg:action:8f48968a672d",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:28523785c507e158",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:43a7cad5a93294eb",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"21",`locator`:"PDF page 21",`quote`:"articularly if they are tired or distracted. This type of risk is typically reduced on bridges and in engine control rooms by the fitting of protective covers over safety- critical buttons, switches and knobs. 2. The master was confident that he had control of his CPPs and did not look at the pitch indicators located on the control consoles. Had he done so he would have realised the st",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:28911275f6448f9f",`source`:"shipkg:action:ddf392fcaa6c",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:28911275f6448f9f",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:53344f366942bb5f",`source_file`:"MAIB_2015_22_Pride_of_Canterbury_CPP_hydraulic_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/563092daed915d566d000002/MAIBInvReport-22_2015.pdf",`page`:"35",`locator`:"PDF page 35",`quote`:"ented a maintenance programme in which at least PSV1, PSV3 and NRV6 are disabled and their function checked once every 5 years. • Added a full flow check-valve, with an opening pressure of 10-12 bar, in the return oil circuit by-passing PSV3, the Oil Cooler and NRV6. Also, an additional alarm signal was to be fitted in the control system to give an alarm at 9-10 bar. For all ships in it",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:2a48247f5c7f3ed7",`source`:"shipkg:condition:7d61f4e32250",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:2a48247f5c7f3ed7",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:4ed3569c8bb32f4f",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"18",`locator`:"PDF page 18",`quote`:"CASE 3 17MAIB Safety Digest 2/2013 The Lessons 1. The turning gear interlock had not been included within the planned maintenance system on board and there was no record of it having been tested. 2. Control console illumination panels are vital to the safe operation of machinery and should therefore be tested regularly. If problems with visual indication or warnin",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:2a97e78dee7e5507",`source`:"shipkg:fault:d047fdea9ee9",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:2a97e78dee7e5507",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:dcba2393344bd01c",`source_file`:"MAIB_2018_14_Wight_Sky_engine_bearing_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5b5217c7ed915d0b81e003df/MAIBInvReport14_2018.pdf",`page`:"14",`locator`:"PDF page 14",`quote`:"e engine’s oil channels was most probably responsible for initiating the failure. ○ When the shells of main bearing 5 turned, the lubrication supply to big end bearing 4 was blocked, resulting in destructive failure. • Rebuilding the engine in a clean and controlled environment and transferring it complete into the engine room would have reduced the likelihood of debris ingress. • The engine was not fitted w",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:2c8577ffddcd1522",`source`:"shipkg:fault:3a609fe447a8",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:52e7560c8465",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"fuel_air",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:2c8577ffddcd1522",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:9de953977942cbdf",`source_file`:"Marine_Engine_Fault_Data_v1.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/19857425",`page`:"",`locator`:"dataset_index.csv:Turbine_Degradation/Turbine_Degradation_40_Load.csv",`quote`:"file_name=Turbine_Degradation/Turbine_Degradation_40_Load.csv; schema_type=scenario; scenario=Turbine degradation; nominal_load=40%; severity_or_program=single load condition; header_rows=3; data_rows=6397; columns=73; anomaly_state=binary (0=pre-anomaly, 1=anomaly); notes=Pre-anomaly and anomaly segments.",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"fuel_air\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:2cfbb8e405ad3549",`source`:"shipkg:action:2c60146dc1a8",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:2cfbb8e405ad3549",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:74d39332305ecab7",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"21",`locator`:"PDF page 21",`quote`:"and rectified the problem. Engineers are put on standby in control rooms during manoeuvring operations for a reason; not least to keep the bridge team informed of the status of all safety-critical systems. 4. The vessel’s crew were all experienced and many of them had spent most of their career operating similar types of vessels with the same company. However, the bridge and engineering teams did not",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:30717ba9df7fb4a4",`source`:"shipkg:component:45c063af0c7c",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:30717ba9df7fb4a4",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:1637d85df75c53f0",`source_file`:"MAIB_2018_14_Wight_Sky_engine_bearing_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5b5217c7ed915d0b81e003df/MAIBInvReport14_2018.pdf",`page`:"14",`locator`:"PDF page 14",`quote`:"cluded that: ○ Debris in the engine’s oil channels was most probably responsible for initiating the failure. ○ When the shells of main bearing 5 turned, the lubrication supply to big end bearing 4 was blocked, resulting in destructive failure. • Rebuilding the engine in a clean and controlled environment and transferring it complete into the engine room would have reduced",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:3235f6a8cc30b355",`source`:"shipkg:equipment:3e7f89ac810b",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:512427f592b7",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"cooling",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:3235f6a8cc30b355",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:fe1c60aff6da4452",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"59",`locator`:"PDF page 59",`quote`:"52 MAIB Safety Digest 1/2016 CASE 22 Supper Would Have Been on Time if the Vessel Had Not Sunk Narrative A 24m steel hulled fishing trawler, with a crew of six, was fishing in calm seas when its engine began to make unusual noises. No-one was in the wheelhouse; the skipper, who was on watch, had gone to the mess room to prepare supper and the majority of the crew wer",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"cooling\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:323764b15e9ba708",`source`:"shipkg:equipment:00688defba1b",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:323764b15e9ba708",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:e9d71048b791d31a",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"26",`locator`:"PDF page 26",`quote`:"as a result of it being insufficiently tightened by shore staff during a recent dry dock. • A section of the adjacent generator’s exhaust piping had been left unlagged following its overhaul during the recent dry dock (Figure 2b). This was hidden from view by the exhaust casing. • Fine oil spray ignited when it came into contact with the hot exhaust casing. Figure 1: Location of the generator w",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:338c172fac81555c",`source`:"shipkg:sensor:7675b8a8bef8",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:512427f592b7",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"cooling",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_