igations did not identify when the damage had",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:ab74838432351b24",`source`:"shipkg:fault:91dfc7218234",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:512427f592b7",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"cooling",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:ab74838432351b24",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:79a139cd88957e11",`source_file`:"Marine_Engine_Fault_Data_v1.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/19857425",`page`:"",`locator`:"dataset_index.csv:AC_Fouling/AC_Fouling_75_Load.csv",`quote`:"file_name=AC_Fouling/AC_Fouling_75_Load.csv; schema_type=scenario; scenario=Air-cooler fouling; nominal_load=75%; severity_or_program=single load condition; header_rows=3; data_rows=6354; columns=73; anomaly_state=binary (0=pre-anomaly, 1=anomaly); notes=Pre-anomaly and anomaly segments.",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"cooling\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:abe3671795dbdb19",`source`:"shipkg:sensor:2ea813c04f69",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:52e7560c8465",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"fuel_air",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:abe3671795dbdb19",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:a7fb6cfa2c672a77",`source_file`:"Marine_Engine_Fault_Data_v1.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/19857425",`page`:"",`locator`:"variable_dictionary.csv:Charge Air IC Air Temp. Out",`quote`:"full_name=Charge Air IC Air Temp. Out; symbol=T15; unit=°C; dtype=number; in_reference=TRUE; in_scenario_files=TRUE; category=temperature",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"fuel_air\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:ad0651ff8195736f",`source`:"shipkg:action:13d66975b925",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:ad0651ff8195736f",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:9663fdde50e013ce",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"your disposal. The function of back-up controls should be well understood and tested. They can help prevent serious accidents. 2. Regular drills simulating propulsion system failure and recovery should be carried out. These drills will give operators confidence in the back-up systems and help them react effectively in an emergency. 3. Frequent engine response tests should be completed, both ahead and astern. This is part",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:ad71a8b71651510c",`source`:"shipkg:action:6234e02eed7e",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:512427f592b7",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"cooling",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:ad71a8b71651510c",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:63871ec3ef77a2d6",`source_file`:"MAN_SL2016_623_cooling_water.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.man-es.com/docs/default-source/service-letters/sl2016-623.pdf",`page`:"3",`locator`:"PDF page 3",`quote`:"which required topping up with untreated water. The MAN Diesel & Turbo recommendations are therefore once every 2 to 6 months to send a coolant sample to an in - dependent laboratory, the engine manufacturer or PrimeServ Lab. How often the coolant samples should be sent to the laboratory depends on the test result received from the labo - ratory. If the test results vary a lot over t",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"cooling\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:ae412ca4b7ccde0a",`source`:"shipkg:fault:dddb0abee018",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:ae412ca4b7ccde0a",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:a33dab8e3476ce99",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"20",`locator`:"PDF page 20",`quote`:"tarboard CPP back-up control mode was inadvertently selected, the master lost bridge control of that propeller. The starboard CPP continued to thrust at over half ahead throughout the vessel’s approach to the berth and up until its engine was stopped (about 2 hours after the contact). Starboard pitch back-up on/off control button Centre console lamps dimmer control buttons Figure 1: Part of brid",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:afd37535d3e74b2b",`source`:"shipkg:fault:73da5c52ce5d",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:afd37535d3e74b2b",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:a0ea937863e1a2df",`source_file`:"MAIB_2011_28_Queen_Mary_2_harmonic_filter_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/547c6fa6ed915d4c10000031/QM2Report.pdf",`page`:"13",`locator`:"PDF page 13",`quote`:"om and the other in the aft main switchboard room. The explosion was triggered by deterioration in the capacitors in the aft HF . Internal arcing between the capacitor plates developed, which vaporised the dielectric medium causing the internal pressure to increase, until it caused the capacitor casing to rupture. Dielectric fluid vapour sprayed out, igniting and creating the likely conditions for an arc-flash",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:b00fc5b7a5b9b248",`source`:"shipkg:action:d556abb4fcfa",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:b00fc5b7a5b9b248",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:dee08b2e20581c60",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"23",`locator`:"PDF page 23",`quote`:"wrong. 3. An oil mist detector gives advance warning of an impending major failure. When a detector alarm occurs, the thought of stopping and inspecting the engine as soon as possible should be uppermost in an engineer’s mind. The consequences of ignoring it are clear, and expensive.",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:b13b196a8c08dc9b",`source`:"shipkg:equipment:aea23b9943a4",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:b13b196a8c08dc9b",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:eb8d9ba0db21fede",`source_file`:"MAIB_2021_02_Finlandia_Seaways_connecting_rod_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/engine-failure-and-subsequent-fire-on-ro-ro-cargo-vessel-finlandia-seaways-with-1-person-injured",`page`:"9",`locator`:"PDF page 9",`quote`:"ent and Incident Investigation Division and the engine manufacturer, MAN Diesel and Turbo SE. The investigation identified that a fracture of the connecting rod small end had led to the sudden failure of the main engine. The investigation also found that the method used to replace the connecting rod small end piston pin bearing bushes by the vessel manager’s maintenance support contractor had intr",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:b42f8a837111b9db",`source`:"shipkg:symptom:ea2cdd59ea5c",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:b42f8a837111b9db",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:31361433815a45d9",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"21",`locator`:"PDF page 21",`quote`:"stigated but could not find any fault with the engine. He reset the alarm and continued with his duties. Several hours later, the OMD alarm activated again. The chief engineer was in the engine room and saw smoke vent from the main engine crankcase explosion relief doors. A lubricating oil low pressure alarm, and a lubricating oil low pressure trip alarm soon followed. The engine th",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:b50ae7519f3ded28",`source`:"shipkg:fault:999defd690d8",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:b50ae7519f3ded28",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:0e28dc346f51844d",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"41",`locator`:"PDF page 41",`quote`:"ifold and catch fire. The small fire then ignited the engine high temperature alarm cabling loom, causing it to short circuit and set off the alarm in the wheelhouse (Figure 2). The functional fire and smoke alarm sensors were some distance from the fire, and the smoke and heat had not migrated that far by the time the master noticed the smoke on the camera monitor.",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:b61ac036fb40fd4f",`source`:"shipkg:component:67b7bcd7344e",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:b61ac036fb40fd4f",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:df67722cb172233f",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"21",`locator`:"PDF page 21",`quote`:"filter cartridge in the on-line filter chamber, and the engine lubricating oil system was contaminated. The contamination caused main bearing seizure, the rotation of bearing shells and the blockage of oil ways, and subsequent oil starvation and overheating to other bearings and to the pistons. The engine daily logs referred to oil filter cartridge changes only prior to the re",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:b69e7e03b8f16cff",`source`:"shipkg:action:a153887f0b20",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:b69e7e03b8f16cff",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:51f2102546185648",`source_file`:"Azimuth_Thruster_CBM_Dataset.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/20101612",`page`:"",`locator`:"table3_lti_by_fault_type_anonymised.csv:row12",`quote`:"System / engine-family case=CAT 3508B/C thruster reference; Fault or condition=Normal operation; Detection/event reference=Normal vibration and oil condition; N/A; Recommended CBM action=Standard monitoring; 500 h vibration / 500 h oil; Included in mechanical LTI summary=no",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:b917473e8f28e134",`source`:"shipkg:observation:f5d747e68b69",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:b917473e8f28e134",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:596b2f398d646f0b",`source_file`:"Azimuth_Thruster_CBM_Dataset.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/20101612",`page`:"",`locator`:"table3_lti_by_fault_type_anonymised.csv:row1",`quote`:"System / engine-family case=CAT C7 shaftline reductor / CAT C7 case A; Fault or condition=Structural looseness; Detection/event reference=Vibration alert Month -3.5; operational failure/gearbox repair; Reference class=LTI_operational; LTI / warning (mo)=3.5; Warning (h)=525.0; Recommended CBM action=Vibration-only CBM; 125 h vibration interval; Included in mechanical LTI summary=yes",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:bbd9dc87ea309aba",`source`:"shipkg:component:160bdfff5e4e",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:512427f592b7",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"cooling",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:bbd9dc87ea309aba",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:818a140783772a9b",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_06_Spirit_of_Discovery_propulsion_loss.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/loss-of-propulsion-in-heavy-weather-experienced-by-the-passenger-vessel-spirit-of-discovery-leading-to-over-100-injuries-and-one-fatality",`page`:"43",`locator`:"PDF page 43",`quote`:"iple this was an entirely sensible precaution to protect the high voltage pod motor from damage. However, the low position of the bilge sensor meant that it could be activated by a relatively small amount of liquid that accumulated within the pod. Since the bilge suction probably did not extend low enough for the automatic bilge pumps to effectively pump the water out,",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"cooling\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:bc231881ff67b008",`source`:"shipkg:fault:9d33e738a3d3",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:bc231881ff67b008",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:9db4aabb400f0aae",`source_file`:"STAMFORD_AGN039_marine_shaft_generators.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.stamford-avk.com/sites/stamfordavk/files/AGNs/AGN-039_C-Marine-Shaft-Generators.pdf",`page`:"2",`locator`:"PDF page 2",`quote`:"ansion of the hot gearbox, which may well expand and lift the shaft centre line by < 1 mm. If the alignment is not accurate, then excessive vibration is likely to damage the shaft generator. There can also be lots of generator damaging vibration when the main engine is running at slow speeds and also when the ship is in storm conditions, because the ship’s hull flexes and so the gearbox to genera",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:bc56748bb1f6339b",`source`:"shipkg:fault:2c644dcfc770",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:bc56748bb1f6339b",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:1143f5b1ae869724",`source_file`:"MAIB_2018_01_Windcat8_bearing_failure_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/683922/MAIBInvReport01_2018.pdf",`page`:"9",`locator`:"PDF page 9",`quote`:"ation systems. Therefore, it is highly unlikely that the failure was the result of incorrect component assembly or a lack of oil. It is more likely that the failure was due to a weakness in the thin-walled shell bearing itself.",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:bcf16e46304a4dc7",`source`:"shipkg:condition:7fb8a1a33328",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:512427f592b7",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"cooling",`name`:"归属系统",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`legacy_relation`:"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM",`id`:"edge:bcf16e46304a4dc7",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:91f76498fecf4e21",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_06_Spirit_of_Discovery_propulsion_loss.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/loss-of-propulsion-in-heavy-weather-experienced-by-the-passenger-vessel-spirit-of-discovery-leading-to-over-100-injuries-and-one-fatality",`page`:"43",`locator`:"PDF page 43",`quote`:"cating oil. In principle this was an entirely sensible precaution to protect the high voltage pod motor from damage. However, the low position of the bilge sensor meant that it could be activated by a relatively small amount of liquid that accumulated within the pod. Since the bilge suction probably did not extend low enough for the automatic bilge pumps to effectively pump the water out, it is likely the vessel’s motion in heavy weather caused the small amoun",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"cooling\", \"name\": \"归属系统\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"legacy_relation\": \"BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:bd389e5f7d6e77d1",`source`:"shipkg:fau