CALL () { UNWIND [{`id`:"edge:033974c90eb04867",`source`:"shipkg:fault:562580f2bf5a",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:775549e4c085",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:033974c90eb04867",`case_id`:"pride_can_cpp_2014",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:45f3ae7b802f6792",`source_file`:"MAIB_2015_22_Pride_of_Canterbury_CPP_hydraulic_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/563092daed915d566d000002/MAIBInvReport-22_2015.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"he accident as a basis for making recommendations to prevent similar accidents occurring in the future. 2.2 CAUSE OF THE FIRE The fire was initiated following the spray of hydraulic oil, from a ruptured pipework joint in the starboard CPP system, onto the hot exhaust uptakes of the starboard main engines. The flanged joint ruptured because the CPP system became over- pressurised as a result of t",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:099f38915e5b1a9c",`source`:"shipkg:fault:72c71c94ca13",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:81fff36694d8",`properties`:{`name`:"很可能导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:099f38915e5b1a9c",`case_id`:"sd2016_22_cooling_pipe",`certainty`:"probable",`certainty_zh`:"很可能",`evidence_id`:"ev:e235f3eb9480640d",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"60",`locator`:"PDF page 60",`quote`:"al. Never delay unnecessarily when abandoning a sinking ship. 4. The rate of water ingress and the speed at which the vessel sank suggests the failure of a main engine sea water cooling pipe. Analysis of maintenance records showed that this pipework had not been inspected or renewed for many years. Sea inlet pipework should be thoroughly checked during planned maintenance periods. skipper, who had remained in the whe",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"很可能导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:0d5490443acb16ee",`source`:"shipkg:condition:85d0ac216249",`target`:"shipkg:condition:37396a158a92",`properties`:{`context_id`:"knowledge:shaft_generator_alignment",`knowledge_layer`:"reference",`data_origin`:"manufacturer_guidance",`applicability`:"通过齿轮箱及联轴器驱动的轴带发电机；不能推广到所有同轴无附加轴承的构型。",`coupling_domains`:"热-机-电",`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:0d5490443acb16ee",`case_id`:"knowledge:shaft_generator_alignment",`certainty`:"guidance",`certainty_zh`:"厂家一般机理/指导（须核对机型）",`evidence_id`:"ev:2d11f04e90b4e6a9",`source_file`:"STAMFORD_AGN039_marine_shaft_generators.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.stamford-avk.com/sites/stamfordavk/files/AGNs/AGN-039_C-Marine-Shaft-Generators.pdf",`page`:"2",`locator`:"PDF page 2",`quote`:"ator damaging vibration when the main engine is running at slow speeds and also when the ship is in storm conditions, because the ship’s hull flexes and so the gearbox to generator alignment becomes distorted. An experienced ship design engineer will know of these potential problems and will ensure that the coupling between gearbox and the shaft generator is a high quality, d",`props_json`:"{\"context_id\": \"knowledge:shaft_generator_alignment\", \"knowledge_layer\": \"reference\", \"data_origin\": \"manufacturer_guidance\", \"applicability\": \"通过齿轮箱及联轴器驱动的轴带发电机；不能推广到所有同轴无附加轴承的构型。\", \"coupling_domains\": \"热-机-电\", \"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:0e92ee66dde8b3d3",`source`:"shipkg:fault:423cd9a63be0",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:4016217446bf",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:0e92ee66dde8b3d3",`case_id`:"kommandor_susan_dg1_2025",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:390711bc162bb6ce",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_10_Kommandor_Susan_generator_bearing_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/catastrophic-engine-failure-and-subsequent-fire-on-board-the-site-investigation-vessel-kommandor-susan",`page`:"1",`locator`:"PDF page 1",`quote`:"r Susan suffered a catastrophic failure of a diesel generator engine while conducting sea trials in the Firth of Forth, Scotland. The failure resulted in an engine room fire and a complete power blackout. The crew responded promptly, extinguished the fire and mustered safely. The vessel lost propulsion and began drifting eastwards. Attempts to deploy anchors were unsuccessful because the anchor winches required electrical power t",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:0f4a666fd242e2a4",`source`:"shipkg:fault:9b76a4f68834",`target`:"shipkg:fault:fee4df6aeb24",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:0f4a666fd242e2a4",`case_id`:"wight_sky_me4_2018",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:3ca79df2a0332a1a",`source_file`:"MAIB_2022_04_Wight_Sky_multiple_engine_failures.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6267cc85e90e071690c1b679/2022-4-WightSky-Report.pdf",`page`:"84",`locator`:"PDF page 84",`quote`:"igh levels of vibration, and contaminated lubricating oil might all have contributed to the event failure. [2.3.1] 3. Wight Sky’s ME4 failed catastrophically because of an assembly error during build at Volvo Penta’s factory in Sweden. Two of the engine’s matched connecting rod big end bearing caps had been transposed during the engine assembly process. [2.3.2] 4. The transposition of the bearing caps reduced the",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:144ae16382b9c7ad",`source`:"shipkg:condition:32eb7154ffd7",`target`:"shipkg:fault:aba0717d72a0",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:144ae16382b9c7ad",`case_id`:"sd2013_05_missing_filter",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:09940c64e5709cec",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"21",`locator`:"PDF page 21",`quote`:"n-line filter chamber, and the engine lubricating oil system was contaminated. The contamination caused main bearing seizure, the rotation of bearing shells and the blockage of oil ways, and subsequent oil starvation and overheating to other bearings and to the pistons. The engine daily logs referred to oil filter cartridge changes only prior to the repair to the oil pumps. They also showed that the pressure rea",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:18bcdfce6810c31b",`source`:"shipkg:fault:7386c69bc1ea",`target`:"shipkg:fault:675217222811",`properties`:{`context_id`:"knowledge:coupling_failure",`knowledge_layer`:"reference",`data_origin`:"field_report",`applicability`:"实际证据是Hebrides的CPP执行器小型爪式联轴器，不是主推进轴联轴器断裂；主轴断裂根因不可由此推断。",`coupling_domains`:"机-电",`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:18bcdfce6810c31b",`case_id`:"knowledge:coupling_failure",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:2cdda8701b9f350e",`source_file`:"MAIB_2017_20_Hebrides_CPP_coupling.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/59b7ab1c40f0b61231e71a54/MAIBInvReport20_2017.pdf",`page`:"30",`locator`:"PDF page 30",`quote`:"CONTROL FAILURE MECHANISM It is evident from the inspection carried out by Hebrides’s engineers shortly after the accident, that control of the ferry’s port CPP was lost due to a mechanical failure within the linear servomotor actuator sited on the port gearbox (Figure 6). The setscrew used to secure one half of the jaw coupling to the stepper motor ‘D’ shaped shaft had backed off from the shaft’",`props_json`:"{\"context_id\": \"knowledge:coupling_failure\", \"knowledge_layer\": \"reference\", \"data_origin\": \"field_report\", \"applicability\": \"实际证据是Hebrides的CPP执行器小型爪式联轴器，不是主推进轴联轴器断裂；主轴断裂根因不可由此推断。\", \"coupling_domains\": \"机-电\", \"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:1ecb8c266da0f796",`source`:"shipkg:fault:1a73f1a1e185",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:2cba0fdbf1dd",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:1ecb8c266da0f796",`case_id`:"sd2013_03_turning_gear",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:1f80efa15bdc4c0e",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"16",`locator`:"PDF page 16",`quote`:"y barrier, had failed to work. The resulting damage to the shaft and gearing (Figure 1) and to the turning gear casing (Figure 2) disabled the ship for a month and cost a six-figure sum to repair. To Turn or Not to Turn?",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:273b85382045876d",`source`:"shipkg:fault:dddb0abee018",`target`:"shipkg:fault:c44e6c4545bf",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:273b85382045876d",`case_id`:"sd2016_05_cpp_backup",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:a33dab8e3476ce99",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"20",`locator`:"PDF page 20",`quote`:"tarboard CPP back-up control mode was inadvertently selected, the master lost bridge control of that propeller. The starboard CPP continued to thrust at over half ahead throughout the vessel’s approach to the berth and up until its engine was stopped (about 2 hours after the contact). Starboard pitch back-up on/off control button Centre console lamps dimmer control buttons Figure 1: Part of brid",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:2a3c64ff89df3e30",`source`:"shipkg:fault:c9a34bd46532",`target`:"shipkg:fault:e97eee073fc6",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:2a3c64ff89df3e30",`case_id`:"spirit_of_discovery_pods_2023",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:755b4102fd859a55",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_06_Spirit_of_Discovery_propulsion_loss.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/loss-of-propulsion-in-heavy-weather-experienced-by-the-passenger-vessel-spirit-of-discovery-leading-to-over-100-injuries-and-one-fatality",`page`:"42",`locator`:"PDF page 42",`quote`:"y’s pitching caused the propellers to come out of the water. This caused a sudden reduction in torque on the propulsion motor and led to a very rapid increase in the motors’ rpm. The engine alarm and monitoring system recorded that, immediately before their shutdown, the rpm of each pod’s propulsion motor very rapidly increased and exceeded the preset overspeed limitation. The pod’s PCS therefore automat",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:2bb6eae6a44bbf06",`source`:"shipkg:fault:3349e319bedc",`target`:"shipkg:fault:256ba55c5fb2",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:2bb6eae6a44bbf06",`case_id`:"stena_europe_fuel_2023",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:2d2994aad520a17a",`source_file`:"MAIB_2024_20_Stena_Europe_fuel_spray_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6756db0ba63e1781efb87793/2024-20-StenaEurope.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"MMENDATIONS 1. Stena Europe experienced a fire on one of its main engines due to an uncontrolled release of pressurised fuel. The fuel sprayed onto the exposed exhaust manifold that was operating at a temperature exceeding 220°C when a screw in a two-screw flange within the fuel oil pipework loosened. [2.2] 2. The fuel oil spray was allowed to reach the hot surface because the joint was not protected by",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:2d27110add1a0c6b",`source`:"shipkg:cause:3667d8d2e0ca",`target`:"shipkg:fault:fce2f501a499",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:2d27110add1a0c6b",`case_id`:"sd2016_09_cpp_response",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:88dffcc589cf9235",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"y to bring the vessel back under control before it struck the quay. It was also revealed during the investigation that the system parameters for astern pitch control had been incorrectly set during the commissioning of the propulsion system when the vessel was delivered from the yard. The Lessons 1. If you are expected to manoeuvre a vessel, you should make every effort to familiarise yourself with the controls at yo",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:2d66b2b8782ccd77",`source`:"shipkg:fault:2c644dcfc770",`target`:"shipkg:fault:423cd9a63be0",`properties`:{`name`:"很可能导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:2d66b2b8782ccd77",`case_id`:"kommandor_susan_dg1_2025",`certainty`:"probable",`certainty_zh`:"很可能",`evidence_id`:"ev:cebfc2d1ae68389d",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_10_Kommandor_Susan_generator_bearing_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/catastrophic-engine-failure-and-subsequent-fire-on-board-the-site-investigation-vessel-kommandor-susan",`page`:"5",`locator`:"PDF page 5",`quote`:"lts break by overload and connecting rod cap number six comes off. Pon Power’s report concluded that: With the facts gathered the most likely root cause is failure of connecting rod bearing number five. The excessive wear on the other connecting rod bearings show that the most likely root cause for the bearing failure is weak bonding of the copper layer. Evidence of weak material bonding was found in several bearings (Figure 4)",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"很可能导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:303af91904a19f18",`source`:"shipkg:condition:06d3b90c2d7b",`target`:"shipkg:fault:f09e1be695a7",`properties`:{`context_id`:"knowledge:winding_insulation",`knowledge_layer`:"reference",`data_origin`:"manufacturer_guidance",`applicability`:"STAMFORD/AvK发电机；检测与干燥作业须停电隔离，由合格人员依本机手册执行，本文不提供通用阈值或操作命令。",`coupling_domains`:"热-电",`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:303af91904a19f18",`case_id`:"knowledge:winding_insulation",`certainty`:"guidance",`certainty_zh`:"厂家一般机理/指导（须核对机型）",`evidence_id`:"ev:31bd0a2dcc933aac",`source_file`:"STAMFORD_AGN040_winding_insulation.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.stamford-avk.com/sites/stamfordavk/files/AGNs/AGN-040_E-Winding-Insulation-System.pdf",`page`:"6",`locator`:"PDF page 6",`quote`:"s of just a few MegOhms become more typical. Major factors, which affect and reduce the IR value, start with the winding outhang. Surface moisture, often present in conjunction with surface contamination, are typically the result of prevailing site conditions. Either will seriously reduce measured IR values, and if the root cause that allows this contaminant to be present i",`props_json`:"{\"context_id\": \"knowledge:winding_insulation\", \"knowledge_layer\": \"reference\", \"data_origin\": \"manufacturer_guidance\", \"applicability\": \"STAMFORD/AvK发电机；检测与干燥作业须停电隔离，由合格人员依本机手册执行，本文不提供通用阈值或操作命令。\", \"coupling_domains\": \"热-电\", \"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:321c0ccbe27aa769",`source`:"shipkg:fault:2c6822dc16f4",`target`:"shipkg:condition:9dd79587307a",`properties`:{`context_id`:"knowledge:liner_scuffing",`knowledge_layer`:"reference",`data_origin`:"manufacturer_guidance",`applicability`:"MAN B&W两冲程柴油机缸套/活塞环；2016通函用于机理，润滑油选择须查2023通函及本机手册。不能把活塞咬死一概等同于已证实拉缸。",`coupling_domains`:"热-机",`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:321c0ccbe27aa769",`case_id`:"knowledge:liner_scuffing",`certainty`:"guidance",`certainty_zh`:"厂家一般机理/指导（须核对机型）",`evidence_id`:"ev:e7c05a5721cf177a",`source_file`:"MAN_SL2016_633_piston_rings_scuffing.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.man-es.com/docs/default-source/service-letters/sl2016-633.pdf",`page`:"2",`locator`:"PDF page 2",`quote`:"ct with the cast iron liner, may generate high friction and seizures that will not recover (liner scuffing). During scuffing, the surface of the liner is hardened and will need machining to recover before new rings can be run in. Cermet is a composite, part-ceramic, part-metal material. It combines the best properties of a ceramic, i.e. high tem - perature-resistance and hardness, with tho",`props_json`:"{\"context_id\": \"knowledge:liner_scuffing\", \"knowledge_layer\": \"reference\", \"data_origin\": \"manufacturer_guidance\", \"applicability\": \"MAN B&W两冲程柴油机缸套/活塞环；2016通函用于机理，润滑油选择须查2023通函及本机手册。不能把活塞咬死一概等同于已证实拉缸。\", \"coupling_domains\": \"热-机\", \"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:334bf86681a182cc",`source`:"shipkg:fault:0b115c0dd100",`target`:"shipkg:condition:88ba505ebf5b",`properties`:{`context_id`:"knowledge:coolant_blockage",`knowledge_layer`:"reference",`data_origin`:"manufacturer_guidance",`applicability`:"MAN四冲程柴油机闭式淡水冷却；水质要求与添加剂须按具体机型手册确认。",`coupling_domains`:"热-机",`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:334bf86681a182cc",`case_id`:"knowledge:coolant_blockage",`certainty`:"guidance",`certainty_zh`:"厂家一般机理/指导（须核对机型）",`evidence_id`:"ev:5e17a921acb00b63",`source_file`:"MAN_SL2016_623_cooling_water.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.man-es.com/docs/default-source/service-letters/sl2016-623.pdf",`page`:"2",`locator`:"PDF page 2",`quote`:"ult in leakages and thereby re - duce the lifetime and safety of the engine components. Lime- scale as well as rust deposits will reduce the heat transfer and may result in thermal overload of the components to be cooled by the engine cooling water. A thermal overload may, however, also result in cracks and leakages as seen in the exhaust valve seat ring. Insufficient cooling water",`props_json`:"{\"context_id\": \"knowledge:coolant_blockage\", \"knowledge_layer\": \"reference\", \"data_origin\": \"manufacturer_guidance\", \"applicability\": \"MAN四冲程柴油机闭式淡水冷却；水质要求与添加剂须按具体机型手册确认。\", \"coupling_domains\": \"热-机\", \"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:3af46f4959d25f42",`source`:"shipkg:cause:2152c85364f8",`target`:"shipkg:fault:f2f9d4b10a0b",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:3af46f4959d25f42",`case_id`:"sd2016_08_generator_oil",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:4925b6b6f40f4c21",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"26",`locator`:"PDF page 26",`quote`:"a loose plug on the generator’s engine-mounted lubricating oil pump (Figure 2a). This had vibrated loose as a result of it being insufficiently tightened by shore staff during a recent dry dock. • A section of the adjacent generator’s exhaust piping had been left unlagged following its overhaul during the recent dry dock (Figure 2b). This was hidden from view by the exhaust casing. • Fine oil sp",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:41ca30b8f935e1bc",`source`:"shipkg:fault:cdf116929c39",`target`:"shipkg:fault:d005e46c6652",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:41ca30b8f935e1bc",`case_id`:"spirit_of_discovery_pods_2023",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:bcc74e57d3088cc6",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_06_Spirit_of_Discovery_propulsion_loss.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/loss-of-propulsion-in-heavy-weather-experienced-by-the-passenger-vessel-spirit-of-discovery-leading-to-over-100-injuries-and-one-fatality",`page`:"42",`locator`:"PDF page 42",`quote`:"eed trips been the only issue. However, with the WLS sequence request active on both pods, when the propulsion motors tripped the pods automatically parked at 90° to Spirit of Discovery‘s heading and the vessel quickly lost speed and steerage. This left the bridge team doing their best to control the vessel’s heading using its bow thrusters. As a result, Spirit of Discovery’s bow was quick",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:4482b776ade00dbc",`source`:"shipkg:fault:4865d7c855d8",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:d1c468a6b34b",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:4482b776ade00dbc",`case_id`:"sd2013_05_missing_filter",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:893e7a7822c901f6",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"21",`locator`:"PDF page 21",`quote`:"ing oil low pressure alarm, and a lubricating oil low pressure trip alarm soon followed. The engine then shut down automatically. With propulsion lost, the master quickly anchored the vessel. After the engine was allowed to cool, the crankcase doors were removed; several crankshaft bearings were severely damaged (Figure 1) which prevented the engine from further operation. The",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:45eb816cfdbcbdf9",`source`:"shipkg:fault:d047fdea9ee9",`target`:"shipkg:fault:fee4df6aeb24",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:45eb816cfdbcbdf9",`case_id`:"wight_sky_me_2017",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:b10bdbaa38429105",`source_file`:"MAIB_2018_14_Wight_Sky_engine_bearing_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5b5217c7ed915d0b81e003df/MAIBInvReport14_2018.pdf",`page`:"14",`locator`:"PDF page 14",`quote`:"for initiating the failure. ○ When the shells of main bearing 5 turned, the lubrication supply to big end bearing 4 was blocked, resulting in destructive failure. • Rebuilding the engine in a clean and controlled environment and transferring it complete into the engine room would have reduced the likelihood of debris ingress. • The engine was not fitted with a wear detector, so there was",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:49ffbdd71fca320e",`source`:"shipkg:fault:7c36cc5888d4",`target`:"shipkg:fault:7386c69bc1ea",`properties`:{`context_id`:"knowledge:coupling_failure",`knowledge_layer`:"reference",`data_origin`:"field_report",`applicability`:"实际证据是Hebrides的CPP执行器小型爪式联轴器，不是主推进轴联轴器断裂；主轴断裂根因不可由此推断。",`coupling_domains`:"机-电",`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:49ffbdd71fca320e",`case_id`:"knowledge:coupling_failure",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:56138ddb26a2655e",`source_file`:"MAIB_2017_20_Hebrides_CPP_coupling.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/59b7ab1c40f0b61231e71a54/MAIBInvReport20_2017.pdf",`page`:"30",`locator`:"PDF page 30",`quote`:"tepper motor shaft rotated inside the jaw coupling in response to the electrical signals from the remote propulsion consoles, the coupling remained stationary and the shaft’s rotary motion was not transferred to the ball screw mechanism. Therefore, the pitch set on the port CPP was unaltered. The setscrew securing the jaw coupling to the stepper motor shaft had loosened since its insta",`props_json`:"{\"context_id\": \"knowledge:coupling_failure\", \"knowledge_layer\": \"reference\", \"data_origin\": \"field_report\", \"applicability\": \"实际证据是Hebrides的CPP执行器小型爪式联轴器，不是主推进轴联轴器断裂；主轴断裂根因不可由此推断。\", \"coupling_domains\": \"机-电\", \"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:4ab21227b3efce20",`source`:"shipkg:fault:5bc176965c58",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:775549e4c085",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:4ab21227b3efce20",`case_id`:"sd2016_08_generator_oil",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:2937d3b0bfe9d29f",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"26",`locator`:"PDF page 26",`quote`:"was spraying on to the adjacent generator. While they were investigating the source of the leak oil that had been sprayed on the exhaust casing of the adjacent engine caught fire. Fortunately the crew were able to quickly identify and isolate the source of the leak and extinguish the fire before it was able to spread. No one was hurt in the incident. Subsequent investigation revealed that: • The oil had c",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:4e06235d11a65dd4",`source`:"shipkg:condition:b290b6459200",`target`:"shipkg:fault:86ef7d39fd57",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:4e06235d11a65dd4",`case_id`:"sd2016_14_sea_valve",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:9bfb29365e610d09",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"40",`locator`:"PDF page 40",`quote`:"nected the electric motor from the pump. He then removed the flange bolts connecting the inlet pipe to the pump. Soon afterwards, water started to flow from the inlet pipe at a rapidly increasing rate. The chief engineer tried to reduce the rate by jamming rags into the pipe, but the flow was too strong. He then sent the motorman to fetch some pieces of wood, which he intended to force into the pip",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:4fa1a9255234d951",`source`:"shipkg:fault:8d2d73a67f71",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:775549e4c085",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:4fa1a9255234d951",`case_id`:"windcat8_port_engine_2017",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:f55562c55772b4c1",`source_file`:"MAIB_2018_01_Windcat8_bearing_failure_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/683922/MAIBInvReport01_2018.pdf",`page`:"11",`locator`:"PDF page 11",`quote`:"lure warranted a more cautious approach to the use of the engine until a deeper technical investigation could be conducted. • The fire resulted from the ignition of oil vapour released from the damaged crankcase and did not spread beyond the port engine. • The fixed fire-fighting system was rendered ineffective because not all the port engine space vents were closed prior to its release. • The safety of the embarked technicians was given",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:520a28c95116afda",`source`:"shipkg:fault:7b886d9d51c3",`target`:"shipkg:fault:3349e319bedc",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:520a28c95116afda",`case_id`:"stena_europe_fuel_2023",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:38b5d9eb759b1681",`source_file`:"MAIB_2024_20_Stena_Europe_fuel_spray_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6756db0ba63e1781efb87793/2024-20-StenaEurope.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"f pressurised fuel. The fuel sprayed onto the exposed exhaust manifold that was operating at a temperature exceeding 220°C when a screw in a two-screw flange within the fuel oil pipework loosened. [2.2] 2. The fuel oil spray was allowed to reach the hot surface because the joint was not protected by anti-splashing tape or shielding and fuel was able to escape forcefully. [2.3.2] 3. The engine manufacturer’s recommended fu",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:561c285555c25a69",`source`:"shipkg:cause:0b368a5a5869",`target`:"shipkg:fault:a20cef558a0a",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:561c285555c25a69",`case_id`:"wight_sky_me4_2018",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:a4a51bca0c30f80d",`source_file`:"MAIB_2022_04_Wight_Sky_multiple_engine_failures.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6267cc85e90e071690c1b679/2022-4-WightSky-Report.pdf",`page`:"84",`locator`:"PDF page 84",`quote`:"f the engine’s matched connecting rod big end bearing caps had been transposed during the engine assembly process. [2.3.2] 4. The transposition of the bearing caps reduced the metal-to-metal contact between surfaces of the connecting rods and their bearing caps. This would have caused fretting wear between the mating faces, which would have led to loosening and rapid failure of the end cap securing bolts. [2.3.2] 5. Four of",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:5b67e69e6ebd2a46",`source`:"shipkg:fault:c8fa85d36573",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:fc1835efb5ca",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:5b67e69e6ebd2a46",`case_id`:"queen_mary2_hf_2010",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:f17ab4bbdcec2bfc",`source_file`:"MAIB_2011_28_Queen_Mary_2_harmonic_filter_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/547c6fa6ed915d4c10000031/QM2Report.pdf",`page`:"13",`locator`:"PDF page 13",`quote`:"e suppression spray heads were activated, one in the aft harmonic filter room and the other in the aft main switchboard room. The explosion was triggered by deterioration in the capacitors in the aft HF . Internal arcing between the capacitor plates developed, which vaporised the dielectric medium causing the internal pressure to increase, until it caused the capacitor casing to rupture. Dielectri",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:5c1e6de9385c0810",`source`:"shipkg:fault:256ba55c5fb2",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:775549e4c085",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:5c1e6de9385c0810",`case_id`:"stena_europe_fuel_2023",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:b0b9daf02ad1af6f",`source_file`:"MAIB_2024_20_Stena_Europe_fuel_spray_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6756db0ba63e1781efb87793/2024-20-StenaEurope.pdf",`page`:"7",`locator`:"PDF page 7",`quote`:"noperative for several weeks. The fire was caused by fuel leaking under pressure from the fuel system of main engine number 3 and igniting on an exposed hot surface. No one was injured and there was no pollution. The investigation found that the fuel had ignited on part of the engine’s exhaust system that had a surface temperature of over 400°C. The post-accident inspection on board Stena Eu",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:631a892829438f4d",`source`:"shipkg:fault:b6b2c9f08149",`target`:"shipkg:fault:4cb7be531584",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:631a892829438f4d",`case_id`:"sd2013_02_control_air",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:88a04930502bf0c9",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"14",`locator`:"PDF page 14",`quote`:"tended. The approach went according to plan until the ferry was about 1½ ships’ length from its final berthing position, when her three main engine clutches disengaged almost simultaneously. No Air, No Clutch, No CPP , No Brakes Damage to lubrication oil pipe and bottom end bearing Bottom end bearing Failed lubricant oil pipe end fitting",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:6341298216cbf48c",`source`:"shipkg:condition:0abf74811b34",`target`:"shipkg:symptom:986db6816df4",`properties`:{`context_id`:"knowledge:cooling_cavitation",`knowledge_layer`:"reference",`data_origin`:"manufacturer_guidance",`applicability`:"扫气空气冷却器水侧；该证据描述低流量局部沸腾及管路汽蚀，不等同于已证明所有冷却泵汽蚀由此引起。",`coupling_domains`:"热-机",`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:6341298216cbf48c",`case_id`:"knowledge:cooling_cavitation",`certainty`:"guidance",`certainty_zh`:"厂家一般机理/指导（须核对机型）",`evidence_id`:"ev:9b96e30fbe8114af",`source_file`:"MAN_main_engine_auxiliary_efficiency.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.man-es.com/docs/default-source/document-sync/efficiency-improvements-main-engine-auxiliary-systems-eng.pdf",`page`:"11",`locator`:"PDF page 11",`quote`:"a function of the engine load and the ambient conditions. When reducing the water flow the following implications are foreseen: – Increased scavenge air temperature which will lead to a reduction of the water condensation amount in certain ambient conditions. Reduced water condensation will lead to a higher humidity level in the combustion chamber, which will have a negative effect on the ge",`props_json`:"{\"context_id\": \"knowledge:cooling_cavitation\", \"knowledge_layer\": \"reference\", \"data_origin\": \"manufacturer_guidance\", \"applicability\": \"扫气空气冷却器水侧；该证据描述低流量局部沸腾及管路汽蚀，不等同于已证明所有冷却泵汽蚀由此引起。\", \"coupling_domains\": \"热-机\", \"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:63455525414a8808",`source`:"shipkg:fault:fce2f501a499",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:2597a77f75b3",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:63455525414a8808",`case_id`:"sd2016_09_cpp_response",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:de42c2cda585b232",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"respond and continued to proceed ahead. Despite placing the pitch control to full astern, the CPP did not respond in time and the vessel’s bow struck the quay. The bulbous bow was holed, but fortunately the damage was above the waterline (Figure 1). The subsequent investigation identified that the vessel had a history of sluggish astern response. However, the crew had accepted this as",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:66050a54d6f46dab",`source`:"shipkg:fault:4cb7be531584",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:c5047807b300",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:66050a54d6f46dab",`case_id`:"sd2013_02_control_air",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:16e773b397fb6388",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"15",`locator`:"PDF page 15",`quote`:"ge the clutches. Although the starboard anchor was let go in an attempt to reduce the speed of approach, this did not prevent the ferry’s bow hitting her berth at a speed of 2.5kts and causing minor damage. Shortly after the impact, the engineers successfully re-engaged the port main engine clutch and the vessel was able to berth safely alongside, assisted by harbour tugs. Subsequent in",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:6dffccd015790a4e",`source`:"shipkg:fault:1e5a23a200ad",`target`:"shipkg:fault:ae4a492efe41",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:6dffccd015790a4e",`case_id`:"pride_can_cpp_2014",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:fbf6ef7897c61557",`source_file`:"MAIB_2015_22_Pride_of_Canterbury_CPP_hydraulic_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/563092daed915d566d000002/MAIBInvReport-22_2015.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"akes of the starboard main engines. The flanged joint ruptured because the CPP system became over- pressurised as a result of the back pressure valve (PSV3) becoming jammed in the closed position. The reason for the temporary increase in the starboard main engine load to 100% and corresponding increase in turbocharger rpm has not been determined. However, the reason is not believed to be related to the cause of the fire.",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:6ed3094ee3192dd5",`source`:"shipkg:consequence:81fff36694d8",`target`:"shipkg:fault:511d6ce8c125",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:6ed3094ee3192dd5",`case_id`:"sd2016_22_cooling_pipe",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:8bf90883ea90543a",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"59",`locator`:"PDF page 59",`quote`:"gineer observed that water was almost level with the top of the main engine and was rising quickly. He started the bilge pump but could not reach the two sea water inlet valves as they were already more than a metre below the water level. The main engine then stopped and the engineer told the skipper that nothing could be done to stem the ingress of water. The Figure 1: Sequence showing fishing vessel s",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:6f00f88d169ef712",`source`:"shipkg:condition:ed8375f7583f",`target`:"shipkg:fault:b6b2c9f08149",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:6f00f88d169ef712",`case_id`:"sd2013_02_control_air",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:008f983201b4fd11",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"14",`locator`:"PDF page 14",`quote`:"he bottom end bearing had overheated and failed (see figure). No1 compressor was isolated but the engineers soon noticed that the air pressure in the main air receiver was dropping. Shortly afterwards, the centre main engine was started and all three main engines were put on standby in preparation for entering port. During this period, multiple alarms sounded in the ECR warning of low control air pressure.",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:6fcfa6500192af8c",`source`:"shipkg:fault:020786dc9fd0",`target`:"shipkg:condition:52a5771f68ca",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:6fcfa6500192af8c",`case_id`:"sd2016_08_generator_oil",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:59a2040fb754c1d5",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"28",`locator`:"PDF page 28",`quote`:"21 MAIB Safety Digest 1/2016 CASE 8 The Lessons 1. Unlagged sections of exhaust piping will radiate heat to the protective casing, causing it to attain temperatures sufficient to ignite an oil or fuel spray. 2. These temperatures are not visible to the eye unless the surface is glowing. However, a thermal image will immediately identify unlagged sections (F",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:7571a5635e421ac3",`source`:"shipkg:fault:2c644dcfc770",`target`:"shipkg:fault:8d2d73a67f71",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:7571a5635e421ac3",`case_id`:"windcat8_port_engine_2017",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:921221ff746c010e",`source_file`:"MAIB_2018_01_Windcat8_bearing_failure_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/683922/MAIBInvReport01_2018.pdf",`page`:"1",`locator`:"PDF page 1",`quote`:"to Windcat 8’s port main engine was caused by the failure of a piston connecting rod big end shell bearing, which resulted in the connecting rod assembly releasing and penetrating through the engine crankcase. The investigation also identified that: • A high oil temperature alarm prior to the engine failure warranted a more cautious approach to the use of the engine until a deeper technical investigation could be conducted. • The fire",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:758bddbadcad8848",`source`:"shipkg:fault:ae4a492efe41",`target`:"shipkg:fault:dd6aba2caf5a",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:758bddbadcad8848",`case_id`:"pride_can_cpp_2014",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:9cb1e1609e478a6f",`source_file`:"MAIB_2015_22_Pride_of_Canterbury_CPP_hydraulic_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/563092daed915d566d000002/MAIBInvReport-22_2015.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"oil, from a ruptured pipework joint in the starboard CPP system, onto the hot exhaust uptakes of the starboard main engines. The flanged joint ruptured because the CPP system became over- pressurised as a result of the back pressure valve (PSV3) becoming jammed in the closed position. The reason for the temporary increase in the starboard main engine load to 100% and corresponding increase in turbocharger rpm has not been det",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:7c222be8825bc855",`source`:"shipkg:fault:fee4df6aeb24",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:775549e4c085",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:7c222be8825bc855",`case_id`:"wight_sky_me_2017",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:feb3c28c6560bd03",`source_file`:"MAIB_2018_14_Wight_Sky_engine_bearing_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5b5217c7ed915d0b81e003df/MAIBInvReport14_2018.pdf",`page`:"1",`locator`:"PDF page 1",`quote`:"t 2133 on 12 September 2017, while approaching Yarmouth, Isle of Wight, the ro-ro passenger ferry Wight Sky (Figure 1) suffered a catastrophic failure of one of its main propulsion engines, followed by a fire. The fire was brought under control in less than 2 minutes, but the vessel’s engineer, who had been standing near the engine, suffered serious burn injuries to his hands and face. Although he was discharged from hospital 7 days l",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:833c59f7f1aa2824",`source`:"shipkg:fault:86ef7d39fd57",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:81fff36694d8",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:833c59f7f1aa2824",`case_id`:"sd2016_14_sea_valve",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:a7f4aefea80b44c7",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"40",`locator`:"PDF page 40",`quote`:"age to machinery, he left the bilge system to stop the generator and main engine, and sent the motorman to the bridge to tell the master that the engine room was flooding. With the water level continuing to rise, the chief engineer evacuated the engine room, leaving open the watertight door between the engine room and the accommodation as he did so. On being informed of the flooding, the master le",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:834325dfe9c79487",`source`:"shipkg:condition:3516d66bca42",`target`:"shipkg:fault:7dd3cdd4fe58",`properties`:{`context_id`:"knowledge:bearing_electrical_erosion",`knowledge_layer`:"reference",`data_origin`:"manufacturer_guidance",`applicability`:"具有闭合轴电流路径的旋转电机；轴承绝缘和接地刷方案按厂家/机型确定，不能假定全部STAMFORD机型都需要绝缘轴承。",`coupling_domains`:"电-机",`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:834325dfe9c79487",`case_id`:"knowledge:bearing_electrical_erosion",`certainty`:"guidance",`certainty_zh`:"厂家一般机理/指导（须核对机型）",`evidence_id`:"ev:0f7534e3f93d98e3",`source_file`:"STAMFORD_AGN033_bearing_currents.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.stamford-avk.com/sites/stamfordavk/files/AGNs/AGN-033_C-Shaft-Bearing-Currents.pdf",`page`:"1",`locator`:"PDF page 1",`quote`:"porting bearings, consequently any resulting current flow will pass across the rolling element of the bearings, and will initiate electrical erosion of the bearing materials, eventually reducing the low friction expectation of the bearing. It is possible for a single bearing alternator to suffer from shaft bearing currents, but here the current flow path at the drive end of the alternator’s shaft mus",`props_json`:"{\"context_id\": \"knowledge:bearing_electrical_erosion\", \"knowledge_layer\": \"reference\", \"data_origin\": \"manufacturer_guidance\", \"applicability\": \"具有闭合轴电流路径的旋转电机；轴承绝缘和接地刷方案按厂家/机型确定，不能假定全部STAMFORD机型都需要绝缘轴承。\", \"coupling_domains\": \"电-机\", \"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:85ba2b346d113001",`source`:"shipkg:consequence:c5047807b300",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:fd1e977000c3",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:85ba2b346d113001",`case_id`:"sd2013_02_control_air",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:7009d03f4c6f89d9",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"15",`locator`:"PDF page 15",`quote`:"ge the clutches. Although the starboard anchor was let go in an attempt to reduce the speed of approach, this did not prevent the ferry’s bow hitting her berth at a speed of 2.5kts and causing minor damage. Shortly after the impact, the engineers successfully re-engaged the port main engine clutch and the vessel was able to berth safely alongside, assisted by harbour tugs. Subsequent investigation identifie",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:8669b6bdfca6b932",`source`:"shipkg:fault:401ffd7724bc",`target`:"shipkg:fault:6ade8daa881a",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:8669b6bdfca6b932",`case_id`:"sd2013_05_missing_filter",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:82256a9ee8fd56dd",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"21",`locator`:"PDF page 21",`quote`:"d main bearing journals; overheating of the bedplate at the main bearing housings; overheating of the piston connecting rods; the seizure of several pistons (Figure 2); failure of the camshaft and turbo charger bearings, and metallic debris throughout the lubricating oil system. The damage sustained necessitated an engine rebuild and the replacement of the bedplate and crankshaft. A",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:88e048fbad4564a1",`source`:"shipkg:fault:ce4fe75e21d8",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:0d26b4ebcffb",`properties`:{`context_id`:"knowledge:bearing_seizure",`knowledge_layer`:"reference",`data_origin`:"manufacturer_guidance",`applicability`:"主机滑动轴承；烧瓦是检索用的工程统称，不能把全部轴瓦疲劳、瓦片转位或轴承失效直接标成已证实烧瓦。",`coupling_domains`:"热-机",`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:88e048fbad4564a1",`case_id`:"knowledge:bearing_seizure",`certainty`:"guidance",`certainty_zh`:"厂家一般机理/指导（须核对机型）",`evidence_id`:"ev:7598b98aa07fcb83",`source_file`:"MAN_SL2013_569_bearing_wear_monitoring.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.man-es.com/docs/default-source/service-letters/sl2013-569.pdf",`page`:"2",`locator`:"PDF page 2",`quote`:"ist detec - tor (OMD) alarm set off and requested slow-down. At this stage, the bearing damage had evolved into a situation where comprehensive repair of the crankshaft and bearing housing (bedplate) was called for. Fig. 1: Damaged bearing shell A subsequent analysis of the signals stored in the BWM system log provided detailed information about the course of the bearing failure. It has been established tha",`props_json`:"{\"context_id\": \"knowledge:bearing_seizure\", \"knowledge_layer\": \"reference\", \"data_origin\": \"manufacturer_guidance\", \"applicability\": \"主机滑动轴承；烧瓦是检索用的工程统称，不能把全部轴瓦疲劳、瓦片转位或轴承失效直接标成已证实烧瓦。\", \"coupling_domains\": \"热-机\", \"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:89d80dca73169f8c",`source`:"shipkg:fault:423cd9a63be0",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:775549e4c085",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:89d80dca73169f8c",`case_id`:"kommandor_susan_dg1_2025",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:390711bc162bb6ce",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_10_Kommandor_Susan_generator_bearing_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/catastrophic-engine-failure-and-subsequent-fire-on-board-the-site-investigation-vessel-kommandor-susan",`page`:"1",`locator`:"PDF page 1",`quote`:"r Susan suffered a catastrophic failure of a diesel generator engine while conducting sea trials in the Firth of Forth, Scotland. The failure resulted in an engine room fire and a complete power blackout. The crew responded promptly, extinguished the fire and mustered safely. The vessel lost propulsion and began drifting eastwards. Attempts to deploy anchors were unsuccessful because the anchor winches required electrical power t",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:92daeaabf4b736a2",`source`:"shipkg:fault:5737f3610967",`target`:"shipkg:fault:73da5c52ce5d",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:92daeaabf4b736a2",`case_id`:"queen_mary2_hf_2010",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:a0ea937863e1a2df",`source_file`:"MAIB_2011_28_Queen_Mary_2_harmonic_filter_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/547c6fa6ed915d4c10000031/QM2Report.pdf",`page`:"13",`locator`:"PDF page 13",`quote`:"om and the other in the aft main switchboard room. The explosion was triggered by deterioration in the capacitors in the aft HF . Internal arcing between the capacitor plates developed, which vaporised the dielectric medium causing the internal pressure to increase, until it caused the capacitor casing to rupture. Dielectric fluid vapour sprayed out, igniting and creating the likely conditions for an arc-flash",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:961d8e73eae49028",`source`:"shipkg:fault:96cc1c0ff36e",`target`:"shipkg:fault:fee4df6aeb24",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:961d8e73eae49028",`case_id`:"wight_sky_me2_2018",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:4846a9af2b7e6456",`source_file`:"MAIB_2022_04_Wight_Sky_multiple_engine_failures.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6267cc85e90e071690c1b679/2022-4-WightSky-Report.pdf",`page`:"84",`locator`:"PDF page 84",`quote`:"S 3.1 SAFETY ISSUES DIRECTLY CONTRIBUTING TO THE ACCIDENTS THAT HAVE BEEN ADDRESSED OR RESULTED IN RECOMMENDATIONS 1. Wight Sky’s ME2 failed catastrophically due to a sudden loss of lubricating oil supply to its number five main journal bearing and number four crankpin. [2.3.1] 2. The oilway to the main journal and crankpin was blocked off when the bearing shells turned in their housing. Poor fuel combustion, the presence of silic",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:9702c3e4689bae04",`source`:"shipkg:condition:d96dbed6a05c",`target`:"shipkg:fault:b7f3d0b1bf24",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:9702c3e4689bae04",`case_id`:"sd2013_12_oily_rag",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:c6b798ec4934dc08",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"41",`locator`:"PDF page 41",`quote`:"iling checks, he wiped the engine sump dipstick on a rag, which he casually left on a tank top above the engine exhaust manifold. Vibration caused the oil-soaked rag to fall onto the hot manifold and catch fire. The small fire then ignited the engine high temperature alarm cabling loom, causing it to short circuit and set off the alarm in the wheelhouse (Figure 2). The functional fire and smoke alarm",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:9ccb002c26da0bad",`source`:"shipkg:fault:b7f3d0b1bf24",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:775549e4c085",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:9ccb002c26da0bad",`case_id`:"sd2013_12_oily_rag",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:1abb50030379f9ee",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"41",`locator`:"PDF page 41",`quote`:"rag, which he casually left on a tank top above the engine exhaust manifold. Vibration caused the oil-soaked rag to fall onto the hot manifold and catch fire. The small fire then ignited the engine high temperature alarm cabling loom, causing it to short circuit and set off the alarm in the wheelhouse (Figure 2). The functional fire and smoke alarm sensors were some distance from the",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:9d377d8fdbd014f0",`source`:"shipkg:condition:553e318feb99",`target`:"shipkg:fault:15fa82225a89",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:9d377d8fdbd014f0",`case_id`:"sd2016_14_sea_valve",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:951a6820ce2d0fc6",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"40",`locator`:"PDF page 40",`quote`:"alarm, mustering the remaining crew. The seaman rigged the portable electric water pump on the main deck but, with the vessel now running on emergency power only, he was unable to start the pump. The master contacted the coastguard by VHF radio and advised that the vessel was flooding. The coastguard transmitted a “Mayday Relay”, and RNLI lifeboats from two stations were tasked to assist",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:9fabc8d3664d53d0",`source`:"shipkg:condition:2ee58a9a8fad",`target`:"shipkg:fault:c9a34bd46532",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:9fabc8d3664d53d0",`case_id`:"spirit_of_discovery_pods_2023",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:b6540313ab8acd21",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_06_Spirit_of_Discovery_propulsion_loss.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/loss-of-propulsion-in-heavy-weather-experienced-by-the-passenger-vessel-spirit-of-discovery-leading-to-over-100-injuries-and-one-fatality",`page`:"42",`locator`:"PDF page 42",`quote`:"conditions at the time, it is almost certain that Spirit of Discovery’s pitching caused the propellers to come out of the water. This caused a sudden reduction in torque on the propulsion motor and led to a very rapid increase in the motors’ rpm. The engine alarm and monitoring system recorded that, immediately before their shutdown, the rpm of each pod’s propulsion motor very rapidly increased and exceeded the preset o",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:a2e2e760f4405d47",`source`:"shipkg:fault:a20cef558a0a",`target`:"shipkg:fault:9b76a4f68834",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:a2e2e760f4405d47",`case_id`:"wight_sky_me4_2018",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:1218b476bea8d173",`source_file`:"MAIB_2022_04_Wight_Sky_multiple_engine_failures.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6267cc85e90e071690c1b679/2022-4-WightSky-Report.pdf",`page`:"84",`locator`:"PDF page 84",`quote`:"ng caps reduced the metal-to-metal contact between surfaces of the connecting rods and their bearing caps. This would have caused fretting wear between the mating faces, which would have led to loosening and rapid failure of the end cap securing bolts. [2.3.2] 5. Four of the five catastrophic engine failures discussed in detail in this report failed suddenly because of a loss of lubrication supply to the engines’ crankshaft journal bearings and cr",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:a3afd89485ae72cd",`source`:"shipkg:fault:f078b5a27275",`target`:"shipkg:fault:dddb0abee018",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:a3afd89485ae72cd",`case_id`:"sd2016_05_cpp_backup",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:738f5c3dde53a776",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"20",`locator`:"PDF page 20",`quote`:"ety Digest 1/2016 CASE 5 The investigation found that when the starboard CPP back-up control mode was inadvertently selected, the master lost bridge control of that propeller. The starboard CPP continued to thrust at over half ahead throughout the vessel’s approach to the berth and up until its engine was stopped (about 2 hours after the contact). Starboard pitch back-up on/off control button Centre c",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:a3e2a6f635c06758",`source`:"shipkg:fault:aba0717d72a0",`target`:"shipkg:fault:d047fdea9ee9",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:a3e2a6f635c06758",`case_id`:"wight_sky_me_2017",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:dcba2393344bd01c",`source_file`:"MAIB_2018_14_Wight_Sky_engine_bearing_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5b5217c7ed915d0b81e003df/MAIBInvReport14_2018.pdf",`page`:"14",`locator`:"PDF page 14",`quote`:"e engine’s oil channels was most probably responsible for initiating the failure. ○ When the shells of main bearing 5 turned, the lubrication supply to big end bearing 4 was blocked, resulting in destructive failure. • Rebuilding the engine in a clean and controlled environment and transferring it complete into the engine room would have reduced the likelihood of debris ingress. • The engine was not fitted w",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:a7be652f87e3112c",`source`:"shipkg:consequence:775549e4c085",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:66c2df24581f",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:a7be652f87e3112c",`case_id`:"stena_europe_fuel_2023",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:db2b2fa6744312cc",`source_file`:"MAIB_2024_20_Stena_Europe_fuel_spray_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6756db0ba63e1781efb87793/2024-20-StenaEurope.pdf",`page`:"7",`locator`:"PDF page 7",`quote`:"Fishguard, Wales on passage from Rosslare, Ireland. The fire caused significant damage to the port main engine room and rendered one of its four main engines inoperative for several weeks. The fire was caused by fuel leaking under pressure from the fuel system of main engine number 3 and igniting on an exposed hot surface. No one was injured and there was no pollution. The investigation found that the fuel had ign",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:a81b23e750118cd9",`source`:"shipkg:fault:439f73a406a0",`target`:"shipkg:fault:1a73f1a1e185",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:a81b23e750118cd9",`case_id`:"sd2013_03_turning_gear",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:543d0b7392fa5ff2",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"16",`locator`:"PDF page 16",`quote`:"on compressed air, a loud bang was heard; the turning gear interlock, the last remaining safety barrier, had failed to work. The resulting damage to the shaft and gearing (Figure 1) and to the turning gear casing (Figure 2) disabled the ship for a month and cost a six-figure sum to repair. To Turn or Not to Turn?",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:a840667b53ddaf5c",`source`:"shipkg:consequence:4016217446bf",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:d1c468a6b34b",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:a840667b53ddaf5c",`case_id`:"kommandor_susan_dg1_2025",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:96c615c53d3b0715",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_10_Kommandor_Susan_generator_bearing_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/catastrophic-engine-failure-and-subsequent-fire-on-board-the-site-investigation-vessel-kommandor-susan",`page`:"1",`locator`:"PDF page 1",`quote`:"ted in an engine room fire and a complete power blackout. The crew responded promptly, extinguished the fire and mustered safely. The vessel lost propulsion and began drifting eastwards. Attempts to deploy anchors were unsuccessful because the anchor winches required electrical power to operate. Kommandor Susan was eventually returned to Leith harbour with limited propulsion restored. The investigation found tha",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:a9fa64e6e5b6251f",`source`:"shipkg:consequence:4016217446bf",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:4f46c84c0d64",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:a9fa64e6e5b6251f",`case_id`:"kommandor_susan_dg1_2025",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:0ec8d60206b6b9cf",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_10_Kommandor_Susan_generator_bearing_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/catastrophic-engine-failure-and-subsequent-fire-on-board-the-site-investigation-vessel-kommandor-susan",`page`:"1",`locator`:"PDF page 1",`quote`:"ustered safely. The vessel lost propulsion and began drifting eastwards. Attempts to deploy anchors were unsuccessful because the anchor winches required electrical power to operate. Kommandor Susan was eventually returned to Leith harbour with limited propulsion restored. The investigation found that the engine failure was caused by premature wear of bearings fitted during a major overhaul in 2019. These co",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:ab3cbed2a2a61e2c",`source`:"shipkg:fault:fee4df6aeb24",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:775549e4c085",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:ab3cbed2a2a61e2c",`case_id`:"finlandia_seaways_me_2018",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:471026a1392177a8",`source_file`:"MAIB_2021_02_Finlandia_Seaways_connecting_rod_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/engine-failure-and-subsequent-fire-on-ro-ro-cargo-vessel-finlandia-seaways-with-1-person-injured",`page`:"9",`locator`:"PDF page 9",`quote`:"1 SYNOPSIS At 2003 on 16 April 2018, the Lithuanian registered ro-ro cargo vessel Finlandia Seaways suffered a catastrophic main engine failure that caused serious structural damage to the engine and a fire in the engine room. The vessel’s third engineer, who was on duty in the engine room at the time, suffered serious smoke-related lung, kidney and eye injuries during his escape. Finlandia Seaways was 11nm east of Lowestoft on a re",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:ad5c7c478856ab6c",`source`:"shipkg:cause:9b5341f924b9",`target`:"shipkg:fault:7c36cc5888d4",`properties`:{`context_id`:"knowledge:coupling_failure",`knowledge_layer`:"reference",`data_origin`:"field_report",`applicability`:"实际证据是Hebrides的CPP执行器小型爪式联轴器，不是主推进轴联轴器断裂；主轴断裂根因不可由此推断。",`coupling_domains`:"机-电",`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:ad5c7c478856ab6c",`case_id`:"knowledge:coupling_failure",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:d3e64cd30311c1bb",`source_file`:"MAIB_2017_20_Hebrides_CPP_coupling.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/59b7ab1c40f0b61231e71a54/MAIBInvReport20_2017.pdf",`page`:"35",`locator`:"PDF page 35",`quote`:"s caused by the loosening of a setscrew used to attach a coupling to a stepper motor shaft due to its lack of rundown torque, the absence of thread locking fluid, and vibration during the actuator’s operation. [2.2] 3. The absence of service instructions for the actuator’s inspection and maintenance that were available from its manufacturer was pivotal to the failure. [2.3] 4. No thread l",`props_json`:"{\"context_id\": \"knowledge:coupling_failure\", \"knowledge_layer\": \"reference\", \"data_origin\": \"field_report\", \"applicability\": \"实际证据是Hebrides的CPP执行器小型爪式联轴器，不是主推进轴联轴器断裂；主轴断裂根因不可由此推断。\", \"coupling_domains\": \"机-电\", \"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:b00142198fe385e9",`source`:"shipkg:fault:c830e7992f26",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:d1c468a6b34b",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:b00142198fe385e9",`case_id`:"spirit_of_discovery_pods_2023",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:166a2a0932391029",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_06_Spirit_of_Discovery_propulsion_loss.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/loss-of-propulsion-in-heavy-weather-experienced-by-the-passenger-vessel-spirit-of-discovery-leading-to-over-100-injuries-and-one-fatality",`page`:"42",`locator`:"PDF page 42",`quote`:"ULSION 2.3.1 Initial loss of propulsion Spirit of Discovery was pitching heavily and rolling violently in 8m to 9m waves when its port pod automatically shut down, followed shortly afterwards by its starboard pod. After shutting down, each pod then automatically rotated and parked at 90° to the vessel’s heading. Given the weather conditions at the time, it is almost certain that Spirit of Discovery’s pitching caused the propellers to come",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:b27d395dd7a1eec9",`source`:"shipkg:condition:0a605c97371c",`target`:"shipkg:condition:2ee58a9a8fad",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:b27d395dd7a1eec9",`case_id`:"spirit_of_discovery_pods_2023",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:9d2abeeb05ea44b5",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_06_Spirit_of_Discovery_propulsion_loss.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/loss-of-propulsion-in-heavy-weather-experienced-by-the-passenger-vessel-spirit-of-discovery-leading-to-over-100-injuries-and-one-fatality",`page`:"42",`locator`:"PDF page 42",`quote`:"parked at 90° to the vessel’s heading. Given the weather conditions at the time, it is almost certain that Spirit of Discovery’s pitching caused the propellers to come out of the water. This caused a sudden reduction in torque on the propulsion motor and led to a very rapid increase in the motors’ rpm. The engine alarm and monitoring system recorded that, immediately before their shutdown, the rpm of each pod’s",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:ba02cd70d4d29ab2",`source`:"shipkg:condition:2d0261049d78",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:4016217446bf",`properties`:{`name`:"很可能导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:ba02cd70d4d29ab2",`case_id`:"queen_mary2_hf_2010",`certainty`:"probable",`certainty_zh`:"很可能",`evidence_id`:"ev:488cfef2b71e970c",`source_file`:"MAIB_2011_28_Queen_Mary_2_harmonic_filter_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/547c6fa6ed915d4c10000031/QM2Report.pdf",`page`:"13",`locator`:"PDF page 13",`quote`:"thin the aft HF at the time of the accident caused general instability in the electrical network which could not be contained and led to the generators shutting down. Lloyd’s Register (Europe, Middle East and Asia) (LR) has been recommended to take forward proposals to the International Association of Classification Societies to: • Establish a requirement for all new vessels fitted with harmo",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"很可能导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:c103c2bf232a01f9",`source`:"shipkg:consequence:775549e4c085",`target`:"shipkg:fault:999defd690d8",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:c103c2bf232a01f9",`case_id`:"sd2013_12_oily_rag",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:e3771166c08962b6",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"41",`locator`:"PDF page 41",`quote`:"ked rag to fall onto the hot manifold and catch fire. The small fire then ignited the engine high temperature alarm cabling loom, causing it to short circuit and set off the alarm in the wheelhouse (Figure 2). The functional fire and smoke alarm sensors were some distance from the fire, and the smoke and heat had not migrated that far by the time the master noticed the smoke on the camera monitor.",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:c1ddb55a944cf2cf",`source`:"shipkg:consequence:81fff36694d8",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:cae4f7ac3ba9",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:c1ddb55a944cf2cf",`case_id`:"sd2016_22_cooling_pipe",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:069c961d11b53b1c",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"60",`locator`:"PDF page 60",`quote`:"l sensors from the wheelhouse as he made his way to the liferaft. Once in the liferaft the crew cut the painter and watched their vessel sink in deep water as they drifted away (Figure 1) After spending an hour in the liferaft the crew were rescued by the crew of a vessel that had responded to the “Mayday” relay message. They were later transferred ashore, unharmed, by a rescue heli",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:c76e4c8742b7bbc2",`source`:"shipkg:cause:c5d7e29b6c94",`target`:"shipkg:fault:0b115c0dd100",`properties`:{`context_id`:"knowledge:coolant_blockage",`knowledge_layer`:"reference",`data_origin`:"manufacturer_guidance",`applicability`:"MAN四冲程柴油机闭式淡水冷却；水质要求与添加剂须按具体机型手册确认。",`coupling_domains`:"热-机",`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:c76e4c8742b7bbc2",`case_id`:"knowledge:coolant_blockage",`certainty`:"guidance",`certainty_zh`:"厂家一般机理/指导（须核对机型）",`evidence_id`:"ev:1ac13d5b81e13593",`source_file`:"MAN_SL2016_623_cooling_water.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.man-es.com/docs/default-source/service-letters/sl2016-623.pdf",`page`:"2",`locator`:"PDF page 2",`quote`:"der head. The damages are often a result of corrosion, restrictions in or blocking of the cooling water flow, which are caused by deposits of limescale and/or rust. In general corrosion may result in leakages and thereby re - duce the lifetime and safety of the engine components. Lime- scale as well as rust deposits will reduce the heat transfer and may result in thermal overload of the com",`props_json`:"{\"context_id\": \"knowledge:coolant_blockage\", \"knowledge_layer\": \"reference\", \"data_origin\": \"manufacturer_guidance\", \"applicability\": \"MAN四冲程柴油机闭式淡水冷却；水质要求与添加剂须按具体机型手册确认。\", \"coupling_domains\": \"热-机\", \"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:c86ee238c72b533c",`source`:"shipkg:condition:5cabdd7ce44c",`target`:"shipkg:fault:8b8846e83caf",`properties`:{`context_id`:"knowledge:winding_insulation",`knowledge_layer`:"reference",`data_origin`:"manufacturer_guidance",`applicability`:"STAMFORD/AvK发电机；检测与干燥作业须停电隔离，由合格人员依本机手册执行，本文不提供通用阈值或操作命令。",`coupling_domains`:"热-电",`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:c86ee238c72b533c",`case_id`:"knowledge:winding_insulation",`certainty`:"guidance",`certainty_zh`:"厂家一般机理/指导（须核对机型）",`evidence_id`:"ev:454c2c34e07b2395",`source_file`:"STAMFORD_AGN035_fault_protection.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.stamford-avk.com/sites/stamfordavk/files/AGNs/AGN-035_B-Overload-and-Fault-Protection.pdf",`page`:"2",`locator`:"PDF page 2",`quote`:"e within the graphically displayed current against time, in order to avoid initiating permanent damage, which would result in the thermal degradation of the alternator’s insulation system. The disconnect times are achieved by the engineer responsible for selecting a circuit breaker, which has the appropriate adjustable tripping characteristics that can be set to ensure complia",`props_json`:"{\"context_id\": \"knowledge:winding_insulation\", \"knowledge_layer\": \"reference\", \"data_origin\": \"manufacturer_guidance\", \"applicability\": \"STAMFORD/AvK发电机；检测与干燥作业须停电隔离，由合格人员依本机手册执行，本文不提供通用阈值或操作命令。\", \"coupling_domains\": \"热-电\", \"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:c89e9a0773956752",`source`:"shipkg:fault:4e2929b80b35",`target`:"shipkg:fault:fee4df6aeb24",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:c89e9a0773956752",`case_id`:"finlandia_seaways_me_2018",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:53cb0d46e7e767ec",`source_file`:"MAIB_2021_02_Finlandia_Seaways_connecting_rod_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/engine-failure-and-subsequent-fire-on-ro-ro-cargo-vessel-finlandia-seaways-with-1-person-injured",`page`:"9",`locator`:"PDF page 9",`quote`:"ent and Incident Investigation Division and the engine manufacturer, MAN Diesel and Turbo SE. The investigation identified that a fracture of the connecting rod small end had led to the sudden failure of the main engine. The investigation also found that the method used to replace the connecting rod small end piston pin bearing bushes by the vessel manager’s maintenance support contractor had introduced stress raisers that signficantly increased",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:d49bfb0e69feaca9",`source`:"shipkg:fault:aba0717d72a0",`target`:"shipkg:fault:96cc1c0ff36e",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:d49bfb0e69feaca9",`case_id`:"wight_sky_me2_2018",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:a67a93bfec361edf",`source_file`:"MAIB_2022_04_Wight_Sky_multiple_engine_failures.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6267cc85e90e071690c1b679/2022-4-WightSky-Report.pdf",`page`:"84",`locator`:"PDF page 84",`quote`:"y due to a sudden loss of lubricating oil supply to its number five main journal bearing and number four crankpin. [2.3.1] 2. The oilway to the main journal and crankpin was blocked off when the bearing shells turned in their housing. Poor fuel combustion, the presence of silica sand and other abrasive particles embedded in the main bearing shells, engine misalignment, high levels of vibration, and contaminated lubricating oil might all have",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:d5e855bff1694f60",`source`:"shipkg:condition:e21862ad051d",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:bcd3a732b87d",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:d5e855bff1694f60",`case_id`:"wight_sky_me_2017",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:d2ddab6cf68a9801",`source_file`:"MAIB_2018_14_Wight_Sky_engine_bearing_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5b5217c7ed915d0b81e003df/MAIBInvReport14_2018.pdf",`page`:"14",`locator`:"PDF page 14",`quote`:"s. • The engine was not fitted with a wear detector, so there was no means of receiving a warning before the engine failed. • The essential services switchboard aft circuit breaker had been left in manual mode, resulting in the loss of power to critical equipment, including the fixed fire-fighting system. ACTION TAKEN Wightlink Limited has: • Agreed with RKM that all engines will be fully assembled and load-tested prior to delivery on",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:dc2be68ce73454a4",`source`:"shipkg:fault:7d56f05dfb4b",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:d1c468a6b34b",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:dc2be68ce73454a4",`case_id`:"queen_mary2_hf_2010",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:c1d3874bb4a2345c",`source_file`:"MAIB_2011_28_Queen_Mary_2_harmonic_filter_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/547c6fa6ed915d4c10000031/QM2Report.pdf",`page`:"13",`locator`:"PDF page 13",`quote`:"room. Within a few seconds, all four propulsion motors shut down, and the vessel blacked out shortly afterwards. Fortunately, the vessel was clear of navigational hazards and drifted in open sea. The emergency generator started automatically and provided essential supplies to the vessel, and it wa s qu ickly es tablished th at th e ex plosion ha d ta ken pl ace in th e af t ha rmonic filter (HF) room, situated within the",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:dc599b8981d72f53",`source`:"shipkg:cause:7009e2343511",`target`:"shipkg:fault:ce4fe75e21d8",`properties`:{`context_id`:"knowledge:bearing_seizure",`knowledge_layer`:"reference",`data_origin`:"manufacturer_guidance",`applicability`:"主机滑动轴承；烧瓦是检索用的工程统称，不能把全部轴瓦疲劳、瓦片转位或轴承失效直接标成已证实烧瓦。",`coupling_domains`:"热-机",`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:dc599b8981d72f53",`case_id`:"knowledge:bearing_seizure",`certainty`:"guidance",`certainty_zh`:"厂家一般机理/指导（须核对机型）",`evidence_id`:"ev:0523deba67297b7c",`source_file`:"MAN_SL2013_569_bearing_wear_monitoring.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.man-es.com/docs/default-source/service-letters/sl2013-569.pdf",`page`:"2",`locator`:"PDF page 2",`quote`:"C A main bearing damage was recently experienced on an MAN B&W S-MC-C main engine of medium bore size. The damage was caused by a sudden ingress of foreign matter into the bearing via the lubricating oil system, and it devel - oped rapidly into a bearing seizure. The engine was equipped with a bearing wear monitoring (BWM) system as recommended by MAN Diesel & Turbo (MDT). However, for rea",`props_json`:"{\"context_id\": \"knowledge:bearing_seizure\", \"knowledge_layer\": \"reference\", \"data_origin\": \"manufacturer_guidance\", \"applicability\": \"主机滑动轴承；烧瓦是检索用的工程统称，不能把全部轴瓦疲劳、瓦片转位或轴承失效直接标成已证实烧瓦。\", \"coupling_domains\": \"热-机\", \"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:dd0ca1362eba18ee",`source`:"shipkg:fault:c44e6c4545bf",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:5c4ffe048cb7",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:dd0ca1362eba18ee",`case_id`:"sd2016_05_cpp_backup",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:a2b206da94882af3",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"19",`locator`:"PDF page 19",`quote`:"y from the berth. The master’s actions proved ineffective as the vessel tore through the linkspan at a speed of about 7 knots and made heavy contact with the concrete berth (Figure 3). Almost immediately, bilge alarms, indicating water ingress into the vessel’s forward spaces, began to sound. The pitch on both propellers was brought to zero but the main engines were kept running. The bridge team mad",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:df874a6b2f2339be",`source`:"shipkg:condition:32eb7154ffd7",`target`:"shipkg:fault:ce4fe75e21d8",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:df874a6b2f2339be",`case_id`:"sd2013_05_missing_filter",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:f82c24711a999936",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"21",`locator`:"PDF page 21",`quote`:"r was found without a filter cartridge in the on-line filter chamber, and the engine lubricating oil system was contaminated. The contamination caused main bearing seizure, the rotation of bearing shells and the blockage of oil ways, and subsequent oil starvation and overheating to other bearings and to the pistons. The engine daily logs referred to oil filter cartridge changes only prior to the re",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:dfb62382120183ff",`source`:"shipkg:fault:db9b4536b139",`target`:"shipkg:fault:c1ffab11185c",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:dfb62382120183ff",`case_id`:"sd2016_14_sea_valve",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:e8101941c0ddc6d2",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"41",`locator`:"PDF page 41",`quote`:"ng emergency? 3. Examination of the isolating valve following the accident identified that the valve actuator had been defective, giving an impression that the valve was fully closed when it was not. Although there was a visual indicator located on the side of the actuator, this was not checked to confirm that the valve was closed prior to removal of the flange bolts. The actuator had previously been repaired. However, the c",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:dfc4450402c39f9e",`source`:"shipkg:fault:58d32c38d0ac",`target`:"shipkg:condition:32eb7154ffd7",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:dfc4450402c39f9e",`case_id`:"sd2013_05_missing_filter",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:7d233ab71e7cf2a1",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"21",`locator`:"PDF page 21",`quote`:"engine appeared to operate without any problems and the vessel undertook several voyages. However, after the engine failure, the duplex filter was found without a filter cartridge in the on-line filter chamber, and the engine lubricating oil system was contaminated. The contamination caused main bearing seizure, the rotation of bearing shells and the blockage of oil ways, and subsequent oil starvation and",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:e5efb78e70023527",`source`:"shipkg:fault:f2f9d4b10a0b",`target`:"shipkg:fault:d26785dacafa",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:e5efb78e70023527",`case_id`:"sd2016_08_generator_oil",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:fc2a120321a8291a",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"26",`locator`:"PDF page 26",`quote`:"ers in the control room acknowledged a low oil pressure alarm on one of the generators (Figure 1). On the CCTV they observed that oil from this generator was spraying on to the adjacent generator. While they were investigating the source of the leak oil that had been sprayed on the exhaust casing of the adjacent engine caught fire. Fortunately the crew were able to quickly identify and isolate",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:eba8a51a21135135",`source`:"shipkg:consequence:5c4ffe048cb7",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:35c015f940ee",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:eba8a51a21135135",`case_id`:"sd2016_05_cpp_backup",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:d11a787d7d142f9d",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"19",`locator`:"PDF page 19",`quote`:"a speed of about 7 knots and made heavy contact with the concrete berth (Figure 3). Almost immediately, bilge alarms, indicating water ingress into the vessel’s forward spaces, began to sound. The pitch on both propellers was brought to zero but the main engines were kept running. The bridge team made safety announcements to the passengers, alerted the port authorities and requested tug assistance. The",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:ecbb3b0b3b413ff1",`source`:"shipkg:consequence:2597a77f75b3",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:ec261d7a91d6",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:ecbb3b0b3b413ff1",`case_id`:"sd2016_09_cpp_response",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:085bb3fe51ea11cc",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"head. Despite placing the pitch control to full astern, the CPP did not respond in time and the vessel’s bow struck the quay. The bulbous bow was holed, but fortunately the damage was above the waterline (Figure 1). The subsequent investigation identified that the vessel had a history of sluggish astern response. However, the crew had accepted this as a ‘characteristic’ of the v",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:ed7bbec95e1a060d",`source`:"shipkg:fault:8969204ea965",`target`:"shipkg:fault:401ffd7724bc",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:ed7bbec95e1a060d",`case_id`:"sd2013_05_missing_filter",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:0fb80ad604213aad",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"21",`locator`:"PDF page 21",`quote`:"was contaminated. The contamination caused main bearing seizure, the rotation of bearing shells and the blockage of oil ways, and subsequent oil starvation and overheating to other bearings and to the pistons. The engine daily logs referred to oil filter cartridge changes only prior to the repair to the oil pumps. They also showed that the pressure reading on the differential pressure gauge for the",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:eefedd80cdcdbdd0",`source`:"shipkg:fault:216400f082cf",`target`:"shipkg:condition:1500802ee98b",`properties`:{`context_id`:"knowledge:shaft_torsional",`knowledge_layer`:"reference",`data_origin`:"manufacturer_guidance",`applicability`:"内燃机-发电机传动链一般机理；证据支持扭振导致失效风险及电气故障转矩冲击，但未建立某大型船主轴联轴器断裂的已证实事故链。",`coupling_domains`:"热-机-电",`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:eefedd80cdcdbdd0",`case_id`:"knowledge:shaft_torsional",`certainty`:"guidance",`certainty_zh`:"厂家一般机理/指导（须核对机型）",`evidence_id`:"ev:5cf0da035bedd926",`source_file`:"STAMFORD_AGN035_fault_protection.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.stamford-avk.com/sites/stamfordavk/files/AGNs/AGN-035_B-Overload-and-Fault-Protection.pdf",`page`:"5",`locator`:"PDF page 5",`quote`:"ic energy, identified by electrical engineers as inertia constant (H). Obviously, the coupling will be subjected to some level of transient peak torque demand during the time zero up to steady state condition and the 'typical' level considered by responsible mechanical engineers is 12 times rated torque. It should not be forgotten that the most arduous conditions for generating mechani",`props_json`:"{\"context_id\": \"knowledge:shaft_torsional\", \"knowledge_layer\": \"reference\", \"data_origin\": \"manufacturer_guidance\", \"applicability\": \"内燃机-发电机传动链一般机理；证据支持扭振导致失效风险及电气故障转矩冲击，但未建立某大型船主轴联轴器断裂的已证实事故链。\", \"coupling_domains\": \"热-机-电\", \"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:f1855f0334a94c6a",`source`:"shipkg:fault:dd6aba2caf5a",`target`:"shipkg:fault:562580f2bf5a",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:f1855f0334a94c6a",`case_id`:"pride_can_cpp_2014",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:b1d5068e305409aa",`source_file`:"MAIB_2015_22_Pride_of_Canterbury_CPP_hydraulic_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/563092daed915d566d000002/MAIBInvReport-22_2015.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"recommendations to prevent similar accidents occurring in the future. 2.2 CAUSE OF THE FIRE The fire was initiated following the spray of hydraulic oil, from a ruptured pipework joint in the starboard CPP system, onto the hot exhaust uptakes of the starboard main engines. The flanged joint ruptured because the CPP system became over- pressurised as a result of the back pressure valve (PSV3) becoming jammed in",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:f322909ce717c0d3",`source`:"shipkg:fault:d26785dacafa",`target`:"shipkg:fault:5bc176965c58",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:f322909ce717c0d3",`case_id`:"sd2016_08_generator_oil",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:a36fbb3ebb9e478c",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"26",`locator`:"PDF page 26",`quote`:"t unlagged following its overhaul during the recent dry dock (Figure 2b). This was hidden from view by the exhaust casing. • Fine oil spray ignited when it came into contact with the hot exhaust casing. Figure 1: Location of the generator with the loose oil plug and the adjacent generator with the uninsulated section of the exhaust piping",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:f34138c6e0145787",`source`:"shipkg:condition:be80fb98e414",`target`:"shipkg:fault:3dabb05debb4",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:f34138c6e0145787",`case_id`:"sd2013_02_control_air",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:c8e14e20edb4d870",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"15",`locator`:"PDF page 15",`quote`:", the need to isolate the main air cylinder when the reserve air cylinder was brought on line was not included. Consequently, the air pressure equalised at a level that was insufficient to re-engage the main engine’s clutches. Use check cards, but don’t let them stop you from thinking on your feet as well. In the engine room, the reserve compressed air cylinder was opened but there was still insufficient air pre",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:f45e0d237e7a3e57",`source`:"shipkg:fault:73da5c52ce5d",`target`:"shipkg:fault:c8fa85d36573",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:f45e0d237e7a3e57",`case_id`:"queen_mary2_hf_2010",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:90e6711ec8bfcb6f",`source_file`:"MAIB_2011_28_Queen_Mary_2_harmonic_filter_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/547c6fa6ed915d4c10000031/QM2Report.pdf",`page`:"13",`locator`:"PDF page 13",`quote`:"between the capacitor plates developed, which vaporised the dielectric medium causing the internal pressure to increase, until it caused the capacitor casing to rupture. Dielectric fluid vapour sprayed out, igniting and creating the likely conditions for an arc-flash to occur between the 1 1000 volt bus bars that fed power to the aft HF . A current imbalance detection system, which was the only",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:f6980acf5b577143",`source`:"shipkg:fault:ce4fe75e21d8",`target`:"shipkg:fault:4865d7c855d8",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:f6980acf5b577143",`case_id`:"sd2013_05_missing_filter",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:76540dbe3ce4a2dc",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"21",`locator`:"PDF page 21",`quote`:"engine was allowed to cool, the crankcase doors were removed; several crankshaft bearings were severely damaged (Figure 1) which prevented the engine from further operation. The vessel was towed to the nearest available port for further assessment. Subsequent investigation by the engine manufacturer determined that the damage included: the failure of all crankshaft main and crankpin bearings; the di",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:f822c98b6b4fd479",`source`:"shipkg:fault:aba0717d72a0",`target`:"shipkg:fault:8969204ea965",`properties`:{`name`:"导致",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:f822c98b6b4fd479",`case_id`:"sd2013_05_missing_filter",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:09940c64e5709cec",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"21",`locator`:"PDF page 21",`quote`:"n-line filter chamber, and the engine lubricating oil system was contaminated. The contamination caused main bearing seizure, the rotation of bearing shells and the blockage of oil ways, and subsequent oil starvation and overheating to other bearings and to the pistons. The engine daily logs referred to oil filter cartridge changes only prior to the repair to the oil pumps. They also showed that the pressure rea",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"导致\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": true}"}}] AS row MATCH (a:ShipKG {id:row.source}), (b:ShipKG {id:row.target}) MERGE (a)-[r:LEADS_TO {id:row.id}]->(b) SET r += row.properties RETURN count(r) AS processed_31 }
CALL () { UNWIND [{`id`:"edge:0454a6feb9b72426",`source`:"shipkg:action:4f7d85454ee0",`target`:"shipkg:condition:2ee58a9a8fad",`properties`:{`name`:"应对",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:0454a6feb9b72426",`case_id`:"spirit_of_discovery_pods_2023",`certainty`:"reported_action",`certainty_zh`:"报告行动/建议",`evidence_id`:"ev:5e9ac17b88449c65",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_06_Spirit_of_Discovery_propulsion_loss.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/loss-of-propulsion-in-heavy-weather-experienced-by-the-passenger-vessel-spirit-of-discovery-leading-to-over-100-injuries-and-one-fatality",`page`:"53",`locator`:"PDF page 53",`quote`:"s: ● Created an additional seakeeping and manoeuvring decision support poster and software tool for the Spirit Class vessels that includes propeller exposure in wave heights up to 10.5m.",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"应对\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:0b8703d6f397cc5d",`source`:"shipkg:action:32b0fb5f9f2b",`target`:"shipkg:fault:020786dc9fd0",`properties`:{`name`:"应对",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:0b8703d6f397cc5d",`case_id`:"sd2016_08_generator_oil",`certainty`:"derived_action",`certainty_zh`:"依据报告整理的检查建议",`evidence_id`:"ev:e9d71048b791d31a",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"26",`locator`:"PDF page 26",`quote`:"as a result of it being insufficiently tightened by shore staff during a recent dry dock. • A section of the adjacent generator’s exhaust piping had been left unlagged following its overhaul during the recent dry dock (Figure 2b). This was hidden from view by the exhaust casing. • Fine oil spray ignited when it came into contact with the hot exhaust casing. Figure 1: Location of the generator w",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"应对\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:0ebd147fa57af7fb",`source`:"shipkg:action:ee6e6a9b5e59",`target`:"shipkg:condition:37dbebf86df6",`properties`:{`name`:"应对",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:0ebd147fa57af7fb",`case_id`:"pride_can_cpp_2014",`certainty`:"reported_action",`certainty_zh`:"报告行动/建议",`evidence_id`:"ev:10c92776735ce916",`source_file`:"MAIB_2015_22_Pride_of_Canterbury_CPP_hydraulic_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/563092daed915d566d000002/MAIBInvReport-22_2015.pdf",`page`:"35",`locator`:"PDF page 35",`quote`:"-10 bar. For all ships in its fleet: • Checked that all CPP system flanges meet standards recommended by manufacturers. • Checked all CPP system flanges are fitted with protective coverings. • Examined hi-fog systems to ensure that the system provides full coverage of all high-risk machinery. 4.2 WARTSILA Wartsila has issued a Technical Bulletin (Annex C) instructing operators to replace back pressure valves at leas",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"应对\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:220787ea1bcab3dd",`source`:"shipkg:action:8076c8558f20",`target`:"shipkg:condition:be80fb98e414",`properties`:{`name`:"应对",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:220787ea1bcab3dd",`case_id`:"sd2013_02_control_air",`certainty`:"derived_action",`certainty_zh`:"依据报告整理的检查建议",`evidence_id`:"ev:a9d1c3390e834930",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"15",`locator`:"PDF page 15",`quote`:"g run. 3. Check cards can be a useful aid to fault diagnosis and rectification when things get hectic. However, in this case, the need to isolate the main air cylinder when the reserve air cylinder was brought on line was not included. Consequently, the air pressure equalised at a level that was insufficient to re-engage the main engine’s clutches. Use check cards, but don’t let them stop you f",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"应对\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:22a9360b80506f14",`source`:"shipkg:action:f1e90ec0f59b",`target`:"shipkg:condition:133adfa97595",`properties`:{`name`:"应对",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:22a9360b80506f14",`case_id`:"sd2016_22_cooling_pipe",`certainty`:"reported_action",`certainty_zh`:"报告行动/建议",`evidence_id`:"ev:6d6d03a1efd0d418",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"60",`locator`:"PDF page 60",`quote`:"ated as designed, with no one present in the wheelhouse to either see or hear it, it was not detected in time to save the vessel. Never leave the wheelhouse unmanned when underway; doing so is in contravention of the COLREGs and puts you and your vessel at risk. 2. The crew were instructed to enter the accommodation to collect lifejackets in preparation for abandoning the vessel, but instead took personal",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"应对\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:289600202fa8e15f",`source`:"shipkg:action:41ba1c42b3a5",`target`:"shipkg:fault:2c6822dc16f4",`properties`:{`context_id`:"knowledge:liner_scuffing",`knowledge_layer`:"reference",`data_origin`:"manufacturer_guidance",`applicability`:"MAN B&W两冲程柴油机缸套/活塞环；2016通函用于机理，润滑油选择须查2023通函及本机手册。不能把活塞咬死一概等同于已证实拉缸。",`coupling_domains`:"热-机",`name`:"应对",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:289600202fa8e15f",`case_id`:"knowledge:liner_scuffing",`certainty`:"guidance",`certainty_zh`:"厂家一般机理/指导（须核对机型）",`evidence_id`:"ev:3a5709969bdeb786",`source_file`:"MAN_SL2016_633_piston_rings_scuffing.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.man-es.com/docs/default-source/service-letters/sl2016-633.pdf",`page`:"2",`locator`:"PDF page 2",`quote`:"rmet will recover after the incident, provided the situ - ation is timely discovered and action is taken to ensure that it stops (increased lubrication and reduced load). However, the liner will need machining at the next overhaul to ensure proper running-in of the new rings. Fig. 1: The CPR ring pack containing 3 high rings with cermet-coating on all rings for 70 bore and above (SL2016-611/JAP)",`props_json`:"{\"context_id\": \"knowledge:liner_scuffing\", \"knowledge_layer\": \"reference\", \"data_origin\": \"manufacturer_guidance\", \"applicability\": \"MAN B&W两冲程柴油机缸套/活塞环；2016通函用于机理，润滑油选择须查2023通函及本机手册。不能把活塞咬死一概等同于已证实拉缸。\", \"coupling_domains\": \"热-机\", \"name\": \"应对\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:2eb61f2c2d236b6f",`source`:"shipkg:action:feb3b27e10a6",`target`:"shipkg:condition:5b302d0da57d",`properties`:{`context_id`:"knowledge:generator_bearing_wear",`knowledge_layer`:"reference",`data_origin`:"manufacturer_guidance",`applicability`:"有滚动轴承的发电机或轴带发电机构型；滚动轴承与主机滑动轴瓦的失效机理不得混用。",`coupling_domains`:"热-机-电",`name`:"应对",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:2eb61f2c2d236b6f",`case_id`:"knowledge:generator_bearing_wear",`certainty`:"guidance",`certainty_zh`:"厂家一般机理/指导（须核对机型）",`evidence_id`:"ev:e409b2a83322445c",`source_file`:"STAMFORD_AGN039_marine_shaft_generators.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.stamford-avk.com/sites/stamfordavk/files/AGNs/AGN-039_C-Marine-Shaft-Generators.pdf",`page`:"2",`locator`:"PDF page 2",`quote`:"at many different speeds and for much of this time unexcited, the ships maintenance schedule should include clear guidance about bearing regreasing instructions. It is recommended that the shaft generator is fitted with re- greasable bearings, which should be specified at time of order. When the shaft generator is aligned with the gearbox drive shaft, the ships design engineer must take",`props_json`:"{\"context_id\": \"knowledge:generator_bearing_wear\", \"knowledge_layer\": \"reference\", \"data_origin\": \"manufacturer_guidance\", \"applicability\": \"有滚动轴承的发电机或轴带发电机构型；滚动轴承与主机滑动轴瓦的失效机理不得混用。\", \"coupling_domains\": \"热-机-电\", \"name\": \"应对\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:32e8d02a6badd5da",`source`:"shipkg:action:13d66975b925",`target`:"shipkg:condition:a40db02fd2fa",`properties`:{`name`:"应对",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:32e8d02a6badd5da",`case_id`:"sd2016_09_cpp_response",`certainty`:"reported_action",`certainty_zh`:"报告行动/建议",`evidence_id`:"ev:9663fdde50e013ce",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"your disposal. The function of back-up controls should be well understood and tested. They can help prevent serious accidents. 2. Regular drills simulating propulsion system failure and recovery should be carried out. These drills will give operators confidence in the back-up systems and help them react effectively in an emergency. 3. Frequent engine response tests should be completed, both ahead and astern. This is part",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"应对\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:3369e57583767edd",`source`:"shipkg:action:99ddd7acf595",`target`:"shipkg:fault:f6eb639558ed",`properties`:{`context_id`:"knowledge:shaft_torsional",`knowledge_layer`:"reference",`data_origin`:"manufacturer_guidance",`applicability`:"内燃机-发电机传动链一般机理；证据支持扭振导致失效风险及电气故障转矩冲击，但未建立某大型船主轴联轴器断裂的已证实事故链。",`coupling_domains`:"热-机-电",`name`:"应对",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:3369e57583767edd",`case_id`:"knowledge:shaft_torsional",`certainty`:"guidance",`certainty_zh`:"厂家一般机理/指导（须核对机型）",`evidence_id`:"ev:40803a19c50fb460",`source_file`:"STAMFORD_AGN235_torsional_analysis.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.stamford-avk.com/sites/stamfordavk/files/AGNs/AGN-235_A-Generating-Set-Assembly-Torsional-Vibration-Analysis.pdf",`page`:"7",`locator`:"PDF page 7",`quote`:"cluding geometry, thermal capacity and torque transmission capacity. Pass / Fail criteria: • Vibratory torque at the coupling for engine normal and misfire scenarios. • Heat load in the coupling for engine normal and misfire scenarios. TVA Calculations and Results Analysis Hand calculations and Software tools such as Matlab, FEA, Dedicated TVA software, etc., are used to assess the system, co",`props_json`:"{\"context_id\": \"knowledge:shaft_torsional\", \"knowledge_layer\": \"reference\", \"data_origin\": \"manufacturer_guidance\", \"applicability\": \"内燃机-发电机传动链一般机理；证据支持扭振导致失效风险及电气故障转矩冲击，但未建立某大型船主轴联轴器断裂的已证实事故链。\", \"coupling_domains\": \"热-机-电\", \"name\": \"应对\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:398a63bbaabc8093",`source`:"shipkg:action:2c60146dc1a8",`target`:"shipkg:fault:f078b5a27275",`properties`:{`name`:"应对",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:398a63bbaabc8093",`case_id`:"sd2016_05_cpp_backup",`certainty`:"reported_action",`certainty_zh`:"报告行动/建议",`evidence_id`:"ev:74d39332305ecab7",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"21",`locator`:"PDF page 21",`quote`:"and rectified the problem. Engineers are put on standby in control rooms during manoeuvring operations for a reason; not least to keep the bridge team informed of the status of all safety-critical systems. 4. The vessel’s crew were all experienced and many of them had spent most of their career operating similar types of vessels with the same company. However, the bridge and engineering teams did not",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"应对\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:3ce6740666ac6746",`source`:"shipkg:action:b39684450af7",`target`:"shipkg:condition:7fb8a1a33328",`properties`:{`name`:"应对",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:3ce6740666ac6746",`case_id`:"spirit_of_discovery_pods_2023",`certainty`:"reported_action",`certainty_zh`:"报告行动/建议",`evidence_id`:"ev:808bd8d1dd9e51f9",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_06_Spirit_of_Discovery_propulsion_loss.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/loss-of-propulsion-in-heavy-weather-experienced-by-the-passenger-vessel-spirit-of-discovery-leading-to-over-100-injuries-and-one-fatality",`page`:"53",`locator`:"PDF page 53",`quote`:"e vessel’s heading. ● Increased the SISHIp eSiPODs overspeed activation point following a mechanical evaluation of the systems. ● Improved the position of the SISHIp eSiPODs bilge sensor arrangements. Meyer Werft GmbH has: ● Created an additional seakeeping and manoeuvring decision support poster and software tool for the Spirit Class vessels that includes propeller exposure in wave heights up to 10.5m.",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"应对\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:409d388d1040602f",`source`:"shipkg:action:b6c45b2c3ead",`target`:"shipkg:fault:1e5a23a200ad",`properties`:{`name`:"应对",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:409d388d1040602f",`case_id`:"pride_can_cpp_2014",`certainty`:"reported_action",`certainty_zh`:"报告行动/建议",`evidence_id`:"ev:51d27e03785728b6",`source_file`:"MAIB_2015_22_Pride_of_Canterbury_CPP_hydraulic_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/563092daed915d566d000002/MAIBInvReport-22_2015.pdf",`page`:"35",`locator`:"PDF page 35",`quote`:"ull coverage of all high-risk machinery. 4.2 WARTSILA Wartsila has issued a Technical Bulletin (Annex C) instructing operators to replace back pressure valves at least every 15 years.",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"应对\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:44e25149b87dbc84",`source`:"shipkg:action:642ddc0bd6c5",`target`:"shipkg:cause:29f8307f5eed",`properties`:{`name`:"应对",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:44e25149b87dbc84",`case_id`:"finlandia_seaways_me_2018",`certainty`:"derived_action",`certainty_zh`:"依据报告整理的检查建议",`evidence_id`:"ev:c4dfa47c81f2ebb5",`source_file`:"MAIB_2021_02_Finlandia_Seaways_connecting_rod_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/engine-failure-and-subsequent-fire-on-ro-ro-cargo-vessel-finlandia-seaways-with-1-person-injured",`page`:"56",`locator`:"PDF page 56",`quote`:"48 recommended procedures for overhauling the connecting rod small ends had not been followed, and the small ends had been damaged during the piston pin bush removal and fitting process. The extent of the damage was clearly visible to the naked eye but was either not identified during the engine/component overhauls or was",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"应对\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:50efcee7c8a5c34f",`source`:"shipkg:action:4e32ee36eba1",`target`:"shipkg:condition:8012db626950",`properties`:{`name`:"应对",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:50efcee7c8a5c34f",`case_id`:"stena_europe_fuel_2023",`certainty`:"reported_action",`certainty_zh`:"报告行动/建议",`evidence_id`:"ev:a7a96386e16a8f7e",`source_file`:"MAIB_2024_20_Stena_Europe_fuel_spray_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6756db0ba63e1781efb87793/2024-20-StenaEurope.pdf",`page`:"31",`locator`:"PDF page 31",`quote`:"porate four-screw flanges. ● Repaired or replaced the shielding and lagging around the external fuel systems and hot surfaces and fitted anti-splashing tape to all joints on the low-pressure fuel systems on all of Stena Europe’s operational engines. ● On 7 June 2023, engaged a third-party contractor to undertake a SOLAS compliance verification thermographic survey following ME3’s return to service",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"应对\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:53eaab34d6d20632",`source`:"shipkg:action:94c3bd7ec403",`target`:"shipkg:fault:b6b2c9f08149",`properties`:{`name`:"应对",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:53eaab34d6d20632",`case_id`:"sd2013_02_control_air",`certainty`:"reported_action",`certainty_zh`:"报告行动/建议",`evidence_id`:"ev:0f3029c8ff2b1f75",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"15",`locator`:"PDF page 15",`quote`:"unications between the engine room department and the bridge are imprecise or vague. Such difficulties can usually be overcome by conducting realistic machinery drills. Although such drills are often difficult to programme, they are a very good investment which, if conducted properly, will probably save time and money in the long run. 3. Check cards can be a useful aid to fault diagnosis and re",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"应对\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:553116897a245486",`source`:"shipkg:action:b1b278b9bbdd",`target`:"shipkg:fault:d005e46c6652",`properties`:{`name`:"应对",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:553116897a245486",`case_id`:"spirit_of_discovery_pods_2023",`certainty`:"reported_action",`certainty_zh`:"报告行动/建议",`evidence_id`:"ev:c7e7236b07b0d8d2",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_06_Spirit_of_Discovery_propulsion_loss.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/loss-of-propulsion-in-heavy-weather-experienced-by-the-passenger-vessel-spirit-of-discovery-leading-to-over-100-injuries-and-one-fatality",`page`:"53",`locator`:"PDF page 53",`quote`:"obal GmbH & Co. KG has: ● Updated the SISHIp eSiPods software and corrected the operators’ manual. ● Updated the PCS to include a revised WLS sequence activation that allows the crew to intervene and prevent the SISHIp eSiPODs parking at 90° to the vessel’s heading. ● Increased the SISHIp eSiPODs overspeed activation point following a mechanical evaluation of the systems. ● Improved the position of the SISHIp eSiPODs bilg",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"应对\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:55618ad87e7f249f",`source`:"shipkg:action:e96de4e3b16c",`target`:"shipkg:condition:ef7365f4e337",`properties`:{`context_id`:"knowledge:bearing_seizure",`knowledge_layer`:"reference",`data_origin`:"manufacturer_guidance",`applicability`:"主机滑动轴承；烧瓦是检索用的工程统称，不能把全部轴瓦疲劳、瓦片转位或轴承失效直接标成已证实烧瓦。",`coupling_domains`:"热-机",`name`:"应对",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:55618ad87e7f249f",`case_id`:"knowledge:bearing_seizure",`certainty`:"guidance",`certainty_zh`:"厂家一般机理/指导（须核对机型）",`evidence_id`:"ev:b4983f0aef368bd8",`source_file`:"MAN_SL2013_569_bearing_wear_monitoring.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.man-es.com/docs/default-source/service-letters/sl2013-569.pdf",`page`:"2",`locator`:"PDF page 2",`quote`:"are capable of early detection of rapidly developing damage. Note that this update introduces connection of the BWM system to the automatic slow-down/load reduction func - tion of the main engine safety system. Questions regarding this service letter can be directed to our Operation department in Copenhagen (email: leo@mandieselturbo.com). -10 0 10 Minutes after damage initiation Damage init",`props_json`:"{\"context_id\": \"knowledge:bearing_seizure\", \"knowledge_layer\": \"reference\", \"data_origin\": \"manufacturer_guidance\", \"applicability\": \"主机滑动轴承；烧瓦是检索用的工程统称，不能把全部轴瓦疲劳、瓦片转位或轴承失效直接标成已证实烧瓦。\", \"coupling_domains\": \"热-机\", \"name\": \"应对\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:5c7193e49d3dd98f",`source`:"shipkg:action:1b28685e1f2a",`target`:"shipkg:condition:d96dbed6a05c",`properties`:{`name`:"应对",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:5c7193e49d3dd98f",`case_id`:"sd2013_12_oily_rag",`certainty`:"reported_action",`certainty_zh`:"报告行动/建议",`evidence_id`:"ev:59fee15f97a89579",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"42",`locator`:"PDF page 42",`quote`:"at was dealt with quickly and safely. However, it does serve to highlight the importance of good housekeeping - in this case, the correct disposal of contaminated waste. Although the rag was ignited by the hot exhaust manifold, oil-soaked waste is also susceptible to self-heating and spontaneous combustion. 1. Distraction can cause carelessness in the proper disposal of waste. Discarded oily mat",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"应对\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:66cbe293a1e6d6cb",`source`:"shipkg:action:984af3c3d6c8",`target`:"shipkg:condition:6fa538170906",`properties`:{`name`:"应对",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:66cbe293a1e6d6cb",`case_id`:"kommandor_susan_dg1_2025",`certainty`:"reported_action",`certainty_zh`:"报告行动/建议",`evidence_id`:"ev:1b6ee0d38c733128",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_10_Kommandor_Susan_generator_bearing_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/catastrophic-engine-failure-and-subsequent-fire-on-board-the-site-investigation-vessel-kommandor-susan",`page`:"6",`locator`:"PDF page 6",`quote`:"edules are only applicable for these parts. Non-Caterpillar parts used in the engine tent to have a shorter service life. [sic] • Check the use of non-Caterpillar bearings in the other engines on the vessel. If so, plan a early change of the main and connecting rod bearings. [sic] Parts approval process The approval process for a ship’s engine parts involved several steps to ensure compliance with safety and performanc",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"应对\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:67361dcd9843664b",`source`:"shipkg:action:b12de133c87b",`target`:"shipkg:condition:0abf74811b34",`properties`:{`context_id`:"knowledge:cooling_cavitation",`knowledge_layer`:"reference",`data_origin`:"manufacturer_guidance",`applicability`:"扫气空气冷却器水侧；该证据描述低流量局部沸腾及管路汽蚀，不等同于已证明所有冷却泵汽蚀由此引起。",`coupling_domains`:"热-机",`name`:"应对",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:67361dcd9843664b",`case_id`:"knowledge:cooling_cavitation",`certainty`:"guidance",`certainty_zh`:"厂家一般机理/指导（须核对机型）",`evidence_id`:"ev:a4b9b5883574eb17",`source_file`:"MAN_main_engine_auxiliary_efficiency.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.man-es.com/docs/default-source/document-sync/efficiency-improvements-main-engine-auxiliary-systems-eng.pdf",`page`:"11",`locator`:"PDF page 11",`quote`:"exceeded, and the engine may thereby not fulfil the Tier II NO X requirements. On this basis, a system has to be established that maintains a constant cooling water flow to the scavenge air cooler and, at the same time, makes it possible to reduce the flow to the LO and jacket water coolers, see Fig. 13. The total flow versus engine load can be obtained by taking the approach that the water flow",`props_json`:"{\"context_id\": \"knowledge:cooling_cavitation\", \"knowledge_layer\": \"reference\", \"data_origin\": \"manufacturer_guidance\", \"applicability\": \"扫气空气冷却器水侧；该证据描述低流量局部沸腾及管路汽蚀，不等同于已证明所有冷却泵汽蚀由此引起。\", \"coupling_domains\": \"热-机\", \"name\": \"应对\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:6e3d474483542162",`source`:"shipkg:action:ddf392fcaa6c",`target`:"shipkg:condition:ff505693e52e",`properties`:{`name`:"应对",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:6e3d474483542162",`case_id`:"pride_can_cpp_2014",`certainty`:"reported_action",`certainty_zh`:"报告行动/建议",`evidence_id`:"ev:53344f366942bb5f",`source_file`:"MAIB_2015_22_Pride_of_Canterbury_CPP_hydraulic_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/563092daed915d566d000002/MAIBInvReport-22_2015.pdf",`page`:"35",`locator`:"PDF page 35",`quote`:"ented a maintenance programme in which at least PSV1, PSV3 and NRV6 are disabled and their function checked once every 5 years. • Added a full flow check-valve, with an opening pressure of 10-12 bar, in the return oil circuit by-passing PSV3, the Oil Cooler and NRV6. Also, an additional alarm signal was to be fitted in the control system to give an alarm at 9-10 bar. For all ships in it",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"应对\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:6e568339ac75aadd",`source`:"shipkg:action:ac5834891dd6",`target`:"shipkg:fault:58d32c38d0ac",`properties`:{`name`:"应对",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:6e568339ac75aadd",`case_id`:"sd2013_05_missing_filter",`certainty`:"reported_action",`certainty_zh`:"报告行动/建议",`evidence_id`:"ev:79bf750178d19ebb",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"23",`locator`:"PDF page 23",`quote`:"times; however it is imperative that ships’ staff maintain sufficient oversight of work undertaken by contractors to ensure that critical steps are not overlooked. 2. One of the advantages of completing daily logs is the ability to assess trends in the operating machinery. A consistently low reading on the filter differential oil pressure gauge, and a comparison with previous operating hou",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"应对\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:6feb08674326e525",`source`:"shipkg:action:6e0e5173ee8f",`target`:"shipkg:fault:fce2f501a499",`properties`:{`name`:"应对",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:6feb08674326e525",`case_id`:"sd2016_09_cpp_response",`certainty`:"reported_action",`certainty_zh`:"报告行动/建议",`evidence_id`:"ev:e53de2fc1df0bd99",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"e. The CPP control panel on the bridge had a back-up control button (Figure 2) for use in an emergency. Activation of this button bypassed the feedback control system, giving direct control of pitch to the pitch control lever. However, the master was not familiar with its use, and therefore lost the opportunity to bring the vessel back under control before it struck the quay. It was also revea",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"应对\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:708d20013395c142",`source`:"shipkg:action:acaa49cd0860",`target`:"shipkg:condition:37396a158a92",`properties`:{`context_id`:"knowledge:shaft_generator_alignment",`knowledge_layer`:"reference",`data_origin`:"manufacturer_guidance",`applicability`:"通过齿轮箱及联轴器驱动的轴带发电机；不能推广到所有同轴无附加轴承的构型。",`coupling_domains`:"热-机-电",`name`:"应对",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:708d20013395c142",`case_id`:"knowledge:shaft_generator_alignment",`certainty`:"guidance",`certainty_zh`:"厂家一般机理/指导（须核对机型）",`evidence_id`:"ev:2bfc3c9a35fee950",`source_file`:"STAMFORD_AGN039_marine_shaft_generators.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.stamford-avk.com/sites/stamfordavk/files/AGNs/AGN-039_C-Marine-Shaft-Generators.pdf",`page`:"2",`locator`:"PDF page 2",`quote`:"and will ensure that the coupling between gearbox and the shaft generator is a high quality, designed for purpose unit, which can absorb misalignment, and also torsional vibrations to help the generator remain reliable. POWER TAKE OUT (PTO) / POWER TAKE IN (PTI) / POWER TAKE HOME (PTH) Marine shaft generators are often required to operate in a multi-function role. They could o",`props_json`:"{\"context_id\": \"knowledge:shaft_generator_alignment\", \"knowledge_layer\": \"reference\", \"data_origin\": \"manufacturer_guidance\", \"applicability\": \"通过齿轮箱及联轴器驱动的轴带发电机；不能推广到所有同轴无附加轴承的构型。\", \"coupling_domains\": \"热-机-电\", \"name\": \"应对\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:7a08f11e0d0dd1e5",`source`:"shipkg:action:1487f0a35cfe",`target`:"shipkg:condition:06d3b90c2d7b",`properties`:{`context_id`:"knowledge:winding_insulation",`knowledge_layer`:"reference",`data_origin`:"manufacturer_guidance",`applicability`:"STAMFORD/AvK发电机；检测与干燥作业须停电隔离，由合格人员依本机手册执行，本文不提供通用阈值或操作命令。",`coupling_domains`:"热-电",`name`:"应对",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:7a08f11e0d0dd1e5",`case_id`:"knowledge:winding_insulation",`certainty`:"guidance",`certainty_zh`:"厂家一般机理/指导（须核对机型）",`evidence_id`:"ev:245f0a658820c70a",`source_file`:"STAMFORD_AGN040_winding_insulation.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.stamford-avk.com/sites/stamfordavk/files/AGNs/AGN-040_E-Winding-Insulation-System.pdf",`page`:"6",`locator`:"PDF page 6",`quote`:"ate storage conditions. Any temporarily reduced IR values can be restored to expected values by following the following explained drying out procedures. Then further operation on load will complete a thorough heating of the winding assemblies and will completely dry-off the IR reducing moisture. The following is offered as helpful guidance, but should be read in conjunction with",`props_json`:"{\"context_id\": \"knowledge:winding_insulation\", \"knowledge_layer\": \"reference\", \"data_origin\": \"manufacturer_guidance\", \"applicability\": \"STAMFORD/AvK发电机；检测与干燥作业须停电隔离，由合格人员依本机手册执行，本文不提供通用阈值或操作命令。\", \"coupling_domains\": \"热-电\", \"name\": \"应对\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:85b1eb68a212e8fc",`source`:"shipkg:action:fa72ffe2b82b",`target`:"shipkg:fault:d26785dacafa",`properties`:{`name`:"应对",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:85b1eb68a212e8fc",`case_id`:"sd2016_08_generator_oil",`certainty`:"reported_action",`certainty_zh`:"报告行动/建议",`evidence_id`:"ev:05847d350f09dacc",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"26",`locator`:"PDF page 26",`quote`:"eak oil that had been sprayed on the exhaust casing of the adjacent engine caught fire. Fortunately the crew were able to quickly identify and isolate the source of the leak and extinguish the fire before it was able to spread. No one was hurt in the incident. Subsequent investigation revealed that: • The oil had come from a loose plug on the generator’s engine-mounted lubricating oil pump (Figure 2a",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"应对\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:91f42e33606379da",`source`:"shipkg:action:9b0a2bc57f23",`target`:"shipkg:fault:655f841ec7d0",`properties`:{`context_id`:"knowledge:damper_failure",`knowledge_layer`:"reference",`data_origin`:"manufacturer_guidance",`applicability`:"MAN L16/24、L21/31、L27/38等通函列明机型；不得推广其维护周期到其它机型。",`coupling_domains`:"热-机",`name`:"应对",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:91f42e33606379da",`case_id`:"knowledge:damper_failure",`certainty`:"guidance",`certainty_zh`:"厂家一般机理/指导（须核对机型）",`evidence_id`:"ev:222a60daefcc64e4",`source_file`:"MAN_SL2017_654_torsional_damper.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.man-es.com/docs/default-source/service-letters/sl2017-654.pdf",`page`:"1",`locator`:"PDF page 1",`quote`:"l noise from the torsional vibration damper or any change in the vibra- tion behavior of the complete GenSet. In such a case, the complete torsional vibration damper must be replaced. For questions or comments please contact operation dept. Holeby: leo7@mandieselturbo.com Yours faithfully Crankshaft Torsional Vibration Damper SL2017-654/JNN November 2017 Concerns Owners and operators of MAN four-stroke diesel",`props_json`:"{\"context_id\": \"knowledge:damper_failure\", \"knowledge_layer\": \"reference\", \"data_origin\": \"manufacturer_guidance\", \"applicability\": \"MAN L16/24、L21/31、L27/38等通函列明机型；不得推广其维护周期到其它机型。\", \"coupling_domains\": \"热-机\", \"name\": \"应对\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:928fdefd1642c5c5",`source`:"shipkg:action:752d3ce3e403",`target`:"shipkg:cause:cf3cb78b47cf",`properties`:{`name`:"应对",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:928fdefd1642c5c5",`case_id`:"wight_sky_me_2017",`certainty`:"reported_action",`certainty_zh`:"报告行动/建议",`evidence_id`:"ev:c2745665875d9964",`source_file`:"MAIB_2018_14_Wight_Sky_engine_bearing_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5b5217c7ed915d0b81e003df/MAIBInvReport14_2018.pdf",`page`:"14",`locator`:"PDF page 14",`quote`:"the shells of main bearing 5 turned, the lubrication supply to big end bearing 4 was blocked, resulting in destructive failure. • Rebuilding the engine in a clean and controlled environment and transferring it complete into the engine room would have reduced the likelihood of debris ingress. • The engine was not fitted with a wear detector, so there was no means of receiving a warning before the engine failed. • The",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"应对\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:97af6394e4396fab",`source`:"shipkg:action:2cd7b4f4bdb0",`target`:"shipkg:cause:9b5341f924b9",`properties`:{`context_id`:"knowledge:coupling_failure",`knowledge_layer`:"reference",`data_origin`:"field_report",`applicability`:"实际证据是Hebrides的CPP执行器小型爪式联轴器，不是主推进轴联轴器断裂；主轴断裂根因不可由此推断。",`coupling_domains`:"机-电",`name`:"应对",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:97af6394e4396fab",`case_id`:"knowledge:coupling_failure",`certainty`:"reported_action",`certainty_zh`:"报告行动/建议",`evidence_id`:"ev:de520bd4ed098df8",`source_file`:"MAIB_2017_20_Hebrides_CPP_coupling.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/59b7ab1c40f0b61231e71a54/MAIBInvReport20_2017.pdf",`page`:"36",`locator`:"PDF page 36",`quote`:"sion control systems regarding the inspection and integrity of the jaw coupling within the linear servomotor actuator. ● Issued a service procedure for the linear servomotor based on OEM requirements. CalMac Ferries Ltd h as: ● Issued a technical bulletin to its major vessels that requires all propulsion controls, including emergency controls, at all stations are tested regularly. ● Conducted its own",`props_json`:"{\"context_id\": \"knowledge:coupling_failure\", \"knowledge_layer\": \"reference\", \"data_origin\": \"field_report\", \"applicability\": \"实际证据是Hebrides的CPP执行器小型爪式联轴器，不是主推进轴联轴器断裂；主轴断裂根因不可由此推断。\", \"coupling_domains\": \"机-电\", \"name\": \"应对\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:9feaba867481f006",`source`:"shipkg:action:4578c5b2c727",`target`:"shipkg:condition:ef4f2a093081",`properties`:{`name`:"应对",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:9feaba867481f006",`case_id`:"stena_europe_fuel_2023",`certainty`:"reported_action",`certainty_zh`:"报告行动/建议",`evidence_id`:"ev:1ba466d574203869",`source_file`:"MAIB_2024_20_Stena_Europe_fuel_spray_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6756db0ba63e1781efb87793/2024-20-StenaEurope.pdf",`page`:"31",`locator`:"PDF page 31",`quote`:"s for the purpose of regular hot spot monitoring and detection in machinery spaces. ● Modified the external fuel piping on ME3 to incorporate four-screw flanges. ● Repaired or replaced the shielding and lagging around the external fuel systems and hot surfaces and fitted anti-splashing tape to all joints on the low-pressure fuel systems on all of Stena Europe’s operational engines. ● On",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"应对\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:a24644858449eba9",`source`:"shipkg:action:9444999ad903",`target`:"shipkg:condition:3516d66bca42",`properties`:{`context_id`:"knowledge:bearing_electrical_erosion",`knowledge_layer`:"reference",`data_origin`:"manufacturer_guidance",`applicability`:"具有闭合轴电流路径的旋转电机；轴承绝缘和接地刷方案按厂家/机型确定，不能假定全部STAMFORD机型都需要绝缘轴承。",`coupling_domains`:"电-机",`name`:"应对",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:a24644858449eba9",`case_id`:"knowledge:bearing_electrical_erosion",`certainty`:"guidance",`certainty_zh`:"厂家一般机理/指导（须核对机型）",`evidence_id`:"ev:8552d0e3f49eb3e2",`source_file`:"STAMFORD_AGN033_bearing_currents.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.stamford-avk.com/sites/stamfordavk/files/AGNs/AGN-033_C-Shaft-Bearing-Currents.pdf",`page`:"3",`locator`:"PDF page 3",`quote`:"life. AvK Alternators. To overcome potential issues caused by induced shaft currents, AvK alternators utilise a combination of a rotor earthing brush and insulated bearings. The selection of these options are application and customer specific and will be determined during alternator specification negotiations. All AvK alternators for marine applications that are fitted with sleeve bearings have the",`props_json`:"{\"context_id\": \"knowledge:bearing_electrical_erosion\", \"knowledge_layer\": \"reference\", \"data_origin\": \"manufacturer_guidance\", \"applicability\": \"具有闭合轴电流路径的旋转电机；轴承绝缘和接地刷方案按厂家/机型确定，不能假定全部STAMFORD机型都需要绝缘轴承。\", \"coupling_domains\": \"电-机\", \"name\": \"应对\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:a27bb92457b32e1d",`source`:"shipkg:action:6234e02eed7e",`target`:"shipkg:cause:c5d7e29b6c94",`properties`:{`context_id`:"knowledge:coolant_blockage",`knowledge_layer`:"reference",`data_origin`:"manufacturer_guidance",`applicability`:"MAN四冲程柴油机闭式淡水冷却；水质要求与添加剂须按具体机型手册确认。",`coupling_domains`:"热-机",`name`:"应对",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:a27bb92457b32e1d",`case_id`:"knowledge:coolant_blockage",`certainty`:"guidance",`certainty_zh`:"厂家一般机理/指导（须核对机型）",`evidence_id`:"ev:63871ec3ef77a2d6",`source_file`:"MAN_SL2016_623_cooling_water.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.man-es.com/docs/default-source/service-letters/sl2016-623.pdf",`page`:"3",`locator`:"PDF page 3",`quote`:"which required topping up with untreated water. The MAN Diesel & Turbo recommendations are therefore once every 2 to 6 months to send a coolant sample to an in - dependent laboratory, the engine manufacturer or PrimeServ Lab. How often the coolant samples should be sent to the laboratory depends on the test result received from the labo - ratory. If the test results vary a lot over t",`props_json`:"{\"context_id\": \"knowledge:coolant_blockage\", \"knowledge_layer\": \"reference\", \"data_origin\": \"manufacturer_guidance\", \"applicability\": \"MAN四冲程柴油机闭式淡水冷却；水质要求与添加剂须按具体机型手册确认。\", \"coupling_domains\": \"热-机\", \"name\": \"应对\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:ae2eb26a66f96065",`source`:"shipkg:action:07654f6d6a9b",`target`:"shipkg:consequence:81fff36694d8",`properties`:{`name`:"应对",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:ae2eb26a66f96065",`case_id`:"sd2016_14_sea_valve",`certainty`:"derived_action",`certainty_zh`:"依据报告整理的检查建议",`evidence_id`:"ev:0e5aaddc8a474eee",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"41",`locator`:"PDF page 41",`quote`:"ve not holding. 2. The crew’s response to the flooding was ineffective because they were not prepared for the emergency. They had never carried out an engine room flooding drill, and half of them had never carried out any form of emergency drill since joining the vessel. Are you prepared for a flooding emergency? 3. Examination of the isolating valve following the accident identified that the valve actua",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"应对\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:b12fa35e7b3df7cf",`source`:"shipkg:action:130ca8701fd4",`target`:"shipkg:condition:9b800c18cd13",`properties`:{`context_id`:"knowledge:liner_scuffing",`knowledge_layer`:"reference",`data_origin`:"manufacturer_guidance",`applicability`:"MAN B&W两冲程柴油机缸套/活塞环；2016通函用于机理，润滑油选择须查2023通函及本机手册。不能把活塞咬死一概等同于已证实拉缸。",`coupling_domains`:"热-机",`name`:"应对",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:b12fa35e7b3df7cf",`case_id`:"knowledge:liner_scuffing",`certainty`:"guidance",`certainty_zh`:"厂家一般机理/指导（须核对机型）",`evidence_id`:"ev:76ff74dc44b9f086",`source_file`:"MAN_SL2023_737_cylinder_lubrication.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.man-es.com/docs/default-source/service-letters/sl2023-737.pdf",`page`:"1",`locator`:"PDF page 1",`quote`:"The lowered fuel sulphur content and the resulting lowering of the cylinder oil feed rate also stresses the importance of always maintaining an adequate oil film. For engines burning high-sulphur fuel, this Service Letter and SL2023-738/IKCA replace SL2014-587. For MC and MC-C engines with Alpha Lubricator Mk. 1 systems, SL2014-587, enclosure 4 should be used. High-performing engines call",`props_json`:"{\"context_id\": \"knowledge:liner_scuffing\", \"knowledge_layer\": \"reference\", \"data_origin\": \"manufacturer_guidance\", \"applicability\": \"MAN B&W两冲程柴油机缸套/活塞环；2016通函用于机理，润滑油选择须查2023通函及本机手册。不能把活塞咬死一概等同于已证实拉缸。\", \"coupling_domains\": \"热-机\", \"name\": \"应对\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:b72477e3948b9021",`source`:"shipkg:action:4a5960af425f",`target`:"shipkg:condition:bdbca1b8295e",`properties`:{`name`:"应对",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:b72477e3948b9021",`case_id`:"sd2013_03_turning_gear",`certainty`:"reported_action",`certainty_zh`:"报告行动/建议",`evidence_id`:"ev:6374a9e189a094d1",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"18",`locator`:"PDF page 18",`quote`:"e was no record of it having been tested. 2. Control console illumination panels are vital to the safe operation of machinery and should therefore be tested regularly. If problems with visual indication or warning lamps cannot be rectified immediately, they must be reported. Living with the problem is not a solution. 3. It is important that the status of the main engine machinery conforms to t",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"应对\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:b8db436d7eca782b",`source`:"shipkg:action:3a42e9e6e745",`target`:"shipkg:condition:7da9174934f9",`properties`:{`name`:"应对",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:b8db436d7eca782b",`case_id`:"sd2013_03_turning_gear",`certainty`:"reported_action",`certainty_zh`:"报告行动/建议",`evidence_id`:"ev:bbdf7e438bd85b80",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"18",`locator`:"PDF page 18",`quote`:"ps cannot be rectified immediately, they must be reported. Living with the problem is not a solution. 3. It is important that the status of the main engine machinery conforms to the status recorded in the engine movement log and machinery state boards to enable everyone involved in an operation to maintain a clear understanding. If it does not, confusion can easily develop, and this inevitably increases the risk of damage t",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"应对\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:bd5d656cddbd9203",`source`:"shipkg:action:d556abb4fcfa",`target`:"shipkg:symptom:ea2cdd59ea5c",`properties`:{`name`:"应对",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:bd5d656cddbd9203",`case_id`:"sd2013_05_missing_filter",`certainty`:"reported_action",`certainty_zh`:"报告行动/建议",`evidence_id`:"ev:dee08b2e20581c60",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"23",`locator`:"PDF page 23",`quote`:"wrong. 3. An oil mist detector gives advance warning of an impending major failure. When a detector alarm occurs, the thought of stopping and inspecting the engine as soon as possible should be uppermost in an engineer’s mind. The consequences of ignoring it are clear, and expensive.",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"应对\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:bdee44f5e88dfa56",`source`:"shipkg:action:8f48968a672d",`target`:"shipkg:condition:7647f12090ef",`properties`:{`name`:"应对",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:bdee44f5e88dfa56",`case_id`:"sd2016_05_cpp_backup",`certainty`:"reported_action",`certainty_zh`:"报告行动/建议",`evidence_id`:"ev:43a7cad5a93294eb",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"21",`locator`:"PDF page 21",`quote`:"articularly if they are tired or distracted. This type of risk is typically reduced on bridges and in engine control rooms by the fitting of protective covers over safety- critical buttons, switches and knobs. 2. The master was confident that he had control of his CPPs and did not look at the pitch indicators located on the control consoles. Had he done so he would have realised the st",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"应对\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:c3dbff76d985212b",`source`:"shipkg:action:f8d140a40b2e",`target`:"shipkg:condition:4ae93bca9f29",`properties`:{`name`:"应对",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:c3dbff76d985212b",`case_id`:"stena_europe_fuel_2023",`certainty`:"reported_action",`certainty_zh`:"报告行动/建议",`evidence_id`:"ev:27210f9a269e08cf",`source_file`:"MAIB_2024_20_Stena_Europe_fuel_spray_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6756db0ba63e1781efb87793/2024-20-StenaEurope.pdf",`page`:"31",`locator`:"PDF page 31",`quote`:"tion thermographic survey following ME3’s return to service on 17 May. ● Undertaken a review of its company SMS and implemented a review process to manage service bulletins and technical service letters from all manufacturers of main engines and auxiliary engines within the Stena fleet.",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"应对\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:d18a92975542579a",`source`:"shipkg:action:16d3373950f9",`target`:"shipkg:condition:6fa538170906",`properties`:{`name`:"应对",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:d18a92975542579a",`case_id`:"kommandor_susan_dg1_2025",`certainty`:"reported_action",`certainty_zh`:"报告行动/建议",`evidence_id`:"ev:9225f4c20470527c",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_10_Kommandor_Susan_generator_bearing_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/catastrophic-engine-failure-and-subsequent-fire-on-board-the-site-investigation-vessel-kommandor-susan",`page`:"9",`locator`:"PDF page 9",`quote`:"ns taken by other organisations Gardline Shipping Limited has: • Rebuilt DG1 with genuine spares, including a new engine block; • Completed major overhauls of DG2, DG3 and DG4 using genuine Caterpillar parts; • Changed the onboard anchoring procedure, highlighting that clutches must remain disengaged when the winches are not in use to ensure they remain ready for use in the event of power failure. RECOMMENDATIONS In view of the actio",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"应对\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:eca2ebb20a238b2d",`source`:"shipkg:action:bb1cd030e27b",`target`:"shipkg:fault:b2aa91be158b",`properties`:{`name`:"应对",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:eca2ebb20a238b2d",`case_id`:"queen_mary2_hf_2010",`certainty`:"reported_action",`certainty_zh`:"报告行动/建议",`evidence_id`:"ev:7ce8bf353caf8467",`source_file`:"MAIB_2011_28_Queen_Mary_2_harmonic_filter_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/547c6fa6ed915d4c10000031/QM2Report.pdf",`page`:"70",`locator`:"PDF page 70",`quote`:"accident (Annex K). Carnival PLC has: • Included harmonic filters in its list of critical equipment for QM2, and has ensured that procedures exist for regular testing of their protection systems. • Developed and implemented procedures for dealing with harmonic filter imbalance alarms and entering harmonic filter rooms after an alarm has activated. • Replaced all the capacitors in QM2’s aft harmonic filter. Converteam has",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"应对\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:f21af884f7354745",`source`:"shipkg:action:84a87c035a24",`target`:"shipkg:condition:b290b6459200",`properties`:{`name`:"应对",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:f21af884f7354745",`case_id`:"sd2016_14_sea_valve",`certainty`:"reported_action",`certainty_zh`:"报告行动/建议",`evidence_id`:"ev:d1a2571c248baad4",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"41",`locator`:"PDF page 41",`quote`:"e was safely released from the suction side of the pump by using the bleed nut on the suction strainer. • Ensuring that the inlet flange was split in a controlled manner with a number of loosened bolts still in situ to enable them to be re-tightened in the event of the isolating valve not holding. 2. The crew’s response to the flooding was ineffective because they were not prepared for the emerge",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"应对\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:ff7e18df79deaa60",`source`:"shipkg:action:04317a406bca",`target`:"shipkg:fault:5737f3610967",`properties`:{`name`:"应对",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:ff7e18df79deaa60",`case_id`:"queen_mary2_hf_2010",`certainty`:"reported_action",`certainty_zh`:"报告行动/建议",`evidence_id`:"ev:54970b12e1896794",`source_file`:"MAIB_2011_28_Queen_Mary_2_harmonic_filter_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/547c6fa6ed915d4c10000031/QM2Report.pdf",`page`:"70",`locator`:"PDF page 70",`quote`:"e of its capacitors and the circumstances that could lead to this. • Replaced the capacitors in QM2’s aft harmonic filter with an improved and safer design. • Carried out a quality audit of the capacitor manufacturer. Lloyd’s Register (Europe, Middle East and Asia) has: • Progressed with existing work to review its rules to recognise and mitigate the hazard of arc-flash associated w",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"应对\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}}] AS row MATCH (a:ShipKG {id:row.source}), (b:ShipKG {id:row.target}) MERGE (a)-[r:ADDRESSES {id:row.id}]->(b) SET r += row.properties RETURN count(r) AS processed_32 }
