uency and 5% for voltage. Well documented causes of such behavior include pulsating torque of generators’ prime movers and/or ﬂuctuating load, which combined with commonly used droop control method for load sharing, possibly leads to severe short and long-term frequency ﬂuctuations. However, little is known about the osci",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"来源于\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:9b94cb30ae59d0ec",`source`:"shipkg:case:ffc594a9fab7",`target`:"shipkg:source:a583fceecb4c",`properties`:{`name`:"来源于",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:9b94cb30ae59d0ec",`case_id`:"sd2013_12_oily_rag",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:7293e870a8d5467f",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"40",`locator`:"PDF page 40",`quote`:"CASE 12 39MAIB Safety Digest 2/2013 Narrative It was a clear, bright morning as the crew of a small passenger catamaran arrived on board to carry out their routine pre-sailing checks before their first trip of the day. While the master carried out his navigational aids checks, the mate went to the engine rooms and checked the fuel and main engines",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"来源于\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:9c72d39d5a2669a9",`source`:"shipkg:case:8b13bdb1a5bc",`target`:"shipkg:source:3f597b4acabc",`properties`:{`name`:"来源于",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:9c72d39d5a2669a9",`case_id`:"sd2016_09_cpp_response",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:e1dce2948e24adc9",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"22 MAIB Safety Digest 1/2016 C