`:"{\"name\": \"来源于\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:ac6908ec9f47ee7b",`source`:"shipkg:case:00057f56fe39",`target`:"shipkg:source:21d1480ba4a6",`properties`:{`name`:"来源于",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:ac6908ec9f47ee7b",`case_id`:"wight_sky_me_2017",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:19d0b2283f62b511",`source_file`:"MAIB_2018_14_Wight_Sky_engine_bearing_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5b5217c7ed915d0b81e003df/MAIBInvReport14_2018.pdf",`page`:"1",`locator`:"PDF page 1",`quote`:"examination conducted by the vessel’s engine maker, Volvo Penta UK, concluded that the most probable trigger for the failure was debris in the engine’s oil channels following rebuild. The MAIB investigation established the following: • The engine had been completely rebuilt and failed after 5½ hours of operation. • The vessel’s soft patches 1 had not been removed, necessitating the engine to be lowered piecem",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"来源于\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:af433c11952ed610",`source`:"shipkg:case:1f8ffc7c55c3",`target`:"shipkg:source:c33d7f8e3fb6",`properties`:{`name`:"来源于",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:af433c11952ed610",`case_id`:"pride_can_cpp_2014",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:8c30394060f9cd2e",`source_file`:"MAIB_2015_22_Pride_of_Canterbury_CPP_hydraulic_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/563092daed915d566d000002/MAIBInvReport-22_2015.pdf",`page`:"30",`locator`:"PDF page 30",`quote`:"d, most likely, occurred gradually over a long period of time. 2.3.3 Pipework joints and shielding Whereas the main components of Pride of Canterbury’s CPP system were supplied after testing by the manufacturer, the interconnecting pipework was supplied and fitted by the shipyard when the vessel was constructed. Although the manufacturer’s drawings specified a particular type",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"来源于\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:b675bb7c1f4fc2de",`source`:"shipkg:run:9690a0157fb9",`target`:"shipkg:source:e12fe2e83b8d",`properties`:{`name`:"来源于",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`original_dataset_id`:"shipkg:dataset:1ceeb4cad6d8",`original_dataset_name`:"Marine Engine Fault Dataset (MU323DGSC)",`original_dataset_props`:"{\"data_origin\": \"controlled_experiment\", \"display_name\": \"Marine Engine Fault Dataset (MU323DGSC)\", \"kind_zh\": \"数据集\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"legacy_kind\": \"Dataset\"}",`legacy_relation`:"HAS_RUN",`legacy_source`:"shipkg:dataset:1ceeb4cad6d8",`legacy_target`:"shipkg:run:9690a0157fb9",`data_origin`:"controlled_experiment",`id`:"edge:b675bb7c1f4fc2de",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:0fd78cc81d9681d2",`source_file`:"Marine_Engine_Fault_Data_v1.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/19857425",`page`:"",`locator`:"dataset_index.csv:Injector_Nozzle/Clogged_Injector_Nozzle1_40_60_85_Load.csv",`quote`:"file_name=Injector_Nozzle/Clogged_Injector_Nozzle1_40_60_85_Load.csv; schema_type=scenario; scenario=Injection-valve nozzle clogging; nominal_load=40%, 60%, 85% (stepped); severity_or_program=one-hole plugged nozzle; header_rows=3; data_rows=6492; columns=73; anomaly_state=all-anomaly (no baseline segment); notes=Anomalous operation only (no baseline segment). Compressor Filter Loss (dPf) and Turbine Back Pressure (dPex) not recorded in this run (columns present but empty).",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"来源于\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"original_dataset_id\": \"shipkg:dataset:1ceeb4cad6d8\", \"original_dataset_name\": \"Marine Engine Fault Dataset (MU323DGSC)\", \"original_dataset_props\": \"{\\\"data_origin\\\": \\\"controlled_experiment\\\", \\\"display_name\\\": \\\"Marine Engine Fault Dataset (MU323DGSC)\\\", \\\"kind_zh\\\": \\\"数据集\\\", \\\"graph_