": \"shipkg:observation:ec255ed61291\", \"data_origin\": \"anonymised_field_summary\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:c023b976da8f777f",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:12275851bbd1",`target`:"shipkg:source:94adb0d6c252",`properties`:{`name`:"来源于",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:c023b976da8f777f",`case_id`:"knowledge:coupling_failure",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:d3e64cd30311c1bb",`source_file`:"MAIB_2017_20_Hebrides_CPP_coupling.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/59b7ab1c40f0b61231e71a54/MAIBInvReport20_2017.pdf",`page`:"35",`locator`:"PDF page 35",`quote`:"s caused by the loosening of a setscrew used to attach a coupling to a stepper motor shaft due to its lack of rundown torque, the absence of thread locking fluid, and vibration during the actuator’s operation. [2.2] 3. The absence of service instructions for the actuator’s inspection and maintenance that were available from its manufacturer was pivotal to the failure. [2.3] 4. No thread l",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"来源于\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:c7489feb424fc12e",`source`:"shipkg:run:265eab3b4373",`target`:"shipkg:source:e12fe2e83b8d",`properties`:{`name`:"来源于",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`original_dataset_id`:"shipkg:dataset:1ceeb4cad6d8",`original_dataset_name`:"Marine Engine Fault Dataset (MU323DGSC)",`original_dataset_props`:"{\"data_origin\": \"controlled_experiment\", \"display_name\": \"Marine Engine Fault Dataset (MU323DGSC)\", \"kind_zh\": \"数据集\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"legacy_kind\": \"Dataset\"}",`legacy_relation`:"HAS_RUN",`legacy_source`:"shipkg:dataset:1ceeb4cad6d8",`legacy_target`:"shipkg:run:265eab3b4373",`data_origin`:"controlled_experiment",`id`:"edge:c7489feb424fc12e",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:19d72a1ed6647ccd",`source_file`:"Marine_Engine_Fault_Data_v1.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/19857425",`page`:"",`locator`:"dataset_index.csv:Injector_Nozzle/Clogged_Injector_Nozzle2_LoadProgram.csv",`quote`:"file_name=Injector_Nozzle/Clogged_Injector_Nozzle2_LoadProgram.csv; schema_type=scenario; scenario=Injection-valve nozzle clogging; nominal_load=load program (~40-85%); severity_or_program=two-hole plugged nozzle / load program; header_rows=3; data_rows=6791; columns=73; anomaly_state=all-anomaly (no baseline segment); notes=Anomalous operation only (no baseline segment). Compressor Filter Loss (dPf) and Turbine Back Pressure (dPex) not recorded in this run (columns present but empty).",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"来源于\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false, \"original_dataset_id\": \"shipkg:dataset:1ceeb4cad6d8\", \"original_dataset_name\": \"Marine Engine Fault Dataset (MU323DGSC)\", \"original_dataset_props\": \"{\\\"data_origin\\\": \\\"controlled_experiment\\\", \\\"display_name\\\": \\\"Marine Engine Fault Dataset (MU323DGSC)\\\", \\\"kind_zh\\\": \\\"数据集\\\", \\\"graph_version\\\": \\\"4.1\\\", \\\"legacy_kind\\\": \\\"Dataset\\\"}\", \"legacy_relation\": \"HAS_RUN\", \"legacy_source\": \"shipkg:dataset:1ceeb4cad6d8\", \"legacy_target\": \"shipkg:run:265eab3b4373\", \"data_origin\": \"controlled_experiment\"}"}},{`id`:"edge:cd4443bced5710fe",`source`:"shipkg:case:187dc871fbd5",`target`:"shipkg:source:d52922af3fc9",`properties`:{`name`:"来源于",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:cd4443bced5710fe",`case_id`:"spirit_of_discovery_pods_2023",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:c3429f0fc22579e1",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_06_Spirit_of_Discovery_propulsion_loss.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/loss-of-propulsion-in-heavy-weather-experienced-by-the-passenger-vessel-spirit-of-discovery-leading-to-over-100-injuries-and-one-fatality",`page`:"42",`locator`:"PDF page 42",`quote`:"e vessel’s heading. Given the weather conditions at the time, it is almost certain that Spirit of Discovery’s pitching caused the propellers to come out of the water. This caused a sudden reduction in torque on the propulsion motor and led to a very rapid increase in the motors’ rpm. The engine alarm and monitoring system recorded that, immediately before their shutdown, the rpm of each pod’s",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"来源于\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:d0b56d0752ecd999",`source`:"shipkg:faulttype:bff048b48ff1",`target`:"shipkg:source:58a84c78e5b9",`properties`:{`name`:"来源于",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:d0b56d0752ecd999",`case_id`:"knowledge:generator_bearing_wear",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:65e2c4b3facd8c2b",`source_file`:"STAMFORD_AGN076_alternator_bearings.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.stamford-avk.com/sites/stamfordavk/files/2024-04/AGN076_C.pdf",`page`:"4",`locator`:"PDF page 4",`quote`:"t fail because of axial vibration, causing a fretting action in the housing, the cylindrical roller bearing might fail because of lack of grease or misalignment damage. The anti-friction ball bearings used on STAMFORD alternators are not insulated bearings. The design of STAMFORD alternators is such that the shaft does not come under the influence of magnetic fields that result in excessive vol",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"来源于\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:d719d5360fcfd4ea",`source`:"shipkg:case:63aa8b018e0d",`target`:"shipkg:source:3d83d6ceacd0",`properties`:{`name`:"来源于",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:d719d5360fcfd4ea",`case_id`:"stena_europe_fuel_2023",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:57049bc52d7488e2",`source_file`:"MAIB_2024_20_Stena_Europe_fuel_spray_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6756db0ba63e1781efb87793/2024-20-StenaEurope.pdf",`page`:"7",`locator`:"PDF page 7",`quote`:"mage to the port main engine room and rendered one of its four main engines inoperative for several weeks. The fire was caused by fuel leaking under pressure from the fuel system of main engine number 3 and igniting on an exposed hot surface. No one was injured and there was no pollution. The investigation found that the fuel had ignited on part of the engine’s exhaust system that had",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"来源于\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:d74ebf20cc5e3892",`source`:"shipkg:case:9792cd36162e",`target`:"shipkg:source:af4bce0c23cd",`properties`:{`name`:"来源于",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:d74ebf20cc5e3892",`case_id`:"windcat8_port_engine_2017",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:4e45851ecc9eb9f4",`source_file`:"MAIB_2018_01_Windcat8_bearing_failure_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/683922/MAIBInvReport01_2018.pdf",`page`:"1",`locator`:"PDF page 1",`quote`:"and no injuries. The MAIB investigation identified that the catastrophic damage to Windcat 8’s port main engine was caused by the failure of a piston connecting rod big end shell bearing, which resulted in the connecting rod assembly releasing and penetrating through the engine crankcase. The investigation also identified that: • A high oil temperature alarm prior to the engine failure warranted a more cautious a",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"来源于\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:d7a5a80824d95559",`source`:"shipkg:observation:83cf859e3d48",`target`:"shipkg:source:5137a1994672",`properties`:{`name`:"来源于",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`original_dataset_id`:"shipkg:dataset:710ea13e53ac",`original_dataset_name`:"Azimuth Thruster CBM Dataset",`original_dataset_props`:"{\"data_origin\": \"anonymised_field_summary\", \"display_name\": \"Azimuth Thruster CBM Dataset\", \"kind_zh\": \"数据集\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"legacy_kind\": \"Dataset\"}",`legacy_relation`:"HAS_CASE",`legacy_source`:"shipkg:dataset:710