; Detection/event reference=Oil-dominant alert at Month -0.3; ND (oil-led); Reference class=ND (oil-led); Recommended CBM action=Oil-led CBM; 500 h vibration / 125 h oil; Included in mechanical LTI summary=no",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"建议采取\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:b823f509dcdde6a0",`source`:"shipkg:observation:59f88fb7c81e",`target`:"shipkg:action:9e4b4715011c",`properties`:{`name`:"建议采取",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:b823f509dcdde6a0",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"dataset_label",`certainty_zh`:"数据集标签",`evidence_id`:"ev:d61287b84a7d06e2",`source_file`:"Azimuth_Thruster_CBM_Dataset.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/20101612",`page`:"",`locator`:"table3_lti_by_fault_type_anonymised.csv:row11",`quote`:"System / engine-family case=CAT C7 engine case A BB / CAT C7 shaftline case A; Fault or condition=Additive depletion; Detection/event reference=Oil-led alert at Month -1.0; ND (oil-led); Reference class=ND (oil-led); Recommended CBM action=Oil-led CBM; 500 h vibration / 125 h oil; Included in mechanical LTI summary=no",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"建议采取\", \"graph_version\": \"4.1\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:ccd6112a8f27fefe",`source`:"shipkg:observation:36b9efa16da9",`target`:"shipkg:action:cc44cd1c6032",`properties`:{`name`:"建议采取",`graph_version`:"4.1",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:ccd6112a8f27fefe",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"dataset_label",`certainty_zh`:"数据集标签",`evidence_id`:"ev:44f19b4f5b32f488",`source_file`:"Azimuth_Thruster_CBM_Dataset.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/20101612",`page`:"",`locator`:"table3_lti_by_fault_type_anonymised.csv:row4",`quote`:"System / engine-family case=CAT 3516C coupling EB 1; Fault or condition=Coupling resonance; Detection/event reference=Vibration alert Month -2.0; maintenance event; Reference class=LTI_maintenance; LTI / warning (mo)=2.0; Warning (h)=300.0; Recommended CBM action=Vibration-led CBM; 125 h vibration / 500 h oil; Included in 